window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1501,"title":"Chapter 1501 The Alchemist Association in Despair","paragraphs":["1501 The Alchemist Association in Despair","A small enchantment automatically formed around every herb sent into the diagram, and the enchantment would automatically evolve into a suitable living environment for that medicinal herb.","It was even more suitable than their original living environments.","Moreover, there were obscure runes on these small enchantments that made the time inside it much faster than in the outside world, allowing these medicinal herbs to mature faster.","This was the most magical part of the herb mountain. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan would not have been able to eat a single Brahma Fruit even after obtaining the Brahma Tree for a few years.","If it was just the blood essence of an expert, it would be impossible for it to mature at such a shocking speed. After all, even if it wanted to absorb it, it would require a very long time. It would also require a lot of time to grow the Brahma Fruit.","But now, in the herb mountain, as long as there was enough spirit energy, the herbs there could be quickly ripened.","This was Chu Yunfan’s greatest treasure.","When it came to the domain of time, even for the current Chu Yunfan, it was as if he was reading a heavenly book. Even with the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, he still did not understand the domain of time. He could only borrow the Mountain River Diagram and borrow the power of time from the herb mountain. He was not clear about this power.","On his way, Chu Yunfan grabbed all the medicinal herbs he saw and placed them on the mountain. The herb garden was very big, but Wang Dong and the others seemed to only be there for the Herb King, so they didn’t stop for the other precious herbs.","They didn’t know how long Chu Yunfan could hold the demons back, and they didn’t have much hope for him. The demons were too powerful. Unless the major human forces joined forces, the demons could not be defeated.","But such a thing was impossible. Moreover, the Alchemist Association was still too weak. In the eyes of ordinary people, the Alchemist Association was a colossus. Even Jinzhanghan had to give in to them. With their power, they naturally had nothing to fear. But when it really came down to risking their lives, the Alchemist Association’s prestige was useless.","They were about to risk their lives, so who cared about their reputation? And at this time, the fatal weakness of the association’s lack of top-notch experts was exposed. Although the Alchemist Association did not lack Cores and even had quite a number of them, what it needed was a true Core Former.","But in the entire Alchemist Association, there was only Wang Dong. Moreover, he was not very good at fighting. It was precisely because of this that Ancestor Hemp Garb had come along.","But even so, he had no advantage against the Ultimate West Demon League. Even with Chu Yunfan, his situation was not much better. Therefore, they had to hurry up!","The demons caught up with Wang Dong’s group. In the deepest part of the herb garden, the demons saw Wang Dong, the white-robed elder, and many experts of the Alchemist Association besieging an old man.","This old man had white hair, but his body was strong and vigorous. Under the attacks of so many experts, he resisted and retreated. Wang Dong and the others were extremely anxious. They set up layers of array formations. Everyone worked together, wanting to keep this old man here, but he kept blocking them.","All these demons were above the Core Stage. Their cultivation and insight were naturally top-notch, and they recognized the old man instantly. He was a ginseng that had turned into a spirit.","“That Ginseng King is at least a few thousand years old,” Golden Lion King said.","The other demon kings widened their eyes. This should be the Herb King they were looking for. A normal ginseng would only be considered precious after a hundred years, and it would only start to grow into a spirit after a thousand years. But to grow to the level of a Herb King—in this case, a Ginseng King—it would take at least thousands of years.","This was something that ordinary forces would not dare to imagine. This was because most forces did not have a history of several thousand years. How could they possibly nurture a Ginseng King that was several thousand years old?","“Hahahaha, looks like we’re not late. This Ginseng King is ours!” Golden Lion King laughed.","Although they had been stopped by Chu Yunfan for a while, they were not too late. Wang Dong and the others had not been able to take down the Ginseng King.","This Ginseng King was quite old. It had even gained sentience and was able to perform martial arts. Just from the fact that he was able to fight on even footing with Wang Dong and the others, it could be seen that his martial arts were very powerful. His combat strength was not inferior to the Core Form Stage.","This was the reason why Wang Dong and the others couldn’t take down the Ginseng King even though they had formed a formation.","“D*mn it!”","Wang Dong’s group quickly noticed the arrival of Golden Lion King and the other demons.","“Jian Wuchen didn’t manage to stop them for long!” Ancestor Hemp Grab’s expression changed.","It was not only the old ancestor, but also the others. When they saw the many demon kings, their faces changed. Their speed was too slow and they couldn’t take down the Ginseng King. However, they couldn’t blame Chu Yunfan, because Chu Yunfan had already bought them quite a bit of time.","However, they were not able to take down the Ginseng King.","There were more than 20 Cores on the other side. It was already a great thing for Chu Yunfan to have lasted up to this point. They didn’t see Chu Yunfan anywhere. In their opinion, he had probably died.","“D*mn it!” Wang Dong roared. They had finally managed to force the Ginseng King into a corner and were about to reap some benefits. However, Golden Lion King had appeared at this moment.","“Stop them!” Wang Dong shouted,","More than ten people from the team that surrounded the Ginseng King turned toward the demons.","“You think these trash can stop us?” Golden Lion King laughed. The other demon kings also revealed ferocious smiles. They couldn’t deal with Chu Yunfan, but they didn’t care about these human warriors.","“Go, Kill them and then catch the Ginseng King!” Golden Lion King shouted.","The demon kings roared and pounced forward, clashing with the Alchemist Association’s experts. However, such a battle was meaningless. These experts who came out to intercept them were not a match for these demon kings.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!"]},{"number":1502,"title":"Chapter 1502 If the Flag Is Set Up, You Will Meet Your Demise","paragraphs":["1502 If the Flag Is Set Up, You Will Meet Your Demise","The battle broke out. They were outnumbered. Their numbers were only half of the Ultimate West Demon League. In addition, their strength was much weaker.","At the beginning of the battle, the humans were already at a disadvantage. They were completely suppressed.","The Divines were sent flying almost instantly.","Spurt!","Spurt!","Spurt!","These experts cried out miserably and spat out a mouthful of blood. They flew backward and crashed heavily into the ground. Their chests had caved in. One could imagine how serious their injuries were.","Compared to these demon kings of the Ultimate West Demon League, these Divine humans of the Alchemist Association were not experts at all. Even the two Core humans who were leading the group soon fell into a disadvantageous position when faced with the siege of this group of Core demons. In a short while, they were grieviously injured.","“Let’s go all out!”","The Core humans bit themselves, drawing mouthfuls of their blood essence, and then spat it out. Their divine power was burning, and they were much stronger than before. They wanted to buy time for Wang Dong and the others. But before they could get up, they saw a big hand falling down from the sky and were sent flying.","Bam!","Bam!","Two loud booms rang out, causing the Core humans to crash into the ground. Their bodies were torn apart and blood splattered everywhere. Soon, they were covered in blood. They had just used a secret technique and their strength had increased greatly. However, they were not a match for the terrifying Golden Lion King and were heavily injured with a single slap. They were heavily injured and fainted.","“You plan to block my path with this kind of trash?” Golden Lion King said disdainfully and roared toward the sky.","The earlier battle with Chu Yunfan was simply too tragic. So many of the demons had surrounded Chu Yunfan, but they could not do anything to him. Now, Golden Lion King could finally vent his anger. Not all humans were like that freak.","“Go!” Golden Lion King roared, and the dozens of demon kings immediately pounced forward.","Suddenly, at this moment, Ancestor Hemp Garb stood out. He knew that these demons weren’t easy to deal with, but he had no choice. He owed the Alchemist Association a huge favor, so even though he knew that the situation was difficult, he still had to go.","“Break!”","A treasure saber appeared in Ancestor Hemp Garb’s hand, and a saber light shot into the sky. He was in the Core Form Stage, and at this time, he released all his strength. This was where his confidence lay.","The saber slashed down fiercely, directly toward Golden Lion King that was charging toward him.","“You dare to be impudent in front of me with such small tricks?!” Golden Lion King laughed out loud.","He stretched out his hand and caught the terrifying saber light in mid-air. The strength of a demon’s body could be seen from this. Golden Lion King’s physical strength was famous among the demons, and at this moment, it was on full display.","In just a moment, Ancestor Hemp Garb was surrounded by several other Core Former demon kings. None of the three experts were weaker than him, so how could he resist?","In addition to Golden Lion King, in just a few short moves, Ancestor Hemp Garb had fallen into a disadvantage. As the saying went, a long defense would lead to a loss. After a few short moves, he started revealing flaws.","Golden Lion King seized the opportunity to grab the ancestor’s chest.","Bam!","Ancestor Hemp Garb spat out a mouthful of blood and he was thrown to the ground. Compared to those Alchemist Association experts from before, there was no difference. He could not withstand so many demons alone. He felt like his entire body was about to fall apart. Golden Lion King was too strong.","Ancestor Hemp Garb could not fight against Golden Lion King alone, not to mention that there were three demon kings who were not weaker than him and were even slightly stronger than him. There were more than 20 Void Core demon kings. It was wishful thinking for him to stall for time with such a lineup. He had no chance of winning.","“Hehehehe! Humans are only so-so. Die!”","At this moment, a figure rushed out and turned into a giant bat. This bat spread its wings that were over ten meters long. From a distance, it looked like a small mountain. It was an ancient mutant, and its entire body emitted a shocking poisonous gas.","The other three demons were Flying Bat Kings that had complete cultivation bases. In terms of cultivation, they were among the top experts of the demons.","‘My life is over...’ Ancestor Hemp Garb closed his eyes. It was over. He could not resist such a terrifying existence.","Suddenly, a shocking sword light shot down from the sky.","Stab!","The sword light pierced through the gigantic bat in the air, and then the sword fell to the ground at lightning speed.","Bam!","The huge bat was sent flying to the ground. He tried to get up, but he was unable to break free. The sword had nailed him to the ground.","“Rrraaagh!!!”","Flying Bat King roared in rage as he felt the mystical power of this sword sealing his powers. He wanted to get up, but he couldn’t.","A clear voice then came from the sky.","“Sorry I’m late!”","Everyone raised their heads and saw a young man in black clothes. He slowly walked over on the light. He seemed slow but was actually fast. In just a moment, he had already arrived in front of everyone.","When they saw this person, the faces of the humans were filled with joy. On the other side, the demons looked as if they had seen a ghost. None of them had expected to see Chu Yunfan at this time.","The demons felt the fear they had when they couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan. They remembered that they hadn’t killed Chu Yunfan before. It was just that he had disappeared. Upon seeing him again, they were shocked.","Chu Yunfan slowly walked up to Flying Bat King and said, “What did you say just now? Humans are just so-so? As the old saying goes, if the flag is set up, you will meet your demise.”"]},{"number":1503,"title":"Chapter 1503 Did I Save You Can Save the Bat?","paragraphs":["1503 Did I Save You Can Save the Bat?","The entire place was dead silent. Everyone was completely dumbfounded. They had not expected Chu Yunfan to appear so suddenly.","Moreover, it was so simple and crude. With a single sword strike, he nailed a top-notch Core Former demon to the ground. The demon could not even get up.","What kind of terrifying strength was this?","That demon was a Core Former! It could suppress the terrifying power of an entire country, but it was smashed to the ground by Chu Yunfan’s attack and couldn’t even get up.","This was also the first time that the humans had seen Chu Yunfan in action, especially the Alchemist Association president, Wang Dong. According to his intelligence, Chu Yunfan should only be an ordinary Core Former, but, it seemed that his strength was not ordinary. After all, Wang Dong had never heard of an ordinary Core Former being able to beat up another Core Former.","“Rrrraaagh!”","Flying Bat King roared and used all its divine power, but it couldn’t break the seal on Chu Yunfan’s sword. He was unwilling to accept this, but this was not the first time Chu Yunfan had defeated an existence of this level.","“Hmph!”","Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and stomped on the head of Flying Bat King. He stomped that huge head into the ground and a huge crack was formed.","“How dare you humiliate us!” Golden Lion King’s face revealed a furious expression.","“So what if I humiliate you?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Come and hit me if you dare!”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Golden Lion King was extremely angry. Although he knew that Chu Yunfan was deliberately provoking him, he could not help but be angry.","“Attack! I him in pieces!”","Golden Lion King roared, and the demon kings pounced on Chu Yunfan without any hesitation. They had long been enraged by Chu Yunfan. They had never seen such an arrogant fellow who had no respect for the demons.","Chu Yunfan was simply despicable.","If they couldn’t kill Chu Yunfan and trample him under their feet, they wouldn’t be able to get their way.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan shouted, “Capture the Ginseng King now!”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Wang Dong and the others immediately reacted. They too had been immersed in the shock of Chu Yunfan’s amazing strength. Only now did they finally remember that their goal was to capture the Ginseng King.","“Thank you!” Wang Dong shouted.","They had paid a big price to invite Chu Yunfan here, and it all seemed worth it now. Without Chu Yunfan, they wouldn’t stand a chance. They would have been scattered by the demon kings.","Boom!","The battle between Chu Yunfan and demons broke out. Wang Dong and the others saw how Chu Yunfan stopped the demons. He grabbed at the air and took out thunder sword. Then, he suddenly disappeared from where he was.","In the face of the demons’ attacks, Chu Yunfan was not afraid in the slightest. On the contrary, he charged forward. It seemed that it would be a piece of cake for him to fight the demons.","The humans were simply dumbfounded. They had seen people with unparalleled valor, but they had never seen such a terrifying and unparalleled existence. The terrifying power instantly collapsed. However, Chu Yunfan was not at a disadvantage when fighting against these demons single-handedly and with just one sword.","Seeing this, Wang Dong and the others finally heaved a sigh of relief. They quickly attacked the Ginseng King again.","“Die!”","Golden Lion King roared loudly and transformed into his original form. He was a huge lion king that was the size of a small mountain. The remaining two Core Former demons also erupted and transformed into their true forms. One of them was an ape covered in gray fur, emitting a violent aura. The other transformed into an huge cat covered in black fur, and its jade green eyes emitted a ferocious look.","The three Core Former demons pounced at Chu Yunfan. The demonic energy on their bodies was extremely dense, turning into thick smoke that swept toward him, obscuring everything.","Chu Yunfan fought the three demon kings alone with his sword. Among them, the strongest was Golden Lion King. He was already in the intermediate Core Form Stage, but the other two demons were also in the Core Form Stage. Although they were not Chu Yunfan’s match, they were enough to restrain Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, a few figures flew toward Flying Bat King that was nailed to the ground. Just as they were about to pull out the treasure sword, an incomparably huge, terrifying sword light that was hundreds of feet long swept over and ruthlessly landed on their bodies.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam1","The demons exploded in mid-air.","“Did I save you can save the bat?” Chu Yunfan’s cold voice came from the sky.","He had killed a few Core Stage demons with just one strike. At this moment, many were frightened. They had wanted to take advantage of the time when Chu Yunfan was restrained by the three demons to save Flying Bat King.","But now, they realized that their previous thoughts were too childish. Without Chu Yunfan’s permission, how could they save Flying Bat King?","Although Chu Yunfan was restrained by the three demons, he only needed one move to deal with them. Everyone understood that if they wanted to save Flying Bat King, they had to kill Chu Yunfan first. Otherwise, not only would they not be able to save Flying Bat King or get the Ginseng King.","Thinking of this, these demons also burst out and transformed into their true forms, participating in the attack on Chu Yunfan. Although his strength made them look at him in a new light, when it came to a life-and-death battle, these demon kings who had fought to the death did not hesitate.","Meanwhile, Wang Dong and the others were watching Chu Yunfan’s battle as they tried to capture the Ginseng King. They were afraid that Chu Yunfan would lose and wanted to be able to run away immediately.","When they saw the scene, they all sucked in a breath of cold air. They understood that unless forced into a corner, it was impossible for these demon kings to transform into their true forms. One could imagine how much pressure Chu Yunfan had placed on the demons."]},{"number":1504,"title":"Chapter 1504 I Can Finally Reveal My True Form","paragraphs":["1504 I Can Finally Reveal My True Form","The humans were shocked. After all, the demon kings were top-notch existences. If it were them, it would be impossible for them to force out the true bodies of these demons.","To be able to do this, Chu Yunfan had the qualifications to be unrivaled in the world.","“Who is this Jian Wuchen? How is he so terrifying?”","They couldn’t figure out how a human could be so terrifying. They had heard of many sword experts in the world, but someone like Chu Yunfan didn’t exist.","However, they quickly relaxed and began to focus on dealing with the Ginseng King. The Ginseng King had already gained sentience and was able to use all sorts of martial arts techniques. If it wasn’t for the array that sealed the Ginseng King’s earth evasion technique, the Ginseng King would probably have escaped by now. This kind of thing was not the first or second for the Alchemist Association. They were very experienced.","On the other side, Chu Yunfan, who single-handedly resisted the demons, did not feel any pressure at all. He swung his sword wantonly and was able to repel the demon kings.","After a long time, he saw that Wang Dong still couldn’t get the Ginseng King, and he became impatient. Although the Ginseng King was indeed very powerful and had the cultivation of the Core Former, Wang Dong’s combat strength just wasn’t very good.","Of course, it wasn’t that Wang Dong was too weak. It was just that among experts of the same level, Wang Dong’s combat strength was considered to be at the bottom. The main direction of an alchemist’s cultivation was alchemy, not combat.","This was the reason Chu Yunfan didn’t walk the path of alchemy even though he had obtained the memories of the Alchemy Emperor. If he did and relied on the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, he could replicate the cultivation path of the Alchemy Emperor. His alchemy would then surpass all those in the alchemy field.","But if that happened, among martial arts experts of the same level, he would be weak. He would be able to become the next Alchemy Emperor, but that was not the goal he wanted to achieve.","“Why are you so slow? Let me help you.”","Chu Yunfan’s large hand suddenly grabbed out, and a seal symbol appeared in the air. Then, this symbol flew directly toward the Ginseng King.","While the Ginseng King was fighting against Wang Dong and the others, he suddenly felt a great danger. He wanted to retreat, but Wang Dong and the others would not let him go. They quickly strengthened the array and trapped him inside.","Immediately after, the symbol turned into a talisman and landed on the Ginseng King’s body. The surging divine power in the Ginseng King’s body was instantly sealed. He transformed from an old man into a ginseng that was more than a meter tall and covered with long white whiskers.","This was his true form.","He could even form an expression on his body, which looked like a human face. This was a Herb King who had become a spirit. He was completely different from ordinary herbs.","“This is great!”","Wang Dong’s face was filled with surprise and joy, but at the same time, he was extremely shocked. Even if they joined forces, they couldn’t do anything to this Ginseng King, but when it faced Chu Yunfan, the Ginseng King was no match at all. His divine power was instantly sealed and he turned back into his original form.","Without the support of divine power, the Ginseng King reverted to his original form. How could he stop Wang Dong?","Wang Dong directly put the Ginseng King into a spatial bag. Although the Ginseng King shook and struggled to break free, how could he break free from the seal talisman Chu Yunfan had placed on him? His strength was far inferior to Chu Yunfan’s.","After obtaining the Ginseng King, Wang Dong roared, “Sword Young Master, I’m comign to help!”","Wang Dong shouted and wanted to join the battle, but Chu Yunfan said, “What are you guys helping me with? I’ll help you stall them!”","Wang Dong and the others stopped in their tracks. They didn’t expect that Chu Yunfan didn’t need their help at all, especially Wang Dong. Although his strength was relatively weak among experts of the same level, he was still a Core Former.","They didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to completely despise them.","However, they did not hesitate. They saw that Chu Yunfan was charging left and right in the battle. He did not seem to be at a disadvantage at all. They immediately understood that Chu Yunfan did not need their help. If Chu Yunfan wanted to leave, he could leave on his own.","Thinking of this, Wang Dong immediately made a decision. He could not let Chu Yunfan’s efforts go to waste.","“Let’s go!”","As he spoke, he helped the Ancestor Hemp Garb to his feet. Then, the others also helped up the Alchemist Association experts who had been severely injured. These people turned into streaks of light and fled.","When the demon kings saw this scene, they roared and became furious. They had come here for the Ginseng King, but now it was about to fly away from their hands. They were furious, but they couldn’t chase after him because Chu Yunfan kept stopping them.","With their strength, they could not break through Chu Yunfan’s defensive circle. They had been able to rush over because Chu Yunfan had gone easy on them. Otherwise, they would not have been able to break through.","After watching them leave, Chu Yunfan stopped his attacks and looked at the terrifying monsters in front of him. They were the kings of the demons, and their true forms were terrifying. Their demonic energy soared into the sky and formed rolling demonic clouds.","Chu Yunfan smiled, but it made the demon kings a little scared. They had never seen him smile like this before and felt that there was some conspiracy behind it. They immediately went on guard.","“After pretending for so long, there’s finally no one left. I can reveal my true colors!” Chu Yunfan grinned and returned to his original appearance.","The demon kings stared at Chu Yunfan with their mouths agape. It was simply unbelievable that this sword expert had transformed into someone esle using a transformation technique. This was impossible. They were all martial arts experts, and each of them had activated their divine eye. Ordinary transformation techniques could not hide from their eyes.","If it was said that it could be hidden from one of them, it might be barely possible. However, so many of them had not seen through it. Even the many humans had not seen through it. This was too shocking.","“You’re Chu Yunfan!” Golden Lion King instantly revealed Chu Yunfan’s identity."]},{"number":1505,"title":"Chapter 1505 True Strength Shocks the Demon Kings","paragraphs":["1505 True Strength Shocks the Demon Kings","Golden Lion King’s eyes were filled with shock. He recognized Chu Yunfan immediately.","The Monster Subduers guarded the western border and targeted the demons. The Ultimate West Demon League was in turn very concerned about the Monster Subduers.","Some time ago, Chu Yunfan single-handedly defeated the two strongest experts of the Monster Subduers. This matter had once caused a huge commotion. How could the demons not pay attention to it?","Especially Chu Yunfan, who had become the number one expert in Great Wei. For the Ultimate West Demon League, which was located nearby, he became a target that needed to be paid attention to.","They never expected to meet Chu Yunfan here, especially when he was donned in an alternate identity called Jian Wuchen. Golden Lion King finally understood why Jian Wuchen was so difficult to deal with. It turned out that he was the number one expert of Great Wei, Chu Yunfan, who had wreaked havoc in the Monster Subduers.","At this moment, Golden Lion King’s expression became even colder. The demon kings behind him also recognized Chu Yunfan. They were all very familiar with him.","Upon seeing Chu Yunfan return to his original appearance, they hated him even more. They wanted to tear him into pieces. Chu Yunfan was clearly looking down on them by doing this.","“Kill him!” Golden Lion King’s eyes flashed with a terrifying killing intent. His entire person was like a volcano that was about to erupt at any moment.","It was different from the killing intent he had before. Previously, he was angry because he couldn’t take Chu Yunfan down and was toyed with. But now, he only had a bone-chilling killing intent.","Chu Yunfan was a huge threat to the Ultimate West Demon League.","“Trying to kill me? Hahaha, just the few of you? Previously, I couldn’t spare my hands, but now, I don’t have much to worry about. All of you can die now!” Chu Yunfan laughed.","Although his sword cultivation was shocking, it was only a part of his strength. While brandishing his sword, felt as if his hands and feet were tied. He was unable to unleash his true strength. But it was different now. There was no one else present, so he no longer need to hide.","“Get him!”","These demon kings released their most powerful demonic aura. The collective aura soared into the sky and condensed into a ball. These demon kings formed a battle formation, and it formed a terrifying monster that was as big as a small mountain. The figure was shocking.","Chu Yunfan did not want to be outdone. All the mana in his body boiled, and in an instant, it turned into lightning that filled the sky. Countless lightningbolts swept out like a spider web with Chu Yunfan as the center, turning into a lightningstorm.","At the center of this lightningstorm, Chu Yunfan was like a god of lightning. Each bolt of lightning was like an lightning dragon. It was as thick as a few water tanks and bombarded these demon kings.","The demon kings howled. What demons was most afraid of was lightning power that represented the purest Yang energy in the world. When lightning power erupted, it could destroy the world. To demons like them, it was a huge restraint. Although they could more or less resist lightning power at their level of cultivation, it was undeniable that this restraint still existed.","The array formed by the demon kings began to tremble violently. Chu Yunfan had shaken it single-handedly.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan, who had released all his strength, gave them a much more terrifying pressure than before.","“Rrrragh!”","Golden Lion King opened its mouth wide and pounced in Chu Yunfan’s direction. However, Chu Yunfan was far faster that him. In an instant, Chu Yunfan’s big hand grabbed the lightning spreading throughout the sky and turned it into a long saber.","The saber light flickered with a shocking light, and it was extremely terrifying.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan entered the array. The demonic energy spreading from the array turned the entire area into a huge swamp, making it difficult for people to move. However, this was not a problem for Chu Yunfan. His emitted terrifying lightning power that was like a sharp knife sweeping around. The demonic energy could not pose any threat to him.","Stepping on the lightning beneath his feet, the domain seemed to have turned into a domain that belonged to him. In an instant, he had arrived in front of one of the demon kings.","This Core demon king tried to retreat and avoid Chu Yunfan, but his speed could not compare. Chu Yunfan simply slashed down with his saber. The demon king, which was as big as a small hill, screamed and was cut in half. The cut was smooth, and the wound was completely charred. That was the result of being cut by lightning.","Chu Yunfan in this state was the most terrifying!","“Surround him! We can’t let him escape!” Golden Lion King roared. He was extremely angry. He stomped his foot and countless pieces of the ground shattered, forming a straight crack that spread in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","The demon kings roared and surrounded Chu Yunfan, restricting his movement. Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast. If they came one by one, they would not be able to catch up with him. Therefore, they had to restrict his movements.","“Trying to restraint me? Hahaha, can you do it?” Chu Yunfan felt extremely satisfied. This was his true combat strength. He had been unable to display it to pretend to be Jian Wuchen earlier.","“Break! First Netherworld Stomp!” Chu Yunfan roared.","These demons wanted to kill him, but he also wanted to kill them. He at first had not taken the Ultimate West Demon League seriously. After all, a force suppressed by the Monster Subduers was probably not very powerful. But now he realized that his previous thinking was probably a huge mistake.","This was not the case at all. Although it was unknown why the Ultimate West Demon League was hiding in the West, as long as it existed, it was a huge threat to Great Wei and the entire human race. Since that was the case, he might as well take this opportunity to cut off some of their wings. The struggle between races was a hundred times crueler than anything else."]},{"number":1506,"title":"Chapter 1506 A One-Sided Massacre","paragraphs":["1506 A One-Sided Massacre","Boom!","Chu Yunfan stomped his foot. He transformed into a huge dharma idol carrying endless netherworld water. His foot ruthlessly landed on the array formed by the demon kings.","The array shook violently, and the demon kings looked shocked. The array was formed through they gathered strength. It was not as simple as one plus one equals two. But under Chu Yunfan’s stomp, it trembled violently.","‘Could this be his true strength?’ many of the demons thought.","“It’s impossible to break the formation!”","Golden Lion King roared. He circulated the power of the array and augmented his body. He rushed up like a mountain rising into the sky. Looking over, the array was astounded.","“Get down!”","Chu Yunfan shouted, “Second Netherworld Stomp!”","He stomped down again. The terrifying power had risen to another level. It was not something that ordinary people could imagine.","Bam!","Golden Lion King, who had just flown up, was stomped in mid-air. His entire body seemed to have hit a huge piece of iron, and an incomparably loud explosion erupted. Then, he crashed into the ground like a meteor.","Boom!","Everyone was dumbfounded. They watched as Golden Lion King, who had been strengthened by the array, was stomped into the ground by Chu Yunfan as if he was trampling on an ant.","Chu Yunfan shouted without hesitation,””Break! Third Netherworld Stomp!”","This stomp was much stronger than the ones before. Endless netherworld water swept toward the array with monstrous strength.","Bam!","The array let out a loud boom. The array made up of more than 20 Cores shook violently.","Spurt!","Spurt!","Spurt!","The demon kings presiding over the array spat out mouthfuls of blood. They felt as if they had suffered a heavy blow that struck their chests. Although the array was not broken, their eyes flickered with disbelief.","This array would not only increase an individual’s strength, but also allow everyone to share each other’s strength. At the same time, it can also reduce damages. All the attacks could be divided equally among them. And the result of a split was enough to make them spit out mouthfuls of blood as if they had been hit hard. If they were stomped on, they would probably die instantly.","But before they could think further, Chu Yunfan shouted, “Fourth Netherworld Stomp!”","The truly terrifying and earth-shattering stomp was coming. The difference between the previous three steps and the fourth step was too great. It was as if the previous three steps were just a foundation for the fourth step.","Boom!","The stomp landed. The array, which could barely withstand the previous stomps, collapsed in an instant. The demon kings who were in charge of the array were sent flying. It was if they had been electrocuted and suffered serious injuries.","Executing four consecutive stomps was a huge test for Chu Yunfan. Fortunately, he was no longer in the Core Stage. After entering the intermediate Void Core stage, his strength had increased by a level. The mana in his body had reached a certain level. Even this level of consumption was not enough to completely exhaust the mana in his body.","Naturally, he would not let go of such a good opportunity. His vanished, then appeared in front of a demon king that was as big as a small mountain. Compared to the demon king that was as big as a hill, Chu Yunfan, who was only 1.8 meters tall, looked like a baby facing a giant.","However, this baby raised his fist and punched out.","Bam!","The mountain-like demon king was hit directly. He had already been severely injured before. Before he could react, he was punched in the head. His head exploded and his huge body fell down from the sky like a rock.","The slaughter had truly begun.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Chu Yunfan used all kinds of techniques. Whether it was a saber, a sword, or a punch, these demon kings were unable to resist and were killed in one blow.","The demon kings, who were already severely injured, did not have the ability to resist. In just a short moment, Chu Yunfan slaughtered these 20 demon kings.","Flying Bat King, who was pinned to the ground, was dumbfounded. He had been unwilling to accept this before, but now, there was nothing left for him to be unwilling to accept. He was scared silly. He had seen all kinds of killings, but they were all massacres of ordinary creatures by high and mighty Cores like them.","He had never seen these Cores being harvested so easily like cabbages. These powerful Cores, who were famous throughout the world, could not even withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","It was a massacre, a one-sided massacre.","If Flying Bat King had not witnessed it, he wouldn’t have believed that someone could do this.","In an instant, there were only four Core Former demons left—Demon Cat King, Grey Ape King, Golden Lion King, and Flying Bat King who was pinned to the ground. The other Void Core demons could not even withstand one move from Chu Yunfan and were completely finished.","The entire scene was deathly silent, and only the breathing of these demons was left.","“Looks like your formation isn’t that great. Are you ready to die, Golden Lion King?” Chu Yunfan sneered and pointed at Golden Lion King.","“Now that things have come to this, this is the only way. Brothers, from now on, my tribe will have to rely on you to take care of it. I’ll stop him. You guys get out of here. This beast is too ferocious. We’re no match for him!”","Golden Lion King felt his heart twist. He had been wary of the Blood Barbarians before, but he did not believe that there was anyone who could beat them up like this. Even if they encountered the most elite Blood Barbarians from the human world, they would not be afraid. They were confident that the demons could kill them.","But now, Chu Yunfan had defeated them all single-handedly. He knew that this was the only way."]},{"number":1507,"title":"Chapter 1507 The Ultimate West Demon League Is Destroyed","paragraphs":["1507 The Ultimate West Demon League Is Destroyed","The demons were selfish, and they were cold and brutal.","If the situation had changed, Golden Lion King would not have chosen to stay behind if there was even the slightest chance. From the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed just now, if he stayed behind, he would have no chance of winning and would only die.","However, it was precisely because he understood the cruelty of the demons that he had to stay and stop them. If no one took care of his tribe, no matter how powerful it was, it would be annexed by others.","Without a Core to oversee the tribe, the tribe was too weak in the Ultimate West Demon League. It was at the mercy of others. Therefore, he had a favor to ask of the other two demon kings. He had to exchange his death for their care. He didn’t know if they could do it, but at least there was a chance.","If it was Gray Ape King and Demon Cat King who were blocking Chu Yunfan, they wouldn’t be able to stop him for long. When Chu Yunfan caught up to Golden Lion King, he would also die.","Thinking of this, his huge face revealed a self-deprecating expression. He did not expect that he, the famous and majestic Golden Lion King, would actually have such a day.","The other two demon kings exchanged glances and heaved a sigh of relief. With Golden Lion King holding down the fort, they surely had enough time to get out. No one wanted to die if they could survive.","Chu Yunfan was as strong as a monster. It was impossible for him to be defeated. Even if they joined forces, they would not have a chance of winning. The only thing they could do now was to leave.","Who would still remember their previous target? It would be good enough if they could survive. What Ginseng King? They didn’t even dare to think about it.","Thinking of this, the two demon kings hurriedly turned around and stepped on a beam of light to escape.","“Did I say you can leave?” Chu Yunfan took a step forward and instantly caught up with them.","“I’m your opponent!” Golden Lion King roared.","He surged forward to block Chu Yunfan. Its originally golden fur had long turned gray because of Chu Yunfan’s repeated attacks, but at this moment, it looked a little red.","A terrifying power was boiling within. He was circulating a secret technique to increase his strength. He didn’t expect to defeat Chu Yunfan, but at the very least, he wanted to delay Chu Yunfan and buy time for the Gray Ape King and Demon Cat King.","The most important thing was to warn the Ultimate West Demon League that there was such a high-level expert among the humans of Great Wei. They had to find a way to kill him.","From the information they had collected, it didn’t take much time for Chu Yunfan to appear and become the number one in the world. When such a person grew up, he would be like a rocket, and he would definitely be a great threat to the Ultimate West Demon League in the future.","“Block me? Can you?” Chu Yunfan roared and stomped down with his foot. It was the Nine Netherworld Stomps.","Golden Lion King, who was supposed to be sent flying by the kick, was able to withstand the stomp. He didn’t move and still stood in front of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s face finally revealed a serious expression, and then he sneered. “You probably think that’s all I have. I’ll let you see my true strength!”","He retracted his fist and all the mana in his body turned into a fist force that filled the sky. In this instant, he turned from the omnipotent lightning god into a boxing grandmaster. The aura of a grandmaster boiled and spread through the sky, turning into a storm.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan threw a punch. This move consumed too much energy. Under normal circumstances, Chu Yunfan was unwilling to use it. However, Golden Lion King was too troublesome. Although he was no match for Chu Yunfan, he was enough to stall Chu Yunfan.","But Chu Yunfan didn’t have that much time to dawdle around.","This punch transformed into eight images behind Chu Yunfan. They were the eight heavenly dragons. At this moment, the dragons merged into a terrifying power that condensed into a torrent that swept toward Golden Lion King.","Golden Lion King knew that he had reached the critical moment. Whether he could stall for time depended on this attack. He roared and his body swelled. Instead of retreating, he advanced and attacked the punch.","Bam!","The punch landed directly on Golden Lion King’s body. He did not move, but Chu Yunfan’s fist force did not decrease. In an instant, the punch pierced through him.","Golden Lion King tried to block Chu Yunfan, but he had underestimated Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan’s strength was beyond his imagination. Chu Yunfan’s strength was already terrifying, not to mention that he had used a powerful fist technique like the Eight Astonishing Punches.","This punch turned Golden Lion King into a rain of blood that filled the sky. In an instant, with the point of collision as the center, the blood spread in all directions like a cloud. One could imagine how terrifying this attack was. The treasury trembled slightly, and the sky above shook violently.","As for Demon Cat King and Gray Ape King, they instantly sensed the battle behind them. A terrifying shockwave swept across their bodies. They hurriedly transformed into their human forms and set up a barrier to protect themselves.","As they turned their heads, they saw the scene. The extremely powerful Golden Lion King, which even they did not dare to provoke, had been smashed into pieces by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Chu Yunfan was catching up with them. Every time he stepped on a lightning ripple, his entire body seemed to accelerate like a rocket. His entire body was like a sharp arrow, shooting toward them.","“Split up!”","The two demon kings instantly felt their hair stand on end. They immediately made this decision and fled in differnt directions in tacit understanding. At this time, if one could escape, one would. They could only hope that Chu Yunfan wasn’t chasing after them.","When Chu Yunfan saw the two split up and escape, he sneered. The lightning power filled the sky under his feet, and he instantly disappeared. When he reappeared, he had already caught up to the Demon Cat King.","Chu Yunfan stomped down.","Bam!","The Demon Cat King’s spine was stepped on, and her body fell to the ground. With a miserable cry, she was turned into minced meat by Chu Yunfan’s Nine Netherworld Stomps.","Chu Yunfan immediately chased after Gray Ape King. The ape king was heavily injured and could not escape quickly. Chu Yunfan caught up and killed him with a slash."]},{"number":1508,"title":"Chapter 1508 Three Herb Kings in Hand, Obtaining a Fortune","paragraphs":["1508 Three Herb Kings in Hand, Obtaining a Fortune","At this point, the only expert sent by the Ultimate West Demon League was Flying Bat King, who was nailed to the ground and on the verge of death. However, he did not have much ability to move at this moment. It was just that the vitality of a Core Former was shockingly high. That was why he could survive until now.","But in the end, he couldn’t escape death. He was beheaded by Chu Yunfan’s finger sword.","Then, Chu Yunfan threw the mountain-like corpses of these demons to the base of the Brahma Tree. The tree absorbed the blood essence of these demons.","These were all Cores. The preciousness of their corpses could be imagined, especially the corpses of Core Formers. It could be said that they were priceless.","At the same time, the spirit stones in Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram were being consumed at a rapid speed. They turned into a long river of spirit energy that filled the sky and surged into the herb mountain.","This was why Chu Yunfan often felt that he did not have enough spirit stones. Fortunately, he had obtained a lot of benefits by killing these demon kings. The place where these demons hid their things was in their inner world, which was different from humans.","Before they were killed by Chu Yunfan, these demon kings were very strong. They has exploded their inner world and these things fell into the spatial turbulence, leaving only a part of them. However, even so, they still held hundreds of millions of Spirit Stones. For Chu Yunfan, who was in urgent need of spirit stones, this solved his urgent need.","A hundred million spirit stones was enough for Chu Yunfan to use for a period of time. He did not have to be forced into a desperate situation where he did not have any spirit stones to use.","Chu Yunfan was about to leave when he suddenly felt a fluctuation in the surrounding space. Although it was only a slight fluctuation, it could not hide from his perception.","“Break!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and reached out with one hand, tearing the space that flashed past. The entire space collapsed in front of him. He saw that there was another space in this space. In this other space, there were three Herb Kings that had already taken shape.","Yes, they were Herb Kings.","“A thousand-year-old Chinese Knotweed King and two King Ginsengs!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up.","It turned out that there was not only one Ginseng King in this herb garden, but three other top-grade Herb Kings.","Chu Yunfan was overjoyed. It was easy to find ordinary medicinal herbs, but Herb Kings was a little harder to find than ordinary heavenly and earthly treasures. It was usually very difficult for a force to have the foundation and strength to cultivate a Herb King. The amount of strength and energy required for this process was simply too shocking.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had exposed their disguise, the three Herb Kings instinctively used the Earth Escape Technique to escape. These Herb Kings were the essence of plants and vegetation, and they were born with the Earth Escape Technique, which was extremely powerful.","Therefore, it was very difficult for ordinary people to find these Herb Kings. Even if they saw them, they would not be able to catch them. They would instantly disappear without a trace. Only experts like the Alchemist Association had the means to restrain them.","If one were to say that the Alchemist Association was an expert in this aspect, then Chu Yunfan, who had inherited the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, was simply a great grandmaster.","Chu Yunfan stomped his foot, and countless electric currents spread out like a spider web. The three Herb Kings had just used the Earth Escape Technique to burrow underground when they were immediately shaken up. Their Earth Escape Technique lost its effect. Chu Yunfan’s lightning power had penetrated into every inch of the ground, it was impossible for them to escape. They would be electrocuted.","“Wow!”","Seeing that they couldn’t escape with the Earth Escape Technique, the three Herb Kings didn’t dare to stay any longer. They all flew up into the sky and fled. They didn’t even have the thought of resisting. Just now, they had seen with their own eyes how Chu Yunfan had defeated all the demon kings of the Ultimate West Demon League and slaughtered them.","They understood how terrifying this man was.","“It’s too late to leave!” Chu Yunfan roared and reached out with his hand.","One of the Ginseng Kings was instantly caught and fell down abruptly. On his body, a seal word suddenly appeared. This seal word sealed all of his divine power, causing him to fall directly to the ground, smashing a huge pit on the ground.","Soon after, the Chinese Knotweed King and the other Ginseng King were also unable to escape. If they managed to escape, it would be very difficult for Chu Yunfan to catch them. However, their flying speed was far inferior to the speed of their tunneling. In front of Chu Yunfan, it was even more insignificant.","Chu Yunfan laughed out loud. This trip was really worth it.","The value of the Herb King was so great that even the Alchemist Association and the Ultimate West Demon League would fight to the death for one of them. Now that he had obtained three, it could naturally be considered a great harvest.","Chu Yunfan wiped out the intelligence of the three Herb Kings and replanted them on the herb mountain. The three Herb Kings each occupied a space and began to absorb spirit energy crazily. Under the nourishment of the herb mountain, they grew healthily.","Chu Yunfan nodded with satisfaction. The three Herb Kings had extraordinary medicinal effects. The Chinese Knotweed could revive the near-dead even if it was not used to make medicine. As long as there was a breath, they could be saved.","As for the two Ginseng Kings, they were even more amazing. Ordinary people could completely recover from any illness with just a whiff of the medicinal scent. Even if they were not made into medicinal pills, they could increase one’s cultivation if consumed.","The two Ginseng Kings added together were useful for Chu Yunfan. He had the memory inheritance of the Alchemy Emperor. In the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, there were many pill recipes that could maximize the medicinal effects of the Ginseng Kings.","This was especially true for Chu Yunfan. His cultivation realm and combat strength were severely unequal, so it was ten times more difficult for him to break through compared to people of the same level.","At that time, these two Ginseng Kings would be of great use. It might even help Chu Yunfan break through another major realm. These were things that could not be bought with money.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan was very satisfied. He had gained a lot this time. However, his gaze immediately turned cold. After helping the Alchemist Association capture the Ginseng King, what he did now was his own business.","It was time to look for Nine Star’s sect master to settle the score.","Chu Yunfan stepped on a beam of light and disappeared."]},{"number":1509,"title":"Chapter 1509 Violet Lightning Peach","paragraphs":["1509 Violet Lightning Peach","The treasury was large and winding. Chu Yunfan shuttled through the passages at lightning speed. He still had many things to do in this treasury.","Other than the Ultimate West Demon League, he had many enemies. Other than Nine Star’s sect master, he also had old grudges with Jinzhanghan and the Netherworld Sect. If he met them, he would have to deal with them.","Chu Yunfan passed by many alchemy rooms, but there were no more pills in them. Even the dried herbs were gone. It was not because they had been taken away by these masters who came in. On the contrary, they had been exhausted a long time ago.","However, Chu Yunfan understood after thinking about it. After the Violet Thunder Swords failed in their expedition to an unknown place. It did not take long for them to fall into decline. The sect’s encampment was even captured.","However, even if it was described in the history books as a very short time, it could not be flattened overnight. It must have gone through a period of struggle. At the moment of life and death, if there were these medicinal pills and herbs, it was naturally impossible to not use them. They would definitely use the herbs all at once. Only the medicinal herbs that had not matured and were not used in the medicinal garden had remained untouched","It was completely different from what everyone had imagined. Not only were the pills gone, but there were also many armors, magic tools, and the like. All that was left were empty shelves covered with thick layers of dust. They had probably been taken out and used during the Violet Thunder Sword’s defense.","Along the way, Chu Yunfan met many people who were still shuttling through these winding passages. However, they were too slow and couldn’t keep up with him. They only saw a flash of light that came and disappeared.","Chu Yunfan noticed that these people were all heading in the same direction. He immediately had an idea and flew in the same direction. In just a moment, he arrived at another huge valley. When he arrived, he found that it was already crowded with people.","Most of the people who came in were gathered here. Moreover, these people were divided into two groups. One group was led by the Left King of Jinzhanghan and the leader of the Netherworld Sect, the largest sect in Jinzhanghan. They were basically experts of these two forces.","On the other side was the master of the Mysteries Pavilion, followed by a large number of experts. There were many of them, but their strength was slightly inferior to the alliance between Jinzhanghan and the Netherworld Sect.","It was a confrontation.","The Mysteries Pavilion had many people, but most of them were experts from all over the world. Their origins were complicated, but they were now in a confrontation with the Netherworld Sect and Jinzhanghan.","Chu Yunfan took a closer look and saw that in the depths of the valley, there was a scene of lightning and thunder. In the sky, the thick clouds looked as if the sky was about to collapse. Countless bolts of lightning surged out of it.","“You’d better leave. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being impolite,” the Left King said.","“That’s right. If you don’t leave, then you can lie down and leave,” the Netherworld Sect Master said without any hesitation.","With the appearance of these two leaders, the experts of Jinzhanghan and the Netherworld Sect also released terrifying auras, trying to scare the crowd away.","“Since we’re here, we should all share. Jinzhanghan and Netherworld Sect are so nosy. Do you think we don’t know that there is a Violet Lightning Peach in there?” the Mysteries pavilion master said coldly.","“That’s right. We’re all here, so we should share.”","“This depends on one’s abilities. Why does Jinzhanghan constantly want to chase people away?”","“We’re not to be trifled with.”","At that moment, the experts of Mysteries Pavilion spoke up. They were not willing to give up just like that. If it was any other time, it would be impossible for them to fight against these two giants. However, with the number of people on their side, they had nothing to fear.","“What Violet Peach? I’ve never even heard of such a thing.” The Left King sneered. “I will not be swayed by you, Mysteries pavilion master. You’re an old thing that toys with people’s hearts!”","The Left King bluntly called the Mysteries pavilion master an old thing.","The pavilion master’s expression darkened and he said, “Everyone knows whether I lied or not. If I hadn’t calculated the time today, would you have been able to enter?”","The pavilion master was very direct. Everyone nodded. They would not be deceived by the Left King. If it was fake, why would the Left King stop them?","“Violet Lightning Peaches grow from the Violet Lightning Peach Tree that the Violet Thunder Swords obtained. After consuming it, one’s physical body will change, attaining a lightning physique. The speed of one’s cultivation of lightning techniques will advance by leaps and bounds, turning one into a peerless genius. In the past, every generation’s successor of the Violet Thunder Swords would have to consume a Violet Lightning Peach to change their physique before they could cultivate the sect’s supreme sword art. But this peach tree disappeared a long time ago. Only one of the Violet Lightning Peaches had been preserved in this special environment until now,” the pavilion master of the Mysteries Pavilion said slowly.","Everyone’s breathing quickened. They didn’t know what the Violet Lightning Peach was before, but now they knew.","This was especially true for the Violet Thunder Swords, which was a colossus that stood above the three kingdoms. The sect leader of the Violet Thunder Swords was the number one expert in the world. Even the sect leader of every generation of the Violet Thunder Swords had to consume this thing to transform their physique. Naturally, there was no need to say much about it.","In particular, lightning techniques were famous and powerful existences among many divine powers. It was definitely one of the top divine powers among the many divine powers.","However, not everyone was able to cultivate lightning power. However, some people were born with the physique suitable for learning the lightning power. Once they learned it, their cultivation would advance by leaps and bounds.","The Violet Lightning Peach had such an effect. How could this not make their breathing quicken?","If they were to obtain it, they would probably surpass their current realm and become the number one in the world.","The Left King’s and the Netherworld Sect’s master’s eyes turned sharp. They did not expect the pavilion master to be so ruthless as to announce the news. It was obvious that these people would not let the matter rest easily."]},{"number":1510,"title":"Chapter 1510 The Battle Begins, Fishing in Muddy Waters","paragraphs":["1510 The Battle Begins, Fishing in Muddy Waters","At the thought of this, both parties looked at each other and immediately understood each other’s intentions.","“Stop them!”","As soon as they finished speaking, the two of them directly flew toward the endless lightning in the depths of the valley.","“D*mn it!”","The pavilion master roared and flew in with a beam of light under his feet.","“Don’t even think about getting past me!” A Core Jinzhanghan warrior stood out, blocking the pavilion master’s path.","“You dare to stop me? Maybe the Left King could have done it. Die!” the pavilion master shouted coldly and clawed out. The attack transformed into endless lightning that pierced through the chest of this warrior, causing his heart to explode.","When everyone saw this scene, they sucked in a breath of cold air. They knew very well that the pavilion master’s deduction ability was the best in the world. Many secrets in the world couldn’t escape their eyes. However, no one expected that he would be so powerful. A late-stage Void Core was killed in one attack. One could imagine how powerful he was.","Because the pavilion master rarely made a move, most people did not know what martial arts and divine arts he cultivated. However, when he made a move, everyone immediately knew that what he cultivated was none other than martial arts and divine arts related to the lightning. Everyone finally understood why he would go against the two behemoths to obtain this Violet Lightning Peach.","With his cultivation of lightning techniques, if he had another Violet Lightning Peach to change his physique and make it suitable for him to cultivate lightning techniques, one could imagine that his cultivation of lightning techniques would immediately advance by leaps and bounds. It was even possible for him to make another breakthrough and reach the late Core Form Stage, or even the peak.","Based on the situation of the Violet Thunder Sword’s sect masters of the past, this was an inevitable process. The pavilion master might even become the number one in the world. No wonder he would offend Jinzhanghan and the Netherworld Sect.","For martial artists who cultivated other martial arts and divine powers, the Violet Lightning Peach could only be considered rare. However, for martial artists who cultivated lightning, it was undoubtedly a divine item.","In the distance, Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up when he saw this. He naturally knew about the Violet Lightning Peach. The Alchemy Emperor’s knowledge was broad, and there were very few things in the world that he was unaware of.","The Violet Lightning Peach was a rare sacred treasure for cultivating lightning techniques even in the Ancient Zenith Civilization. It was enough to be the treasure of a sect. Unfortunately, according to the pavilion master, this Violet Lightning Peach had long disappeared. Otherwise, it would be priceless. It was not something that anything could compare to.","Its value was only slightly inferior to the Brahma Tree. The reason why it was said to be slightly inferior was not because the Violet Lightning Peach’s effect was inferior to the Brahma Tree. In fact, the Violet Lightning Peach’s effect was even more obvious to experts who cultivated lightning. However, to experts who cultivated other martial arts and divine powers, the effect was not so great. t was not like the Brahma Tree, which was useful to all cultivators. Just this alone multiplied the Brahma Tree’s value by several times.","But even so, just one Violet Lightning Peach was worth an astonishing amount. It was worth it for Chu Yunfan to make a move.","The pavilion master needed this Violet Lightning Peach, but Chu Yunfan needed it even more. He didn’t need the Violet Lightning Peach to improve his physique. His Thunderclap Physique had already been integrated into the Imperial Physique, and his physique was already a first-class tyrannical lightning-type physique. The Violet Lightning Peach wasn’t enough to change him, but it could increase his cultivation greatly.","Ordinary people couldn’t do anything with the Violet Lightning Peach, but to him, it was a great tonic. Even if he couldn’t get it, he couldn’t let the Netherworld Sect sect master, the Left King or the pavilion master obtain it.","Chu Yunfan had a grudge against these people.","While Chu Yunfan was hesitating, the entire scene became chaotic. The experts brought by the pavilion master clashed with the experts of the Netherworld Sect and Jinzhanghan.","The Mysteries Pavilion wanted a share of the loot, while Jinzhanghan and Netherworld Sect wanted to stall them. For a moment, the entire scene was extremely chaotic, and a great battle broke out.","Among these people, two figures managed to break free from the obstruction. One of them was a thin middle-aged man. He was filled with a sinister aura and looked quite strange. However, he held a sword and charged forward. After splitting the encirclement of two Netherworld Sect members, he gave chase.","There was also an old woman holding a dragon-headed crutch. She looked white-haired and wrinkled, but she was extremely powerful. The dragon-headed crutch felt like a weapon of the utmost strength. With one strike, she smashed a general of Jinzhanghan and instantly killed him.","Although Jinzhanghan and the Netherworld Sect had received the death order, they dared not stop the two of them. They had no choice but to let them go. However, they were not so polite to the others. The battle broke out instantly.","Just as their line of defense was re-established, Chu Yunfan turned into a golden light and disappeared.","“Who are you?” a Jinzhanghan warrior shouted as he felt a golden light pass by him. In the next moment, his head was cut off and sent flying.","The speed was too fast, so fast that no one noticed it and it had already ended. If the old woman was extremely strong and powerful, then this golden light represented the supreme principle of martial arts. Before they could see what had happened, it had already ended. How could they stop Chu Yunfan?","“Who is that?” someone cried out in surprise. They hadn’t noticed Chu Yunfan hiding among them. It was only when Chu Yunfan suddenly attacked that they reacted.","After Chu Yunfan crossed the blockade line, he chased after the crowd. However, he did not follow too closely because he knew that it was not time yet.","Although he was not afraid, the five people in front of him were not easy to deal with. None of them were simple. If the five of them joined forces, even he would have a headache."]},{"number":1511,"title":"Chapter 1511 An All-Out Fight","paragraphs":["1511 An All-Out Fight","It was not difficult to tell with Chu Yunfan’s strength. Whether it was the Left King, the sect master of the Netherworld Sect, or the master of the Mysteries Pavilion, they were the world’s top experts. They were all in the intermediate Core Form Stage.","The other middle-aged man and the old woman were slightly weaker, but they were still much stronger than the Right King. They were in the early stage of the Core Form Stage.","Once one entered the Core Form Stage, one would be a kingdom guardian. Chu Yunfan was not afraid of any one of them, but the five of them working together was a very troublesome matter. Therefore, he hid his aura so that others would not be able to discover him, especially in this environment where lightning was flying about.","It was an environment specially prepared for him, allowing him to be like a fish in water.","Because he had the constitution of the Thunderclap Physique, he could absorb lightning energy at will without fear of being injured. However, the other five people were not as good as Chu Yunfan. For them, the lightning energy was very dangerous.","A random bolt of lightning was not too dangerous for them, but thousands were enough to pose a fatal threat to them. For this reason, they all activated their protective energy shields to protect themselves. Even so, they still had to be careful. If they were not careful, their defenses could be broken and they would die.","Moreover, the closer they got to the depths of the valley, the denser the lightning energy became, and the more dangerous it became. They had to be careful.","Chu Yunfan swaggered behind them. He was still in the mood to observe the environment. This kind of valley had a special name in the world—Thunderbolt Valley. No one knew how it was formed, but there were some special places in the world that would gather countless lightning energy, forming a scene where countless lightning forces were rampant.","Chu Yunfan was unable to come into contact with this level, but from the memory of the Alchemy Emperor, he knew that it was formed because the lightning was too dense in some places. Similarly, there were also flames, storms, and so on.","Chu Yunfan clicked his tongue in wonder. After all, he hadn’t reached the stage where he could understand these phenomena.","In this Thunderbolt Valley, he noticed that there was an altar in the deepest part of the valley. On the altar was a peach about the size of a fist. Compared to ordinary peaches, this peach was purple-blue in color. It did not look like a peach, but a work of art.","“It really is a Violet Thunder Peach!” Chu Yunfan clicked his tongue in wonder. Only such an environment could preserve a Violet Thunder Peach until now by continuously absorbing the lightning energy between heaven and earth.","He knew that a Violet Thunder Peach Tree should have been planted here. In an ordinary environment, the tree would never have survived. It could only survive in Thunderbolt Valley.","“D*mn it! Sword Demon and Dragon Granny are here as well!” Netherworld Sect’s master glanced behind him and felt that it was extremely troublesome.","Just the pavilion master alone was already troublesome, let alone Sword Demon and Dragon Granny, two apex experts who had once shaken the world. It was only because they had not come out of retirement in recent years that not many people knew about them, but all those who were slightly older knew.","Although their strength was slightly weaker than theirs, it wouldn’t matter if it was under normal circumstances. But f they joined forces with the pavilion master, they could pose a huge threat to him and the Left King.","“D*mned fellow!” the sect master said gloomily.","This was all brought on by the pavilion master. If he hadn’t been a big mouth and told everyone everything, there wouldn’t have been so many people coming from all over the world. They wouldn’t have had such a difficult time.","“Why don’t we kill these three old fellows first then?” the Left King said as he halted to a stop. “Otherwise, it’ll be troublesome when the time comes.”","The sect master nodded. He agreed to fight first. After all, only five of them were qualified to compete. In that case, they should just fight first.","The pavilion master instantly understood their plan. He shouted, “Sword Demon! Dragon Granny! We have to join forces or they’ll cut us down!”","Sword Demon and Dragon Granny caught up to them and stood on either side of the pavilion master. It was clear that they were planning to join forces with him. Without the pavilion master, they would not have been a match for the two before them.","“In that case, there’s no need for words. Let’s see the truth in our hands!” Dragon Granny sneered.","Immediately, a great battle erupted. Five Core Formers erupted together. What kind of concept was that? It was a terrifying attack that could blast the entire valley into pieces. Only after a long period of reinforcement could it withstand such an attack.","The sect master and the Left King joined forces. Although they had fewer people, they were stronger. For a moment, they were in a stalemate, just like the battle outside.","However, what they didn’t know was that while they were fighting to the death, Chu Yunfan had entered the Mountain River Diagram. He was just sitting back and watching the shocking show.","If they knew about this, they would probably be in a mess.","The battle reached a white-hot stage. Everyone was furious. All kinds of methods were held back previously, but now they completely erupted. But just as the two sides were about to take another step forward, an angry roar came from the depths of the sky. Immediately after, a dark blue figure flew over. Its body that was like a small mountain gave everyone a huge pressure.","Everyone stopped fighting and turned around. In the deepest part of the Thunderbolt Valley, there was a huge beast formed by lightning staring at the people outside.","“Oh my, it’s a ferocious beast formed from pure lightning. I can’t believe I get to see such a good thing here!” Chu Yunfan said in disbelief.","It was a hundred times more difficult to create a living creature with pure natural elements than it was for a plant spirit like the Herb King. It was impossible for such a thing to develop in a normal environment. It was only possible in extreme environments.","Chu Yunfan took a closer look and saw that this ferocious beast was made up of lightning energy. It was extremely pure and clear blue. Its body was covered with countless scales that flickered with lightning, and its eyes flickered with a fierce light.","If not for the fact that there were so many people outside and their auras were terrifying, the creature would have rushed out and started a massacre."]},{"number":1512,"title":"Chapter 1512 Obtaining the Violet Lightning Peach","paragraphs":["1512 Obtaining the Violet Lightning Peach","The strength of this ferocious beast of lightning was probably above everyone else and not inferior to the khan of Jinzhanghan. It was probably at the late Core Form Stage. Even though this sort of elemental beast was relatively simple, it was dangerous. Their divine arts were often difficult to deal with.","This lightning beast emitted an extremely terrifying aura, and its huge lantern-like eyes stared at everyone. There was no need to think too much. Everyone instantly reached an agreement to deal with this lightning beast first. Otherwise, this beast would surely take advantage of them.","The five experts stopped immediately. They didn’t even wait and charged at this lightning beast. Although the strength of these people was much weaker than the lightning beast’s, they had an advantage in numbers. They could be said to be the top experts in the entire world.","The martial arts and divine powers they knew were all top-notch. Although this lightning beast was powerful, there was no doubt that it was being beaten back for a while and could not gain the upper hand. The strength of everyone working together was shocking, especially at this critical moment. No one wanted to fail at the last step, so they all took out their trump cards.","For a time, the entire depths of Thunderbolt Valley collapsed. These Core Formers attacked with all their might. Their strength was not something that ordinary people could imagine.","Chu Yunfan followed the battlefield into the depths of the Thunderbolt Valley. In the battle between the six masters, no one noticed that there was another person. Chu Yunfan’s method of concealing his aura was too strong. In addition, among the countless lightning bolts, this place was his home ground which helped him to conceal his aura.","The further they went in, the closer Chu Yunfan got to the Violet Thunder Peach. Suddenly, the ferocious beast that was being beaten back seemed to notice something. It looked in Chu Yunfan’s direction with its fierce eyes.","It sensed Chu Yunfan’s existence at this critical moment.","“Rrrraggh!”","The lightning beast left the others behind and headed in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","At this moment, the others also realized that there was someone there. They were instantly furious. Someone actually dared to take advantage of their battle to pick the peach. It was simply a great humiliation.","Suddenly, five humans and one elemental beast flew toward Chu Yunfan. When he noticed these experts, he sneered and said, “You noticed me, but it’s too late!”","He didn’t bother to hide anymore. He reached out with one hand and grabbed the Violet Thunder Peach.","Boom!","A purple enchantment appeared around the Violet Thunder Peach, but Chu Yunfan shattered it. This enchantment was only to ensure that the essence of the Violet Thunder Peach would not be lost due to the passage of time. It had the function of freezing time, but it was not very powerful in terms of protection. After all, this was the depths of the treasury. Under normal circumstances, no enemy would be able to reach this place.","Chu Yunfan grabbed the peach. From behind him, the lightning beast rushed up and grabbed at Chu Yunfan. The beast was fast. It was a beast formed by lightning energy, so its speed was even more shocking. Just as it was about to touch Chu Yunfan, the space around him shook violently and he disappeared without a trace.","Boom!","The place where Chu Yunfan had been standing was torn to pieces by this huge claw, but it didn’t catch anyone.","“Rrrraaaaagh!”","The beast roared angrily as if its most important thing had been stolen.","“D*mn it, who was it?!” The five experts who had followed behind were furious.","“It was Jian Wuchen!”","The pavilion master instantly recognized this person. Who else could it be but Jian Wuchen, who had caused such a huge commotion that even the pavilion master had to lower his head to? Although it was only for a moment, he was sure of what he saw.","“D*mn it! How dare you take our peach!” The sect master was furious.","“You have to find him. I don’t believe that he simply vanished. He must be here!”","Everyone else was similarly furious. They had worked so hard, yet they had not even managed to touch the Violet Thunder Peach before someone took advantage of them.","Immediately, their divine wills spread out in all directions, trying to find Chu Yunfan, but unfortunately, the lightning energy here was too dense. The endless thunderbolts hurt their divine wills, causing their senses to drop by several levels. However, they didn’t know how to sense Chu Yunfan, who had already entered the Mountain River Diagram.","The lightning beast was furious that it couldn’t find the Violet Thunder Peach. In the eyes of the Left King and the others, Chu Yunfan had picked up a bargain, but to this lightning beast, these humans were all the same. It immediately saw them as a group, and in a flash, it appeared right in front of Sword Demon and slapped him.","Sword Demon did not have time to dodge. His strength was at the bottom of the pack, and he could only pin down the beast in the exchange earlier. How could he face it head-on?","He was slapped and sent flying.","Bam!","Sword Demon was sent flying and spat out a mouthful of blood. He felt as if his body was about to be shattered by the attack. He was in the Core Form Stage, and there was no doubt about the strength of his physical body, but this beast was too shocking!","“B*stard, you need to be fierce!”","“Die!” the sect master shouted. He rushed forward with a sword in his hand and swept out a shocking sword light.","It was not that he wanted to save Sword Demon, but rather, the beast was simply too terrifying. Its strength was far above theirs, and it had an elemental body. Even if they attacked, it would be very difficult for them to hurt the beast. Even if they did, the beast would recover immediately because it was an elemental body. After all, it was not a body of flesh and blood, so it was a completely different concept.","The others also came to a realization. No matter what happened to Jian Wuchen, they had to deal with this beast first. Otherwise, none of them would be able to survive.","Thinking of this, they all pounced forward!"]},{"number":1513,"title":"Chapter 1513 Late Void Core Stage! Sword Demon Dies!","paragraphs":["1513 Late Void Core Stage! Sword Demon Dies!","In the meantime, Chu Yunfan grabbed the Violet Thunder Peach and hid in the Mountain River Diagram. Those people immediately lost sight of him.","“Hahahaha!”","Chu Yunfan laughed uproariously. Those people had fought to the death, but in the end, he got the peach. There was nothing better.","He didn’t get along with these people, and every one of them treated him unkindly. However, in the end, he was the one who obtained the Violet Thunder Peach.","Without the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan would have been in a very dangerous situation. Among the five Core Formers, only Sword Demon and Dragon Granny were at the fledging Core Form Stage. The pavilion master, the sect master, and the Left King were all at the intermediate Core Form Stage. Even if their strength was slightly weaker than his, it was not much different.","Not to mention that the lightning beast was at the late Core Form Stage. In terms of strength, it was even stronger than him. Facing the encirclement of these six experts, Chu Yunfan’s final outcome was unpredictable.","He could not go out now. He was sure that the six experts were desperately looking for him.","“Find me if you can!”","Chu Yunfan laughed. He held the Violet Thunder Peach in his hand. It looked like the crystallization of lightning. It was completely transparent, but Chu Yunfan could sense that it contained extremely terrifying energy.","“Most people wouldn’t be able to do anything even if they obtained the Violet Thunder Peach, but for me, it’s a supreme tonic. I have the Thunderclap Physique, and with the Celestial Devouring Art, I can completely absorb this peach. My Thunderclap Physique will be strengthened, and my understanding of the lightning will also further improve.”","Now that they were fighting outside, he could cultivate in the Mountain River Diagram. When he went out, he would be able to give them a big surprise.","“Hahaha, this is a great time to train!”","Chu Yunfan was in a good mood. He sat cross-legged and floated in the air, swallowing the Violet Thunder Peach. The fruit melted as soon as it entered his mouth. It immediately transformed into a terrifying lightning energy that rushed into every cell of his body.","This only happened to Chu Yunfan. If it was an ordinary person, their cells would be electrocuted on the spot and their entire body would be killed. However, Chu Yunfan was able to absorb this power. His Thunderclap Physique had played a great role. The thunderbolts were not that terrifying to him. Instead, it could be turned into power that he could use.","Chu Yunfan circulated the Celestial Devouring Art. His body turned into a huge beast that devoured the massive amounts of lightning energy in the Violet Thunder Peach.","The energy within the peaches was slowly absorbed by Chu Yunfan. His cultivation was already at the intermediate Void Core Stage. Now, he started to break through to the late Void Core Stage.","Although Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had broken through continuously during this period, his foundation was extremely solid. At this time, the benefits finally showed themselves. He didn’t need to think much. He could absorb this pure lightning energy.","Round after round, Chu Yunfan tried to break through to the late Void Core Stage. His body was like a volcano that was about to erupt. Countless lightning energy erupted from his every pore, forming a powerful lightning storm around him. After a full two hours, he was completely surrounded by the lightning storm that was getting bigger and bigger. Chu Yunfan couldn’t even see his own body.","At a certain moment, this increasingly huge thunderstorm began to shrink. It was like the universe was collapsing, shrinking crazily. In just a moment, it had disappeared without a trace.","Chu Yunfan’s figure was revealed. At this moment, there was no longer a trace of electricity around his body, and he looked completely calm. The reason for this was undoubtedly because he had broken through. During the process of his breakthrough, the mana capacity in his body had reached its peak and he could not go any further.","After breaking through, he absorbed all the lightning energy in one breath and turned it into divine power with the Celestial Devouring Art. The power of this technique was evident from this. No matter what kind of energy it was, it could be completely absorbed and converted for one’s own use.","Chu Yunfan slowly opened his eyes and felt the huge power surging in his body. Although he had just broken through, he could feel that his entire body was surging with powerful divine power. It was not as unstable as when ordinary people had just broken through. His foundation was solid. His previous steady and steady actions of constantly strengthening his foundation finally paid off.","He had just broken through and had already immediately stabilized his cultivation level. Although it was only a breakthrough of one level, Chu Yunfan could feel that he was at least several times stronger than before.","It had reached a shocking level. Even if the khan dared to appear in front of him again, he would show the khan who was going to run this time.","His combat strength charged into the late Core Form Stage!","“This Violet Thunder Peach is really powerful,” Chu Yunfan said, “The most powerful thing about this peach is that it can change a person’s physique. However, it was formed by some special cultivation method that I don’t have.”","Chu Yunfan did not feel that it was a pity. Although he had swallowed the Violet Thunder Peach and it did not change his body, his Thunderclap Physique was already very powerful. The peach just served to strengthen it.","Chu Yunfan stood up and said, “It’s time to go out and end this farce.”","He turned into a bolt of lightning and disappeared. In the next instant, he appeared within Thunderbolt Valley as countless bolts of lightning rained down on him. At the same time, Sword Demon, who was standing beside him, turned pale with fright.","Someone had suddenly appeared in mid-air, and he instinctively swung his sword at the figure. However, this figure exploded with an astonishing aura. An astonishing sword light slashed down at a speed several times faster than his.","Slice!","Sword Demon grunted as he was sliced in half in mid-air, dying instantly."]},{"number":1514,"title":"Chapter 1514 One Person Intimidating Everyone","paragraphs":["1514 One Person Intimidating Everyone","The sudden change shocked everyone. When their eyes swept over the person, they widened their eyes.","It was none other than Chu Yunfan.","When they saw him, they all wanted to tear him to pieces.","“It’s him! He appeared!”","“Kill him and take the Violet Thunder Peach!”","“Kill him!”","A series of shouts rang out. Chu Yunfan opened his eyes and looked at the scene.","At this moment, all the experts present were mixed together and were besieging the lightning beast. Previously, the beast was fierce, but now, it was a little tired, and there were even wounds on its body. It was already shocking enough that it could not recover immediately. The recovery ability of an elemental life form was not something that a human with flesh and blood could compare to.","But after being besieged continuously, the lightning glow on its body had dimmed. Although the beast was very strong, it was still heavily injured by the combined attacks of the various large factions’ experts.","To deal with this crazy beast, the experts had temporarily abandoned their grudges and joined forces to kill the beast. They could tell that this beast was an elemental lifeform. In the body of every elemental lifeform, there was a highly concentrated crystal core, and it was priceless.","Since they had come here, they did not want to leave empty-handed.","However, this thunder beast was in the late Core Form Stage. Although it was jointly injured by the experts, at the same time, the experts also suffered heavy casualties. The bodies of these experts were strewn all over the ground. Chu Yunfan had just come out when he bumped into Sword Demon, who was about to attack.","Sword Demon’s first reaction was to attack Chu Yunfan, but unfortunately, he bumped into Chu Yunfan who had just greatly improved in his cultivation. Chu Yunfan killed him in a single slash.","For a moment, the entire place was dead silent. Only the sound of countless lightning dragons rolling down from above the Thunderbolt Valley could be heard. Chu Yunfan’s performance was too shocking. Sword Demon was one of the five experts present, but he had died so easily at Chu Yunfan’s hands. Even though it was an accident and he was caught off guard, Chu Yunfan’s move still shocked everyone.","Then, there was a wave of curses.","But for some reason, when Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept over them, his cold gaze pierced their hearts like a blade, instantly making the people who were cursing shut up. It was as if they were being targeted by a ferocious beast. It was much more terrifying than that the thunder beast.","Chu Yunfan’s terrifying attack had completely frightened them!","Sword Demon was a Core Former, and if he were to be placed in the world, he would be considered a kingdom guardian. If he was willing to join any kingdom, he would receive the highest standard of treatment. Even if he wanted to establish his own sect, the kingdom would give him the people, the money, and their full support.","Chu Yunfan had instantly killed such an existence!","The others were dumbfounded, especially Jinzhanghan’s Left King, Netherworld Sect’s sect master, Mysteries Pavilion’s master, and Dragon Granny. Their expressions were extremely ugly as they stared at Chu Yunfan.","“He actually dared to appear!” The Left King looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. His eyes were as cold as ice.","“Rrrraaagh!”","The thunder beast was the first to react. When it saw Chu Yunfan, its eyes filled with hatred. The mountain-like figure flew toward Chu Yunfan. Along with its mountain-like body came endless lightning energy, which fell on Chu Yunfan like raindrops.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it. Ripples appeared around his body and he swept his sword out.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s sword landed on the body of the beast. The already heavily injured beast was sent flying.","“Quiet down. It’s not your turn yet!”","Everyone was once again shocked by Chu Yunfan. After besieging the beast and suffering heavy casualties, they failed to take it down. But when the beast faced Chu Yunfan, it was so weak that it was sent flying by Chu Yunfan’s sword.","Of course, the beast was now heavily injured and its strength had been greatly reduced, but this meant Chu Yunfan’s strength was even more powerful.","‘W-Was Jian Wuchen ever this strong?’","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. For the first time, they truly realized how terrifying this black-robed young man was. It was not what they had thought.","“Kill him! He’s just one person. He only killed Sword Demon. Sword Demon was already heavily injured and weak, so it’s not a big deal for him to be killed off in a moment of surprise!” the Left King said loudly.","Everyone calmed down when they heard his words. Although Chu Yunfan’s two strikes were shocking, the opponents he faced were not at their peak. They were all heavily injured. He was simply taking advantage of them.","Moreover, as powerful as that beast was, wasn’t it on the verge of collapse under their siege? They would have defeated it anytime now. Experts of that level shouldn’t be able to withstand their fearless joint attacks!","At this moment, the experts of Jinzhanghan roared and rushed toward Chu Yunfan. They were all soldiers, and their obedience to the Left King’s orders was unwavering.","When the others saw Jinzhanghan rushing to the front line, they all roared and rushed forward. For a moment, it was as if they could see the scene from when everyone was besieging the lightning beast. However, the next scene was beyond everyone’s expectations.","Facing these people’s attacks, Chu Yunfan smiled disdainfully.","Stab!","Chu Yunfan’s sword pierced a Core general of Jinzhanghan standing before him in the throat. A flower of blood bloomed!"]},{"number":1515,"title":"Chapter 1515 Easily Killing Core Formers","paragraphs":["1515 Easily Killing Core Formers","As the blood bloomed, the general clutched his throat and stared at Chu Yunfan with his mouth agape. He never expected to be so vulnerable in front of Chu Yunfan. And this slaughter was only the beginning.","Chu Yunfan finally displayed the terrifying scene of a swordsman killing.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","Terrifying sword light swept out, and there was no excess sword light scattered. A sword light condensed from lightning was formed. With a single slash, these experts died one after another. None of them used a second slash. No matter what kind of defense they had, their protective aura was pierced through by Chu Yunfan’s sword. Their armor was shattered by the sword, and then their throats were instantly pierced.","There were no exceptions.","Chu Yunfan seemed slow but was actually fast. In a moment, he had already walked through the entire scene.","The next moment, these people who were arrogant and despotic earlier and wanted to kill Chu Yunfan all fell down one by one with their hands clutching their throats. It made no difference whether they were Divines or Cores.","At this moment, only Dragon Granny, the pavilion master, the sect master, and the Left King were still standing. These people were their subordinates, and they never expected them to be slaughtered by Chu Yunfan so easily.","This scene was too shocking!","Everyone’s faces were ashen, but strangely, under this extreme anger, they did not say anything. They were extremely angry, but at the same time, their fear of Chu Yunfan had also risen to the extreme.","They were all Core Formers, so they understood how amazing Chu Yunfan’s move was. They too could kill people, but definitely not as easily as Chu Yunfan had. This showed that his strength was high about these people. If he was without a sword, he could still replicate what had happened just now and kill all these people with a withered branch, not to mention he was holding one right now.","Everyone could feel that Chu Yunfan’s aura was even more terrifying than before, and it was several times more terrifying. It was not difficult to guess the reason behind this. Without a doubt, it was the Violet Thunder Peach.","Thinking of this, the anger in their hearts rose. They had worked hard to fight that lightning beast, but Chu Yunfan had plucked the peach without saying a word. Moreover, he had even used the peach to raise his strength to this extent.","When they thought of this, they could not tolerate it.","“Let’s attack together and kill him!” the Left King shouted and took the lead. The others also attacked Chu Yunfan from four directions.","There was no need to say anything. When they surrounded and attacked the beast earlier, they already had enough tacit understanding.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s position was immediately covered by all kinds of attacks. All kinds of top-notch divine powers and martial arts techniques were thrown at his head. One could imagine how much they hated him.","They did not hold back before. Now, facing Chu Yunfan, they went all out to kill him.","“He’s dead!” Dragon Granny said with a serious expression.","The others also had ashen faces. They had not held back at all in their attacks. Even a late-stage Core Former could not possibly receive them so casually. But in view of Chu Yunfan’s amazing performance, they did not dare to relax.","And true enough, they underestimated Chu Yunfan. After the dust settled, he appeared in front of them. He was not severely injured like what they had imagined. On the contrary, he was completely unharmed.","“How is this possible?!” the Left King said in shock.","“F*ck! How?!” the sect master cursed as if he had been frightened by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s performance was too shocking, but Chu Yunfan was not going to allow time for them to prepare. His figure flashed and he appeared in front of Dragon Granny like a bolt of lightning.","His sword slashed down.","“Damn it! Why did you choose me first? Do you think I’m a pushover? This is too much!” Dragon Granny roared.","Her entire body emitted an extremely terrifying aura. She was extremely angry. There were clearly four people, but Chu Yunfan chose her first. Wasn’t this bullying her because she was the weakest?","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s sword slashed down, and the dragon walking stick in Dragon Granny’s hand was cut in half by the sword light condensed from Chu Yunfan’s lightning energy. It was a little like Sword Demon’s earlier attack. She tried to block it, but how could she?","Dragon Granny was instantly sliced into two and she fell to the ground. Her eyes flashed with disbelief. She had died just like that. She couldn’t even withstand one of Chu Yunfan’s attacks. She died so easily at his hands.","“I’m sorry. I’m not bullying you because you’re the weakest. You were just the closest to me,” Chu Yunfan said softly.","Ever since he swallowed the Violet Thunder Peach, the power of his Thunderclap Physique had increased by a notch and reached another level. The lightning that he casually condensed now had the power of a middle-grade spirit weapon. After condensing it into a sword, it could slash apart other middle-grade spirit weapons. Its power was beyond imagination.","The other three were horrified when they heard his words. What kind of reason was this? They did not dare to stop, and all kinds of terrifying attacks continued to rain on Chu Yunfan. However, he was not injured in the slightest. His physical strength was much stronger than before. After consuming the Violet Thunder Peach, his physical strength increased by another level.","Stab!","The Netherworld Sect’s sect master clutched his throat. His throat had been pierced by the lightning sword light. His eyes were filled with disbelief. Chu Yunfan’s attack was too fast. It was so fast that he couldn’t react in time.","“Second one down,” Chu Yunfan said softly. As he spoke, his figure flashed and he appeared in front of the Left King.","“You monster! I’ll fight you to the death!” the Left King shouted, and the blood-red spear in his hand pierced toward Chu Yunfan at lightning speed.","However, he did not have the time to stab out completely as the sword light was faster than him. His head was instantly sent flying.","“One more.”"]},{"number":1516,"title":"Chapter 1516 Killing the Master of Mysteries Pavilion","paragraphs":["1516 Killing the Master of Mysteries Pavilion","Chu Yunfan felt a little incredulous when he killed the Left King with a single strike. Back then, he couldn’t defeat the Right King and had to take advantage of the fact that the Right King hadn’t completely teleported over. However, time had passed, and now the Left King, who was much stronger than the Right King, could not stop Chu Yunfan.","In just a few short moves, they were all killed.","With his current power, Chu Yunfan was probably even above the khan, who was known as the number one in the world. He was vaguely the number one in the world now. He did not know if there were any old monsters in the world, but so what if there were?","When it came to cultivation, people weren’t more powerful just because they were older. Chu Yunfan could see that many inheritances in the world were incomplete, and their future paths were broken.","This was similar to the situation of the Federation. However, in comparison, the various large factions in the Spirit Realm were destined to follow the same pattern. Their path forward had been cut off, and it would be very difficult to restore the path forward. It was already good enough for a sect to have hundreds of thousands of disciples, but they were all on guard and could not make full use of their strength. There was no way for them to mobilize tens of billions of humans to continue the road ahead like the Federation.","There was not much difference between the sects in the Spirit Realm hundreds of years ago and hundreds of years later. Even if someone’s strength reached a new level, that would only happen to one person.","The Federation was different. Once they broke through, a large number of experts would appear like an oil well. A few hundred years would produce earth-shattering changes in the development of the Federation’s martial arts.","Chu Yunfan was not afraid of any powerful old monsters hiding in this world. This was the situation in the Spirit Realm.","The pavilion master stared at Chu Yunfan. He felt as if he had fallen into an ice cave—as if he had been targeted by a ferocious beast.","“Jian Wuchen, you can’t kill me!” the pavilion master hurriedly said, “We don’t have any deep hatred against each other!”","He was no longer as spirited as before. Before he came, he was full of vigor and thought that he could seize the Violet Thunder Peach and improve his cultivation. He could even become the number one master in the world and compete with the khan.","Who knew that they would encounter such a monster?!","This was beyond his expectations. He had never suffered such a big loss before. All along, he had relied on his ability to calculate and rarely suffered losses. Usually, before heading out the door, he simply read his fortune to know whether he would succeed or not. Who would have thought that this plan would completely fail against Chu Yunfan?","Originally, his predictions showed that he had a high chance of getting what he wanted. It had not indicated that there would be a fatal disaster. There was only one possibility for this situation, and that was that Chu Yunfan was a person with great luck. This kind of person was blessed by heaven and earth. Only then could he escape from his calculations.","“Yes. We didn’t have a deep hatred before,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","Although he had a conflict with the Mysteries Pavilion in the past, it was only to force the Mysteries Pavilion branch to lower its head. To big shots like them, such a conflict was nothing. The person in charge of the Mysteries Pavilion’s branch was blind and had provoked an expert of his level. As long as the people from the Mysteries Pavilion were smart enough, they wouldn’t press the issue.","But that was before.","“When you and the others surrounded me to kill me, things changed.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Jian Wuchen, don’t go too far!” the pavilion master said through gritted teeth.","“Go too far? If I were weaker, would you let me go?” Chu Yunfan said coldly. If there was room for reconciliation between the two sides before, then there was none now.","The power that the Mysteries Pavilion controlled was shocking. Although Chu Yunfan was not afraid, if the Mysteries Pavilion wanted to dig up dirt on him, it was possible for them to do so. Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan wasn’t about to hold back.","“In that case, even if I die, I won’t let you off easily. I want you to die together with me!”","The pavilion master understood that Chu Yunfan would never let him off. If he was in the same position, he would not let go either. It was normal to cut the weeds and remove the roots.","Boom!","A terrifying aura erupted from the pavilion master. It was at least a level higher than before. Countless lightning energy surged around him. He cultivated lightning techniques, so this Thunderbolt Valley was his home ground.","“Thunderstorm Claw!”","The pavilion master roared and reached out with his hand. The entire world shook violently as a bolt of lightning directly grabbed Chu Yunfan.","“Petty tricks!”","Countless thunderbolts gathered around Chu Yunfan’s body and turned into a sword light that swept out.","Slice!","The Thunderstorm Claw was cut off by Chu Yunfan in mid-air.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan launched another attack. In a flash, he arrived in front of the pavilion master. The powerful energy around the pavilion master was instantly torn apart, unable to stop Chu Yunfan’s advance.","“Go to hell,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","He pointed out with his sword that was as fast as a swan. In an instant, it turned into a shocking sword light that pierced through the pavilion master’s throat.","The pavilion master’s protective energy shield instantly exploded, and the defensive spirit armor on his body exploded. All these defenses were like paper in front of Chu Yunfan.","The pavilion master widened his eyes in disbelief. Chu Yunfan was too fast. So fast that he could not react in time. At the same time, the power of this sword was too terrifying and had pierced right through his throat.","He could not imagine how this ordinary sword could have such terrifying power.","All of this took a long time to describe, but it happened in just a short moment. As Chu Yunfan killed the pavilion master with a single sword strike, a body the size of a small mountain flew over. With a loud roar, terrifying lightning energy struck down from the sky.","Boom!","The thunderbolts fell directly on Chu Yunfan’s body, but he didn’t dodge. On the contrary, a vortex seemed to have formed around his body, absorbing the thunderbolts into his body to replenish the consumption of his divine power.","“You should be glad that I didn’t go looking for you. You actually dare to look for trouble with me?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “I guess an animal will always be an animal.”"]},{"number":1517,"title":"Chapter 1517 Battle Strength Greatly Increases, Peak Late Void Core Stage","paragraphs":["1517 Battle Strength Greatly Increases, Peak Late Void Core Stage","If it was any other method, it might pose a threat to Chu Yunfan. However, lightning energy could not hurt him. Instead, he absorbed it all.","Chu Yunfan’s affinity for the lightning was even stronger than this beast’s.","“Rrrraagh!”","The beast’s next attack followed closely. After a violent roar, countless lightning energy turned into waves that swept toward Chu Yunfan. The beast stood on the lightning wave, looking extremely mighty.","Although it was almost forced to a dead end by the siege earlier, it was a late Core Form beast. Once it used its divine powers, it was extremely shocking.","Chu Yunfan no longer needed to hold back because there was no one else presen. He shouted, “Eight Astonishing Punches!” He clenched his fist and pulled it back to his abdomen. Then, he punched out.","The sky collapsed and the earth cracked. Eight huge figures turned into a terrifying torrent in the sky, tearing everything apart. The huge wave formed by lightning energy was instantly shattered. The attack fell on the beast without any reduction in its momentum.","Bam!","The beast let out a miserable cry as it flew backward. It and Chu Yunfan had the combat strength of the late Core Form Stage, but it was clear that the beast was far inferior to Chu Yunfan. It was sent flying by a punch.","At this time, there were no outsiders, so Chu Yunfan naturally did not hide anything, because there was no need.","“Rrrraagh!”","The beast let out a loud roar and struggled to get up, wanting to pounce again.","First Netherworld Stomp!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and stomped down. The attack trampled the lightning beast to the ground.","Boom!","A huge footprint appeared on the beast’s body. The attack almost went right through the monster. If it was an ordinary person, this kick would have already severely injured him. After all, humans were made of flesh and blood. Being trampled on like would leave them severely injured. However, this beast was an elemental lifeform. Its vitality was tenacious and it tried to get up again.","“You aren’t getting up.”","Chu Yunfan attacked again.","“Second Netherworld Stomp!”","He stomped down again, and the beast that was trying to get up was once again trampled to the ground.","Boom!","A huge hole was created in the ground.","Every time the beast tried to get up, Chu Yunfan would step on it mercilessly.","Chu Yunfan was terrifying in this state. He truly unleashed all his techniques without any hesitation.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Loud booms rang out, accompanied by the furious roars of the beast.","Initially, the beast wanted to show off, but slowly, the lightning on its body became dimmer and dimmer. Finally, the beast was once again trampled to the ground by Chu Yunfan. This time, it could not get up. Only an extremely pure lightning crystal core was left.","Although Chu Yunfan had used up a lot of his energy after beating up the beast, it was still a rare sight. This was the core of the lightning beast. Only in a very special environment could such a pure elemental creature be formed, and this was the foundation.","Chu Yunfan grabbed the crystal core. The beast that had been so fierce had turned into lightning and disappeared. It was trampled to death by Chu Yunfan. No one saw it, but if someone did, it would probably cause a huge uproar.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was too shocking. He had killed a late Core Former elemental life form. How shocking was this? However, he had done it.","Chu Yunfan observed the crystal core. Although a lot of its energy had been consumed, the energy inside was still very rich. He circulated the Celestial Devouring Art and swallowed the crystal core.","Boom!","Endless lightning energy burst out from the crystal core, turning into a terrifying energy that began to sweep through Chu Yunfan’s body, trying to tear it apart. If it was before, this lightning energy might have succeeded. But Chu Yunfan had undergone earth-shattering changes. The meridians in his body were not just a little tougher.","Although this energy was huge and pure, it was not a problem for Chu Yunfan. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan’s divine power was increasing because he had absorbed this pure lightning energy. With his current strength, absorbing ordinary lightning energy was like taking in trash. There was no benefit at all. His energy level was already different.","In just a moment, Chu Yunfan had completely absorbed the crystal core.","Boom!","Countless divine power boiled in Chu Yunfan’s body. Relying on the lightning crystal core, his strength instantly reached the peak late-Void Core Stage from the early late-Void Core Stage that he had just broken through. He was just a hair’s breadth away from breaking through to the peak of the Void Core Stage.","He was now that far from the Core Form Stage, which was the level of a kingdom guardian. For ordinary people, they wouldn’t dare to absorb the crystal core so casually. They would have to be fully prepared and use all kinds of methods. However, for Chu Yunfan, it was just a piece of cake!","Chu Yunfan moved slightly, and his body emitted a series of crackling sounds.","‘When this matter is over, I should find a place to cultivate in seclusion. When my cultivation level breaks through to the Core Form Stage, my combat strength should reach the Golden Core Stage. When that happens, I should become the number one of this world,’ Chu Yunfan thought.","No one would be able to stop him then. However, he was still worried about Tang Siyu. It was very likely that she was no longer around these parts, so he had to leave this place and follow in her footsteps.","Chu Yunfan rose up and left the valley in a flash of light, leaving behind a mess. He flew through all kinds of complicated passages, searching for the whereabouts of Nine Star’s sect master.","Suddenly, the sound of an intense battle came from afar."]},{"number":1518,"title":"Chapter 1518 One Strike per Person","paragraphs":["1518 One Strike per Person","Chu Yunfan looked over and saw a fierce battle in the distance, and it was approaching him at a shocking speed. The battlefield was moving, and a group of people was chasing after another group.","He recognized the group who was being hunted. Who else could it be if not Great Wei? The two people leading them were the chief disciple of the Monster Subduers, Yun Tian, and the mysterious elder of Great Wei’s imperial family.","The people chasing after them were none other than Nine Stars.","Chu Yunfan was a little puzzled. Whether it was Yun Tian or the Great Wei elder, they were both in Core Form Stage. They were one of the top experts in the world. Why were they being chased down in such a sorry state? Moreover, the strongest of Nine Stars’ experts behind them was only at the peak of the Void Core Stage. No matter how one looked at it, it was not normal for a Void Core to chase after a Core Former.","But when Chu Yunfan looked again, he realized that Yun Tian and the Great Wei elder were in a sorry state. Their clothes were ragged. It was clear that they had just fought a great battle and had fatal injuries on their bodies.","There was a huge wound on Yun Tian’s body that almost tore him into two halves. On the chest of the Great Wei elder, there was an incomparably huge handprint that almost pierced through his chest.","In their current state, they were at ten percent vitality. Otherwise, they would not be chased by Void Cores to this extent. To cover the retreat, they had to stop from time to time to fight off Nine Stars. This made the two of them spit out a mouthful of blood every time, and their injuries worsened.","“It’s no good! Someone please help!”","As they fled frantically, they suddenly spotted someone approaching on a streak of light. They were instantly shocked. They realized that the person in front of them was Chu Yunfan.","“Chu Yunfan! Help!” Yun Tian shouted.","Although he still brooded over the fact that Chu Yunfan had easily defeated him, he did not hold it against Chu Yunfan. This was because Chu Yunfan was so strong that even his master was no match for him.","Not to mention that Chu Yunfan could save them now. He was like the rain after a long drought.","When the Great Wei experts saw Chu Yunfan, they were overjoyed. They were all injured, and their injuries were pretty severe. It was already difficult for them to escape with all their might.","Chu Yunfan stepped on the light and rushed up. This time, he did not disguise himself as Jian Wuchen because there was no need to. He arrived in front of the Great Wei group that was frantically fleeing.","The Great Wei experts stopped in their tracks and came to Chu Yunfan’s side. Regardless of whether they hated or liked him, they were all overjoyed. After all, Chu Yunfan was the number one of their kingdom.","At this moment, Nine Stars had also rushed over. Although there were not many people, they surrounded the Great Wei group.","“Yun Tian. Wei Dingshan. Why did you two stop running?” the leader of the Nine Stars group said coldly.","He glanced at Chu Yunfan, who was only a late Void Core. It was not difficult for him to determine Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level from the fluctuations he emitted. He did not take Chu Yunfan seriously.","Although a late Void Core would be considered a figure in any place, they would not be able to overturn the heavens in this situation.","“D*mn it! Nine Stars, you ambushed us! The wrath of Great Wei isn’t something your sect can bear!” Wei Dingshan said through gritted teeth.","He had been high and mighty for many years, and it had been a long time since he had suffered such a huge loss. He swore that if he got back to Great Wei, he would do his best to take revenge on Nine Stars.","Although Nine Stars was a colossus with countless experts, it was still far from Great Wei. Even if the sect master was powerful, if Great Wei was determined to deal with them, there were ways to do so. Everything depended on whether it was worth it.","“Hahahaha! Great Wei? When our master’s divine arts reach a higher level, even if you send your imperial guards to our sect’s door, it’ll be useless. Killing you won’t be much harder than crushing an ant!” the leader laughed. “You both have joined forces, but you still can’t defeat our master. Even Great Wei’s number one, Yun Huang, is no match for our master!”","Hearing this, Nine Stars burst into laughter. They laughed without restraint. They were not scared of these people they had surrounded. Great Wei gnashed their teeth in hatred. However, there was nothing they could do. Just as Nine Stars had said, they were no match for the sect master.","The difference in strength between the two sides was too great.","Yun Tian never expected the sect master to be so powerful. They were on the same level, but he had been so easily defeated. In terms of strength, the sect master was even stronger than his own master.","And since the sect master had managed to obtain that item, it meant that his strength would further improve and reach the late Core Form Stage. If that was the case, then it would be a sticky situation. No one in the world would be able to match up to him. Even the strongest Imperial Guards of Great Wei would not be able to do anything to such a person.","“Kid, your luck is rotten. Looks like you’re going to die with them,” the leader said as he laughed, disdain filling his eyes. He didn’t take Chu Yunfan seriously.","“We’re going to die together?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Wait here. We’ll chat after I’ve dealt with this b*stard.”","“Who are you calling a b*stard?!” the leader shouted, angered by Chu Yunfan’s words.","“I’m talking about you.”","Chu Yunfan’s calm voice rang the leader’s ears. He was then horrified to find that Chu Yunfan had already appeared right in front of him.","Chu Yunfan grabbed a lightning sword and pierced the leader’s throat.","A peak Void Core had died!"]},{"number":1519,"title":"Chapter 1519 I’ll Kill Him","paragraphs":["1519 I’ll Kill Him","This sword strike was ordinary and did not contain any shocking moves or martial arts concepts. It was just a simple sword strike, but a powerful peak Void Core wa unable to resist and was instantly killed by it.","This sword shocked the entire scene, causing everyone to suck in a breath of cold air. Even the Nine Stars members who had not taken Chu Yunfan seriously all had serious expressions on their faces.","He was too strong!","At this moment, how could they not see that this guy who looked like he was only at the late Void Core Stage was truly terrifying?","They didn’t recognize that the person in front of them was Nine Stars mortal enemy, Jian Wuchen. However, they could sense that this fellow in front of them was definitely not easy to deal with.","On the contrary, the experts of Great Wei were greatly invigorated after seeing Chu Yunfan’s attack. The stronger Chu Yunfan was, the better it was for them. Only Yun Tian’s expression was slightly calmer. The man in front of him was a strong man who had defeated his master. Killing a peak Void Core was nothing.","In fact, if he hadn’t been nearly cut in half by the Nine Stars’ sect master and suffered severe injuries, he wouldn’t have been forced into a dead end by a Void Core.","“B*stards of the Nine Stars, I’ll kill every one of you!”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes were filled with killing intent. He was just about to find these Nine Stars’s experts. He had not expected them to come to him. As the saying goes, if you wear out your iron shoes and look for no place, you will get them without any effort.","Swoosh!","Chu Yunfan’s figure suddenly disappeared from where he was. In the next moment, he appeared in front of a Nine Stars expert. He swung his sword and the Nine Stars expert was killed before they could say anything or even react.","Slash!","Boom!","Bang!","All kinds of collision sounds were released in an instant. In just a few breaths, accompanied by screams, these experts all died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","At this time, the experts of Great Wei finally reacted. Looking at Chu Yunfan, who was so relaxed as if he was just pulling out some weeds, they gulped. It was not the first time most of them had seen him. Many of them had even witnessed the battle between Chu Yunfan and Yun Huang. Compared to the Chu Yunfan who had shown off his abilities back then, the current Chu Yunfan looked a little simple and unadorned. However, this Chu Yunfan looked even more terrifying.","Without a doubt, Chu Yunfan’s strength had made great progress again, so he didn’t need to make a big move. He only used a few basic sword techniques to slaughter all these Nine Stars experts. These were all big shots of Nine Stars. The weakest of them was at half-step Core Stage. Even if Yun Tian or Wei Dingshan, who were also in the Core Form Stage, wanted to deal with people of this level, it would not be easy. After all, the other party had too many people. It was impossible for them to kill these people so easily like Chu Yunfan.","“All right, it’s over,” Chu Yunfan said, “Are you okay?”","“We’re fine. Although our injuries are serious, they can’t take our lives,” Yun Tian said.","In fact, with the super strong vitality of a Core Former, if they were not constantly being chased and was given some time to recover, they would have the ability to protect themselves and would not be in such a sorry state.","As for the others, their situation was similar. As long as they were not being chased, they would be able to recover at least 50 – 60% of their strength if they were given some time. Although they wouldn’t recover to their peak, it was still much better than being killed at any time.","“In that case, you guys heal first. We’ll talk later,” Chu Yunfan said.","Everyone nodded in agreement. Then, they sat cross-legged in the air and took out a large number of healing pills from their spatial bags. They had prepared these beforehand. If they weren’t constantly being chased and didn’t have time to heal, they would have taken them out long ago.","These were the top experts of Great Wei, and the healing pills they possessed were naturally extraordinary. In just a few minutes, they had already recovered half of their strength. At least, from their appearance, it was no longer obvious that they had suffered such serious injuries.","If they wanted to fully recover, even if they consumed a large number of healing pills, it would still take several days. It was not something that could be done in a day.","“How did you get ambushed by Nine Stars?” Chu Yunfan asked when he saw that they were almost done healing.","When everyone heard this question, they were a little depressed. Then, Yun Tian said, “We were all deceived by that thief. He invited us to explore the treasure together and used us as cannon fodder to destroy the traps. When he was about to obtain the treasure, he suddenly attacked and severely injured us.”","“What treasure?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“It was a meteorite that contains powerful energy,” Yun Tian said through gritted teeth, “The meteorite was collected by the Violet Thunder Swords many years ago. It contains a powerful energy, but it has never been used. It was placed in this treasury. Later, Nine Stars received the news and invited us to go with them. Who knew that when they found this meteorite, they would suddenly turn hostile and attack us. I’m afraid that they are already absorbing the energy inside. When they come out of seclusion, they will definitely be even harder to deal with. Their sect master might even be able to become the number one expert in the world.”","When Chu Yunfan heard this, he felt incredulous. These people all had their own plans. Previously, the pavilion master also wanted to consume the Violet Thunder Peach and advance his cultivation to the late Core Form Stage to stabilize his status as the number one expert in the world. The Nine Stars Master had turned his back for a meteorite. He would do anything to become the number one expert in the world.","It seemed that although they usually didn’t speak, they took this matter very seriously.","“We can’t let them successfully absorb the energy from that meteorite. Otherwise, the consequences will be unimaginable!” Yun Tian hurriedly said.","“Don’t worry, if he wants to become the number one expert in the world, he’ll have to ask me. However, this matter cannot be delayed” Chu Yunfan said coldly."]},{"number":1520,"title":"Chapter 1520 When Enemies Meet, Their Eyes Turn Red","paragraphs":["1520 When Enemies Meet, Their Eyes Turn Red","“Good. I want to see him dead,” Yun Tian said through gritted teeth. Although he had been wary of the Nine Star’s sect master, he didn’t expect him to be so ambitious. Not only did the sect master want to take everything for himself, but he also wanted to kill all of them.","If experts who had cultivated to their level cultivated step by step, their progress would be very slow. Otherwise, Yun Tian’s master, who he regarded as a god, would not have been stuck in the Core Form Stage for so many years. The only way was to have all kinds of fortuitous encounters to speed up the process.","They would not care about ordinary opportunities. Only this kind of fortuitous encounter could allow their cultivation to advance further and even reach the intermediate Core Form Stage.","Based on the current situation, an intermediate Core Former was already a first-rate expert in the Core Form Stage. They were even on par with Yun Tian’s master. Therefore, even though he was wary, he still agreed to go with them.","Who knew that he would be tricked and almost die here?","He had always thought highly of himself, so how could he accept this?","“All right then, follow me. As for the rest of you, it’s best for you to leave quickly. This place is called a treasury, but all the good things have been plundered,” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at everyone.","They nodded. How could they not understand? The Violet Thunder Swords was not wiped out overnight. Most of the good stuff in this treasury had probably been used up long ago, leaving them with very little.","“Thank you for today. In the future, if there’s anything you need, I’ll go through fire and water to help you,” Wei Dingshan said. His gaze was complicated. He had come to owe such a big favor today, and to Chu Yunfan whom he had not taken seriously before.","In reality, he was also a guardian of Great Wei, but he was special. He was a member of the previous generation of Great Wei’s imperial family. But he was obsessed with martial arts and did not have much interest in fighting for power.","He had talent and ambition. In addition, Great Wei’s imperial family wanted descendants. Therefore, they nurtured Wei Dingshan at all costs, allowing him to become the second Core Former in Great Wei after Yun Huang. This was why the imperial family of Great Wei was as stable as Mount Tai. Whether or not there were kingdom guardians was a completely different matter.","During the change of dynasty, the previous emperor of Great Wei had sent people to invite him, but he was not interested. After all, this was not an invasion from an external enemy, but an internal change of dynasty. No matter who became the emperor, it did not make much difference to him. With his strength and status, even if it was another emperor, they would not dare to take away the treatment he deserved.","At that time, Chu Yunfan was just a junior with great potential in his eyes. Chu Yunfan had the chance to enter the Core Form Stage in the future.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan’s strength would undergo such a drastic change in just a short period? Even Wei Dingshan could not see through Chu Yunfan.","“That’s right. In the future, as long as you says the word, I’ll definitely die for you, Master Chu.”","“If there is a chance in the future, please come to our sect. We’ll definitely welcome you.”","“As long as you ask, we will come to help even if we are thousands of miles away.”","These experts said one after another. They owed Chu Yunfan such a big favor, so they had no choice but to speak up. If they did not think of a way to repay the favor, it would be detrimental to their future cultivation.","Ordinary people did not care because they could not feel it. However, which of these people was not a top martial arts master? They had understood karma. They owed Chu Yunfan a lot of karma today, and these things had to be repaid sooner or later.","“It’s okay. It’s just a small matter,” Chu Yunfan said. He was satisfied with simply improving his relationship with the experts of Great Wei. In any case, it was just a piece of cake for him.","After thanking him, these experts turned around and left. They had been cheated by Nine Stars. Thinking of this, they were extremely angry. The conflict between Great Wei and Nine Stars would be endless from now on.","After everyone left, Chu Yunfan followed Yun Tian and headed straight for Nine Star’s sect master.","Under Yun Tian’s lead, Chu Yunfan came to an incomparably huge treasure vault. This was the true treasure vault. Huge shelves could be seen everywhere and a thick layer of dust covered everything.","Countless years ago, all kinds of treasures of the Violet Thunder Swords were placed here. Some of the barriers had not been destroyed and were still emitting a faint luster. It was just that they had not been replenished for many years. The barriers were still there, but in reality, it would turn into ashes with a single touch.","The wooden shelves were like towering trees, all of them hundreds of meters tall. They were then cut into different squares, and different things were placed in them. Chu Yunfan scanned the area. In the deepest part of the treasure vault, countless mechanical puppets were scattered all over the ground. They were clearly the defenses of the treasure vault, but they had been destroyed by the experts of Nine Stars and Great Wei in the previous battle.","At the center of these puppets was a massive meteorite that was emitting a faint green light. A human figure was sitting cross-legged on top of it. Around him, the energy from the meteorite formed a terrifying energy storm. It was clear that the energy storm was being absorbed by the figure. His aura was increasing crazily at every moment.","How could Chu Yunfan not know that the figure was Nine Star’s sect master?","As the saying goes, when enemies meet, their eyes will turn red. Chu Yunfan wasn’t the only one who wanted to kill the sect master. Yun Tian’s eyes had already turned red. He had suffered a huge loss this time, and it was different from the last battle with Chu Yunfan.","In that battle, Chu Yunfan had no intention of killing Yun Tian. Although he was completely defeated, his life was not in danger. But this time, they were almost killed by the sect master. If he had absorbed the energy from this meteorite, he and Wei Dingshan would have been doomed.","“It’s that b*stard. Let’s kill him!” Yun Tian shouted.","Two figures flew over from afar and blocked Chu Yunfan and Yun Tian from the left and right.","“Yun Tian, you’re still alive and dare to come back? It seems that you’re destined to die in our hands today!”"]},{"number":1521,"title":"Chapter 1521 Insignificant","paragraphs":["1521 Insignificant","“Just the two of you?” Yun Tian shouted.","Chu Yunfan glanced at them and saw that they were two men with the same face. One on the left and the other on the right. He immediately guessed the identity of the two men—the Left Protector and the Right Protector of Nine Stars.","Chu Yunfan had obtained a lot of information about Nine Stars from the Mysteries Pavilion, including the names of these two brothers. They were two of the most famous masters in Nine Stars. They were twins, and they both had amazing talent in cultivation. After they were recruited by Nine Stars, they had a smooth journey and rose rapidly. Later, they became the Left and Right Protectors of the sect.","They were some of the strongest in Nine Stars. Neither of them were inferior to Yun Tian. They were experts who had already entered the half-step Core Form Stage.","In the entire world, there were only a handful of experts at this level. If there was an opportunity in the future, they might even be like Yun Tian, entering the completion level and becoming kingdom guardians.","Although most of Nine Star’s experts had gone after Yun Tian and the others, they still left the two strongest experts behind to be on the safe side.","“Master Chu, you deal with that b*stard. I’ll take care of these two. Don’t let them hold you back!” Yun Tian said loudly.","If it was before, he was being chased by Void Cores. But now, his strength had recovered by half. Although he was not at his peak, he was not afraid of facing two half-step Core Formers.","“Only you two?” The Left Protector of Nine Stars stared at Chu Yunfan and Yun Tian with a grave expression. They could see that Chu Yunfan’s strength was extraordinary.","“No need. There’s no need to waste time on these two good-for-nothings.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“You’re courting death!”","The Protectors were instantly angered by Chu Yunfan’s attitude. Terrifying divine power surged from their bodies and they rushed toward Chu Yunfan. They attacked Chu Yunfan from the left and right. As they attacked, countless stars seemed to cover the sky and land as they fell on Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan simply punched out. The force of his fist instantly twisted and tore everything apart. It tore apart the stars in the sky, and then suddenly, his fist landed on the two.","Bam!","Bam!","The punch landed on the Protectors, and they screamed as they were instantly sent flying. Their bodies seemed to have been attacked by a terrifying force and were torn apart.","In an instant, the two brothers had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands!","Yun Tian’s mouth hung wide open. For a moment, he did not know what to say. If he wanted to defeat these two people, it would not be a simple matter to obtain a complete victory. There were half-step Core Formers and possessed some Core Form Stage abilities. But facing Chu Yunfan, it was like pulling weeds.","This reminded Yun Tian of the time when Chu Yunfan had knocked him out. Although he was now in the Core Form Stage and his strength was incomparable to before, Chu Yunfan had also made rapid progress. Chu Yunfan had killed the Protectors with a casual punch. Back then, he couldn’t have done this so casually.","“How dare you!”","Following a loud roar, a terrifying pressure came from the energy storm.","Yun Tian felt the pressure and his expression fell. He could feel that the sect master was improving at an astonishing speed. He was about to break through to the late Core Form Stage.","“Sh*t! We can’t let him break through. Otherwise, the consequences will be unimaginable!” Yun Tian hurriedly said.","Chu Yunfan pursed his lips and sneered at the energy storm in front of him. “It doesn’t matter. Even if he breaks through, he’ll still die.”","Although the sect master’s strength was increasing rapidly and he had crossed the line of life and death, he was still not a threat to Chu Yunfan. At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s strength had undergone earth-shattering changes.","A figure flew out from the energy storm and tore through everything. In an instant, he arrived in front of the two.","“You actually dared to kill my people in front of me?! You’re courting death!” the sect master said coldly.","Yun Tian could feel an astonishing pressure pressing down on his body, and he immediately felt a little uncomfortable. But he was a Core Former, so he could bear it.","He then saw Chu Yunfan was completely unaffected. It was as if the pressure of the Nine Stars Master could not pose any threat to him.","“Late Core Form Stage?” Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows and sneered.","“That’s right. It’s too late for you to figure that out now. Bet you didn’t expect this!” The Nine Stars Master stared at Chu Yunfan. “I don’t know who you are, but how dare you kill the Protectors of Nine Stars. No one in the world will be able to save you now!”","“Do I need saving?” Chu Yunfan sneered, “If not for the fact that I have something to ask you, do you think you’d still be standing there and talking?”","“Impudent! You’re courting death!” The sect master was completely enraged by Chu Yunfan’s words. In an instant, his divine power burned and turned into starlight. He then threw a punch.","Boom!","The world shook violently, and the punch turned into a star that headed straight for Chu Yunfan. The terrifying power was enough to completely raze a mountain to the ground. Yun Tian had no choice but to put up a defensive barrier to resist the aftershock emitted by this punch. However, Chu Yunfan did not move. He stood still and took the punch.","“Hmph, that’s pitiful.” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly.","All the energy and blood in his body surged. The sect master immediately felt a terrifying force rebound back. It was the fist force that he had used to bombard Chu Yunfan.","Thud, thud, thud!","The sect master retreated a few steps before he finally stopped. He could feel the blood in his chest boil."]},{"number":1522,"title":"Chapter 1522 Slapped to the Ground","paragraphs":["1522 Slapped to the Ground","“What?” The sect master’s eyes widened. Although he couldn’t use his full strength in this punch, with his current cultivation of the late Core Form Stage, his casual punch could destroy the world. A few more punches would be enough to turn the entire city into ashes.","However, Chu Yunfan was able to take it without batting an eyelid. This was enough to completely change his opinion of Chu Yunfan. This Chu Yunfan was definitely not someone to be trifled with.","It was different from what he had expected!","Chu Yunfan’s mana fluctuation was only at the Void Core Stage. His initial goal was to get to Yun Tian, but now it seemed that Chu Yunfan was the stronger of the two.","“Master Chu, are you okay?” Yun Tian said with concern. Even his teacher would have been severely injured if he had taken the overbearing punch from the sect master.","There was a huge difference in strength between the two sides.","“I’m fine. An attack of this level can’t hurt me!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“That’s good. But you should be careful. This b*stard isn’t someone to be trifled with.”","Yun Tian heaved a sigh of relief, but he still warned Chu Yunfan.","The sect master snorted coldly and threw a punch at Yun Tian.","Yun Tian immediately felt an endless fist pressure pressing down on him in all directions. In an instant, he was about to be blasted into a mess.","“Sh*t!” Yun Tian cursed and retreated, wanting to escape the range of this punch.","However, he discovered that he had been locked onto by a terrifying divine sense. He wanted to retreat, but it was impossible.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan stretched out his hand and casually grabbed out. The terrifying fist intent that had turned into stars was grabbed by Chu Yunfan into nothingness.","“I’m your opponent,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly, “If you want to act tough in front of me, you will have to have the ability.”","At this moment, the sect master finally looked Chu Yunfan in the eye. He didn’t pursue Yun Tian, who had infuriated him, but said, “Master Chu, your family name is Chu. Are you the number one expert in the world, Chu Yunfan, who recently appeared in Great Wei?”","The sect master guessed Chu Yunfan’s identity. No one knew who Chu Yunfan’s alternate identity was, so they didn’t know. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had turned Great Wei upside down. The foreign forces gathering information would surely not ignore Chu Yunfan, who had recently overturned the world.","“That’s right, I’m that Chu Yunfan,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“Do you have to oppose me?” The sect master didn’t shout for a fight. Even though he hated Chu Yunfan for killing the Protectors and possibly the other Nine Star members, he was not confident that he could defeat Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s strength gave him an unfathomable feeling. Experts at his level were rare in the world. If he was not completely confident, he did not want to completely fall out with Chu Yunfan, even if the two sides had already shed pretenses of cordiality. Finding Chu Yunfan’s weakness and killing him later was completely different from finding trouble with Chu Yunfan now.","“Oppose you? If you think so, it’s not bad,” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“You’re shameless!” The Nine Stars Master’s tone turned cold as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","“What’s there to respect about you?” Chu Yunfan burst into laughter. “Hahahaha! You think too highly of yourself. I have something to ask you. How much do you know about Tang Siyu’s disappearance? If you tell me obediently, I’ll leave your corpse intact.”","“Tang Siyu? Why is it about that b*tch again?” The Nine Stars Master was confused. Why was it about Tang Siyu again?","In the past half a year, Tang Siyu’s presence had been too strong. Previously, he had severely injured Tang Siyu, but he didn’t pay much attention to her. How could an ordinary Core attract his attention?","If it wasn’t for his son, he wouldn’t have paid any attention to her.","He had severely injured Tang Siyu and her whereabouts were unknown, but that was just the beginning of the trouble. Jian Wuchen had appeared and caused Nine Stars to suffer heavy losses. A large number of elders had died in battle, and many experts had been killed, including the old sect master. The vice sect master had also died at Jian Wuchen’s hands. In such a short time, the Nine Stars had lost everything.","The sect master’s first goal was to find Jian Wuchen and kill him. Who knew that before he could find Jian Wuchen to settle the matter, the number one expert of Great Wei would suddenly appear and look for Tang Siyu too?","These people were more powerful than the last!","This made the sect master somewhat regretful. Perhaps he should not have taken action back then. He would not have gotten into such a big problem otherwise. Each of these experts was more troublesome than the last. But now, he had no choice but to kill them.","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes, and his eyes were filled with killing intent. “B*tch? You’re the b*tch!”","Chu Yunfan made his move. He swept out his palm and slapped the sect master’s face.","Smack!","The sect master didn’t have time to react and was sent flying.","Boom!","He was slapped to the ground. He jumped back up with a look of disbelief on his face as if he couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan had slapped him. With his cultivation, there were not many people in the world who could touch him. But in the end, he was slapped by Chu Yunfan.","“You’re courting death!”","The sect master was enraged. His mana surged and he shot into the sky. The feeling of being slapped was a humiliation—a blatant humiliation.","“I must kill you!”","Waves of terrifying pressure pressed down on Chu Yunfan like a tide, but he did not move. He was like a reef in the endless waves. No matter how much pressure pressed down on him, nobody could move Chu Yunfan.","Yun Tian had already retreated several hundred meters away. How could he not understand that such a battle was not something he could interfere in?"]},{"number":1523,"title":"Chapter 1523 Humiliating the Sect Master of Nine Star","paragraphs":["1523 Humiliating the Sect Master of Nine Star","He looked at Chu Yunfan’s back as if he was looking at a monster. Chu Yunfan’s slap had not only stunned the sect master, but even Yun Tian.","He didn’t even have time to react.","This was the legendary sect master of Nine Stars, a terrifying existence that even Yun Tian’s master was no match for after breaking through. The sect master had now entered the late Core Form Stage, and his strength had reached a whole new height. He knew that if the sect master wanted to kill him, he would not be able to escape.","Who knew that he would be so vulnerable when facing Chu Yunfan? The sect master was even slapped to the ground. It wasn’t some random cabbage that was randomly picked from the roadside, but it was actually so terrifying.","Thinking of Chu Yunfan’s age, Yun Tian didn’t know how to describe him. He was probably a monster. At this moment, he didn’t have the slightest thought of competing with Chu Yunfan. He didn’t even dare to think about such a thing. He could only say that he was standing far away. In this kind of battle, no one in this arena was someone he could deal with.","“You have a death wish... You provoked me, and now you’re dead!” The sect master stared at Chu Yunfan. He roared like a wounded beast.","“I’m dead? You’re going to kill me?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Looks like that slap didn’t wake you up.”","Chu Yunfan faced the boundless pressure and walked forward step by step. He was not afraid in the slightest. This pressure could not pose any threat to him.","“Die! Nine Stars Alignment!” the sect master roared. He turned into a star and crashed into Chu Yunfan. This was not the end, but just the beginning. One star after another fell on Chu Yunfan.","“Still refusing to wake up?” Chu Yunfan sneered and slapped out again. It was a seemingly ordinary slap, but it went straight for the stars that covered the sky.","Boom!","Nine Stars were smashed by Chu Yunfan in mid-air. The collision between the two sides formed an unimaginably huge explosion, tearing the entire sky apart.","A figure fell from the terrifying explosion and landed on the ground.","Bam!","A huge hole was created in the ground, with the sect master as the center. Cracks spread out in all directions like a spider web.","Spurt!","The sect master felt his chest throb as he spat out a mouthful of blood. The slap had landed on the other side of his face. His fierce eyes were filled with disbelief. He couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan could slap him again. If he was still a little confused earlier, then he was now fully aware.","Chu Yunfan was strong—ridiculously strong.","“Rrrraaaaggh!” the sect master roared angrily. He was like a wild beast, completely enraged by Chu Yunfan. “This time... This time! I won’t be careless!”","The sect master’s anger was so intense that it burned through the entire sky. His eyes revealed anger. He was slapped twice in a row. This was something that had never happened in his life.","“Hah!” Chu Yunfan sneered. He looked at the sect master with disdain.","“You’ve completely angered me! You’re dead!” The sect master exploded in anger and then threw a punch at Chu Yunfan. He stepped on the light that filled the sky, and instantly arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","“Nine Stars Glory!”","The sect master punched out. This punch turned into nine stars, but it was different from the previous ones. This time, Nine Stars appeared at the same time. It was as if they were shining brightly, illuminating and destroying everything.","These nine stars brought everything, but they also brought destruction!","The terrifying power brought about by this attack could be felt by even Yun Tian, who had already retreated far away. He deeply felt that although they were both in the Core Form Stage, the difference in combat strength between the fledgling Core Form Stage and the late Core Form Stage was simply heaven and earth. If it were him, he definitely wouldn’t be able to resist such a terrifying existence.","But looking at Chu Yunfan’s expression, there was not a trace of fear. He simply sneered and slapped the sect master. It was the same simple action as before, and the effect was the same. With a loud crash, the sect master was sent flying again.","The punch that he had thrown out was blown up by Chu Yunfan in mid-air. It could not pose any threat to Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","The sect master fell to the ground again.","Chu Yunfan’s actions were simple and crude!","Yun Tian was no longer as nervous and afraid as he was at the beginning. Instead, he didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. At this point, how could he not see that Chu Yunfan’s strength had completely occupied the upper hand?","He had seen people defeat their opponents before, but he had never seen someone beat them up so simply and cruelly!","It was easy to imagine how aggrieved the sect master must have felt. This made Yun Tian recall how he was no match for Chu Yunfan’s Nine Netherworld Stomps and was knocked unconscious.","The sect master felt even more aggrieved. When Chu Yunfan stepped on him earlier, he didn’t mean to humiliate him. But now, Chu Yunfan was humiliating the sect master.","“I don’t care what methods you use. I’ll just slap you to the ground. No matter how great the humiliation is, there won’t be any more.”","Yun Tian suddenly remembered how the sect master had called Tang Siyu a b*tch. He shuddered. Did Chu Yunfan remember that until now and then used this opportunity to humiliate the sect master?","Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold, and his eyes were nonchalant. But now, no one would doubt his strength.","“Ahhhhhh! D*mn it!”","The sect master was furious. He had never been humiliated like this before. He was slapped to the ground again and again.","“I’ll kill you!”","The sect master’s power surged into the sky as if he was going to tear the entire world apart."]},{"number":1524,"title":"Chapter 1524 I Learned the Move Because I Wanted To","paragraphs":["1524 I Learned the Move Because I Wanted To","“How dare you humiliate me!”","The sect master was completely enraged. He was humiliated by Chu Yunfan’s series of slaps. He had completely lost his calm state of mind.","“Humiliate you? That’s right, I am humiliating you. But so what?!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Yun Tian’s guess was right. Chu Yunfan bore a grudge against the sect master because of the sect master’s words. The sect master thought too highly of himself, but to Chu Yunfan, a mere sect master was nothing.","Chu Yunfan’s power had greatly improved after devouring the crystal core of the lightning beast, even before his breakthrough, his strength was not something that the sect master, who had just entered the late Core Form Stage, could compare to.","“Tell me, do you know where Tang Siyu is? If you do, I might let you live,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“That b*tch is dead!” the sect master roared, his eyes bloodshot. “I’ve already killed her. Next, I’ll kill you and bury you with her!”","The divine power inside the sect master boiled, and it was clearly a level higher than before. Then, he grabbed at the air and took a pill, swallowing it.","Boom!","His divine power burned fiercely. His power rose continuously and the intensity of this divine power was much more terrifying than before. Like a tide, it spread out in all directions with his body as the center.","Yun Tian retreated even further. His expression was extremely solemn as he looked at the sect master, who had gone completely crazy.","“Master Chu was being too arrogant. He has completely angered the sect master! Now he’s using his life force to fight Master Chu. Master Chu was in danger...” Yun Tian muttered to himself.","In his opinion, Chu Yunfan was unwise. He had completely infuriated his opponent.","“Nine Stars Glory!”","The sect master punched out. It was clear to the naked eye that all the muscles in his body were torn apart because he was enduring a terrifying force that even his body couldn’t withstand.","Because he had just broken through, the cultivation of his physical body could not keep up, not to mention that the divine power in his body had increased by at least 50% compared to the beginning. Nine Stars that were blasted out by this punch were clearly stronger than Nine Stars that were blasted out before.","Chu Yunfan sneered and raised his eyebrows. Then, he withdrew his fist and shouted, “Nine Stars Glory!”","He blasted out Nine Stars Glory, which was exactly the same as the sect master’s move. His nine stars then shattered Nine Stars that the sect master had blasted.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s fist force didn’t slow down, and he hit the sect master in the chest. The sect master grunted and spat out a mouthful of blood, flying backward.","“Impossible!”","The sect master struggled to get up. His eyes were filled with disbelief. Chu Yunfan had somehow learned his move. This was the supreme technique of Nine Stars. He had spent several years to learn it. This technique had been passed down from generation to generation without exception, so Chu Yunfan definitely couldn’t have learned it from somewhere else.","In other words, Chu Yunfan had learned their ultimate technique in just a short time.","What kind of shocking talent and monstrous ability was this?!","The sect master recalled that Chu Yunfan was only in his twenties. At this age, it was impossible for Chu Yunfan to be on the same level as him or even stronger than him. It was impossible for him to say that Chu Yunfan’s talent in cultivation was not strong. It was just that being this strong was too shocking.","“You couldn’t possibly have learned the Nine Star Glory!” The sect master had already guessed the truth, but he was unwilling to accept it. Otherwise, his worldview would be overturned.","Even Yun Tian was scared to death when he saw this scene. Nine Star’s ultimate skill was not inferior to Monster Subduer’s ultimate skill. There was no doubt about the difficulty of cultivation. In the end, Chu Yunfan had mastered it after only a few glances.","This was terrifyingly shocking for an orthodox cultivator like Yun Tian. If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have believed it even if someone else had told him.","“Nine Stars Glory? It’s nothing. I learned it long ago.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","With the help of the godhead, he had easily learned Nine Stars Glory. This might be an extremely shocking ultimate art for the current era, but it was nothing to him. It was nothing compared to the unique skills he knew, such as the Nine Netherworld Stomps and the Eight Astonishing Fists.","“Do you know why I didn’t stop you from burning your life force?” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. He looked the sect master up and down as he walked. “I want to tell you that no matter how much you jump around, you’re just an ant in front of me. If I want to crush you, I can do it with just a word. Your unique skills and your pride are nothing in front of me. You wonder how I learned Nine Stars Glory. Well, it because I wanted.”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, the sect master spat out a mouthful of blood. What did he mean by learning it just because he wanted to? The sect master had gone through a lot of hardships to learn Nine Stars Glory, and even then, in the history of Nine Stars, he was considered a genius. But in front of Chu Yunfan, his performance was clumsy. He was as stupid as a pig.","Yun Tian didn’t know what to say. Chu Yunfan was vengeful. Even now, he didn’t forget to humiliate the sect master. He pitied the sect master. Facing such a genius, it was hopeless. Yun Tian had talent and he was even known as one of the top few people in Monster Subduer’s history. In the future, he might even surpass his teacher, Yun Huang. But next to Chu Yunfan, he was still far from being able to compare.","“Today, the history of Nine Stars ends here,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","Today, all the top leaders of Nine Stars had been captured by Chu Yunfan. The glorious history of Nine Stars would come to an end."]},{"number":1525,"title":"Chapter 1525 Nine Star’s Sect Master Is Dead","paragraphs":["1525 Nine Star’s Sect Master Is Dead","The sect master’s face turned pale. He was powerless to fight back against Chu Yunfan. He couldn’t understand why the difference in strength between the two sides was so great.","There was no doubt that if he couldn’t escape today, Nine Stars would be in big trouble. Even if Chu Yunfan didn’t find trouble with Nine Stars, countless forces in the outer realm were eyeing Nine Stars like tigers eyeing their prey. Even the allies who seemed to have a good relationship with Nine Stars and the forces that were dependent on Nine Stars were keeping close tabs on them.","If Nine Stars didn’t have enough masters to guard the setc, especially if they didn’t have a Core Form master, they wouldn’t be able to maintain their status. Others might not know how the Violet Thunder Swords had declined, but Nine Stars knew a little about it.","Nine Stars was the successor to one of the sects that had attacked the Violet Thunder Swords.","Back when the Violet Thunder Swords fell, they faced a situation where a group of wolves bit tiger to death, and they were bitten to death.","The sect master was unwilling to die in Chu Yunfan’s hands, and he was even more unwilling to see Nine Stars decline during his reign.","“I’ll fight you till my last breath!” The sect master roared and burned his life force. He gathered his divine power and threw himself at Chu Yunfan. “Even if I die, I want you to die with me! Nine Star Destroyer!”","He displayed his final ultimate skill. This was his ultimate skill that he could only use once in his life. Once he used it, he would die together with his enemy. The divine power in his body rapidly increased. It was like a source of explosion that could explode at any time.","“Watch out, Master Chu!” Yun Tian shouted as he retreated frantically. He had already sensed an extremely terrifying danger brewing. The terrifying energy could explode at any moment.","“It’s nothing.” Chu Yunfan sneered. Facing the sect master’s final attack, he merely sneered and then raised his arm to slap the sect master.","Bam!","The sect master screamed and flew backward like a deflated balloon. The crazed look on his face was gone. The sect master laid on the ground covered in blood. Nobody would believe that this was the terrifying expert from before if they hadn’t seem him with their own eyes.","‘It’s over just like that?’ Yun Tian’s eyes widened in disbelief. The terrifying pressure from earlier had disappeared, and he felt that it was unbelievable. It was as if he had seen a ghost. The sect master was terrifying, but he was so weak when facing Chu Yunfan.","“Yes.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “This trash can’t do anything.”","The sect master’s life force was withering at an astonishing speed. His divine power and life force were leaving as fast as they had came. Many of his muscles disappeared without a trace, leaving only a layer of skin.","This was the aftereffect of him using a forbidden method. If not for this, he would not have suffered such a shocking backlash. This attack was a double-edged sword. Once it was defeated, it was easy to suffer a backlash.","The sect master thought that he could defeat Chu Yunfan with this method, or at least injure him severely. Who knew that even if he used the forbidden method, he had no chance of winning against Chu Yunfan.","With a single slap, his attack was nullified.","The sect master was breathing heavily and his eyes were dull. However, he still struggled to get up and fight Chu Yunfan. A shocking sword light flew through the air and chopped off his head. Now, the sect master had truly fallen. Even if a Core Former was beheaded, they would still die.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at the sect master’s corpse because the sect master was now worthless. The backlash from using the forbidden technique and being broken by Chu Yunfan had devoured most of his blood essence.","It was a pity. Otherwise, he could have used the sect master to water the Brahma Tree. However, what he really regretted was that he didn’t manage to find out anything about Tang Siyu. Even though the sect master had said that he had killed her, Chu Yunfan had not lost his basic judgment. He could tell that the sect master had been lying.","However, it was also because of this that he lost track of Tang Siyu’s whereabouts.","After this series of events, Chu Yunfan’s reputation would rise through the land. If Tang Siyu was still here, she should hear his name and come to him.","He had heard of a saying that being famous was also a way to report his safety. But if Tang Siyu didn’t come, then there was only one possibility. She was no longer in these lands. He would have to embark on another journey to find her. He did not think that this land was confined to this. After all, from what he had obtained, this was definitely not the entire world.","The Violet Thunder Swords had once gone on an expedition against a powerful enemy in the distance. Although they had been destroyed, it was enough to prove that this land was not the end.","Just as Chu Yunfan’s thoughts were running wild, Yun Tian came to his side. Looking at the sect master’s corpse, he sighed in his heart. He didn’t expect such an ambitious person, who even his master feared, would die at Chu Yunfan’s hands. However, he didn’t have the slightest sympathy. He knew that he was almost killed by the sect master. If he hadn’t met Chu Yunfan, he would have been finished.","Thinking of this, he still had a lingering fear.","“Master Chu, thank you for your help today. If it weren’t for you, we would’ve died at the hands of this b*stard,” Yun Tian said, “Or you planning to continue exploring the treasury or do you plan to leave?”","“Let’s leave. There’s nothing else here. According to the Mysteries Pavilion’s speculation, this treasury won’t be near the plane’s exit for long. It’ll soon disappear into spatial turbulence again. If we don’t leave now, we’ll be trapped here for the rest of our lives,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Okay.”","After the two of them made up their minds, they flew toward the exit."]},{"number":1526,"title":"Chapter 1526 The World Was Shocked","paragraphs":["1526 The World Was Shocked","The trip to the Violet Thunder Sword treasury had finally come to an end, but the uproar it had caused was just the beginning. There weren’t many people who had entered the treasury, but they were all top experts in the world. Even the weakest of them were experts at the half-step Core Stage. Such experts would be an overlord in any country.","However, in the treasury, a large number of people had fallen. Not to mention that several kingdom guardians had died in the scuffle as well—the Left King, the Netherworld Sect sect master, the Nine Stars sect master, Sword Demon, Dragon Granny, and the Mysteries Pavilion leader. All of these people were famous and terrifying figures who had once shaken an era.","The death of any one of them would be considered a big deal, but now, six of them had died in one go. The opening of the treasury this time could be said to be earth-shattering. This was especially true for those behemoths. An incomparably powerful kingdom guardian was the key to suppressing all enemies who were spying on them. And now that they had all fallen, it was undoubtedly terrible news for the forces they were in.","Apart from Jinzhanghan and its khan, the Netherworld Sect, Nine Stars, and the Mysteries Pavilion were all in extreme danger overnight. There were even people who swore that there were a large number of sneaky and unknown people in the surrounding areas of these forces.","For a time, the entire world was in an uproar.","“Is the Violet Thunder Sword treasury really that dangerous?”","“As expected of the Violet Thunder Swords that ruled the entire world. Even though they’ve been destroyed, the treasury they left behind has caused the current generation to lose several kingdom guardians level fighters!”","“Yeah, it’s said that that era was the true golden age of martial arts. I’ve read some records about it. It’s said that in that era, kingdom guardians were not rare, and there were even more terrifying masters. Our current times is probably an era of chaos in their minds.”","When many people heard this news, they all sucked in a breath of cold air. In reality, few knew of the opening of the treasury. Only the upper echelons of a few huge organizations knew about this news. The smaller forces didn’t even know about it, and when they did, it wasn’t as if the major forces had made a fortune overnight. On the contrary, they received news that the major forces had suffered heavy losses. How could they not be shocked?","However, more news spread out soon after. Two names spread throughout the world overnight.","“It was Jian Wuchen. It is said that the Left King, the Netherworld Sect master, the Pavilion Master, Sword Demon, and Dragon Granny all died at his hands!”","“Five kingdom guardians all died at the hands of one person. Is Jian Wuchen a monster?”","“I have absolutely reliable news that the sect master of Nine Stars died at the hands of Chu Yunfan of Great Wei!”","“The Nine Stars sect master is a veteran expert. It’s said that he can stand shoulder to shoulder with the khan, but he died in Chu Yunfan’s hands.”","“What’s wrong with that? You must not know. After the Small Pill Origin Meet, the Right King led a large group of experts to kill the alchemists of Great Wei and Great Qi. In the end, not only did they lose a large number of Cores and tens of thousands of Blood Barbarians, even the Right King died. The person who did it was Chu Yunfan!”","“How is that possible? If that’s the case, Jinzhanghan has suffered the greatest loss. Both the Left and Right Kings are dead. In other words, the two most powerful successors of Jinzhanghan are dead!”","As all kinds of rumors spread, news about Jian Wuchen and Chu Yunfan spread all over the place. If one didn’t want others to know, then they had to do it themselves, especially when Chu Yunfan had killed a few times. In fact, he hadn’t avoided others. There were too many smart people in the world, even if there were only a few words of information.","When Chu Yunfan killed the Left King and the others, no one was present. When he killed the sect master, only Yun Tian was present. However, this did not prevent them from speculating. After all, they had all died after Chu Yunfan came to their door, so it was not difficult to guess. Apart from the fact that Chu Yunfan was Jian Wuchen himself, they had deduced almost everything.","For a time, the entire world was in an uproar, causing a huge uproar. Before this, Chu Yunfan and Jian Wuchen’s names were unfamiliar to everyone in the world. However, in a short time, all kinds of information and information about the two of them had been collected by the various large factions. No force in the world would dare to ignore such terrifying combat power that could easily kill a kingdom guardian. This was especially so when these two people were so vicious and merciless that it made many people tremble in fear.","Of course, they had to study it carefully to avoid accidentally bumping into the muzzle of a gun.","Both of them had risen rapidly in recent times. Chu Yunfan had defeated five of Great Wei’s top experts in succession, claiming the title of Great Wei’s number-one expert in the world. Later on, he killed the Left King and Nine Stars sect leader, who were both famous kingdom guardians.","Jian Wuchen’s rise to power was even shorter, but his battle achievements were not inferior, maybe even better. He started his career by challenging dozens of first-rate sects and killing the former Nine Stars sect leader and a large number of experts.","Then, he killed the Left King, the Netherworld Sect master, the Mysteries Pavilion master, Dragon Granny, and Sword Demon, all of whom were kingdom guardians who had been famous for a long time.","Overnight, the two of them became famous all over the world. Moreover, they looked so young. They were at most in their twenties. This almost let everyone know that two very young martial arts grandmasters had risen in the world.","It was not that no one suspected that the two were the same person. After all, all of this seemed too coincidental. However, it was quickly refuted because according to the information they had received, Jian Wuchen was a supreme sword grandmaster who focused on the sword, while Chu Yunfan was different. He was a martial dao master who had learned many skills.","The two paths were not the same at all. They did not believe that someone could reach the peak of all fields. This in itself was too contrary to their worldviews.","And the rise of these two people was without a doubt due to the fact that they had stepped on the corpses of the kingdom guardians who had been famous for a long time. This made the successors of those powers gnash their teeth in hatred."]},{"number":1527,"title":"Chapter 1527 Visiting the Alchemist Association Headquarters, Obtaining the Nine Heavens Small Rejuvenating Pill","paragraphs":["1527 Visiting the Alchemist Association Headquarters, Obtaining the Nine Heavens Small Rejuvenating Pill","In their eyes, Chu Yunfan and Jian Wuchen had undoubtedly stepped on the corpses of their leaders to ascend to the throne.","This was to be a blood feud!","Many people felt a chill in their hearts because it was normal for forces to change. Since ancient times, countless forces had been replaced. Among the declining forces, Nine Stars and the Mysteries Pavilion were not the first, nor would they be the last.","What kind of power change was the most stable? It was to step on the corpses of the predecessors. This was the most stable.","No one dared to ignore the reputation of killing their predecessors. Everyone had to tremble under such a reputation. There was even news that someone had offered a sky-high reward behind the scenes. This reward was offered to all the assassin organizations in the world, and the target was Chu Yunfan and Jian Wuchen.","The news caused an uproar. After the shock, no one found it strange. The people killed by Chu Yunfan and Jian Wuchen were not ordinary people.","In any force, a Core was basically a figure at the level of a great ancestor. Usually, the death of any of such figures would cause a huge commotion. Moreover, these two had killed more than one of them. They had killed them in groups. This was how Chu Yunfan and Jian Wuchen’s reputation was built up.","Behind him were the figures of the Mysteries Pavilion and Nine Stars. Although the pavilion master and the sect master had fallen long ago, their forces were still huge. Their wealth was comparable to that of a country. No matter what kind of price they had to pay, as long as they killed Chu Yunfan, everything would be worth it.","That price was enough to make a country’s heart flutter. However, even so, no one dared to take the order. No one even offered a price. After all, according to many people’s speculations, the strength of these two people was probably already at the late Core Form Stage. Any one of such figures was a top-notch expert. They were terrifying figures who could establish a sect.","This person had the chance to become the number one in the world. Who would dare to accept such a request? Wasn’t that courting death?","Even the major assassin organizations did not dare to accept such a request. They were afraid that their organization would be targeted by these two killing gods and be destroyed. If it was an ordinary person, they would not believe that it would be like this. However, Chu Yunfan and Jian Wuchen were different. They were known for their slaughter since their debut. They had no scruples at all, nor did they show any mercy.","Whoever provoked them would only end up dead.","No one knew that while everyone was discussing these two people, in the outer realm, in the incomparably huge Alchemy City, at the headquarters of the Alchemist Association, a guest had arrived today.","Alchemy City was a holy land that all alchemists in the world looked up to. There were as many experts as clouds in the city. It was rare to see great alchemists in ordinary places, but there were countless of them in Alchemy City. It was unknown how many powerful alchemists had joined Alchemy City over the years.","In addition, alchemy experts were often martial arts experts with long lifespans. These top experts were all hidden in Alchemy City, so no one knew how many experts were hidden there.","It was not inferior to the imperial capitals of Great Wei, Great Qi, and Jinzhanghan.","There were even some who claimed that the wealth contained within Alchemy City was something that even the three kingdoms couldn’t compare to. After all, the Alchemist Association was a colossus that had already existed before the three kingdoms were established.","On this day, Chu Yunfan disguised himself as Jian Wuchen and came to the Alchemist Association’s headquarters. Looking from afar, it was an incomparably huge city. Countless alchemists were making pills, and the alchemical energy formed was so dense that it was visible to the naked eye. It formed an incomparably huge roof that covered the entire city.","Chu Yunfan looked at it from afar and was amazed. This roof was very particular. It was not an ordinary roof, but something similar to the condensation of fate. The person who built Alchemy City back then was clearly a great divine arts practitioner. He was able to condense the luck and alchemical energy of the Alchemist Association into a roof that protected the city.","With this kind of roof, even if they were attacked by thousands of troops, would be very difficult to break. This was the reason the Alchemist Association could stand proudly in the world and not fear the three kingdoms.","Chu Yunfan reported his name and was soon led to a huge palace in the depths of the city. This was where the headquarters of the Alchemist Association was located. The palace was endless, with carved beams and painted buildings. It was extremely luxurious. He could clearly feel countless powerful martial arts auras hidden in them. At least hundreds of auras above the Core Stage were lurking in this area.","The Alchemist Association headquarters was indeed worthy of being one of the transcending forces in the entire world. They indeed had their own confidence.","After a while, Wang Dong came out to welcome Chu Yunfan.","“Sword Young Master, you’ve come from afar. I’m so sorry for not welcoming you soon,” Wang Dong quickly apologized, “If you had just sent word, we’d have delivered the pill to you.”","Wang Dong knew why Chu Yunfan was there. It was for the Nine Heavens Small Rejuvenating Pill. He had no intention of denying it. Although he didn’t see Chu Yunfan kill those demon kings with his own eyes, it didn’t prevent him from learning about it later.","This time, he had invited Chu Yunfan, which could be said to be the most cost-effective deal. An expert of Chu Yunfan’s level was not someone who could be invited just because they wanted to. Not to mention, they were only hoping that Chu Yunfan could buy them some time. They didn’t have any other thoughts.","Who knew that Chu Yunfan would be so fierce that he would kill the enemy?","Thinking of those terrifying demon kings, Wang Dong felt his scalp go numb. He thought to himself that it was fortunate that he did not offend Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, he would not have ended up much better than them.","“It’s fine. It’s just a few more steps.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","He couldn’t just give out an address because his disguise was a fictional character and didn’t have an address. Moreover, he knew that many people were probably trying to figure out his background and wanted to know where he came from.","“Sword Young Master, please wait a moment. I’ve already gotten someone to retrieve the pill,” Wang Dong quickly said.","A moment later, a servant boy came over with a jade box and handed it to Wang Dong."]},{"number":1528,"title":"Chapter 1528 The Medicinal Pill in Hand, Secluded Cultivation","paragraphs":["1528 The Medicinal Pill in Hand, Secluded Cultivation","Wang Dong took the jade box and went up to Chu Yunfan. He opened the box and a thumb-sized pill appeared in front of Chu Yunfan.","It was golden in color and seemed to contain extremely powerful medicinal power, but not a single bit of medicinal power spread out. This box was also a specially made jade box. There were ancient patterns carved on it, forming a small array that completely sealed the medicinal power inside and did not let it spread out.","Others might not know, but Chu Yunfan knew it all too well. This jade box was invented by the Alchemy Emperor. At that time, the Alchemy Emperor felt that it was difficult to store pills. As time passed, the medicinal strength would continue to dissipate. This was why he had developed this jade box. With the help of the formation on the surface of the box, one could seal the medicinal power in the jade box. Of course, there were spirit stones at the bottom of the jade box. As long as the spirit energy in those spirit stones was not exhausted, the jade box could be used forever. Even if the spirit energy in the spirit stones were exhausted, the box could be used again simply by replacing the spirit stones.","This was the Alchemy Emperor’s proud handiwork. Ever since then, it was no longer difficult for alchemists to store medicinal pills.","Chu Yunfan confirmed that this was indeed the Nine Heavens Small Rejuvenating Pill. After all, it could fool others, but it could not fool an expert like him.","“Very straightforward. In that case, I won’t stand on ceremony.” Chu Yunfan put away the jade box in the Mountain River Diagram.","“Sword Young Master, aren’t you going to check it?” Wang Dong asked.","“There’s no need. A mere medicinal pill can’t fool me,” Chu Yunfan said, “There’s no pill in the world that can hide from me. Also, your credibility isn’t limited to just this pill, President Wang.”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, a strange look flashed across Wang Dong’s eyes. He suspected that Chu Yunfan must have high attainment in alchemy and knew many things that even he did not know. Now that he heard Chu Yunfan’s words, he was confident that he was right. However, he did not take it to heart. He did not care how Chu Yunfan had learned all this.","“You flatter me, Sword Young Master.” Wang Dong smiled. “However, you and Chu Yunfan’s reputation has risen recently. As far as I know, there seem to be many people planning to find trouble with you. What’s your opinion on this?”","“They’re just some clowns. They only dare to use some underhanded methods.” Chu Yunfan sneered. In the face of absolute strength, all schemes and plots were meaningless. “I’ve heard about the bounty they offered, but we’ll have to see if anyone has the guts to take the job. If any assassin organization dares to take this job, I’ll flatten their headquarters.”","Wang Dong’s expression froze. He hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan’s reaction to be so intense. It could even be said that Chu Yunfan didn’t have any intention of easing up. It was as if he would kill whoever dared to provoke him.","But then he thought of Chu Yunfan’s usual style of doing things. It seemed that it was indeed like this. He would kill anyone who stood in his way.","“That’s true. With your strength, I’m afraid there’s no one who can do anything to you,” said Wang Dong, “But I heard that they are spending a large sum to invite the khan to help. Be careful, Sword Young Master.”","“The khan?” Chu Yunfan furrowed his brows. “It’s fine. As far as I know, the khan is too busy taking care of himself. It’s good enough that he’s still alive. He shouldn’t come looking for trouble.”","Chu Yunfan cracked a smile. Others might not know, but he did. The khan had just been severely injured by him and was fleeing. If he had not run fast enough, he would have been dead by now. At that time, Chu Yunfan’s power was far weaker than now. With his current strength, he didn’t even need the Ash Fire Physique to blow up the khan.","“Oh?” Wang Dong finally showed a shocked expression. He had not received any news before, but judging from Chu Yunfan’s expression, he was not speaking without thinking. In other words, the khan was probably not in good condition. Only now did he realize that there were probably too many things in this world that even he, the Alchemist Association’s president, did not know.","“Thank you for the warning, President Wang. Since there’s nothing else, I’ll take my leave now,” Chu Yunfan said. He couldn’t wait to try the pill.","At that time, his strength will improve even further. Even if the khan was still in his cultivation, Chu Yunfan could easily crush him like an ant, let alone the fact that he had severely injured the khan.","“All right then, I won’t be seeing you off. Take care now!” Wang Dong cupped his hands.","Chu Yunfan nodded and left Alchemy City.","Wang Dong, on the other hand, stood where he was, his expression uncertain. Chu Yunfan’s words shocked him greatly. The khan, who was known as the world’s number one expert, had likely met with an accident, or at least suffer heavy injuries. This was another great variable in the current turbulent situation.","“Men, pass on my orders. Find out the whereabouts of the khan using everything you have. Report to me if you have any news.”","In the Imperial Capital of Great Wei, in the imperial advisor’s residence.","In the courtyard, Chu Yunfan had changed back to his original appearance. In front of him was a stone table. On the stone table was a jade box, and in the jade box was the Nine Heavens Small Rejuvenating Pill.","In the capital of Great Wei, the imperial advisor’s residence occupied a large area. During the time when Chu Yunfan was not around, it was built magnificently, and its magnificence was not inferior to the Imperial Palace.","If it were any other person, they would have been impeached long ago and would not have been able to live in such a luxurious mansion. However, no one had any objections to this mansion.","Everyone knew that this was the residence of the number one expert in the world, the pillar of this dynasty, Chu Yunfan. None of the courtiers had the guts to impeach the imperial advisor. After all, everyone knew that he was the emperor’s backer. He was like a retired emperor. No one dared to provoke him.","‘It’s time to go into seclusion!’ Chu Yunfan thought.","He had broken through continuously during this period, so it was indeed time to consolidate his cultivation. He did not want his cultivation to progress too quickly and his foundation to be unstable.","“Pass on my orders. I’m going into seclusion for three months and won’t see anyone.”"]},{"number":1529,"title":"Chapter 1529 The Ultimate West Demon League’s Invasion","paragraphs":["1529 The Ultimate West Demon League’s Invasion","Chu Yunfan had declared a three-month seclusion and announced that he would not meet with anyone. This caused quite a stir in the Imperial Capital. Chu Yunfan’s departure was a shocking statement. It was clear that he was no longer just the number one expert in Great Wei, but the number one expert in the world.","Countless powerful figures of Great Wei wanted to meet him, but they were all stopped at the door. Even when the new emperor came to visit, he was still barred from entering.","This seclusion was extremely important to Chu Yunfan. Therefore, whether it was the emperor or the current minister, King Chu, they were all stopped outside the door and could not meet Chu Yunfan. The two most powerful people in the court were stopped, so the others naturally had nothing to say.","The waves caused by Chu Yunfan’s return finally calmed down.","For his seclusion, Chu Yunfan went into the Mountain River Diagram. He didn’t know what was going on outside. In front of him, the Nine Heavens Small Rejuvenating Pill lay quietly in a jade box. He broke the enchantment in the jade box and a shocking medicinal aura spread out. It became stronger and stronger as if the pill was reviving. He did not hesitate and immediately swallowed the pill.","The Nine Heavens Small Rejuvenating Pill immediately turned into a powerful medicinal energy that spread out in all directions, spreading through his limbs and bones. It was like a huge dragon that was about to rush out of his head and scatter heaven and earth. The medicinal efficacy of this pill was shocking.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan immediately sealed every pore in his body to prevent the medicinal aura from leaking out. He allowed the medicinal energy to cleanse his cells. He was not in a hurry to break through. This time, he not only wanted to complete a breakthrough but also lay a solid foundation.","The next step was to reach the Core Form Stage. The Void Core Stage was called Void Core because it only formed the phantom of a golden core in the body. At the Core Form Stage, one had to condense this illusory core into a solid core until reaching the final Golden Core Stage. This golden core was where a martial art practitioner’s life lay. As the saying went, once a Golden Core was formed, one’s life would be in their own hands.","For the later stages of cultivation, the Core Stage was a very important stage. It was a stage where one could truly lay a solid foundation. With the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, Chu Yunfan knew how important this stage was. It was the beginning of the true step toward transcendence.","Therefore, he was not in a hurry to break through. Instead, he worked on laying a solid foundation. Only then could he walk further in the future, walking further than the Alchemy Emperor.","Cultivation knew no time, and in the blink of an eye, time passed. While Chu Yunfan was in seclusion, trying his best to strengthen his foundation and breakthrough, three months passed in the blink of an eye. Autumn arrived, and the world was filled with a somber atmosphere. In the capital of Great Wei, pedestrians were walking in a hurry. Everyone’s faces carried a solemn and worried expression.","At this moment, on the long street outside the imperial advisor’s residence, squads of imperial guards had sealed off the entire street. The imperial advisor’s residence occupied one side of an entire street.","At the entrance of the residence, a young man dressed in military attire was rubbing his hands together and pacing back and forth. It was the leader of the scions of Great Wei, Chu Hongcai, the heir of King Chu.","Chu Hongcai was pacing back and forth in front of the residence, but he didn’t dare to step in. Not long after the imperial guards sealed off the area, a huge carriage pulled by nine white imperial horses arrived at the entrance of the residence, surrounded by a large number of attendants and soldiers.","A figure jumped down from the carriage. It was the emperor of Great Wei, Wei Wuji.","“Greetings, Your Majesty.” Chu Hongcai hurriedly bowed to Wei Wuji.","“Stand up,” Wei Wuji said anxiously.","“Thank you, Your Majesty,” Chu Hongcai said.","“What’s going on? Has Master Chu come out of seclusion yet?” Wei Wuji sounded anxious.","“Not yet,” Chu Hongcai reported, “There’s a barrier outside the entire residence. I can’t enter.”","“What do we do then? The kingdom is in danger,” Wei Wuji said gloomily.","“Brother Fan said that he’ll come out of seclusion in three months. He should be coming out soon,” Chu Hongcai said.","“I hope so. You should know the current situation at the border. The defense line has collapsed. King Chu went there to reorganize the defense line, and so has my great-uncle. But now, there’s even worse news. Jinzhanghan is taking advantage of the Ultimate West Demon League’s invasion to seize control.”","Wei Wuji couldn’t contain his anger when he thought of this. He did not expect that in just three months, the situation would have become so bad. The border guards at the Western border were unable to withstand an all-out attack from the demon alliance. In just a month, they had captured more than half the territories at the western border.","Wei Wuji recalled that all of this had started about three months ago when the Ultimate West Demon League suddenly launched an attack. The border guards, who had not experienced a real large-scale war for many years, could not withstand a single blow. The defense line that had been built over the years had collapsed. Even the Monster Subduers guarding the Western border had been captured. Large numbers of sects on the western border had been captured and uprooted.","The endless army of monsters swept over like a tsunami. Wherever they passed, no humans or animals were left behind. Everything was turned into ruins. These monster armies were not purely killing, but hunting for food. All the humans and creatures they saw were devoured by these monster armies.","Although most of the residents of Great Wei had martial arts, they had no way to resist the endless tide of monsters. In just a few short months, the demons had conquered more than half of the western border. According to this trend, it would not be long before they would invade the hinterland of the Central Plains. At that time, it would be a true disaster.","At this dangerous time, Jinzhanghan in the north suddenly sent a large army to invade the northern border. They had been eyeing the northern border like tigers eyeing their prey.","At this moment, Wei Wuji truly understood what it meant to be a leaking house meeting the rain. Although he had been reorganizing the Imperial Court, he had only ascended the throne recently and had yet to completely control the entire court. If he was not careful, the entire world would fall apart."]},{"number":1530,"title":"Chapter 1530 Everything Was at Stake, Coming Out of Seclusion","paragraphs":["1530 Everything Was at Stake, Coming Out of Seclusion","News of defeat came from all over the world. This made Wei Wuji, who had just ascended the throne, feel what it meant to be in a bad spot. Fortunately, there were not many voices of opposition inside and outside the Imperial Court. Other than the large-scale purge of the court some time ago, the Ultimate West Demon League invasion had happened.","This was different from the invasion of the two human kingdoms. This was a battle between different races. If Jinzhanghan invaded, some people could still protect their wealth and glory by joining Jinzhanghan. There were many people like this since ancient times. However, it was a different story for the Ultimate West Demon League. The countless monsters under the command of the demon league were like asuras that had crawled out of hell. They ate all the living beings in front of them, and wherever they went, the land became barren.","It was useless to talk about joining these monsters because they had not interest in ruling Great Wei. Instead, they wanted to establish a country that belonged to the demons. How could they possibly let the humans live?","It was precisely because of this that Great Wei was unprecedentedly united. The cogs of the kingdom began to turn, which made Wei Wuji feel a little comforted. But even so, it was useless because Great Wei was weak compared to the entire demon league. Only by gathering the strength of the entire human race could they resist these demons.","However, Jinzhanghan had invaded them. It was obvious that they wanted to stab them in the back at this critical moment. They could not rely on Jinzhanghan. And Great Qi was nowhere to be found.","At this moment, Wei Wuji could only rely on the strength of Great Wei. This made him feel like he was alone against the entire world. To rectify the situation at the front lines, King Chu, who was now in charge of the army, was sent out. At the same time, the only kingdom guardian in the imperial family, his great-uncle, was also sent out.","It was only after he ascended the throne that Wei Wuji found out that there was such a terrifying existence in the imperial family. This made him sigh. He was really lucky that his great-uncle had not interfered when he rebelled. Otherwise, with Chu Yunfan’s strength at that time, he would not have been able to deal with this great-uncle. In the end, he would have fled from Great Wei.","He didn’t have many cards to play now, and he had already played all of them. If things did not go well, he would cease to become the ruler of Great Wei. At that time, who knew how history would record such a ruler of Great Wei? He would probably not be able to escape being viewed as a bad ruler.","He had placed all his hopes on Chu Yunfan, the national master who had repeatedly created miracles and made him feel hope in despair. Previously, he was somewhat afraid of Chu Yunfan, but now, he no longer had any fear. He hoped that Chu Yunfan would be as powerful as possible.","“Right now, the various vassals are also restless. If the Imperial Court can’t stabilize the borders, I’m afraid that there’s a possibility that they will raise an army to rebel. There’s even a possibility that they will flee Great Wei with their entire clan,” Chu Hongcai said gloomily.","As the heir of King Chu, he had access to information that ordinary people could not access. Naturally, he understood that the current situation was extremely dangerous.","These great clans were more cunning than the last. If Great Wei could not hold on, they would immediately flee from Great Wei. With their strength, they would be welcomed wherever they went.","“These rebels!” Wei Wuji said furiously, “If Great Wei is captured, the entire human world will fall. Where can they escape to then? It will be useless even if they escape to the ends of the earth. This was a race war, not a war between families!”","Chu Hongcai sighed. At this point, the human world still couldn’t band together to fight.","“I asked you to investigate why the Ultimate West Demon League suddenly went crazy. How much have you found?” Wei Wuji looked at Chu Hongcai.","“Your Majesty, the representatives that my father sent to negotiate with the demon league were chopped up and fed to the monsters. They’re a bunch of beasts that haven’t evolved,” Chu Hongcai said furiously, “They’ve never thought of reconciling with us. I’m afraid they’re really going to destroy Great Wei. They said that Jian Wuchen killed many of their demon kings, so they want to kill all humans to avenge them.”","Wei Wuji was a little dumbfounded. If Jian Wuchen killed their demon kings, then they should go and take revenge on Jian Wuchen. What did it have to do with him?","He felt that he had already hidden well on the battlefield. He was lying in the trench, but he was still shot in the knee. He was about to cry his eyes out. What did this matter have to do with him? Why did he have to take the blame?","“They said that, but in my opinion, this is probably just an excuse,” Chu Hongcai said, “The demon league is just a bunch of armored beasts. They have been eyeing Great Wei covetously for a long time. Now, they’ve found a random excuse. Even without Jian Wuchen, I’m afraid they would have found other excuses.”","Wei Wuji nodded. Of course, he could see that this was just an excuse for the Ultimate West Demon League to start a war. After all, they needed an excuse to break the peace treaty with the humans that had been established for many years.","This was also an excuse for the other two kingdoms not to interfere.","“Forget about the Ultimate West Demon League. Jinzhanghan is actually taking advantage of the chaos to invade the other border. They’re beasts in human clothes. Indeed, those who are not of our family have different hearts. They’re a group of barbarians!” Wei Wuji gnashed his teeth.","Forget about the Ultimate West Demon League. What really infuriated him was that Jinzhanghan had betrayed the unspoken rules that the human world had followed for many years and joined forces with the demons to take down Great Wei.","“Don’t worry, Your Majesty. It won’t be long before Brother Fan comes out of seclusion, and his strength should have improved,” Chu Hongcai said. However, he didn’t sound very confident.","Then, Chu Hongcai cupped his hands and said, “Your Majesty, I request to lead my troops out of the capital to the battlefield. My father is in charge of the western battlefield. I’m willing to lead my troops north to fight against Jinzhanghan.”","Wei Wuji nodded and said, “A long journey tests a horse’s strength, and a long time tests a person’s heart. I’m very comforted by the loyalty of King Chu’s family. Since you have such a heart, I will grant you your wish. Tomorrow, you will leave the capital. I will allocate 300,000 troops to you to lead. I will also ask the imperial family to allocate ten officials to go with you.”","“Thank you, Your Majesty,” Chu Hongcai said.","Suddenly, just as the two of them were talking, the faint barrier that had been enveloping the imperial advisor’s residence fluctuated and then disappeared without a trace."]},{"number":1531,"title":"Chapter 1531 Peak Void Core Stage","paragraphs":["1531 Peak Void Core Stage","“M-Master Chu has come out of seclusion!” Wei Wuji joyfully exclaimed.","Chu Yunfan walked out of the Mountain River Diagram and appeared in the residence. He wore a loose black robe with his hair tied up and a white headband on his forehead, looking casual.","Although his expression was indifferent, his eyes showed a hint of joy. He had gained much over the past three months. Not only had he consolidated his cultivation, but he also took another step forward, reaching the peak of the Void Core stage.","He had reached the peak Core Form Stage regarding combat strength. Now, no one would be his match. He had initially broken through quickly, but his foundation was somewhat unstable. It had been too long since he had consolidated it. His previous breakthroughs had been too fast, and much of his comprehension remained incomplete.","Chu Yunfan could not compare to experts who had been grinding for years. However, he had used the godhead to increase his cultivation level comprehension these past three months.","Those three months were equivalent to ten years for an ordinary person.","Of course, he had exhausted his spirit stones to activate the godhead to such an extent. That was why he came out of seclusion. If not for that, he would have continued his seclusion until he reached the Core Form stage.","Nonetheless, he knew the day was not far away. Initially, his body only had a faint shadow of the golden core, but it had solidified. This process continued, constantly using his dense divine power to condense the golden core.","Chu Yunfan predicted it would not be long before it condensed into a solid core. He could then step into the Core Form Stage, and none could match him. It had not been long, but he had used all the spirit stones he had gathered through various methods, feeding them to the godhead and herb mountain.","‘Looks like I have to ask Wei Wuji to order me another batch of spirit stones,’ Chu Yunfan thought, ‘That’s the benefit of having someone like him around. Wei Wuji will find a way to get me more spirit stones and cultivation resources.’","It would save Chu Yunfan countless years. It was also why there had been many experts among the rogue cultivators. The top experts were mighty, but the rogue cultivators’ strength was weak compared to organized and disciplined martial artists.","“Let’s wait until my cultivation level increases. Then I can devise a way to leave these lands. Siyu, wait for me,” Chu Yunfan said, feeling much better now.","Suddenly, he sensed something touching the barrier he had set up. He spread his divine will and saw Chu Hongcai and Wei Wuji pacing outside his residence. He then stepped forward and appeared outside the residence almost instantly. The duo was pleasantly surprised by his sudden appearance.","“Brother Fan, you’ve finally come out of seclusion,” Chu Hongcai exclaimed.","Chu Hongcai did not act like the leader of the scions. Instead, he was the unremarkable little brother when standing before Chu Yunfan.","“Master Chu!” Wei Wuji was just as surprised.","“Your Majesty.” Chu Yunfan nodded at Wei Wuji. “Why do you have time to visit?”","“Something big has happened.”","Wei Wuji told Chu Yunfan everything. Chu Yunfan was shocked as he had not expected such a thing to happen so soon. The peaceful Ultimate West Demon League had invaded Great Wei. They had swept through the entire Western border in just a few months.","Great Wei suffered tremendous losses. Most of its residents had no time to escape as the monsters slaughtered them overnight.","Chu Yunfan could imagine how horrific it was for the residents, even though he had witnessed many slaughters. Back then, the Federation’s several base cities had fallen to the hands of demons too. Countless humans suffered casualties and died to the beasts.","This matter was related to Chu Yunfan. The Ultimate West Demon League was targeting Jian Wuchen. Although this was just an excuse, for Chu Yunfan, this matter was related to him.","“How did things get so dire? Didn’t the Monster Subduers send out a warning? Aren’t they guarding the western border?” Chu Yunfan asked.","He thought that the Monster Subduers could at least buy some time. If they had enough time to react, they could organize the evacuation of the residents at the western border. At least the losses would not be so great.","Wei Wuji sighed. “The demon league came prepared this time. Their first target was the Monster Subduers and they were caught off guard. Sect master Yun Huang was severely injured and was attacked by the demon league. It seemed that someone had rescued them.","“Right now, the Monster Subduers are still under siege. According to the information I received, countless monsters have surrounded the mountain, from the sky to the ground, and it’s so tightly surrounded that not even water can pass through. If it weren’t for the various barriers and formations that the Monster Subduers have been strengthening over the years, I’m afraid it would’ve fallen long ago. And though they have yet to fall, it’s only a matter of time before they do.”","Wei Wuji felt a headache coming on. Back then, he had also been troubled by the power of the Monster Subduers. Now, he understood why his ancestor had left the Monster Subduers behind and allowed them to grow at the western border. It was not without reason. At this moment, not only did he appreciate the strength of the Monster Subduers, but he also hoped that the Monster Subduers could become stronger.","“I get the whole story now.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “Since I’m out of seclusion, I won’t ignore this matter. These animals are courting death.”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with cold killing intent. He had led the army to quell the demon rebellion back in the Kunlun Realm. He had fought his way out of mountains of corpses and seas of blood.","“Your Majesty, I’ll have to trouble you to send someone to the northern border to stop Jinzhanghan. I’ll deal with the Ultimate West Demon League invasion first. After I’ve settled that, I’ll go to Jinzhanghan and kill the khan. He refuses to change his bandit nature even during a race war,” Chu Yunfan said."]},{"number":1532,"title":"Chapter 1532 Cold Slaughter","paragraphs":["1532 Cold Slaughter","“Thank goodness you’re here, Master Chu!”","Wei Wuji was overjoyed. At this moment, the entire country was in a precarious situation. The last trump card he could count on was none other than Chu Yunfan. Now that Chu Yunfan had finally come out of seclusion, he could finally breathe a sigh of relief.","Chu Yunfan nodded and said, “I’ll go check out what’s going on with the Monster Subduers first. Please arrange for the rest, Your Majesty.”","“No problem. I’ll soon organize enough troops to cooperate with your counterattack,” Wei Wuji said.","Although Chu Yunfan was only one person, he was a kingdom guardian. An existence that could decide the fate of an entire country was comparable to an army of millions. Once Chu Yunfan went out, the effect would be much more effective than sending out a million troops at the same time.","Seeing Chu Yunfan disappear into the horizon, Wei Wuji heaved a sigh of relief. Then, he said to Chu Hongcai, “Lead your troops north. Find a way to stop Jinzhanghan and buy time for the Imperial Advisor.”","“Yes, Your Majesty,” Chu Hongcai said as he saluted.","After Chu Yunfan left the capital, he stepped on the light and headed toward the western border. Along the way, he could see people fleeing in a hurry and troops rushing to the front line. The entire country was in a state of panic.","However, when Chu Yunfan really entered the western border, he felt that their panic was nothing compared to the situation at the western border. At this moment, the western border was filled with the scene of Great Wei’s army and countless demons fighting. Countless lives were being ended at every moment, and tragic killings were being played out at every moment, and Great Wei’s army was slowly being pushed back. There was no end to human strength, but there was no end to these monsters.","There was no end to killing them.","When he got deep into the western border, Chu Yunfan saw a scene that made his eyes widen. There were ruins everywhere. The once prosperous city had turned into waste. Countless monsters wandered around, searching for the remaining humans. Once the humans were discovered, countless monsters would descend and devour them. Not even their corpses were left behind.","As soon as Chu Yunfan entered the depths of the western border, countless flying monsters immediately flew over. They were extremely huge. When they gathered together, they were like a huge cloud.","“You’re courting death!”","Chu Yunfan saw that these flying monsters were still holding broken human limbs in their mouths. Countless bolts of lightning surged out from behind him and turned into all kinds of weapons, forming a huge wall of weapons behind him.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Countless weapons turned into streams of light and bombarded the flying monsters.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","These flying monsters, which had bared their fangs, were no match for Chu Yunfan’s attack. Hundreds and thousands of them were blown up. These flying monsters rushed out crazily, wanting to rush to Chu Yunfan’s left, but Chu Yunfan’s divine power surged. No matter how crazy they were, they could not do anything to him.","In just a moment, Chu Yunfan had slaughtered hundreds of thousands of flying monsters. Among these flying monsters, there were many Divine ones. Unfortunately, they were unable to withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan, who had already reached the peak of the Core Form Stage.","Soon, this seemingly enormous group of flying monsters was slaughtered by Chu Yunfan.","He continued toward the Monster Subduers in the depths of the western border. Suddenly, another powerful monster appeared.","“Rrrraaaagh!”","An incomparably loud beast roar rang out, followed by a terrifying pressure from afar. This pressure could even make ordinary Divines vomit blood and retreat.","A white tiger with a single horn appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. Its entire body was white-gold in color, and its huge body looked incomparably huge. This one monster seemed to control the entire western border.","‘A Core Form demon king?’","Chu Yunfan could immediately tell that this single-horned white tiger was a Core Former monster. Even in the demon league, there were very few monsters of this level. Now, he had encountered one.","“Human, you’re good. Very powerful. You were able to kill your way to this spot without suffering any injuries. It seems that you are even stronger than the number one expert of Great Wei, Yun Huang.”","The white tiger opened its mouth. Its eyes flickered with an extremely sharp light.","“A late Core Former demon king? I’m really lucky today. It must’ve been you who summoned all these monsters,” Chu Yunfan said lightly, “After I kill you, the monsters in this area should disperse.”","“Human, it’s still too early for you to think of killing me,” The white tiger shook its head. “I’ve lived for many years. I’ve even met the Great Ancestor of Great Wei. Do you think a junior like you can kill me? That’s ridiculous.","“But I can tell that you’re an expert among humans. Your blood essence is vigorous. When I devour you, my strength should increase greatly.”","This white tiger had existed since the founding of Great Wei. Its age was indeed shocking. However, Chu Yunfan was not surprised. The lifespan of a demon was generally much longer than that of humans. This was normal. However, it was difficult for demons to awaken their spiritual intelligence. Their cultivation speed was often difficult to compare with humans, let alone human geniuses.","This white tiger’s cultivation was comparable to the late Core Form Stage. It had taken thousands of years to reach this point, but the top geniuses among humans might be able to achieve it in hundreds of years. Therefore, it could only be said that each race had their advantages, and it was difficult to say which one was stronger.","This white tiger was indeed powerful. Its four paws stepped on the air, but it felt as if it was stepping on the ground. The endless distance was condensed on its body. It had enough confidence that a human was nothing. He could easily kill humans of the same cultivation level.","There was a huge difference in combat strength between the two of them."]},{"number":1533,"title":"Chapter 1533 Instant Kill! True Strength!","paragraphs":["1533 Instant Kill! True Strength!","Chu Yunfan could feel that this demon king was powerful. He was afraid that the khan’s strength was not even comparable to this white tiger. And the khan was known as the number one expert in the world.","From this, one could see how terrifying this demon was.","For many years, this demon had been lurking at the western border. Once he awakened his intelligence, his lifespan became incomparably long and extremely shocking. No one knew how many top experts there were in the demon league, and this was just one of them.","If Chu Yunfan, who hadn’t broken through before, had encountered it, he might have found it a little troublesome. However, for the current Chu Yunfan, this was nothing.","Swoosh!","In an instant, the white tiger attacked. He could tell that Chu Yunfan was not easy to deal with. He had experienced too many things in his life, and he had experienced too much time. He did not know how many human experts he had killed.","His claws was like five sharp swords tearing apart everything. It instantly disappeared and reappeared before Chu Yunfan. Five sharp sword lights shattered everything.","This white tiger was old and intelligent. Although it had not transformed into a human, it could managed to cultivate a set of martial arts. According to the legends passed down by the elders, how the humans developed all kinds of martial arts was learning it from the demons.","Demons were born with all kinds of skills, and these skills were innate. Many of them could be learned without learning. Humans did not have such conditions, but they were more intelligent. Through observing the demons’ behavior, they developed various martial arts, such as the Monkey Fist, the Crane Fist, the Snake Fist, and so on. Demons did not learn martial arts, but they could automatically comprehend these powerful skills.","The speed of this demon’s attack was extremely fast, and it was difficult for ordinary cultivators to dodge it. However, the person he encountered was Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s reaction was fast. He raised his hand and grabbed a sword light, stabbing it in the air.","Clang!","His sword collided with the claws of the white tiger. The collision between the two sides was like the sound of metal colliding, and sparks flew. However, this wasn’t the end. The white tiger stood up straight, and its claws turned into ten shocking sword lights, slashing toward Chu Yunfan.","There were powerful humans who could use martial arts such as the Double Blades or even Triple Blades. The more weapons these experts had, the more powerful they would be.","This white tiger was similar. Its ten claws turned into ten different sword lights and attacked Chu Yunfan from all directions. It formed a huge net that enveloped Chu Yunfan.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He grabbed a sword light, and his entire body transformed into countless figures that attacked from all directions.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s astonishing speed was fully displayed.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Loud booms rang out. From afar, it looked like countless sword lights were colliding in the air. This was a confrontation of sword arts.","This white tiger didn’t have the size of a human, but it was a sword expert—an expert of ten blades.","Chu Yunfan had defended himself with a single sword, blocking all the attacks.","This was a pure clash of sword arts!","“Hahahaha, interesting!” Chu Yunfan felt his blood boil because he hadn’t had such a pure sword duel in a long time.","Each of his sword strike was like a heavenly horse flying in the sky, like an antelope hanging on its horn. It was impossible to grasp it at all, but every time, it hit the key point and was able to block the white tiger’s attacks.","The tiger’s huge eyes were filled with shock. It never thought that a human could compete with it in the way of the sword.","The two sides fought at an extremely fast speed. Rays of sharp sword light tore through everything, cutting the entire sky into pieces.","“Looks like I underestimated you,” the white tiger said coldly. His eyes were fixed on Chu Yunfan. He admitted that he had underestimated Chu Yunfan. If he continued to fight like this, it would be difficult for him to take Chu Yunfan down.","Chu Yunfan was fast. His attacked were fast, accurate, and ruthless. This was the foundation the sword path, but he had never seen anyone who could display i to such an amazing level. Just a simple move was able to break his sword intent. This was enough to prove that this human in front of him was not an ordinary person.","At this moment, he stood up and turned into a muscular middle-aged man. This middle-aged man was white-gold in color and looked like a metal statue. He looked extremely terrifying, but there was a huge horn on his head.","He reached out and grabbed the huge horn on his head. He pulled it out and turned it into a giant sword that was about the width of a human. He stared at Chu Yunfan.","Swoosh!","The giant sword that was as thick as a man slashed down at Chu Yunfan. It was just a sword, but it split into countless sword lights, which then formed a huge sword array that enveloped Chu Yunfan.","“You want to fight me? But I don’t have time to play with you.” Chu Yunfan sighed.","At his level of cultivation, there were very few who could compete with him purely in sword arts. There were very few opponents like this, and those who could cultivate the sword path to the peak were as rare.","But both sides were mortal enemies, and he couldn’t afford to be lenient.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at the sword light and stepped forward. “Fifth Netherworld Stomp!”","Chu Yunfan stomped down, destroying everything before him. The sword array formed by countless sword lights was crushed. The terrifying stomp landed on the white tiger.","Bam!","The white tiger was sent flying. His eyes were filled with disbelief. He finally realized that Chu Yunfan had not used his full strength. The gap between them was too big.","Before he could even get up, a sword light descended from the sky and cut off his head."]},{"number":1534,"title":"Chapter 1534 Rescuing the Monster Subduers","paragraphs":["1534 Rescuing the Monster Subduers","This demon king was at the late Core Form Stage, but against Chu Yunfan, he could only last one move.","Chu Yunfan coldly stared at the white tiger in the Core Form Stage. Then, he put the tiger corpse into the Mountain River Diagram and turned it into nutrition for the Brahma Tree. Then, he turned into a streak of light and headed in the direction of the Monster Subduers.","Two hours later, Chu Yunfan finally arrived. As the rulers of the western border, the Monster Subduers were the most powerful existence in the entire western border. There were several large cities around them, each filled with millions of people. They all had similar relationships to the Monster Subduers. Many of them were even descendants of Monster Subduers’ disciples.","But now, these big cities had long been reduced to ashes. Countless ruins and broken walls were everywhere, and blood flowed like a river. Through the huge barrier, Chu Yunfan saw that there were countless people gathered in the mountain range where the Monster Subduers was located.","Before this huge change, the Monster Subduers had rescued a portion of people and brought them into the mountain. However, the usually spacious mountain gate was filled to the brim. The entire mountain gate was filled with ordinary people with fearful expressions.","They were all looking outwards of the barrier in horror. Countless monsters were charging over one after another. There was no end to them. It was one monstrous wave after another. In contrast, the Monster Subduers was like a small boat that could submerged under these endless waves at any time.","They were afraid and nervous because they did not know how long this barrier could last. They knew very well that no barrier could last forever. Though the barrier had been continuously strengthened by generations of ancestors, it would still be breached in the face of the endless monster swarm. Although they were not weak, facing these endless monsters, they were afraid that the only end was death, and their corpses would be devoured.","Above the barrier, countless Monster Subduer disciples flew up and injected their divine power into the barrier to keep it from breaking. There were even some Divine disciples who were bold enough to leave the barrier from time to time and kill some monsters. But it was useless against the endless monsters.","Chu Yunfan swept his gaze across the mountain and discovered that the real battle was at the base of the mountain, under the incomparably huge Monster Subduer Stele. Before, he had found the Monster Subduer Stele a little strange. He now realized that there was actually a spatial rift inside the stele. There was a huge underground space under the Monster Subduer Stele.","The Monster Subduers most elite disciples were gathered here. This place had formed an incomparably huge flesh mill. Countless elite monsters were crazily attacking this little space.","Most of the disciples at the seventh tier of the Divine Abilities Stage and above were guarding this spot. There were also many Core elders on guard. They formed a large array as if they were guarding something.","Chu Yunfan sensed the auras of many powerful monsters around this underground space, at least above the Core Stage. These monster kings above the Core Stage commanded the ordinary monsters to attack this underground space.","It was clear that there was something in this underground space.","Chu Yunfan could feel that these monster kings were getting impatient as if they were planning to take action themselves.","An incomparably powerful monster king stepped out. It was an incomparably huge python. This python was at least a few hundred feet long, and it was terrifyingly long. He opened his bloody mouth and transformed into a middle-aged man. He said to the disciples guarding the stele, “Puny Monster Subduers, you dare stand in the way of our army? You’re courting death.”","This middle-aged man was tall and slender, and he carried a sinister aura. Then an armored ape descended from the sky. It held a huge iron staff and smashed it atop the barrier. The entire barrier shook violently as if the sky was collapsing.","Chu Yunfan could see that the core of the barrier was near the stele, and the demons’ attacks was concentrated on this spot.","‘I wonder what’s hidden at the stele.’ Chu Yunfan took a closer look and realized that a hole had been punched through the barrier. The barrier formed by the Monster Subduer’s Core elders and tier seven Divines was to guard this hole.","Countless monsters rushed forward one after another, but they were strangled to death as if they had encountered a flesh mill. Even so, Chu Yunfan could see that the elders and disciples in the barrier were extremely tired. Their replenishment of divine power could not keep up with their speed of consumption.","These Core demon kings didn’t make a move. Instead, they kept driving these monsters to their deaths. They were clearly trying to exhaust the human’s divine power.","“Hold on! Once Junior Sect Master awakens the Monster Vanquisher, we’ll be able to kill these beasts and chase them out!” an old man shouted as he strode forth.","Chu Yunfan recognized him. He was the chief elder of the Monster Subduers. He was the third strongest expert in the Monster Subduers after Yun Huang and Yun Tian. His strength had long entered the half-step Core Form Stage. With such strength, if he had not been in the Monster Subduers all this time, he would have been famous all over the world.","Apart from him, Chu Yunfan also saw several half-step Core Formers, as well as several peak Void Cores. The number of experts here far outweighed the other forces in Great Wei. That was why Yun Tian had said that if the Monster Subduers had not kept a low profile, the so-called five great experts of Great Wei would have all belonged to the Monster Subduers.","Yun Tian indeed had his reasons for being proud.","‘What about Yun Huang? Where did he go?’ Chu Yunfan was puzzled. From what the chief elder of the Monster Subduers said, Yun Tian was in the space under the Monster Subduer Stele, but where was Yun Huang?","At this moment, a sudden change occurred. The space under the stele that had been tightly blocked suddenly erupted with a violent explosion."]},{"number":1535,"title":"Chapter 1535 The Barrier Shatters, Terror Reigns","paragraphs":["1535 The Barrier Shatters, Terror Reigns","With this huge explosion, the originally orderly barrier suddenly became chaotic. It injured a few Monster Subduers disciples with relatively low cultivation levels.","Immediately after, a black figure flew out from the depths of the cave. This black figure rushed into the barrier and started a massacre. In just a moment, the figure had killed more than ten Divine disciples.","In addition to the people who were injured by the explosion, the entire barrier was in complete chaos, and it started to flatter.","“D*mn it!”","The chief elder was furious. He did not know what had happened in the underground cave, but there was no doubt that this black figure was an enemy and not a friend. He took a step forward and chased after it.","He instantly slapped down. He was a half-step Core Former. Though he was not in the Core Form Stage, his strength was still extraordinary. This slap was enough to shatter a mountain.","However, the black figure turned around and struck out as well. In a moment, it clashed with the chief elder.","Boom!","This collision turned into a terrifying energy tide, almost causing the barrier to collapse.","“How is this possible?!”","The chief elder suddenly realized that this black figure was a half-step Core Former. In terms of strength, it was not inferior to him, and might even surpass him. But at least this attack had slowed the black figure.","Finally, people could see clearly what that black figure was.","The figure was a black cat the size of a calf with a huge scar on its forehead. He was fast, so fast that ordinary people could not keep up with him. Ordinary Divines could not withstand a single blow from him, and he killed more than ten of them in an instant.","“D*mn it! Hell Cat King, you were hiding in the cave and didn’t leave!” the chief elder roared angrily. He stared at the black cat that looked like a calf. The black fur on its body was a strange black color as if it represented death.","This was the famous cat king of the demons. It was said that this cat king was originally just an ordinary cat demon, but later on, he had a fortuitous encounter. His intelligence developed greatly and he cultivated a demonic technique that required him to absorb a large amount of human souls to greatly increase his cultivation.","Thus, Hell Cat King infiltrated Great Wei more than once and carried out massacres, wiping out entire towns. He was powerful and came and went like the wind. Nobody could catch him, and he was very proud of himself for a time.","Later on, he angered Monster Subduers’ sect master, Yun Huang. He chased the demon for thousands of miles and killed his way into the demon league. He almost killed Hell Cat King in one strike. If it was not for the fear of the other Core Form demon kings that came after him, Hell Cat King would have died long ago.","Hence, they formed a life and death feud. Yun Huang’s attack had severely injured the Hell Cat King’s foundation, preventing him from stepping into the Core Form Stage. Hell Cat King was one of the demon experts who had attacked the Monster Subduer Stele. However, he didn’t retreat with the other demons. Instead, he hid in the underground cave and made trouble.","“Sh*t, Junior Sect Master is in trouble!” The chief elder suddenly realized that with Hell Cat King here, the Junior Sect Master who was inside must be in big trouble.","Under normal circumstances, the ten Hell Cat Kings were no match for the Junior Sect Master, but now was the crucial moment that he was awakening the Monster Vanquisher. If he was ambushed, the consequences would be unimaginable.","“Hahaha, that’s right. You didn’t expect this, did you? I’m going to kill everyone in the Monster Subduer for that sword attack!” Hell Cat King opened his bloody mouth and spoke in human language as it laughed.","“You think you’ll get away with this?!” The other half-step Core Formers of the Monster Subduers rushed over in anger.","“Hahaha, you think you can stop me?” Hell Cat King burst into laughter. He turned into a black light and escaped from the formation.","“Hurry up, guys. I severely injured Yun Tian and he is unable to awaken the Monster Vanquisher. This is a rare opportunity for us to attack the Monster Subduers and get rid of the demon league’s biggest threat!”","Hell Cat King escaped from the formation. He was fast, and he had no intention of letting the chief elder stop him. The chief elder could only watch as he escaped. He was furious, but there was nothing he could do.","“Alright, my children. Kill them. Break through the barrier and wipe out the Monster Subduers!”","The armored ape king let out a strange cry. He waved the incomparably huge iron staff in his hand and smashed it on the barrier.","Boom!","The barrier was instantly shattered. The barrier that was already difficult to maintain was now turned into nothingness. In the barrier, whether it was the Divine disciples or the Core elders, they were all forced back and coughed out mouthfuls of blood.","It was clear that the barrier had backfired on them.","This armored ape was a Core Form demon king. Its strength was extremely powerful and terrifying.","At this moment, countless monsters cried out and pounced on the humans.","‘My life is over!’ There was only one thought in everyone’s mind—they were dead.","Facing such terrifying existences, they had tried their best, but there was no way to resist. They could barely fight against Core Former demon kings with the help of the barrier. Now that it was gone, they had no chance of winning against Core Former demon kings. These two tyrannical demon kings could kill them all in minutes.","“Hahaha, die!”","The armored ape king laughed. He raised his iron staff and smashed it down on the humans. The terrifying demonic power set off a shocking tide. If this attack fell, everyone in the barrier would die a tragic death.","“Stop!”","An exasperated voice came from the depths of the Demon Subduer Stele’s cave. However, it couldn’t match the iron staff’s speed."]},{"number":1536,"title":"Chapter 1536 A Casually Slap Is So Terrifying!","paragraphs":["1536 A Casually Slap Is So Terrifying!","An exasperated voice rang out from the space beneath the Monster Subduer Stele. However, it was too late to stop the iron staff from smashing down.","‘We’re finished!’","This was the only thought left in the minds of these Monster Subduers disciples. Compared to Core Formers, they were as weak as ants. Even a half-step Core Former would find it difficult to protect themselves.","Bam!","However, the staff did not meet its mark. Instead, it was grabbed by a large hand made out of air. A sound like metal clashing rang out.","“What is it? Impossible!”","The armored ape king’s expression paled. He knew very well that this staff was a middle-grade spirit weapon that he had refined. All of his wealth had been spent on this iron staff. It might not seem like much, but it was extremely powerful. Even an ordinary low-grade spirit weapon would be smashed into pieces if it was hit by this staff.","His greatest confidence lay in his staff, and he knew that he had done his best in this attack. He had no intention of holding back. He wanted to destroy all these Monster Subduer disciples in one go.","However, it was caught by a large hand made of energy. This minor divine power that could be used by an Innate should not have been able to withstand a single blow. Even if a hundred hands came, they would be turned into ashes by his staff.","Panic flashed through the ape’s eyes.","All of this took a long time to describe, but it only took an instant. Everyone was horrified to find that another huge hand had slapped down from the sky. It was clearly just a huge hand that was only a few meters in circumference, but when it slammed down, it was like a mountain falling from the sky.","A terrifying pressure descended from the sky. Just as the disciples were in despair, they realized that the hand wasn’t aimed at them. It was aimed directly at the Hell Cat King who was about to escape the barrier.","Hell Cat King, who was extremely fast, was pinned to the ground as if he was caught in a huge net. He felt as if he had run into a giant hand and was pressed down onto the ground, creating a huge crack.","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. They could tell that Hell Cat King didn’t run to the hand on his own. Instead, his escape had been calculated. Someone had predicted his moves. One could imagine how shocking the person behind this was.","Everyone looked up into the sky and saw that a young man in black had appeared out of nowhere. The young man easily blocked a Core Former demon king’s attack while pressing down on the half-step Core Former Hell Cat King. The two famous monster kings of the demons were like toys in front of this person.","“Chu Yunfan?!” someone shouted.","Everyone was in an uproar. It was Chu Yunfan!","The humans had mixed feelings about Chu Yunfan. After all, he had used their sect to pave his fame and become the number one expert in Great Wei. He had defeated Yun Huang and became the publicly acknowledged number-one expert of Great Wei.","In the past, they were not convinced of him and felt that he would not win against Yun Huang, whose strength had greatly improved after seclusion. If there was another battle, it was unknown who would win. However, there had never been a moment like this. They hoped that Chu Yunfan lived up to his name and save them from this abyss of suffering.","Countless people at the gates of the sect also spotted Chu Yunfan descending from the sky like a god. Their originally frightened expressions revealed a few traces of surprise and joy. No matter whether they hated Chu Yunfan or liked him, they were now looking at their savior.","“Hoho, things are pretty lively around here!”","Chu Yunfan walked down step by step, seemingly slow but actually fast. In just a moment, he had arrived above the barrier.","“Be careful, Master Chu! There are too many demons!” the chief elder shouted.","The monster kings were frightened by Chu Yunfan. The ordinary monsters had shed their intelligence, leaving only the will to kill. When they saw Chu Yunfan, they were not afraid. Like a landslide and a tsunami, they pounced on him.","“It’s fine. They’re just a bunch of clowns.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Rrrraaaagh”","A loud beast roar rang out. Everyone looked over and saw Hell Cat King was trying to get up. His entire body was trembling.","“Did I say you could stand up? Since you want to die first, I’ll fulfill your wish.” Chu Yunfan sneered, and the giant hand flew up.","When Hell Cat King felt the pressure on his body lighten, he was instantly delighted. He turned into a black light and tried to escape. However, what followed was the huge hand slapping down again.","Bam!","The collision was even more shocking than the previous one. Everyone watched as Hell Cat King was smashed to the ground again. What made them suck in a breath of cold air was that Hell Cat King had stopped moving. He had stopped breathing and his iron-like body had turned into a bloody mess.","Everyone was dumbfounded. A half-step Core Former demon king that no one could do anything about had been slapped to death. Moreover, this was not Chu Yunfan’s full strength. It was just an energy hand.","Everyone knew that an energy hand did not unleash even one-tenth of the user’s original strength. It was just a ball of spirit energy. But even under such circumstances, Hell Cat King couldn’t withstand a single slap.","When the armored ape king noticed Chu Yunfan’s gaze on him, all the hairs on his body stood up in fear. Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept over him. It made him feel as if he was being stared at by a terrifying beast.","Ever since he unlocked his spiritual intelligence and cultivated into a demon, he had not felt this fear that came through the biological chain."]},{"number":1537,"title":"Chapter 1537 Killing a Core Former in Two Moves","paragraphs":["1537 Killing a Core Former in Two Moves","And now, the fear in his bones resurface, and he felt a chill run down his spine. Immediately after, he felt the staff in his hand suffer a terrifying force. He tried to struggle, but he could not shake off the large energy hand.","He felt that if he did not let go of the staff, he would be pulled over. He couldn’t defend against it. This feeling was unprecedented. After all, although he was part of the demon race that was not large and was smaller than the humans, they were famous for being strong.","He could throw around ordinary monsters that were as big as hills as if they were toys. However, faced with this large energy hand, he was completely powerless to retaliate. The other party exerted force and he was dragged over ten meters. If this continued, he would be dragged toward the other party’s side.","Thinking of this, his hair stood on end. He sucked in a breath of cold air and felt an extreme sense of danger. He instinctively chose to let go. Immediately, the staff was grabbed by the huge hand that had appeared out of thin air.","Chu Yunfan sneered. The ape king reacted rather quickly and let go at a critical moment. Otherwise, he would have been pulled over. If the ape king had been pulled to his reach, he would have died.","This ape king was strong, but that depended on who it was compared to. Compared to a freak with infinite strength like Chu Yunfan, it was nothing. The Thunderclap Physique and the Imperial Physique were extremely powerful, and the combination of the two made his strength even more shocking. Purely competing with him in strength was courting death.","At this moment, everyone realized how terrifying Chu Yunfan was. He was just standing there. The large energy hand grabbed the staff and started to twirl it. Suddenly, it emitted a series of mournful and deep sounds that broke through the air.","As it twirled, it formed a shocking frenzy.","All of this took a long time to describe, but it was just an instant. The monsters that were like a tide pounced over. These monsters were above the Divine Abilities Stage. They formed groups and charged in by the thousands. The scene was extremely terrifying.","Boom!","The staff smashed down, and endless divine power spread out, turning into lightning, turning the entire sky into a sea of lightning. As the staff swept down, thousands of Divine monsters were wiped out with a single strike. Suddenly, Chu Yunfan’s surroundings became empty.","Everyone was dumbfounded. That was thousands of Divine monsters. Even a Core Former would have fled at the sight of them. As the saying went, quantitative change led to qualitative change. When the number reached a certain level, even Divines who were looked down upon by Core Formers could erupt with extremely shocking and terrifying power.","‘Is he a monster in human skin?’","This thought flashed through the minds of some people. To them, this was something that had never happened before. Chu Yunfan’s strength was too shocking for them.","As the staff struck, the lightning formed by the divine power brought about a terrifying tide that swept away everything. The monsters that were swept by it exploded in the air one after another.","Such terrifying strength was enough to make anyone’s scalp go numb. This attack was terrifying.","“Not bad,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly. Then, he looked at the armored ape king and said, “It’s your turn.”","The armored ape king felt his hair stand on end when Chu Yunfan looked at him. It was as if he had been targeted by an ancient beast.","In an instant, the staff smashed down. It felt as if the entire world had been destroyed.","“Sh*t!”","The ape king was scared out of his wits and hastily retreated. It felt as if this was not just a staff smashing down. It felt as if the entire world had collapsed along with it.","The ape king wanted to run away, but he could not keep up with Chu Yunfan’s speed. Chu Yunfan was too fast. In almost an instant, he was hit with the staff.","Clang!","A huge explosion sounded like the sound of metal clashing. Everyone saw that the ape king, who had turned into a beam of light to escape, was smashed by this staff. His body which was as hard as iron was smashed to the ground.","Boom!","A huge pit was smashed into the ground. With the ape as the center, cracks spread out in all directions like a spider web. The ape king looked extremely miserable. He was no longer as high-spirited and arrogant as before.","His body did not crumble from the attack, but there were countless cracks all over his body. Blood flowed out and formed a pool of blood. He looked extremely miserable as his entire body was soaked in blood.","“Rrrraaaagh!”","The ape king struggled to escape. Although he was heavily injured, the fear in his heart caused him to burn his life force and stimulate his potential. He began to escape crazily.","However, Chu Yunfan, who had already reached this stage, would not just watch as the ape king escaped. He smashed down with the staff again.","The ape king was not so lucky this time. It was already heavily injured, and its body, which was riddled with wounds, instantly exploded in mid-air.","Two hits!","In just two hits, the ape king, who had entered the Core Form Stage, was smashed to death by Chu Yunfan before everyone’s eyes. They all stared at Chu Yunfan. This could no longer be described as powerful. This was a monster—a terrifying monster. At the same time, his methods were brutal.","When they saw Chu Yunfan beating up the ape king, a title appeared in everyone’s mind—a ferocious monster.","After killing the ape king with a single strike, Chu Yunfan looked at the middle-aged man who had transformed into a giant python. The man’s hair stood on end. After all, in all his years of cultivation, he had never felt so terrified before. It was as if the grim reaper was right beside him."]},{"number":1538,"title":"Chapter 1538 Resolving the Crisis","paragraphs":["1538 Resolving the Crisis","He couldn’t help but be afraid. First, Hell Cat King had been killed by Chu Yunfan with two slaps. Then, the Ape King, who had entered the Core Form Stage, was killed by his own magic weapon in two whacks.","The ape king’s magic tool was a middle-grade spirit tool. All of them had spirit energy, but there was not the slightest bit of resistance. What did this mean? It meant that the moment Chu Yunfan grabbed the staff, he suppressed the weapon with absolute strength. Then, he unleashed such an astonishing attack.","Core Formers were kingdom guardians. In the demon league, where there were many powerful warriors, they were at the top of the pyramid. How could he not be afraid when his comrades were casually knocked struck to death?","At this moment, his back was cold, and he felt as if he had fallen into an ice cave. His hair stood on end and his sixth sense was going off. He trusted his sixth sense very much. One’s sixth sense was much more accurate than anything else.","He immediately decided to turn around and flee. He believed in his sixth sense and did not dare to stay.","However, Chu Yunfan would not let him escape so easily. He immediately smashed the staff down. The staff was a middle-grade spirit weapon and was huge. Although the middle-aged man was fast and was about to escape on a light beam, the staff in Chu Yunfan’s hand swelled and caught up with the man. Then, it fell down.","Bam!","There was another loud sound of metal clashing. Then, everyone saw a huge python falling from the sky. The middle-aged man had been beaten back to his original form. It was an incomparably huge snake king, which was considered a top-notch expert among the demons.","Scales that didn’t belong to the snake race appeared on his body. There were even two bumps on his head. This was clearly a sign that he was about to transform into a flood dragon.","Dragons were one of the most powerful creatures in the world. According to rumors, they could even challenge the gods. In other words, they were one of the legendary god races that could control clouds and rain.","Although the flood dragon was only a subspecies of the dragon race, it was still terrifying among the demons, especially now that the pure-blooded dragon race was nowhere to be found. Among the many subspecies of the dragon race, the flood dragon was considered the most powerful.","If he could transform into a flood dragon, he would be truly powerful. He would probably surpass the Core Stage and reach another level.","But now, he would never get the chance. Chu Yunfan had smashed him to the ground. It was as if a mountain had fallen, setting off thousands of feet of dust.","Soon, the ground beneath him was soaked in endless blood. This was because his body was the same as the ape king’s. There were dense wounds all over his body. It was cracked by Chu Yunfan’s attack.","He struggled to get up, but he couldn’t. Chu Yunfan waved and the energy hand smashed down again.","Bam!","The head of the snake king was smashed by Chu Yunfan’s staff. The huge body struggled but soon stopped moving. This Snake King had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","“How scary!”","It was deathly silent. Even the monster army, which was shouting and fighting, was frightened. These beasts had the sharpest senses, so they knew very well how terrifying that black-robed young man was. That was a suppression erupting from their gut, making them tremble in fear.","They had been driven by these demon kings to attack the Monster Subduers. Now that these demon kings had been killed by Chu Yunfan, how could they dare to stay? Their rationality had returned.","The millions of monsters were endless, but they all dispersed quickly. Although these monsters did not have high intelligence, the more intelligent they were, the more they could feel how terrifying Chu Yunfan was. They did not dare to stay behind and acted according to their instincts.","“We survived! Hahahaha! We actually survived!”","“Grandmaster, bless us! We aren’t dead!”","Everyone in the Monster Subduers was in a state of jubilation. They thought that they were going to die and were prepared to die. Even if they did, they would drag these monsters down with them.","Such a large-scale monster invasion was something that even Great Wei’s imperial court could not deal with. They could not even protect themselves. They never expected Chu Yunfan to crack it.","Everyone cheered loudly. The feeling of escaping death was too good. Many people began to weep silently. There had been too many casualties, especially in the mountains where the Monster Subduers were located. There were countless civilians, and they were all related to the Monster Subduers in some way. Only a portion of them were lucky enough to escape. Although the Monster Subduers had carried out rescue and evacuation, only a portion of them could be saved.","Many of their family and friends had died in the mouths of the monsters. Previously, the monster army had surrounded them and they had no time to think about this. However, now that they had escaped death, this came to mind.","After the initial joy of escaping death passed, everyone began to feel saddened. Countless cries gathered into a flood.","Chu Yunfan sighed and shook his head. Although these monsters were powerful, they were just a group of animals. When they were controlled by others, they were fearless and had no concept of death. However, once their leader was killed, they immediately fell apart. If it was human elites, such as the Blood Barbarians or the Imperial Guards of Great Wei, even if their leader was killed, they would fight to the last person.","This was the difference. One side did not fear death because they did not have the concept of death, while the other side knew death and was willing to die.","Chu Yunfan quickly put away the staff and the three demon king corpses, which became the nourishment for the Brahma Tree. He descended and entered the underground cave of the Monster Subduers.","At this moment, in the center of the coffin, a huge sword that was about a hundred feet long and a few feet wide was stabbed into the coffin. The huge sword emitted a sealing light as if it was suppressing something."]},{"number":1539,"title":"Chapter 1539 The Demon Under the Monster Subduer Stele","paragraphs":["1539 The Demon Under the Monster Subduer Stele","The huge sword was stabbed into a coffin. The sword emitted a faint pressure as if it was suppressing something. However, the lid of the coffin had been lifted and pushed to the side.","The coffin was unusual. It was not an ordinary coffin. It was covered in hot golden patterns. These patterns looked extremely ancient and had a special meaning. They were extraordinary and not just for looks. Ordinary people couldn’t understand these golden patterns but Chu Yunfan could see that these golden patterns were actually a kind of barrier after just studying it for a moment.","It was a sealing enchantment!","Chu Yunfan’s interest was piqued. The sword and coffin seemed to be suppressing something.","‘Monster Subduers?’ Chu Yunfan suddenly thought of something. He could feel that although the coffin was not very large, it was an extremely pure and powerful demonic energy.","Chu Yunfan suddenly thought of something. The name “Monster Subduers” probably contained some meaning. It was not just a name but had a deeper meaning.","“Master Chu, I didn’t expect you to save me again,” Yun Tian said with a bitter smile.","“It’s nothing. Heal first. We’ll talk once you’re better.” Chu Yunfan immediately came to Yun Tian and protected him. Yun Tian could finally recover and start healing.","Chu Yunfan did not give him any healing pills because as the young master of the Monster Subduers, Yun Tian had a shocking amount of wealth. Naturally, he would not lack healing pills. However, similar to before, he did not have time to heal his injuries.","With Chu Yunfan protecting him, he could rest assured. He immediately stuffed all kinds of healing pills into his mouth as if they were free. Yun Tian recovered more than half his strength in minutes. The remaining injuries would require time to recover. They could not be recovered in a hurry.","This had already hurt his foundation.","“Thank you for today, Master Chu. If it weren’t for you, I’m afraid we wouldn’t have made it through. Thousands of the Monster Subduers would have died.” Yun Tian stood up and bowed to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan nodded. Although Yun Tian was still young, he was concerned about the world. Chu Yunfan had saved him once before, but he had not given Chu Yunfan such a big bow then. But when Chu Yunfan saved everyone in the Monster Subduers, Yun Tian was willing to give Chu Yunfan such a big bow.","The Monster Subduers were more important than his own life.","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop him. He just said, “Tell me, what’s going on.”","“Sigh, now that things have come to this, there’s nothing to hide,” Yun Tian said, “You’ve heard of some of the legends of the Monster Subduers, correct? According to the rumors, the founder of our sect came to the western border to suppress the demons and established the Monster Subduers to suppress them.”","Chu Yunfan nodded. He had heard about this rumor. It was said that the founder of the Monster Subduers was very powerful. Later, to suppress a powerful demon clan, he established the Monster Subduers.","“It isn’t just a rumor, but the truth,” Yun Tian said, “You might not know this, but the Monster Subduers’ mission is to suppress this demon, a very powerful one. Our sect has known about this for generations, but not many outsiders know about it. In fact, only the sect master and the sect master’s heir of each generation has full knowledge of this matter.”","Chu Yunfan nodded. In other words, only Yun Huang and Yun Tian knew about this. However, this secret could no longer be kept. After all, the space under the Monster Subduer Stele had been broken through. The huge sword and coffin were probably prepared to guard that demon, but they were broken through. The lid of the coffin had been lifted, and the demon that was suppressed inside had disappeared.","This in itself already explained the problem. The suppression had failed.","Chu Yunfan felt that things were about to get tricky. Others might not be able to understand the patterns on the coffin, but he could. It was a shocking sealing enchantment. Coupled with the mysterious material of the coffin and the huge sword on the outside, one could imagine how strict the arrangements were. Moreover, how many years had passed since the founder of the Monster Subduers established the sect? Even the people of the Monster Subduers themselves were not sure. It had been at least thousands of years.","After thousands of years, the demon that had been suppressed had not died. It was still alive and had been rescued. What a terrifying monster this was. If it was a human expert, they would have long become a pile of bones. Even for demons, thousands of years was an extremely long time.","Although monsters were born with long lifespans, it was very difficult for them to break through to more than 1,000 years. Core monsters had a lifespan of 1,000 years. Although it was much longer than that of humans, it was already shocking to live for thousands of years without dying from serious injuries.","This meant that this demon’s cultivation was above the Core Stage. It was not even the Golden Core Stage, which was stronger than the Core Form Stage, but a level that had completely surpassed the Core Stage.","Only by doing so could he have survived until now.","Just how strong was this demon? It was not to be underestimated. Even the founder of the Monster Subduers could not kill it. It could only suppress it generation after generation.","Chu Yunfan felt a sense of fear when he thought about it. The more he thought about it, the more problematic it became.","“And the demons’ surprise attack was to save this demon,” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at Yun Tian.","“That’s right. Their goal was to save this demon, and they succeeded. My master rushed here to hold back the demon but he was ambushed by several Core Former demon kings who were prepared for this,” Yun Tian said.","As he said this, his face revealed a hideous expression."]},{"number":1540,"title":"Chapter 1540 For the Sake of the World","paragraphs":["1540 For the Sake of the World","“An ambush?” Chu Yunfan frowned. “It seems that it was premeditated and not a whim.”","“That’s right, it was premeditated,” Yun Tian said.","“But what was being suppressed here?” Chu Yunfan asked. “To be able to make the demons pay so much attention to it, it must be no ordinary demon.”","“Indeed. It’s been a long time and records have been lost.” Yun Tian shook his head. “The only thing we know is that this demon is extremely extraordinary. It came from beyond the heavens and isn’t a native demon. It came here and started a massacre. In the end, our founder suppressed it. All this time, our sect has been constantly strengthening this barrier to prevent anyone from breaking through.” He sighed. “But today, that monster still managed to escape. It’s a calamity!”","“Calamity? I don’t believe that. I only believe in myself,” Chu Yunfan said, “Since this place has been breached, what are you doing here? You were even ambushed by Hell Cat King.”","Yun Tian explained, “I wanted to wake the Monster Vanquisher. This is a magical sword that our ancestors spent a lot of effort to forge. It was this Monster Vanquisher that suppressed that demon. Now that the demon has escaped, the world will fall into a state of misery.","“Our ancestor said that if that demon escaped one day, he’d awaken the Monster Vanquisher and kill it. Now is the most critical moment,” Yun Tian said, “Now, not only has that monster escaped, but countless monsters have invaded the western border and are about to sweep the world. Do you know why?”","Chu Yunfan shook his head. “Does this matter have anything to do with that demon?”","“It has everything to do with that demon. That demon has been suppressed by our ancestor’s Monster Vanquisher for so many years, and there’s not much blood left in its body. In other words, even if it’s not dead, it’s at the brink of death,” Yun Tian said, “The demons did their best to save this demon, so they definitely won’t let it die. According to our intelligence, many demon kings are working together to set up a Blood and Spirit Revival Circle in the demon league. It’s an amazing array that can revive even a dying person.","“But there’s a problem with this array. The stronger the person you want to save, the more blood you’ll need. The people who were killed by the monsters will eventually provide energy for the circle,” Yun Tian said, “If we don’t stop them, I’m afraid all of Great Wei will be massacred. That’s why I came here to restore the Monster Vanquisher. Who knew that at the most critical moment, I’d be ambushed by Hell Cat King.”","“So that’s what happened. No wonder those demons allowed the monsters to massacre wantonly.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","If the demon league intended to attack Great Wei, the best way was to lead countless monsters to attack the capital of Great Wei as quickly as possible. In that case, Great Wei would be leaderless and unable to effectively organize armies. At that time, the fall of Great Wei would only be a matter of time.","Chu Yunfan didn’t doubt whether these beasts had such an ability because many of them were intelligent. This was basic strategic thinking. There was no reason for those monster kings to not understand this.","And now, those monsters had spread out to the entire western border to go on a killing spree. They did not concentrate their forces to break through Great Wei’s defenses and approach the Imperial Capital.","Chu Yunfan was a little puzzled at first. He didn’t expect such a reason behind it.","“We don’t have much time left. Most of the people on the western border have been killed. Other than those who’ve escaped, there are only a few thousand people that our sect has taken in. This means that even if that demon doesn’t fully recover, it’ll recover by half at least. When it fully recovers, the world will fall into the demon’s mouth.” Yun Tian stood up and bowed to Chu Yunfan. “I’ve already failed. I’m severely injured and won’t be able to fully recover in a short time. Even if I awaken the Monster Vanquisher, I’m afraid I won’t be able to turn the situation around.”","Chu Yunfan’s expression was solemn. He could see that Yun Tian had given up all his previous grudges and was truly concerned about the lives of the world.","“Since you’ve said so, I’m obliged to do so. But isn’t the Monster Vanquisher your sect’s treasure?” Chu Yunfan said, “If I want to awaken the sword and wield it like an arm, I need to refine it. If that happens, I’m afraid it won’t belong to your sect anymore.”","“Master Chu, please make your move as soon as possible. The Monster Vanquisher was forged to suppress that demon. That is its mission,” Yun Tian said, “Our sect has declined since the time of our founder. No one can control the Monster Vanquisher anymore. I was planning to sacrifice my life to the Monster Vanquisher to awaken its power, but Master Chu, you’re different. Your future is among the stars of the heavens, not this small pond. Therefore, the Monster Vanquisher in your hands is not a disgrace to the sword’s prestige, nor does it disappoint our founder. Even if my master was here, I believe he wouldn’t object.","“Please, for the sake of the world, please, Master Chu!” Yun Tian bowed deeply again.","“In that case, I won’t object anymore.” Chu Yunfan nodded. If things were as Yun Tian had said, things would have reached a point where they could not be salvaged. He really needed the Monster Vanquisher.","“That’s great. I’ll relay to you the method to awaken and refine the sword,” Yun Tian hurriedly said.","As he spoke, Yun Tian quickly sent the awakening and refining method of the Monster Vanquisher into Chu Yunfan’s mind. A complicated awakening ritual and sacrificial refining method appeared in Chu Yunfan’s mind. The godhead in his mind flickered slightly. In just a moment, he had already understood the various mysteries and was ready to start refining."]},{"number":1541,"title":"Chapter 1541 Subduing the Monster Subduers","paragraphs":["1541 Subduing the Monster Subduers","Seeing that Chu Yunfan was ready to start the ritual almost immediately, without even asking him about it or without any further need to comprehend it, Yun Tian was shocked and quickly said, “Aren’t you going to comprehend it fully first, Master Chu?”","“I’ve already learned it. There’s no need.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Yun Tian choked. He never expected Chu Yunfan’s answer to be that he had grasped everything completely. The method of awakening and refining the Monster Vanquisher was very complicated. Back then, he had to learn it for a month before he was confident that he could awaken the sword.","This was one of the unique inheritances of the Monster Subduers’ sect master. But now, Chu Yunfan had learned it in just a few moves? How could he believe it? Looking at Chu Yunfan’s expression, it was definitely not a joke. Moreover, he knew that Chu Yunfan would never joke about this matter. He could only retreat to the side and watch as Chu Yunfan started to form seals. He recognized that this was the starting stance to awaken the Monster Vanquisher.","As Chu Yunfan formed the seals one by one, the enormous divine power in his body was guided out and poured into the sword at an extremely shocking speed. The sword, which had been quietly floating above the coffin, burst out with extremely bright light, echoing with Chu Yunfan’s divine power.","‘He truly has learned it!’ Yun Tian looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief as if he had seen a ghost. When he saw that Chu Yunfan had learned the ritual, he was almost scared to death.","What kind of astonishing monster was this? Back then, he had only been confident after learning for a month. Chu Yunfan was already confident in just a few short moments. He thought of Chu Yunfan’s age and how he was already the number one expert in the world at only twenty. When Yun Tian was in his twenties, he was only in the Divine Abilities Stage. There was no doubt that the difference was huge.","Perhaps such monsters existed in this world.","What he didn’t know was that Chu Yunfan had the help of the godhead, and his comprehension was already at the super monstrous level. In addition, he also had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor. He had a deep understanding of this awakening ritual and the refining method. It was far from what Yun Tian could imagine.","He was standing at an extremely high altitude and looking down at this refining technique. From a strategic position, it was naturally extraordinary. As Chu Yunfan’s divine power continued to be injected into the sword, the Monster Vanquisher continued to emit a powerful pressure. It was released in waves and formed a resonance with Chu Yunfan’s divine power. As this resonance continued to grow, the Monster Vanquisher’s pressure was gradually released.","The sword had been dormant for many years, and now, it finally began to wake up at Chu Yunfan’s behest. He immersed in it and slowly sensed the Monster Vanquisher. In his mind, a huge sword appeared out of thin air. A voice rang out in Chu Yunfan’s mind.","“Who call upon me?”","Chu Yunfan knew that this was the voice of the Monster Vanquisher’s spirit. He continued to increase his divine power and injected it into the sword. He formed complicated seals and released his divine power, forming a storm.","Yun Tian, who was not far away from Chu Yunfan, hastily retreated. His eyes flickered with disbelief. He had spent a full day and night to finally awaken to this extent. Chu Yunfan had only just started for a moment, but he had already revived the Monster Vanquisher to an even further extent. It was about to be awakened.","He had to admit that there were geniuses and mediocrity in this world. However, he wasn’t a mediocre person. He was a genius, and this Chu Yunfan in front of him wasn’t a genius, but a monster.","Monsters weren’t humans, so humans couldn’t compete with monsters because there was no need.","After another two hours, endless sword light shot into the sky. Everyone in the Monster Subduers saw a sword light that was more than ten thousand feet long and hundreds of feet wide tear through the sky.","Zzt!","The air shook violently. Everyone could feel that the foundation of the sect shake violently. This sword light had reached a terrifying level. The monsters around the sect fled at an astonishing speed as if they had sensed their natural enemy. Even the Cores of the sect were stunned.","This sword light was terrifying.","If this sword light even brushed them, it would be a dead end. They would be instantly severyl injured. Even a Core would end up with his body shattered.","“That place... This sword light... Could it be the legendary Monster Vanquisher?” A Core elder stared at the scene in front of him with his mouth agape. It was as if he had seen a ghost.","The sword light shot into the sky like a heavenly pillar.","In the Monster Subduers, not many people have seen the Monster Vanquisher. But as an elder, although he was not clear about the various secrets of the sect, he was not completely ignorant.","They knew about the existence of such a divine sword, especially at the moment of life and death. Yun Tian wanted to awaken the Monster Vanquisher and make its existence public. It was just that the Monster Vanquisher had been dormant for many years, and they had never seen the Monster Vanquisher truly awaken.","Immediately after, everyone felt that the terrifying sword light that soared into the sky gradually weaken as if this force was being controlled by someone.","“Has Junior Sect Master already awakened the Monster Vanquisher?” someone guessed, crying in surprise and joy.","The power of the Monster Vanquisher was evident from just this. It was extraordinary. With just one strike, any demon king that was cut would die. With a sweep of the sword, thousands of monsters would die.","Its power was naturally great.","After a long time, the sword light finally extinguished, and a figure flew out from under the Monster Subduer Stele, holding an ancient sword. Everyone looked and saw that it was not the junior sect master, Yun Tian, but Chu Yunfan.","This immediately caused a huge uproar. However, they immediately saw Yun Tian flying out closely after him. The two sides did not seem to have fought, so they heaved a sigh of relief.","They knew that this was probably Yun Tian’s decision. Chu Yunfan was the number one expert in the world. The Monster Vanquisher was more suitable for him than Yun Tian, who was currently heavily injured."]},{"number":1542,"title":"Chapter 1542 Sword Trial, Infinite Power","paragraphs":["1542 Sword Trial, Infinite Power","Chu Yunfan held the Monster Vanquisher in his hand. A terrifying power was boiled within the sword, but Chu Yunfan forcefully suppressed it.","‘This sword is no ordinary weapon,’ Chu Yunfan’s expression was solemn as he thought about it. He had awakened the Monster Vanquisher, thinking he had broken the sword’s seal. But after completely refining the sword, he realized that he had only unlocked the first seal. Even though he had the method to refine it, with his strength, he could only undo the first layer of the seals on the Monster Vanquisher.","Even though only the first seal had been removed, the power of the Monster Vanquisher had already reached the level of a supreme-grade spirit weapon. Even Golden Cores who had surpassed the Core Form Stage only had superior-grade spirit weapons. Even so, not everyone had them. As for supreme-grade spirit weapons, they were only possessed by existences that had already surpassed the Core Form Stage. One could imagine how terrifying the Monster Vanquisher was.","“I’ve only managed to undone the first seal, and the swords already possess the power of a supreme-grade spirit weapon,” Chu Yunfan said with a sigh.","This Monster Vanquisher did not only have one seal. If it was completely unsealed, the power of this sword would reach an extremely shocking level. At the same time, he was certain that this Monster Vanquisher was not like what Yun Tian had said. It was not forged by this world, because the power of the Monster Vanquisher had already surpassed the limits of what this world could forge. A place’s martial arts level, alchemy level, and artifact refinement level were all closely related. It was impossible to surpass them by so much.","However, Chu Yunfan was not concerned about these things at the moment. He raised the Monster Vanquisher high up in the air and swung it out.","Boom!","A sword light that was more than ten thousand feet long and dozens of feet wide swept out and crushed down, falling directly into the endless monster army. A huge crater was formed in the ground, and a huge crack swept toward the endless army.","The monsters that the sword light swept across were all wiped out. They were killed and injured. With just one move, tens of thousands of demons were killed, and a large area of space was swept clean.","The terrifying power of this sword shook the entire sect. Everyone stared at the scene in front of them in a daze, as if they had seen an amazing miracle. Even Yun Tian, who was mentally prepared, was completely dumbfounded when he saw this scene.","He cursed at the sight. Even though he had long known that the Monster Vanquisher was extremely powerful, he had not expected it to be so terrifying. With a single strike, tens of thousands of monsters were instantly killed. Be it an Innate or a Divine, they were all killed.","Everyone was shocked. Chu Yunfan’s sword strike had given them hope. They had felt despair before, but now, there was real hope.","On the other hand, the Core demon kings hidden among the countless monsters were scared to death. If they were hit by this sword, their outcome would not be any better. These demon kings remembered records of this Monster Vanquisher in ancient legends. That destructive power was the root of the suppression on the powerful demons.","Those records were from a long long time ago. Now, they were finally seeing it with their own eyes. The ancient records were not without reason. On the contrary, they were all facts.","“Want to run now? I’m afraid it’s too late.”","Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and slashed down one again and again. Everyone saw the sword lights falling like a mountain range, falling into the endless monster army. Countless monsters exploded. A total of more than ten demon kings were struck by the sword lights. They were killed on the spot before they could even think. These Cores did not fare any better against Chu Yunfan’s attacks, and it was just a sword strikes.","Without these demon kings leading the way, all the powerful monsters that besieged the Monster Subduers collapsed. They quickly retreated. The figure flying in the sky had a great power over them.","“That’s amazing, Master Chu!” Yun Tian said. Then, he saw that Chu Yunfan’s face seemed a little pale. “Master Chu, are you all right?”","Chu Yunfan shook his head. “I’m fine. I just used too much divine power.”","Only then did Chu Yunfan finally catch his breath. The dozens of sword strikes had drained his divine power. The power of the Monster Vanquisher was astonishing, but it also put a huge strain on the user.","This was the difference between using technological attack methods. The use of technological weapons had zero requirements on the user’s strength. If one used a nuclear bomb, the effect would be far better than this and there would be no consumption on the user’s energy.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood. The Monster Vanquisher was not suitable for cleaning up ordinary monsters. The consumption of energy was too great. Unless he took a step further and reached a new level, it would be possible.","However, he was still very satisfied with the power of the Monster Vanquisher. Killing a Core demon king with the sword was as easy as playing a game. It was too easy. Not to mention a Core Former, even a Golden Core would not be able to withstand it.","Yun Tian looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. He knew the consumption of the Monster Vanquisher all too well. If it was him, he would have used up all his divine power with one strike. Unless he burned his life force to obtain powerful strength in a short period, he would only be able to use that sword with his full strength.","He was already in the Core Form Stage. Chu Yunfan had yet to enter the Core Form Stage, but he could actually unleash more than ten sword lights in one breath. This meant that Chu Yunfan’s mana was at least ten times stronger than his.","Chu Yunfan had yet to enter the Core Form Stage. If he had entered the Core Form Stage, his divine power would have increased by at least several times, which would be at least ten times more than Yun Tian’s.","He was a monster!","Yun Tian sighed. A monster was indeed a monster. It was not something that ordinary people could compare to.","It was really a case of comparing people to death and comparing goods to throw them away.","After a while, Chu Yunfan’s face regained its color. Suddenly, a figure flew out from the depths of the Monster Subduers and came toward Chu Yunfan and Yun Tian, shouting, “Junior Master, Master Chu, Jinzhanghan has sent millions of cavalry south and broke through the northern defense line.”"]},{"number":1543,"title":"Chapter 1543 The Imperial Capital, Endless Blood and Fire","paragraphs":["1543 The Imperial Capital, Endless Blood and Fire","Chu Yunfan and Yun Tian’s expressions changed when they heard this. Jinzhanghan was taking advantage of the situation. Now, most of Great Wei’s military forces were placed on the defense line at the western border.","There were not many soldiers left at the northern defense line. They had been unable to defeat Jinzhanghan in the first, so of course, they could not defeat Jinzhanghan now. Even under normal circumstances, Jinzhanghan’s 10 million strong army heading south would be a disaster for Great Wei, let alone now.","“D*mn it, these Jinzhanghan barbarians!”","Yun Tian was both shocked and furious. Although the Monster Subduers was semi-independent of Great Wei, he knew that if Great Wei was destroyed, the Monster Subduers would be able to survive the monster swarms.","It would be a disaster.","And the major sects in Jinzhanghan probably wanted their Monster Subduers to be destroyed. Therefore, although the Monster Subduers could ignore Great Wei, in reality, they were in a relationship of prosperity and humiliation.","“The khan is courting death,” Chu Yunfan said coldly, his eyes flashing with killing intent.","He wanted to deal with the demon invasion before dealing with Great Wei. However, it seemed that this could not be done.","“Since he wants to die so badly, I’ll kill him first.” As Chu Yunfan spoke, his expression became cold. “Yun Tian, I’ll have to trouble you to keep an eye on the demons for now. If there’s any movement, send someone to inform me immediately. I’ll go kill the khan and deal with these demons later.”","“Okay.” Yun Tian nodded. “Leave the matters here to me. You don’t have to worry.”","Now that the monster army had just retreated, they should not come again anytime soon. They could breathe easy for now.","Yun Tian had no doubts about whether Chu Yunfan could kill the khan after witnessing Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength. With his terrifying strength, coupled with the Monster Vanquisher, it was enough to make Chu Yunfan’s strength soar to a shocking level.","“I’ll have to borrow your sect’s teleportation circle,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Yes, but now that Jinzhanghan has gone south, I’m afraid that the space around the capital has been sealed off. The teleportation circle can’t teleport you there directly,” Yun Tian said, “I can only teleport you to the nearest city.”","“That’s fine.” Chu Yunfan nodded. Jinzhanghan had gone south. To cut off the reinforcements from the imperial capital, Jinzhanghan had probably seal off the place to prevent people from teleporting over. This was a normal strategy. Otherwise, with the solid defense of the imperial capital and the continuous reinforcements from the army, it would be impossible for Jinzhanghan to capture it quickly.","Chu Yunfan and Yun Tian flew straight into the depths of the Monster Subduers. They were the teleportation circle of the various parts of Great Wei, used for emergency evacuation.","Chu Yunfan stepped into a teleportation circle and disappeared.","“I hope Master Chu’s trip goes smoothly!” Yun Tian sighed, then said to the sect elders, “Everyone, although the monster army has retreated, we can’t be too relaxed. If those monsters return, we won’t even have time for us to regret it. I hope everyone will continue to endure and work hard to strengthen the defense line. We’re the only refuge in the entire western border. In addition, open up the teleportation circles and send these civilians to the eastern part of the empire. That is the only safe location currently.”","These commoners should have been sent away by the teleportation circles long ago. However, the space near the Monster Subduers had been sealed by the monster army. Many of the monsters had deep attainments in array formations and had sealed off the space near sect, preventing hundreds of thousands of civilians from leaving.","“Yes, Junior Master.” All the elders nodded.","Now that the sect master was severely injured, the junior master, Yun Tian, was the highest commander in the entire sect. The prestige that Yun Tian had accumulated over the years finally came in handy.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan felt a tearing force in space. His vision blurred, and he appeared in the sky above a city that was not sealed off. The place was in a state of panic. The monsters were invading from the west, and Jinzhanghan’s army from the north was heading south. They were not far from here. Once they captured the capital, they would sweep through the surrounding areas.","This city would be swept away at the first moment. No one felt that the capital could be defended. It was only a matter of time before it fell. Under such circumstances, everyone in the city was in a state of panic. Countless people helped the old and the young flee. The entire kingdom fell into an apocalyptic atmosphere. Even those who had the most confidence in the kingdom lost their confidence at this time.","The rampaging monsters and the enemy of the empire, Jinzhanghan, were undefeatable. Now that the two sides had joined forces, the empire might really be at the end of its days.","Chu Yunfan saw everything, but he didn’t have time to think about it. He stepped on the light and headed straight for the imperial capital. In just a moment, he had reached the outskirts of the capital. The endless horsemen were like endless ants, surrounding the capital.","There were tens of thousands of people, not to mention tens of millions of people. For Jinzhanghan, all the people were soldiers and there were no ordinary people. Even an ordinary herdsman was an expert in riding and archery.","The smallrt cities around the capital had long been captured. Countless villages were caught in blood and fire, and tens of millions of cavalry were wreaking havoc. Compared to the western border that was ravaged by the demons, the surroundings of the capital were not much better.","Countless people fell in pools of blood. Despite their resistance, it was useless against tens of millions of cavalry. Men, children, and elderly were killed, women were dragged away, and some were even raped on the spot.","“D*mn it!”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with killing intent. He was furious, but he knew that now was not the time to care about this. He flew straight toward the capital.","“Who is that? Kill him!”","As soon as he stepped into the defense line of the capital, Chu Yunfan was immediately surrounded. Thousands of cavalry flew in the air and blocked his path. The leader was a half-step Core. When he saw Chu Yunfan, he was about to give the order to kill him.","All of a sudden, a sword light flashed past, and over a thousand cavalrymen, including the leader, were slashed into pieces, turning into a cloud of blood mist."]},{"number":1544,"title":"Chapter 1544 A Slaughter That Shocks the Battlefield","paragraphs":["1544 A Slaughter That Shocks the Battlefield","The soldiers of Jinzhanghan never expected to be killed so easily. These were the elite soldiers who guarded the perimeter to block the reinforcements coming in from all over Great Wei. Even if there were thousands of ordinary troops, they would not be able to break through in a short time.","Unfortunately, they encountered Chu Yunfan. He held the Monster Vanquisher in his hand and slashed the thousands of elites into nothingness. Then, he stepped on the light and headed in the direction of the imperial capital.","Chu Yunfan did not hide his whereabouts. He was loud and immediately attracted the attention of tens of millions of cavalry. He was being reckless. From time to time, he would send out a sword light, which was like a sword that could destroy the world. With a casual swing of his sword, thousands of Jinzhanghan cavalry were killed.","After causing such a huge commotion, many powerful warriors’ auras flew up from the Jinzhanghan army and rushed toward Chu Yunfan. Jinzhanghan had sent tens of millions of troops to the south. Even if half of them were sent out to besiege the capital day and night, the remaining half was still endless with countless experts.","Team after team of elites rose into the air, trying to stop Chu Yunfan, but the result was only one—they were killed by Chu Yunfan with a single sword.","Chu Yunfan would strike out with his sword from time to time, and the elite troops that were charging at him were all blown to pieces. They were simply unable to resist.","“Kill him!”","A furious voice came from the royal tent of Jinzhanghan. It was like a great bell that shook the entire camp.","Instantly, 100,000 incomparably powerful auras boiled up, bringing with them an endless blood-colored tide. As the 100,000 figures rose into the air and began to snipe, the other elites of Jinzhanghan, who had been rushing over, stopped and looked at the 100,000-strong army in awe.","This army was none other than the most elite Blood Barbarians of Jinzhanghan.","Among the khan’s soldiers, they were the elite of the elite. One Bkood Barbarian was equivalent to a 100-man troop or even a 1,000. They were extremely powerful.","Jinzhanghan went south, and it was thanks to the Blood Barbarians that they were able to break through the defenses of Great Wei’s army and surround the capital.","“Blood Barbarians?”","Chu Yunfan looked at the army in front of him and sneered. It was not the first time he had fought with the Blood Barbarians. It could be considered fate, but this fate was accompanied by endless slaughter.","The 100,000 Blood Barbarians arrived in front of Chu Yunfan in a flash. There were more than a dozen Cores among them. The number of experts in Jinzhanghan far exceeded that of Great Wei.","Chu Yunfan sneered, “You’re going to stop me?” Can you block me?”","With a sneer, he rushed into the Blood Barbarians’ ranks and swung the Monster Vanquisher in his hand. In an instant, a thousand feet of sword light swept out, like a mountain being thrown out. Chu Yunfan controlled the sword light to sweep around, and all the Blood Barbarians within a thousand feet were instantly killed. The dozen or so Cores at the front of the heavy load were no exception. Those who were swept by Chu Yunfan all exploded.","At this moment, the terrifying power was displayed before the eyes of countless experts of Jinzhanghan, making them feel real fear. It was fine that Chu Yunfan had killed the elite soldiers with a single strike, but now, the formation formed by the Blood Barbarians was broken in an instant. Even the Cores were killed.","What a terrifying thing!","They had truly witnessed what a great killing weapon was. This was a great killing weapon.","Chu Yunfan, who held the Monster Vanquisher, turned into a super killing weapon. Anyone who got in his way would die!","Chu Yunfan had killed one-third of the Blood Barbarians with this sword strike. An ordinary army would have collapsed by now, and an ordinary elite army could only withstand 50% of the losses. However, the Blood Barbarians were the elite troops of Jinzhanghan. Even though they had suffered heavy losses, they still charged at Chu Yunfan.","And this was exactly what Chu Yunfan wanted.","He rushed into the midst of the Blood Barbarians and casually swept out with his sword. In an instant, thousands of Blood Barbarians died at his hands. After a few slashes, not a single one was left in the sky.","Chu Yunfan remembered that the Blood Barbarians had almost forced him into a desperate situation. If it weren’t for the nuclear bomb and the Mountain River Diagram, an ordinary person would have been doomed.","The hundred thousand Blood Barbarians could not stop him for a moment. In a few moves, they were slashed into a bloody mist.","Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry to move forward. These few strikes had consumed a lot of energy, and maintaining sufficient divine power and physical strength in this battle formation was important. In just a moment, his divine power had recovered by 70 – 80%.","His slaughter of a hundred thousand Blood Barbarians had caused a great uproar. Both Jinzhanghan and Great Wei were shocked and found it unbelievable. One hundred thousand Blood Barbarians were comparable to a million elites. This meant that Chu Yunfan had quickly killed millions of elite soldiers. This was something that even Cores couldn’t do.","An ordinary Core would only have one outcome if they encountered a hundred thousand Blood Barbarians, and that was to flee. If they were surrounded, they would die. One hundred thousand Blood Barbarians could kill a Core. Even a Core Former might not be able to escape.","Everyone on Jinzhanghan’s side had thought that the one-hundred-thousand Blood Barbarians were enough. Who knew that they would be slaughtered in a moment?","“Is he human? Is that an expert of Great Wei?”","Many people’s eyes flashed with a terrified expression as if they had seen a ghost. They couldn’t believe that there was such a terrifying existence in Great Wei and were all frightened. Even the bloodthirsty cavalrymen of Jinzhanghan, who lived on killing, were completely dumbfounded by this scene.","On the contrary, the originally demoralized soldiers of the Imperial Capital cheered when they recognized the person who had come. Wasn’t it the Imperial Advisor of Great Wei, Chu Yunfan?","“It’s the Imperial Advisor! He has come to save us!”","“We’re saved!”"]},{"number":1545,"title":"Chapter 1545 You Trash? I’m Afraid It’s Not Enough!","paragraphs":["1545 You Trash? I’m Afraid It’s Not Enough!","The countless guards in the Imperial Capital quickly learned about it. The news of Chu Yunfan’s return spread like wildfire throughout the entire Imperial Capital. Countless guards, experts, and the residents of the capital were filled with hope. Whether they hated Chu Yunfan or liked him, he had become their only hope before they were drowned although they knew that it was impossible for one person to repel this army of tens of millions.","On the city wall of the Imperial Capital, a figure wearing golden armor saw Chu Yunfan and was surprised and happy. This person was none other than the emperor, Wei Wuji.","“Thank goodness Master Chu is back!”","Wei Wuji was desperate. Despite the dangerous situation, Chu Yunfan could still rush into the army to save him. This was his only hope.","“Everyone, the Imperial Advisor is back. Jinzhanghan will soon suffer the consequences of their actions.”","Wei Wuji’s loud shout immediately caused countless people to echo him. He helplessly looked into the distance at the endless cavalry of Jinzhanghan and felt aggrieved.","What was the concept of tens of millions of cavalry? Each arrow shot by one person would cause the entire capital to be rained down with arrows. It was so dense that it was impossible to dodge.","He was in despair. No one had expected Jinzhanghan to be so decisive. They did not hesitate and led their troops to the south. The ten million iron cavalry defeated the one million army in the north of Great Wei and forced their way into the capital.","Although the capital had barriers that had been continuously strengthened over the years, according to the intensity of the attack, it would probably be breached in a few days.","Now that Chu Yunfan had returned, he became the hope for everyone in the capital.","“How dare you, Chu Yunfan!” A loud and furious roar was heard.","Everyone felt an endless pressure being emitted, enveloping the entire battlefield, making the figure look like a god. They looked over and saw a middle-aged man wearing a non-human imperial robe fly out. The entire Jinzhanghan army was shocked when they saw this figure. The tens of millions of cavalrymen who were not fighting all prostrated because this was their khan, the ruler of the entire kingdom.","The khan stared at Chu Yunfan fiercely. His eyes were filled with bone-deep killing intent. He wanted nothing more than to kill Chu Yunfan. The last time he was injured by Chu Yunfan was the most humiliating moment of his life. If he hadn’t fled, he would have died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","At this moment, hundreds of figures flew out at the same time. These figures were all Cores, the top experts of Jinzhanghan. They formed a large formation and surrounded the khan. Such a lineup was obviously coming for Chu Yunfan.","The strength of Jinzhanghan was vividly displayed.","“Have you recovered from your injuries?” Chu Yunfan asked with a cold smile. “Looks like you recovered pretty quickly if you have time to come out and cause trouble.”","When everyone heard this, their hearts were in turmoil. Great Wei and Jinzhanghan felt the same. Everyone recognized him. He was the khan. In terms of strength, he was unrivaled throughout the world. The title of the world’s number one expert was not bestowed for nothing.","However, from what Chu Yunfan said, it was possible that the khan was injured by Chu Yunfan. How shocking was this?","“That’s right. I remember the injuries you gave me in my every waking moment. I’m going to tear you into pieces!” the khan said through gritted teeth and his eyes flashed with killing intent.","“Kill me? With just you lot?” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Then, he frowned because he could feel a faint demonic aura coming from the khan. No matter how much human martial artists cultivated, it was impossible for them to possess demonic energy. Judging from the severe injuries he had inflicted on the khan, the khan should be recuperating for some time.","But now, not only did the khan look like he had recovered completely, but he even seemed to have climbed to the peak. Now Chu Yunfan understood that it was probably related to the demons.","He instantly understood everything. It was no wonder that the demons and Jinzhanghan seemed to have such a tacit understanding. When the demons invaded Great Wei, Jinzhanghan cooperated with them. They led their troops south and swept away tens of millions of cavalry.","This was clearly the prelude to the two sides joining forces to divide Great Wei.","The two sides had probably reached an agreement long ago, and the demons had probably helped the khan with mending his injuries. Of course, the demons would not do something that did not benefit them. Their goal was simple. They wanted Jinzhanghan to hold back Great Wei so that they could slaughter the humans in Great Wei and use them to resurrect the great demon.","In a flash, Chu Yunfan understood everything. Thinking of this, the light in his eyes turned from disgust to killing intent.","“Bunch of clowns. No matter how many people there are, you’re just here to die. Have you forgotten that you were beaten up by me and were forced to run away?”","Chu Yunfan’s words made the khan furious. He remembered that he had burned his life force to escape Chu Yunfan’s pursuit. If he hadn’t received the help of the demon’s secret technique, he would still be hiding like a dog now, panting and licking his wounds.","Just as Chu Yunfan had guessed, Jinzhanghan had indeed joined forces with the demons. The monsters wanted Jinzhanghan to hold back the military forces of Great Wei, so they offered many benefits. His recovery was just one of the gifts. There were countless other benefits.","The khan was ambitious and wanted to swallow Great Wei in one go. By then, the strength of Jinzhanghan would skyrocket and rise to another level. Great Qi would definitely not be a match for them.","By then, the khan would unify the human world. He would not be afraid even if he had to face the demons of the demon league. He knew what the demons were planning, but in his eyes, they were just using each other.","Now that Chu Yunfan had exposed his scars, the anger he had suppressed could not help but erupt like a volcano.","“Kill him!”"]},{"number":1546,"title":"Chapter 1546 One Strike to Slash a Core","paragraphs":["1546 One Strike to Slash a Core","The khan exploded like an enraged lion.","Hundreds of Cores formed a large formation, and like a shocking millstone, they surrounded Chu Yunfan. Every Core’s mana was released, and it was like a landslide and tsunami. It turned into a terrifying array that surrounded Chu Yunfan and crushed him with its power.","“Just you lot?” Chu Yunfan’s lips curled into a cold smile. Then, he stepped on lightning and turned into a bolt of lightning.","Swish!","Swish!","Swish!","In just a moment, Chu Yunfan had already arrived in front of a Core. His Monster Vanquisher suddenly slashed down. There was no sword intent. The sword light slashed down. It was just an ordinary attack, but it was as fast as lightning.","Slash!","This Core didn’t even have time to react before he was cut in half. His protective energy shield and spirit armor were easily cut apart like paper.","The sharpness of the Monster Vanquisher had reached a shocking level. It was abnormally sharp.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan had already disappeared from where he was. When he reappeared, he was in front of another Core.","This Core had not expected him to suddenly appear. The power of the entire formation was easily cut off by Chu Yunfan’s sword.","Slash!","Another Core was killed!","A terrifying massacre began. None of the Cores could have imagined that Chu Yunfan would choose such a method to break out of the situation. They had no intention of meeting him head-on, but the power of their array was unable to delay his footsteps.","When the array was activated, those who were surrounded should feel that the power of heaven and earth was obscure as if they were trapped in a quagmire. It was difficult to move.","But Chu Yunfan did not seem to be affected in the slightest. He disappeared and appeared, and no one could follow him. No one knew if he was ignoring the power of the array or if the array had no effect on him, but even so, his speed was still extremely fast.","In just a short period, Chu Yunfan had already killed more than 30 Cores. He was about to single-handedly blast the entire array into pieces.","One breath of death. The formation was on the verge of collapse.","The khan’s expression, who was watching this scene from afar, changed. These hundred Cores were the last and most powerful guards of Jinzhanghan. These experts usually stayed in the royal tent of Jinzhanghan. Ordinary people could not see them.","Previously, he had rushed out alone and did not bring these experts with him. Therefore, even Chu Yunfan did not know that the khan had such a terrifying group of experts protecting him. This group of experts was like Great Wei’s imperial advisors. They would not take action for ordinary things, nor would they lead troops to battle. They would only appear when the khan was in danger.","But now, one-third of this expert group that could stop an army of a million had been slaughtered in mere moments. What a terrifying efficiency!","“D*mn it! Everyone, defend with all your might. Help me stall him. I’ll kill him!”","The khan could not hold in his fury anymore. If Chu Yunfan continued to kill like this, this group of experts would be wiped out.","These experts were all shocked and stabilized their momentum. The fear of being slaughtered by Chu Yunfan was dispelled. The invincible khan was finally going to make his move. All they had to do was stall Chu Yunfan.","“Stall me? You lot?” Chu Yunfan laughed. He held the Monster Vanquisher in his hand and flew forward, directly rushing into the group of experts.","“Don’t even think about it! Stop him!”","An old man among the experts erupted with Core Former strength. Jinzhanghan had far more than a few Cores. One could imagine how powerful they were. They were indeed much stronger than Great Qi and Great Wei.","A Core Former was considered an expert at the kingdom guardian-level. In Great Wei, other than Chu Yunfan, there was only two other kingdom guardians in Great Wei, Yun Tian and Yun Huang.","Chu Yunfan had already killed two people from Jinzhanghan. This should be the third one.","“Die!” the old man roared, and his aura soared like a mountain.","Others might be afraid of Chu Yunfan, but he was not. With his Core Form Stage cultivation, he could go anywhere in the world. His hands were smooth as he clenched his fists and punched out. The force of his fists tore through the sky like two dragons and instantly arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","“Petty trick.” Chu Yunfan sneered and smashed the punch with a backhand slap.","“How is this possible!” The eyes of the Core Form Stage elder widened in complete disbelief as if he had seen a ghost.","If he had attacked with all his strength, it would have been enough to flatten a city. However, Chu Yunfan had easily broken his attack. One could imagine how amazing Chu Yunfan’s strength was.","But Chu Yunfan looked so young. How could he have such amazing strength?","But Chu Yunfan didn’t give him any time to think. In an instant, he arrived in front of the Core Former old man. His expression was calm as he casually slashed down with his sword. It was just a simple attack, but it was so sharp that it almost tore the air into two.","“It’s impossible for you to kill me!”","The old man bellowed repeatedly as he punched out with his fists like dragons. He met the sword that was slashing down. However, it was broken by Chu Yunfan almost instantly.","Slash!","The old man was cut in half in mid-air, no different from the others. His protective energy shield and spirit armor were cut in half by the sword as if they were made of paper. They could not withstand a single blow.","Before his body could fall, Chu Yunfan grabbed him and dragged him into the Mountain River Diagram.","A Core was no match for the might of a single sword!"]},{"number":1547,"title":"Chapter 1547 The Khan’s Half-Demon Transformation? His Reputation Was Ruined!","paragraphs":["1547 The Khan’s Half-Demon Transformation? His Reputation Was Ruined!","The battlefield was dead silent. Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan in a daze. Even the experts seemed to be scared silly.","That was the leader of their group who was a Core. In their opinion, a kingdom guardian would be able to stop Chu Yunfan no matter what, but in reality, he couldn’t even block Chu Yunfan’s strike.","“What a terrifying sword!”","Many people were dumbfounded. They had never seen anyone fight like this. Chu Yunfan was like a martial arts rookie who didn’t know any true energy at all. He only relied on his moves. However, this seemingly ordinary move was quick, accurate, and ruthless. It had such great power.","“What a sharp sword. Regardless of whether it’s a Void Core or a Core Former’s defense, it’s simply like paper in front of it.”","Many people could tell that the sword in Chu Yunfan’s hand was different. After all, even without divine power, the sword already had such power. Everyone knew that this sword was definitely not an ordinary sword.","It was extraordinary!","“You’re courting death!”","At this moment, the khan had already flown over. His body swept over like a mountain range, instantly suppressing Chu Yunfan. A blood-colored spear appeared in his hand. The spear was like a huge dragon, opening its bloody mouth and trying to pierce through Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it, and just swung his sword.","Clang!","With a loud boom, the sword collided with the khan’s spear. Immediately, a series of loud collisions spread out. The khan’s attack was blocked. His arms trembled slightly as a look of horror flashed through his eyes. He had not held back in this attack, but it did not hurt Chu Yunfan in the slightest and was easily blocked.","“Too weak and too slow,” Chu Yunfan said as he glanced at the khan. “Is this all you can do? I’m so disappointed.”","Chu Yunfan’s words immediately made the khan furious. Chu Yunfan had only been able to injure him by relying on an unorthodox method. It had only been a short time, yet Chu Yunfan dared to speak to him in such a tone.","“If that’s all you can do, then you’re dead.” Chu Yunfan’s lips curled into a cold smile as he slashed out with the Monster Vanquisher.","Swoosh!","Chu Yunfan instantly appeared before the khan. The Monster Vanquisher in his hand slashed at the khan’s throat, almost slicing it open.","“D*mn it!”","The khan was shocked and angry, but he was prepared. He had fought with Chu Yunfan before, so he knew Chu Yunfan well. Although Chu Yunfan was extremely fast, it did not break through his limit.","The khan retreated a few steps as the spear in his hand shielded him.","Clang!","The sound of metal clashing rang out as the sword struck the spear. Chu Yunfan’s seemingly casual strike landed in the khan’s hands, and it made his entire body tremble.","“Too slow. If that’s all you have, I’ll take your head!”","Then, Chu Yunfan swept over at an even more astonishing speed. The sword light slashed at the khan’s neck. Every move was fatal.","“Rrrrraaagggh!”","The khan roared. He was like a wounded beast. Suddenly, powerful demonic energy burst out from his body.","An extremely dense demonic energy appeared from the body of a human.","Accompanied by this demonic aura, the khan underwent a tremendous change. His body began to undergo a minor demonic transformation. Tiny scales began to grow on his arms, and his pupils were like those of a snake, looking extremely terrifying.","After his body burst out with demonic energy, his arms, which had been paralyzed by Chu Yunfan’s sword, returned to normal and expelled the soreness and numbness. At the critical moment, the spear in his hand blocked Chu Yunfan.","Clang!","There was another loud explosion. Everyone saw the khan’s body being enveloped in a ball of demonic energy. He was in the late Core Form Stage, but now he had expanded to the peak.","This was the true strength of the khan at this stage.","The terrifying demonic energy spread out and enveloped the tens of millions of soldiers on the battlefield. Everyone shuddered. Great Wei was especially worried about Chu Yunfan. The current khan looked terrifying. He was invincible and could fight against thousands of troops alone.","“Chu Yunfan, you forced me into this state! Today, you will die!” the khan said in a hoarse voice as he glared at Chu Yunfan.","He knew that even his loyal subjects would be suspicious. After all, no matter what, he was still a human. However, he had undergone demonic transformation. Everyone would be suspicious.","Were they loyal to humans or demons?","This was a life-and-death feud between the two races. There was no possibility of resolving it.","However, he couldn’t care less right now. If he didn’t burst out into half-demon form, he would probably die under Chu Yunfan’s sword. He never knew that a simple basic sword technique could have such astonishing power. Or rather, no one had ever been able to display this simple basic sword technique to such an extent.","Killing a Core Former with a basic sword technique. If anyone had told him this before, he would not have believed it. He would think it was a joke. But now, he had witnessed it with his own eyes. This was not a joke, but the trut. Chu Yunfan indeed had such strength.","At this moment, he saw the faint smile on Chu Yunfan’s face and realized that Chu Yunfan had been attacking casually. Chu Yunfan had concealed his strength, and his goal was to force out his half-demon form.","He instantly understood that although Chu Yunfan’s sword was terrifying, his goal was not to kill him, but to force out of his half-demon form. Not only did Chu Yunfan have killing intent toward him, but he also wanted to destroy his reputation.","The king of a human country was actually a half-demon. Was there anything more ridiculous than this?"]},{"number":1548,"title":"Chapter 1548 Can’t Even Break Through His Defense","paragraphs":["1548 Can’t Even Break Through His Defense","Although those in Jinzhanghan had always competed for the position of khan, it was within their own people. Even if Chu Yunfan was strong enough to defeat Jinzhanghan and kill all these people, he could not become the Khan of Jinzhanghan because he was not a native of Jinzhanghan and did not have royal blood.","And now, the khan had the blood of demons! Those who are not of the same race were of different hearts. They did not say this out loud, but they knew it. After today, no matter what, it would be very difficult for the khan to hold on to his position.","But after enjoying the highest power in the world, he was unwilling to give up. Chu Yunfan was destroying his foundation. From today onward, everyone would know that he was a half-demon. It was impossible for such a half-demon to rule Jinzhanghan.","At the thought of this, his eyes were filled with unimaginable hatred. “You forced me to this point. You’re dead!” the khan said through gritted teeth. His teeth had become unusually sharp. They were not teeth that belonged to humans, but a characteristic of the demons.","“I’m dead?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “I don’t know what kind of agreement you made with the demons, but it was your worst decision to lead your army south today. Not only will your reputation be ruined, but you will also die here. I want to see how many of the ten million Jinzhanghan cavalry will make it back alive.”","“You dare?” The khan laughed.","This was a force of tens of millions of cavalry. Even he would have to retreat if he were to encounter such a force. Ordinary armies were nothing to an expert like him. If he was surrounded by a million ordinary troops, he could kill them several times out. He would slowly eliminate them and destroy them.","However, it was a different matter when the number reached ten million. It was enough to kill him several times. And this Chu Yunfan wanted to bury his army of ten million soldiers? It was simply wishful thinking. Chu Yunfan was a madman.","And he was forced to this extent by such a lunatic!","Thinking of this, the khan burst out in anger.","Whoosh!","The spear in the khan’s hand was like a snow dragon piercing through the sky. The spear’s radiance tore apart and went straight for Chu Yunfan. After entering the half-demon state, the khan’s strength increased by a whole level.","Chu Yunfan sneered. The khan’s half-demon appearance might scare others, but it was nothing to him. In the past, the Monster Cult had captured many people for their transformation experiments. They all looked like this, and some were even more disgusting and strange.","“Interesting. Well, don’t disappoint me!” Chu Yunfan laughed and slashed out with his sword.","Clang!","The loud boom turned into a huge sound wave that spread in all directions, affecting the entire battlefield. The soldiers of Jinzhanghan who could not escape were swept away. These two terrifying existences at the peak of the Core Stage attacked at full force. Just the aftershock of the battle was enough to kill tens of thousands of these ordinary soldiers.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about the soldiers of Jinzhanghan who were used to killing. And it was clear that the khan didn’t care either. The two of them attacked like two huge balls of flames and collided.","Rumble!","Every time the two sides collided, it was like thunder. Waves of thunder exploded on the spot. Everyone saw the two sides fighting crazily in the sky. They could no longer follow the battle. Only the collisions between the two sides could be seen.","“The imperial advisor is so powerful!”","In the capital, countless soldiers and civilians were watching Chu Yunfan, who was displaying his divine might like a god in the sky. Everyone was boiling with excitement. Only the real experts looked at Chu Yunfan with a serious expression. They knew that the khan was the legendary number one expert in the world. He was not the number one expert of Great Wei, but the publicly acknowledged number one expert of the human world.","And Chu Yunfan had only appeared for a short time. Although his combat strength had already broken through to the Core Form Stage and had defeated Yun Huang and become the number one expert of Great Wei, there were still many other masters throughout the world. Chu Yunfan was quite a distance away from being the number one master of the entire world. But now, he was able to fight the number one, the khan. What kind of insane improvement speed was this?!","Chu Yunfan was only a half-step Core when he first became known to the public. Even then, he was already considered to be an outstanding talent. Now, he was no longer an outstanding talent. He had reached a realm that everyone needed to look up to.","The soldiers of Jinzhanghan were even more restless. In the past, no matter what kind of strong enemy there was, as long as the khan attacked, theyw ould be able to topple it. No one had ever been able to compare to the khan, let alone force him to this extent. This was a huge blow to their invincible confidence.","And Chu Yunfan was so young. If the khan couldn’t kill Chu Yunfan today, he would become Jinzhanghan’s most terrifying enemy if he was given enough time.","“Hahaha, Chu Yunfan! You were careless! I caught your weakness!”","All of a sudden, everyone heard a wild laugh. The person who laughed was none other than the khan.","A blood-red dragon tore through the sky and stabbed at the other figure in the sky. It was as if it had found a flaw in the sword light that filled the sky and headed straight for it.","“This is great!”","The Jinzhanghan experts held their breaths and almost cheered. But then, something happened that shocked them. The spear did hit Chu Yunfan and the divine power washed over him, but he didn’t move an ince. The spear failed to hurt him in the slightest!","“How could this be!” the khan said with his mouth agape. He couldn’t believe that his attack couldn’t hurt Chu Yunfan, and couldn’t even break through Chu Yunfan’s defense.","He held nothing back in this attack. He had used all his strength, but Chu Yunfan had received it without any injuries. It had completely overturned his worldview."]},{"number":1549,"title":"Chapter 1549 Enough Games, I’ll Kill You in Three Moves!","paragraphs":["1549 Enough Games, I’ll Kill You in Three Moves!","This was different from what he had imagined. It was undeniable that Chu Yunfan was the most terrifying opponent he had ever met in his life. He had never met such a terrifying opponent.","Chu Yunfan’s swordsmanship had reached a level of god-like mastery. Any simple sword technique could be transformed into something magical in Chu Yunfan’s hands. On top of that, his mana was like the sea, unfathomable and endless. After fighting for so long, even the khan, who was in his half-demon form, was struggling, but Chu Yunfan did not seem the least bit tired.","What kind of terrifying monster was this? It had no weakness!","Moreover, he was fast. So fast that the khan had no choice but to use all his strength. Otherwise, he could be hit at any time. It was not easy for him to finally catch a flaw in Chu Yunfan’s attack. He then stabbed Chu Yunfan with his spear. Under normal circumstances, even if a Core Former was stabbed, they would die. Humans could not withstand such an attack.","But now, Chu Yunfan had overturned his world views and let him know that humans could be so strong. He did not move at all and received all of his attacks without suffering any injuries.","When the khan looked again, Chu Yunfan’s face was no longer expressionless. On the contrary, there was a faint smile on his face.","“What? Are you disappointed?” Chu Yunfan smiled slightly. If it was an ordinary person, they would have been seriously injured at this time, but to him, it was nothing.","At this moment, the Imperial Physique was beginning to show its terror.","“I’m tight on time, so I won’t play any more games with you,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“What? A game?” The khan was furious. He had used all his strength, but Chu Yunfan said that he was just playing a game. He felt like a monkey jumping around in Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","He completely erupted. The demonic energy in his body boiled. The degree of his demonic transformation increased. Or rather, the demonic energy was constantly eroding his body, causing him to transform into a full demon step by step.","The khan was unwilling to use this method so casually because he was afraid that he would degenerate into a full demon. However, this was clearly not the time for him to think so much.","After further demonization, he could feel that his strength had become stronger. The spear in his hand was grabbed by Chu Yunfan and he could not break free. He simply jumped up like a dragon and descended like a phoenix. In an instant, he had arrived before Chu Yunfan. He stretched out his arms that had turned into sharp claws and suddenly tore at Chu Yunfan, wanting to tear him apart.","“You’re going to stop me?” Chu Yunfan burst into laughter. “Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan punched out, and eight figures appeared around him, protecting him. He looked like a god in the sky, full of dignity. The terrifying fist intent that swept out from this punch tore everything apart, instantly turning the khan’s attack into nothingness.","Chu Yunfan’s punch did not lose its momentum. It smashed right into the khan with monstrous power.","The khan felt a terrifying pressure pressing down on him from head to toe, and the sky was shaking crazily. “How are you so strong?!” he shouted.","He was finally flustered. This power was about to crush him. He did not want to be captured without a fight. He roared as if he had completely degenerated into a demon. His entire body was completely wrapped in a ball of demonic energy, and his appearance could not be seen.","“You forced me to this point. I want you dead!”","The khan shouted and threw a punch, wanting to meet Chu Yunfan’s attack.","Boom!","The two fists collided in mid-air, and the sky within a radius of a hundred miles shook violently. The energy tide formed by the spreading fist intent instantly wiped out countless cavalry of Jinzhanghan.","But at this moment, no one noticed these dead people. Everyone’s gaze was fixed on the sky. Everyone had a premonition that the time to determine the victor had come.","Everyone’s eyes were focused on the two.","They heard a scream. Then, they saw the khan cry out in pain as he flew backward and his blood splatter all over the sky. Everyone found that one of the khan’s arms had exploded. He had suffered a great loss in the clash with Chu Yunfan. His entire arm was blasted apart.","On the other side, Chu Yunfan was completely fine. His long hair and clothes fluttered in the wind. He looked like a god of war in the sky. He was extremely powerful and terrifying.","This was the first time everyone knew how terrifying Chu Yunfan was. Now, everyone finally realized that his physical body was so powerful.","Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level was lower than that of the khan. Logically speaking, even if he was a physique cultivator who specialized in cultivating the body, it was impossible for him to be so powerful. Not to mention that the khan had undergone half-demonization. Everyone knew that the physical body of demons was much stronger than that of humans. After half-demonization, the physical body of the khan had been greatly improved.","However, Chu Yunfan had done such an incredible thing. One punch shattered one of the khan’s arms. Chu Yunfan’s divine power was boiling like a flame, like a powerful god.","The khan, who had been sent flying, covered his broken arm with one hand. His face was filled with utter disbelief. His punch had been shattered by Chu Yunfan.","“Enough games. I’ll kill you in three moves,” Chu Yunfan said loudly as he stared at the khan coldly. His voice spread throughout the entire battlefield, and everyone’s eyes turned to Chu Yunfan.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan moved. His body disappeared in a ball of lightning. This time, he did not hold back. A pair of lightning wings appeared on his back. He stepped on the Nine Heavenly Deity Transformations and his speed soared to the extreme. In an instant, he arrived in front of the khan and threw a punch.","“D*mn it! How could this be?!”","The khan roared and opened his bloody mouth. Instantly, boundless demonic energy gushed out and swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even glance at him. He smashed the khan’s fist into pieces, and his punch landed on the khan.","Bam!","The khan groaned and flew backward."]},{"number":1550,"title":"Chapter 1550 Killing the Khan and Launching Nuclear Bombs","paragraphs":["1550 Killing the Khan and Launching Nuclear Bombs","The punch sent the khan flying, and blood spattered everywhere. The terrifying force tore everything apart and surged into the khan’s body. His entire body was injured from the shock. Blood gushed out from every pore, forming a rain of blood in the sky.","Everyone was terrified. Even the tens of millions of cavalry of Jinzhanghan had never been timid, but they were frightened by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was too strong. Even the khan, who they respected like a god, was no match for Chu Yunfan. To them, this was simply a world-shattering blow. They never thought that they would see such a scene in their lives.","“That was the first move. How long can you last, khan?” Chu Yunfan roared, and the divine power in his body boiled, forming a terrifying storm around him. “Fifth Netherworld Stomp!”","Chu Yunfan stomped down on the khan without giving him any time to react. The entire sky shook violently as the stomp landed. Endless netherworld water appeared and turned into a terrifying torrent that instantly crushed the khan. Before the khan could react, he was stomped on and he was smashed to the ground.","Boom!","With a loud boom, the khan was smashed into the ground. Jinzhanghan’s cavalry within a thousand meters was also sent flying. All the bones in their bodies were broken, and they died on the spot. The khan, who had taken the brunt of Chu Yunfan’s stomps, was not in any better shape. He felt that all the bones in his body had been completely shattered. Blood flowed out of him, and the big pit that surrounded him was quickly becoming a pool of blood.","Spurt!","The khan wanted to get up but instead spat out a mouthful of blood. He had been grievously injured. The recovery ability of a Core Former was shocking, and it was even more shocking after a half-demon transformation. But an attack of this level was enough to render his recovery ability to zero.","The khan’s eyes went wide as he stared at Chu Yunfan. He couldn’t understand how Chu Yunfan, who was clearly not his match before, had become so powerful so quickly. Previously, he had been injured because of a trick. Now, he could see that Chu Yunfan was not using any tricks, but he really had the strength to crush him.","Chu Yunfan was just horsing around earlier, playing a game. In just a few short moves, he had severely injured the opponent. What kind of terrifying fortuitous encounter did Chu Yunfan have that allowed his cultivation to improve so quickly?","Before he could think further, Chu Yunfan said in a calm but unusually cold tone, “This is the last move. I’ll send you on your way now.”","“Sh*t!”","The khan leaped up and tried to escape, but he saw Chu Yunfan appear in front of him with lightning under his feet. Chu Yunfan was so fast that he could not see him clearly. The next moment, Chu Yunfan raised the Monster Vanquisher in his hand and slashed down. The khan wanted to escape, but all the bones in his body were broken. Even if he wanted to escape, it would be very difficult.","Then, he was slashed. He realized that he could see his own body. His head had been cut off.","“I can’t accept this... Why did this happen?”","The khan let out a blood-curdling scream and died tragically.","The battlefield was dead silent. Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan in a daze as if they had seen a ghost. He was so strong that the khan was killed in a few moves.","“Kill him! Avenge the khan!”","Someone suddenly shouted, and tens of millions of cavalrymen turned their weapons on Chu Yunfan. The tens of millions of cavalrymen were united against a common enemy, and the terrifying aura of the army froze the entire sky and covered the sun.","Their military formation was terrifying. When all the soldiers in the army were united, they would be able to unleash a terrifying power. Ordinary Core Formers would not be able to hold on for long if they were surrounded like this and would be torn apart.","The cavalry of Jinzhanghan looked at Chu Yunfan with grief and indignation. Although they could not accept a half-human, half-demon monster leading Jinzhanghan, it did not mean that they would be indifferent. Under the instigation of some people, these people did not flee. On the contrary, they charged toward Chu Yunfan, wanting to surround and kill him.","“Oh no, the imperial advisor is in danger!” Wei Wuji, who had been paying attention to this matter, said with a pale face.","Chu Hongcai, who was beside him, also turned pale with fright. It was unimaginable for tens of millions of cavalry to kill a person.","Chu Yunfan flew high in the sky and looked at the army that was charging at him. He could even feel that the air was frozen as if he was trapped in a swamp and could not move. The willpower of tens of millions of people was earth-shattering, and its power could even make a Core pale.","“Ten million troops? Is it anything to blink at?” Chu Yunfan sneered, and a small missile launcher appeared in his hand.","When this small missile launcher appeared in his hand, everyone on the battlefield felt a sense of extreme danger. They did not know where the danger came from, but as martial arts masters, their intuition was much more accurate than the average person.","Soon, everyone’s eyes focused on the small missile launcher in Chu Yunfan’s hand. Of course, this small size was only relative. It was several meters tall, but with Chu Yunfan’s current strength, it was easy for him to lift it.","Swoosh!","After a sharp air-piercing sound, a missile with a long flaming tail flew toward the hundreds of thousands of Blood Barbarians at lightning speed.","Kaboom!","A huge mushroom cloud slowly rose up, and the battlefield shook violently. The great killing weapon of the Federation was released in the Spirit Realm. To the experts of Jinzhanghan, they had never seen such bloody and terrifying means.","The ground shook violently, and the mushroom cloud that rose up with the energy tide spread in all directions. It was like the flames of a death god, taking away everything."]},{"number":1551,"title":"Chapter 1551 Ten Million Army Annihilated","paragraphs":["1551 Ten Million Army Annihilated","Hundreds of thousands of Blood Barbarians were instantly engulfed by the explosion. The terrifying flames engulfed them in an instant, swallowing them in one breath.","The sky shook violently, and Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold. In the Federation, this level of a nuclear bomb was only considered a tactical level. If it was a strategic level, a few of them would probably destroy tens of millions of cavalry in an instant.","The power of a nuclear bomb was something that martial artists could not contend against. Some powerful martial artists might be able to dodge it, but they could not withstand it. It was the same even for Cores. Unless one could reach an extremely profound realm, only then could one possibly withstand the bombardment of nuclear bombs. An expert of that level was not something that Chu Yunfan could hope to catch up to, much less these tens of millions of cavalry. They simply could not resist.","When the nuclear bomb landed, not only were the hundreds of thousands of Blood Barbarians devoured, but even the tens of thousands of cavalry near the nuclear bomb were affected. They were sent flying by the powerful energy waves, and their bones were shattered. Although they did not die immediately, they were on the brink of death.","The nuclear bombs of the Federation had been improved over a long period of time. The nuclear radiation was minimal. Otherwise, even if they did not die on the spot, they would be quickly tortured to death by nuclear radiation.","“What kind of weapon is this?” Everyone was shocked. Only Chu Hongcai was slightly calmer because he remembered that Chu Yunfan had used this magic tool to uproot the Great Formless Sect.","The flames that destroyed everything turned into a mushroom cloud that devoured everything. The monstrous dust waves that were set off could be seen from hundreds of miles away. The destructive energy was not something that ordinary people could possess.","“Is that the magic tool the imperial advisor used back then?” Wei Wuji suddenly remembered something.","Back then, Chu Yunfan had uprooted the entire Great Formless Sect. That matter had caused a huge commotion. Before Chu Yunfan, no one had been able to do this on their own. And once Chu Yunfan did, Wei Wuji paid special attention to it. He had not seen the event with his own eyes, but he had heard about it from others. The current situation was exactly the same as what others had described.","“That’s right. That’s the nuclear bomb that Brother Fan talked about,” Chu Hongcai said in a daze. “This is Brother Fan’s ultimate trump card.”","“Not bad. It’s quite strong,” the old imperial family guardian who was in the Core Stage said. His eyes were shining brightly.","For a top-notch expert like him, this spirit tool was not very powerful. If he was careful and guarded against it, he would be able to hide far away the moment the missile was fired. It might not be able to kill him in one shot. If one was willing, they could even avoid it completely by maintaining a sufficient distance.","However, not everyone was an expert at his level. There were only two or three of them in Great Wei. For ordinary people, they could not escape at all. Chu Yunfan did not use it when he killed the khan because nuclear bombs might not be 100% effective in a confrontation of that level. However, when used to clear out soldiers, it was simply accurate.","“Hahaha, the Heavens don’t wish for Great Wei to fall. So what if there are tens of millions of cavalry? How many can escape today?” Wei Wuji laughed. He finally understood what Chu Yunfan meant.","With the nuclear bomb in hand, it was meaningless to have the numbers.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan attacked again. One nuclear bomb after another flew to various parts of the battlefield with a long tail of flames.","Kaboom!","Kaboom!","Kaboom!","Massive explosions sounded out as the world was immersed in endless explosions. The center of the nuclear explosion was as dazzling as the sun and drowned out everything. The terrifying dust waves that struck the ground surged up to thousands of feet high.","Mushroom clouds rose up one after another, and countless cavalrymen didn’t even have time to scream before they were vaporized. Not even a drop of water was left behind.","It was Hell on Earth—Hell had appeared in the human world!","Among the tens of millions of cavalry of Jinzhanghan, there were still many Cores, but none of them could escape, especially those Cores who had besieged Chu Yunfan. Other than the few who were killed by Chu Yunfan, the rest were swallowed up by the nuclear explosion and turned into nothingness.","In the face of a nuclear bomb, a Core was no different from an ordinary lifeform.","Dozens of nuclear bombs exploded at the same time, and the entire ground shook. Even the people in the Imperial Capital who were protected by the barrier could feel the ground shaking.","There was no need to mention the tens of millions of cavalry. In an instant, seven to eight million had been killed. The remaining ones were completely dumbfounded. They screamed and fled. They were at the periphery of the battlefield, which was why they were not instantly swallowed up.","However, they were affected by the aftermath of the explosion. Many people saw the nuclear bomb explode and were blinded by the flash of light. Many people were blown away by the strong wind caused by the explosion. Only a few hundred thousand people were unscathed. There were at the outermost area, the furthest place, which even Chu Yunfan could not take care of.","In the Imperial Capital, everyone was dumbstruck by this scene. Then, they looked at Chu Yunfan, who had slowly put away the launcher, as if they were looking at a god. To them, Chu Yunfan, who possessed such terrifying power, was no different from a god.","Wei Wuji flew up high and shouted, “Everyone, it’s time for us to fight back! Jinzhanghan is finished. Today, we will destroy Jinzhanghan and turn the northern sheep-herding land into Great Wei’s farmlands. We will trample this enemy of Great Wei that has troubled us for countless years!”","Instantly, the morale of countless soldiers in the Imperial Capital soared. To them, it was already good enough that they were not killed. Who would have thought that the tables would be turned? In just a short period, the situation had taken a turn and they went from being prey to hunter.","Jinzhanghan was a giant that had posed a fatal threat to Great Wei when it was first established. Now that all the troops of Jinzhanghan had gone south and been destroyed here, it was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to destroy this old enemy."]},{"number":1552,"title":"Chapter 1552 Jinzhanghan Is Finished","paragraphs":["1552 Jinzhanghan Is Finished","This was something that the ancestors of Great Wei had failed to achieve. Their generation was about to completely end this grassland empire that had brought countless nightmares to Great Wei.","Thinking of this, countless people swarmed out of the city and chased after the cavalry that had been knocked to the ground by the blast. The remaining cavalry of Jinzhanghan did not dare to stay. They galloped wildly, trying to escape back to the northern grasslands.","When they had gone south earlier, the journey had been smooth. But when they were trying to return north, it was far too long. Behind them, millions of elite troops from the Imperial Capital began to pursue and kill them. Everyone knew that less than ten percent of these hundreds of thousands of cavalry could escape.","However, for Jinzhanghan, this was just the beginning of their troubles. Without the protection of tens of millions of soldiers and countless martial arts masters, this powerful grassland empire would instantly collapse. Not to mention Great Wei, which hated them to the bone, even Great Qi would attack Jinzhanghan as soon as they received the news.","This once-powerful grassland empire would probably be destroyed overnight. It was only a matter of time.","Chu Yunfan looked at the millions of troops swarming out of the Imperial Capital and sighed in relief. From today onward, Jinzhanghan was a thing of the past. There would be no chance for it to rise again. The khan had not expected that he would be sending Jinzhanghan to its death when he brought them to destroy Great Wei.","From now on, the three great kingdoms of mankind would be dominated by Great Wei and Great Qi. Even if it was to eradicate the roots, Great Wei and Great Qi would not let the remaining members of Jinzhanghan escape.","There was no need for Chu Yunfan to do anything else.","Chu Yunfan descended from the light and arrived at the top of the city wall. Chu Hongcai came up to him and said excitedly, “Brother Fan, that was amazing. Hahaha, I didn’t expect a nuclear bomb to be so powerful!”","“Yes, nuclear bombs are a product of another path of cultivation.” Chu Yunfan didn’t say much about this matter.","“Imperial Advisor, thank you for everything. I’m afraid we would have died if not for you,” Wei Wuji quickly stepped forward and said with an excited expression on his face. He was still in a state of unprecedented excitement.","This was something that even the Great Ancestor of Great Wei had failed to do. Yet, Chu Yunfan had done it. He had destroyed the powerful khan. From now on, he could imagine how the history books would record his deeds. His martial arts far surpassed the Great Ancestor.","Wei Wuji suppressed the excitement in his heart and asked, “Imperial Advisor, how are the Monster Subduers doing?”","Chu Yunfan said, “They were invaded by the demons, and the demons were not fighting alone. They colluded with Jinzhanghan. However, I’ve temporarily repelled them. When I heard that the capital was surrounded, I rushed back using a teleportation circle.”","“I see. It’s good that the Monster Subduers are fine.” Wei Wuji nodded.","Chu Yunfan then told Wei Wuji everything he knew. The more Wei Wuji listened, the more serious his expression became. He was no longer as excited as before.","Beside him, the old imperial guardian had an extremely ugly expression. He said, “I know from the records of the royal family that there is indeed a demon suppressed under the Monster Subduers. I just didn’t expect that the demons’ target to be that demon.”","“In that case, it’s safe to assume that the demons are after something big.” Wei Wuji nodded solemnly. “Fortunately, we’ve already defeated Jinzhanghan. Soon, we’ll move our army to the western border.”","Chu Yunfan nodded. “I’ll have to trouble you to arrange the troops, Your Majesty. I’m still worried. I’m going to the demon league to see what they’re up to. We can’t let them revive that monster. Otherwise, the consequences will be unimaginable.”","Even now, Chu Yunfan still felt that it was a pity that tens of millions of elite cavalry had been reduced to nothing in the battle between humans. If they could be used to resist the demon invasion, then they would have died a worthy death. However, Chu Yunfan had no other choice. After all, he would never allow Jinzhanghan to take over Great Wei.","He bid Wei Wuji farewell. This time, without the army surrounding him, he could use the teleportation circle and instantly teleport to the Monster Subduers.","At this moment, Yun Tian, who had been waiting for news in the Monster Subduers, saw Chu Yunfan appear in the teleportation circle and immediately went forward to say, “Master Chu, how’s everything? How’s the Imperial Capital?”","Chu Yunfan said, “The khan of Jinzhanghan is dead. Only a few hundred thousand of the tens of millions of cavalry have fled to the northern border. I don’t think many of them will get far. In short, Jinzhanghan is finished.”","Yun Tian gasped. The information contained in Chu Yunfan’s words was too much. Jinzhanghan that dominated the world and put great pressure on Great Wei and Great Qi was gone just like that. He imagined the few hundred thousand of the ten million cavalry had remained. It might seem like a lot, but in a war of this level, it was just a small wave. It was nothing.","The death of the khan, along with the deaths of the Left and Right Kings, meant that the high-ranking officials of Jinzhanghan had been wiped out. Under such circumstances, Jinzhanghan could be declared dead.","Yun Tian heaved a sigh of relief. Then, he gritted his teeth and said, “Serves them right for taking advantage of the situation. This is Heaven’s Will.”","For Yun Tian, a cultivator who defied the will of the heavens, to say something like karma, one could imagine how much he hated Jinzhanghan, who had taken advantage of the situation.","“Now that I’ve dealt with Jinzhanghan, the next thing to do is to deal with the demons,” Chu Yunfan said, “It won’t be long before the imperial court sends an army to the west to kill the demons who are causing trouble at the western border. The Monster Subduers can also help the imperial army to kill the demons.”","“No problem. I’ve been waiting for a long time!” Yun Huang rubbed his hands together as he spoke. Although he had long wanted to deal with these demons and although the Monster Subduers were powerful, they were only a sect. Against the endless number of demons, they were helpless. Only the imperial court could deal with them.","“Then I shall head off now. I want to see what the demon league is up to.”"]},{"number":1553,"title":"Chapter 1553 Sneaking Into the Demon League","paragraphs":["1553 Sneaking Into the Demon League","A bolt of lightning flashed across the sky, but strangely, it did not make any sound. If one looked carefully, one could see that the instant the bolt of lightning flashed, a figure stepped on it.","Stepping on lightning, Chu Yunfan flew with the wind. The wind was biting cold, but Chu Yunfan didn’t raise his protective energy shield. His clothes fluttered in the wind.","The cold wind howled. Coupled with Chu Yunfan’s super speed, the wind was strong enough to kill. But for him, it was not enough. Although he hadn’t used his final trump card, the lightning wings, his speed was already as fast as lightning.","He carried the Monster Vanquisher on his back and placed his hands behind his back, like a sword immortal riding a sword. In a flash, he had left the western border and entered the demon league.","This was a territory where very few humans had set foot. It was a pure paradise for demons. Countless demons lived here, and the dense demonic energy rolled in the sky, forming thick dark clouds. It looked extremely dark and was unsuitable for human life.","To demons, this place was heaven, but to humans, this place was simply hell on earth. Even a little bit of demonic energy would corrode one’s entire body as if they were poisoned.","However, this was nothing to Chu Yunfan. After cultivating the Imperial Physique, Chu Yunfan was like an iron plate. Even if he absorbed all the demonic energy directly, it would not do anything to him. Instead, it would be converted into energy that he could use because of the Celestial Devouring Art he cultivated. Even in this important place of the demon that ordinary human experts were afraid of, he was like a fish in water.","However, as soon as Chu Yunfan flew into it, a group of flying monsters immediately pounced on him. Chu Yunfan did not move at all and let these monsters crash into him. Before these monsters could touch him, they were all torn into pieces by the sharp sword intent that erupted from his body.","An invisible sword intent appeared under Chu Yunfan’s will. It was like a sharp sword, and it charged forward. In front of him, countless monsters exploded and turned into clouds of blood mist.","Chu Yunfan continued his massacre as he headed toward the depths of the demon league. Along the way, he would encounter Core demons from time to time, but even a Core Stage demon king was not Chu Yunfan’s match. He tore them apart with one strike of the Monster Vanquisher.","However, the closer he got to the center of the demon league, the number of demons increased. They were so dense that they almost surrounded Chu Yunfan. No matter how Chu Yunfan killed one wave, another wave would come.","They could not be cut down, and they could not be killed.","Soon, Chu Yunfan changed his mind. Although these beasts were nothing to him, and even if they wanted to exhaust him to death, it was impossible. With his recovery ability, even if he was surrounded, he would not be exhausted even if he fought for three days and three nights. However, these monsters would slow Chu Yunfan down, so he immediately changed his method and hid his aura.","There were countless methods to conceal one’s aura in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. One of them was called the Myriad Body Technique. It could conceal one’s aura and imitate all kinds of auras.","This wasn’t something the Alchemy Emperor had invented. He had obtained it from an enemy. That enemy had relied on this technique to deceive countless people and escape death countless times.","Chu Yunfan recalled the Myriad Body Technique. With the help of the godhead, he quickly covered up his human aura and turned it into the aura of the demon. Although he still had the appearance of a human, he did not seem to be out of place in this endless demonic energy. He may have had a human appearance, it was not strange since many demon kings maintained their human appearance.","Chu Yunfan went straight into the demon league. The place was huge, but then Chu Yunfan saw a scene that made his eyes pop out. Groups of demons were riding demonic winds and carrying groups of humans into the depths of the demon league. The humans had lost their consciousness and were transported into the depths of the demon league like goods.","Chu Yunfan was furious, but he didn’t make a scene because he wanted to see what these demons were doing. After hiding for a while, he discovered that more than one group of demons were transporting humans to the depths of the demon league. In a short time, at least thousands of humans were transported over.","His expression turned solemn. He thought that these monster armies had invaded the western border and that the residents there had been swallowed by these monsters. However, it seemed that this was not the case at all. A large portion of them had not been eaten by ordinary monsters, but had been taken away.","‘The demon league is cunning,’ Chu Yunfan thought. No matter what the demons were planning, he could not let them succeed.","He followed the demonic wind and headed deep into the demon league. Because Chu Yunfan had used the technique of transforming into thousands of bodies to simulate the aura of the demons, and because he had hidden well, no one discovered him. He managed to get close to a group of demons, and these demons did not notice that there was someone following behind them.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan finally arrived at the heart of the Ultimate West Demon League, the legendary kingdom of ten thousand demons. The closer they got to the depths of the demon league, the more powerful the demons.Powerful demons had formed tribes and occupied the place.","However, what entered Chu Yunfan’s eyes was a huge blood-colored array. This red array extended for hundreds of miles and was endless. The blood-red veins covered the entire ground like the roots of an old tree, and these veins formed the array. He could clearly see that at the foot of the array, hundreds of humans were transported to the edge of the array.","The elite demons formed strange seals and extracted the blood essence and souls of these humans, then sealed the blood and souls into the array. These ordinary humans were instantly awakened from their coma. With a miserable cry, their blood essence and souls had been sealed into the array.","In just a moment, these hundreds of people had been slaughtered and died tragically."]},{"number":1554,"title":"Chapter 1554 The Blood and Spirit Revival Circle","paragraphs":["1554 The Blood and Spirit Revival Circle","“You guys have a death wish!”","Chu Yunfan saw what they were doing from afar and was instantly furious. When he arrived, the hundreds of ordinary people had all died in the array. He was a step late. After all, to investigate clearly, he had been forced to follow far behind.","“Who is it?”","Hundreds of demons jumped up. These hundreds of demons were all elites. They were all Divine, and there was actually a Core leading them.","Just now, it was the Void Core demon who suddenly attacked, catching Chu Yunfan off guard and preventing him from saving the person. Although he was only at the Void Core Stage, this array could be considered high-end.","Before the hundreds of demons could react, a sword light descended from the sky and slashed them into pieces. They fell into a pool of blood. Previously, they had sacrificed the blood essence and souls of ordinary humans to the array. However, after they fell, their blood essence was instantly sucked dry by the formation as if they were attracted by something powerful.","The array did not care whether it was human or demon. As long as it was blood essence, it would be absorbed. Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely cold. Without a doubt, this array should be the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle that Yun Tian had mentioned.","At this moment, he understood why these demons had kidnapped ordinary humans. Their fundamental goal was to feed this array. As the array circulated, one could feel a faint, powerful pressure slowly spreading.","This array was developed to heal injuries. No matter what kind of injury it was, it could be repaired. However, the price it extracted was also very shocking. It was detrimental to the heavens. And according to the density of the bloody aura in the array, at least tens of millions of humans had been sacrificed.","From afar, Chu Yunfan could see many monsters standing next to the array with their bloody jaws hanging open. Then, many human limbs were spat out and fell into the array.","Only then did Chu Yunfan fully understand. The demons’ sudden attack was not a last-minute idea. It was premeditated. It was not only reflected in the sudden ambush that heavily injured Yun Huang and Yun Tian. It was even more evident in the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle.","The demons had probably already planned to slaughter humans and use their blood essence to complete the array.","After all, there was only one way for the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle to operate, and that was to use the blood essence of countless living beings as sacrifice. If they did not kill the humans, there was only one other way, and that was to let the monsters kill each other.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even need to think about it. These demons would definitely choose to kill humans instead of letting the monsters kill each other. Thinking of this, his expression became even colder. Then, with a loud shout, the Monster Vanquisher behind him suddenly unsheated and grew. In an instant, it had grown to more than ten thousand feet long.","“River Sunset Slash!”","When Chu Yunfan’s attack fell, it slashed out an illusion of the sun setting over a river. This concept carried a sharp sword intent that tore apart and shattered everything.","Boom!","The array shook violently. Just as Chu Yunfan’s sword light was about to hit it, the barrier above the array activated and blocked his attack.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","When this sword fell, even a Core Former would be killed by it. This was the power of the Monster Vanquisher was activated by Chu Yunfan. But even so, he failed to even touch the array. One could imagine how powerful it was.","Chu Yunfan’s expression became serious. That sword attack failed to do anything to the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle.","‘I have to assess the array. Otherwise, it will take too long to break,’ Chu Yunfan thought of something. Only by finding the core of the array could he break it.","The blood essence and vengeful souls of tens of millions of people had been sacrificed to this array. How powerful was it?","When all that power was gathered together, it was absolutely terrifying. Even Chu Yunfan, who was holding the Monster Vanquisher, found it difficult to break through.","Chu Yunfan could even feel a faint backlash. Endless evil spirits roared in Chu Yunfan’s ears. They were the vengeful spirits of ordinary humans who had been tortured to death. At this moment, they had lost their will and attacked anyone who dared to destroy the array.","He snorted coldly, and the vengeful spirits around him instantly turned into nothingness. These were not even ghosts, just some resentment.","“D*mn demons! I will make you pay with your blood!” Chu Yunfan said coldly. He thought of the Monster Cult back in the Federation. They had used many equally cruel or even crueler methods to hunt humans.","But the commotion caused by Chu Yunfan’s attack was too great. He had managed to sneak in, but now, he had alerted all the demons.","“There’s an enemy invasion. Pass on the great ancestor’s decree. Find the invader and tear them to pieces!”","A loud order came from the other side of the array, causing a commotion among countless demons. For these demons, this was their homebase, and the core was the nest of their nests. And they were attacked here. There was no doubt that only human experts would do such a thing.","Immediately, it caused a sensation, but Chu Yunfan did not take it to heart. His eyes were fixed on this enormous array. It was not easy to find the core of this array because it had considerable spirituality. The core was constantly shifting. Only experienced array masters could find the core and find the pattern, and that was after through a long search.","Although Chu Yunfan wasn’t an array master, his godhead was emitting layers of light. All kinds of data kept floating in front of his eyes. It was as if there was a supercomputer in his brain that was calculating rapidly.","Not long after, his eyes lit up and he said, “I found it!”","Before his eyes, the entire array was no longer a secret. Everything was under his control and he knew the location of the core.","However, at this moment, powerful demonic energy approached from afar!"]},{"number":1555,"title":"Chapter 1555 A Golden Core Demon","paragraphs":["1555 A Golden Core Demon","When Chu Yunfan located the array core, streams of demonic energy approached at an alarming speed. Although his shocking sword attack failed to break the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle, it had alarmed the demons guarding it.","“Pass on the great ancestor’s decree. Kill all intruders without mercy!”","“Pass on the league master’s orders. Kill the invaders!”","Explosions sounded from the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle. Powerful demon auras were revived and searched everywhere.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was solemn. The demon league had been dormant for many years. No one really knew how strong they were. There were many people who naively believed that these demi-humans had been fighting each other for many years, and it was difficult for their strength to truly improve.","However, this was not the case. The demons formed their spiritual intelligence relatively late, and it was much more difficult for them to cultivate than ordinary humans. However, their lifespan was generally several times longer than that of humans, ten times longer even.","Many demon kings had existed since the founding of Great Wei, and the great heroes that were Great Wei’s founders had long died. From this, one could imagine the terrifying strength of the demon league. The accumulation of generations had reached a shocking level.","The three great human kingdoms were constantly changing, and there would be wars between them from time to time. Internal strife was frequent, so the number of experts increased slowly. It was impossible for the humans to achieve explosive growth in just a few hundred years.","The demon league finally showed its fangs. Just from what Chu Yunfan could see, there were hundreds of top Cores and hundreds of half-step Cores surrounding him. Such a lineup would be enough to shock the entire human world, and this was only a part of it.","If it were an ordinary person, even an expert like the khan who had reached the peak of the Core Form Stage, he would probably be scared to death. It was simply impossible to contend with a team of this level.","However, they were facing Chu Yunfan. For him, there was only an incomparably cold killing intent boiling in his heart.","“No matter what your plans are, you have completely angered me.” Chu Yunfan looked coldly at the countless figures surrounding him. “Today, I will start a massacre and kill until the entire demon league trembles. I’m going to pay tribute to the millions of dead living creatures!”","Chu Yunfan despised these blood sacrifice methods. It easily cost the lives of tens of millions or even billions of living beings.","“We found him! He’s here!” someone shouted.","An extremely powerful yak covered in long hair appeared before Chu Yunfan. His body was like a small mountain, and he opened his bloody mouth. His mouth was filled with sharp teeth, and the smell of blood assaulted Chu Yunfan’s face as it bit down.","Chu Yunfan sneered and slapped him.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan slapped the yak, and its mountain-like body exploded.","A Core demon king was instantly slapped into pieces!","Immediately, all the demon kings who were flying over froze. Suddenly, someone shouted from the clouds formed by countless demonic energy, “Let’s attack together. He can’t fight all of us at once. We’ll tear him to pieces and fill the array with his blood!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the hundreds of Core Stage, half-step Core Stage, and countless Divine demons pounced on Chu Yunfan. Although their numbers were not comparable to the Jinzhanghan army, the terrifying power they created was not inferior either.","“Go to hell!”","Chu Yunfan let out a loud roar. In his hand, the Monster Vanquisher emitted a powerful light. In the pitch-black atmosphere of the demon league, it was like a huge sun that tore everything apart. The endless demonic energy in the surroundings was oppressive, but it was stirred up the powerful aura of the Monster Vanquisher.","The sword slashed out, and powerful sword lights swept through the air.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The sword lights were too fast, and their range was unimaginably wide. It instantly swept through the faster demons that pounced over.","“Rrrraaagh!”","Countless loud roars sounded. These demons were swept away and exploded in mid-air. Wherever the sword lights passed, whether it was Divine, half-step Core, or Core demons, they all exploded.","Chu Yunfan had killed at least 20 powerful Core demon kings.","The Monster Vanquisher was refined to defeat demons. When facing the demons, the power of its sword light was even more powerful.","However, this wave of attack was far from over. It was just the beginning.","The sword lights were like bolts of lightning that tore through the darkness. They tore through everything and shattered everything. They fell into the midst of the demons who had just charged over, and it was as if powerful bombs had exploded. These demon kings were blasted into pieces. They could not stop the sword lights.","More than ten sword lights swept past. These hundreds of Cores, hundreds of half-step Cores, and countless Divine demons, all died under Chu Yunfan’s sword lights.","Chu Yunfan’s face was slightly pale after slashing out more than a dozen sword lights in one breath. The consumption was too great. There was no need to talk about the power of the Monster Vanquisher, but its requirements for the user were also extremely high.","Just as Chu Yunfan was trying to recover, a terrifying aura pressed down on him like Mount Tai. An even more terrifying figure flew out from the depths of the array. It was an extremely terrifying expert. The terrifying aura released made the place freeze.","‘A Golden Core!’","Chu Yunfan’s expression became solemn. This demon was a Golden Core, an existence that was above the Core Form Stage.","With the strong physique of the demon and the accumulation of strength over the years, demons often had the advantage among experts of the same level. Not to mention that this demon expert was far stronger than Chu Yunfan.","“D*mned human! You killed so many of us demons! I want you dead!”"]},{"number":1556,"title":"Chapter 1556 The Attack That Shakes the Heavens, Defeating the League Master","paragraphs":["1556 The Attack That Shakes the Heavens, Defeating the League Master","The figure flew over in a fluster. The huge aura on its body swept toward Chu Yunfan like a gale. Chu Yunfan could feel that the air around him had solidified, making him feel as if he was trapped in a swamp. Even breathing was difficult.","This figure arrived with a dense demonic energy. In the sky, a pair of blood-red eyes appeared, looking extremely terrifying. Chu Yunfan felt like he was being targeted by an ancient beast. Originally, Chu Yunfan didn’t take it to heart, but now he could feel how terrifying this demon was.","“Human, tell me, how would you like to die?”","His deep voice like a thunderclap shook the world.","“A Golden Core demon? When did such a powerful expert appear among the demons? Are you the leader of the Ultimate West Demon League, or are you the great ancestor of the demons?” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at the pair of eyes in the sky.","Chu Yunfan was wary of the Golden Core demon, but he was not afraid. He thought of what Yun Tian had told him about the demon league. Although it was difficult for humans to truly investigate the secrets of the demon league, the Monster Subduers had guarded the border for many years and they knew some basic information.","In the demon league, besides those powerful Core demon kings, there were two truly powerful figures. One was the current league master of the demon league, whose strength was extremely powerful and unfathomable. As for the other, he was mysterious and unfathomable. He was known as the Great Ancestor Demon, and no one knew his background.","These two people were known as the most terrifying experts in the entire demon league and even the entire demon race. Even the unruly demon kings dared not show any disrespect to them. The status of these two people in the demon league was probably similar to the status of Yun Huang within Great Wei. They were powerful and transcendental.","“I didn’t expect a small human like you to know about me. Yes, I am the league master.” The pair of enormous blood-red eyes shook for a moment, and an incomparably low voice sounded from within the surging demonic energy.","“Human, tell me, how do you want to die?” the league master asked coldly.","Suddenly, he realized that something was wrong. Chu Yunfan’s aura was increasing at an astonishing speed. After a dozen consecutive slashes, Chu Yunfan’s divine power had been exhausted. The divine power of a Core was endless, but at the same time, if it was exhausted, it would not be easy to replenish it.","However, the Chu Yunfan in front of him had completely broken his understanding. Chu Yunfan did not take any recovery pills, but in record time, he was almost fully recovered.","“Are you stalling?”","The leader of the demon league was a veteran. How could he not understand Chu Yunfan’s little trick? His voice was filled with anger. He did not care that Chu Yunfan took advantage of this short time to recover. After all, he had already seen through Chu Yunfan’s true strength. He was just a human warrior at the peak of the Void Core Stage, not even at the Core Form Stage.","What kind of threat could Chu Yunfan pose?","What he cared about was that he had been deceived by such a detestable human. This was simply a great humiliation.","“That’s right, I am stalling.”","Chu Yunfan could feel the divine power in his body recovering at an astonishing speed. The Imperial Physia and the powerful Thunderclap Physique were vividly displayed. In a battle between experts, even a little bit more stamina and divine power could lead to victory or defeat, not to mention such a huge difference. The difference was even enough to determine the outcome of a battle.","“Human, do you think that stalling will be of any use?” A huge bloody mouth appeared in the demonic energy. The league leader revealed a ferocious smile filled with disdain.","Chu Yunfan attacked at the same time. The divine power in his body exploded like an ocean and was injected into the Monster Vanquisher.","The Monster Vanquisher burst out with a strong sword light. The sword light was like a blazing sun tearing through the darkness, instantly tearing everything apart.","Chu Yunfan gripped the sword tightly with both hands and controlled the sword light to slash down.","Bam!","The sword light shattered everything and landed on the sharp claw. The sharp claw was shattered in mid-air and turned into a cloud of blood mist.","This sword light was just the beginning. In an instant, it slashed down along the sharp claw and cut into the cloud formed by the black demonic energy.","“Agh!”","When the sword light cut into the black demonic energy, a loud scream came from it. Immediately after, countless blood spurted out and fell on the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle as if it was raining blood.","The array rapidly absorbed this blood rain. The blood essence of a Golden Core was far more useful than the blood essence of an ordinary human. It was equivalent to hundreds of thousands of ordinary humans.","“You dare to injure me?!”","Within the black demonic energy, a pair of blood-red eyes were wide open. They looked furious. The roar shook the sky as if it wanted to tear everything apart the whole world.","“Ahhhh, I’m going to kill you!”","The league master never expected to be injured. He was shocked and angry. The violent demonic energy on his body surged, tearing everything apart and causing a terrifying scene.","Above the array, Chu Yunfan’s face was extremely pale. The power of the sword was astonishing, but at the same time, it also exhausted his divine power which had just recovered to its peak. His vitality was drained.","“You want to kill me? I’ll kill you!”","Chu Yunfan took a step forward. Although he didn’t have any divine power, his blood was still surging and his body was still strong."]},{"number":1557,"title":"Chapter 1557 Killing the League Master","paragraphs":["1557 Killing the League Master","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he charged into the black fog and punched out, His energy and blood surged. At this moment, his divine power had already been exhausted, but that did not mean that he would be captured without a fight. This might be the case for ordinary warriors, but for Chu Yunfan, even if his divine power was exhausted, his combat strength might not be much worse.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s punch hit something solid, and then the black demonic cloud was shattered. Only then did he finally see what was hidden behind the demonic cloud—an ape covered in green scales.","This ape was tall, about the height of two people. Its entire body was covered in green scales, and there were even barbs on many of the scales. Its eyes were red, and it looked extremely ferocious. Its demonic power was shocking. Chu Yunfan had never seen a demon of this level.","No one in the world would be a match for this demon.","However, there was a huge gash on the demon’s chest. It was the wound caused by the Monster Vanquisher. He looked extremely miserable. He no longer looked like a great demon with unparalleled might. This wound went from one of his shoulders to the other side of his waist. If the demon overexerted himself, he would be torn in half. The demon’s left shoulder was also covered in blood and was devoid of an arm. It had exploded during Chu Yunfan’s attack.","This was Chu Yunfan’s first time seeing the true form of the league master. No one in the outside world knew about it. After all, humans’ understanding of the demon league was too shallow. They barely knew anything. They only knew that the demons had a master, but no one knew what creature it was.","“I’m going to kill you!” the league master roared as he bared his fangs.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at him. He stepped on the air, rushed toward the league master, and punched his head.","Bam!","The punch landed directly on the league master’s head. The demon was not expecting Chu Yunfan to dare to fight him so fiercely. Ordinary human warriors would not choose to fight the demons in a melee fight. That was to attack the enemy’s strength with their own weaknesses. However, Chu Yunfan was different. His body was his strongest point.","Although Chu Yunfan had lost his divine power, he still had the strength of his body. This punch hit the head of the league master, making him dizzy. At the same time, the wound on his body opened a little more.","“Rrrraggghhh! I’m going to tear you apart!”","The leader of the demon league revealed a fierce look. His remaining arm grabbed ar Chu Yunfan. He had not lost his divine power. When he used it, his speed was as fast as lightning.","But what happened next scared him to death. Chu Yunfan didn’t even try to dodge and let the claw land on his body. An ear-piercing sound was heard, and then the claw made a sound of metal clashing on Chu Yunfan’s body. It was as if his arm had grabbed a piece of iron, and sparks flew everywhere.","It was completely useless.","The league master found that the power he was so proud of couldn’t stop Chu Yunfan from flying down like a roc spreading its wings.","“Eat my punch!”","Without divine power, Chu Yunfan was still extremely ferocious. Only then did he truly display his physical cultivation. This punch hit the league master squarely in the waist, which was the deepest part of the wound that Chu Yunfan had made.","The leader of the demon league screamed. His protective energy shield was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s pure punch, and then Chu Yunfan’s fist landed on his wound.","The wound that had barely stopped bleeding burst open again. Blood gushed out, and the injury expanded a little. The league master had never seen such a fierce human who could charge at him without caring about his close combat.","This was Chu Yunfan’s only choice. He had to exchange injury for injury and heavily injure the leader of the demon league.","If it were an ordinary person, their vitality would have been drained and they would have died. Even if they hurt the league master, they would not be able to fight back. After all, a Golden Core expert was too terrifying.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. Without the support of divine power, his combat strength would not be much worse. However, the leader of the demon league was different. After he was seriously injured, his combat strength fell below the Golden Core Stage, and he could only be comparable to an ordinary peak Core Former.","Although it was still terrifying, it was nothing compared to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t give him any space to escape. Relying on the little divine power in his body, he dashed forward and punched the league master.","Bam!","The league master was sent flying like a shooting star. Chu Yunfan’s fighting style was too rough. With the support of his powerful body, an ordinary fist could be exchanged for a terrifying power.","Boom!","The league master crashed hard into the ground. The entire ground shook, and a huge pit was smashed out. The leader of the demon league was in pain, and his wounds worsened. He was getting weaker and weaker, and his wounds were further devouring his combat strength. If he could find a place to recover, this sword would not have been a fatal wound to him, but Chu Yunfan did not give him the chance.","Chu Yunfan fell like a god descending to the mortal world and threw another punch at the league master.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Chu Yunfan didn’t even know how many punches he threw until the league master stopped moving and was killed."]},{"number":1558,"title":"Chapter 1558 Breakthrough Is Near","paragraphs":["1558 Breakthrough Is Near","“Huff, huff, huff!”","Rather than saying that he had killed the league master, it was more accurate to say that the league master had been killed by the injuries caused by the sword strike earlier. The league master was seriously injured, but he was able to suppress it with his powerful internal energy. Now, Chu Yunfan had punched him out.","‘I didn’t expect a Golden Core to be so difficult to deal with.’ Chu Yunfan’s expression was a little solemn. With his cultivation, it was almost impossible to find a match for him in the Core Form Stage. Ordinary Core Formers could not even withstand a few of his attacks. Even if there were half a dozen of the khans, who was an expert at the peak of the Core Form Stage, he would not care.","However, there were many experts in the demon league. The leader league master was a Golden Core. He was even more famous than the entire demon league and more powerful.","According to Yun Tian’s information, when the league master became the master of the countless demon tribes, he also received the support of the Great Ancestor Demon. It was an old demon that had existed for countless years.","Compared to the leader of the demon league, the great ancestor was probably stronger.","Chu Yunfan was able to kill the league master largely because he had caught the enemy off guard. The aura he released looked like he was only at the peak of the Void Core Stage. That was his true cultivation level. Of course, his combat strength was far more than that, but the aura he released was still very confusing so the league master had not him seriously.","That was why he was able to heavily injure him with a single strike.","If it was an ordinary Core Former, even if ten of them were in front of him, they would still be killed with a single sword strike. However, the league master, who was in the Golden Core Stage, was not severely injured and killed.","Chu Yunfan’s vigilance against Golden Cores had never been higher. He had used all his strength in that attack and even injured his foundation. Otherwise, with the Imperial Physique, even if his mana was depleted, he could still use the Celestial Devouring Art to absorb the demonic energy and recover it in a short time.","In this battle, Chu Yunfan had killed the league master. At the same time, he had shaken the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle.","Chu Yunfan placed the corpse of the league master at the base of the Brahma Tree. Countless spirit energy surged into the tree and waves of light erupted from it. The Brahma Fruit on the tree, which had absorbed countless blood essence and spirit energy, was gradually emitting waves of pleasant fragrance.","Chu Yunfan knew that the Brahma Fruit was about to ripen and was delighted. This had come at just the right time. When he swallowed the Brahma Fruit, his strength would have an even greater improvement and enter the Core Form Stage. His combat strength would break through the current barrier and upper limit. He would step into the Golden Core Stage. At that time, he would be truly invincible. He would not even be afraid of the Great Ancestor Demon.","Chu Yunfan had just killed all the experts led by the league master in one breath. However, more powerful auras were gathering. He quickly entered the the Mountain River Diagram.","In just a moment, thousands of powerful demons appeared where Chu Yunfan had been standing.","Many of these demons maintained their original demon bodies. They were tall and big like small mountains. Just a thousand of them covered the sky. However, at this moment, all the ferocious faces of the demons revealed solemn expressions. In just a short period, so many demons had been slaughtered.","There was even the league master among the fallen. Although they did not want to believe that the league master, who was one of the top experts in the Ultimate West Demon League, would be ambushed and killed, they couldn’t sense the aura of their master. They had no other choice but to believe it.","“The great ancestor has ordered us to split up and search. We must find the intruder and tear them to pieces!” one of the demons shouted.","The group of demons immediately scattered and searched in all directions. However, they never thought that the person they were looking for was not elsewhere, but here.","In the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in midair. As time passed, his energy that had been heavily injured by the sword slowly recovered.","Chu Yunfan’s divine power was also gradually recovering, and his energy and blood were slowly recovering to their peak. His recovery speed became faster and faster. Before long, he had already recovered to his peak condition. He also consumed all manner of healing pills.","‘The Brahma Fruit still needs some time to ripen. I can use this time to investigate,’ Chu Yunfan thought.","Chu Yunfan was familiar with the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle by now. In just a moment, he found the array core. He turned into a bolt of lightning and headed straight for the array core.","However, the closer he got to the center of the array, the more demons he encountered. Although he was not afraid, he did not want to alarm these demons again. When he met the patrolling demons, he would dive into the Mountain River Diagram. When the patrolling demons left, he would continue forward. Although some demons felt that something was wrong, Chu Yunfan, who had hidden in the Mountain River Diagram, was not someone they could discover.","Just like that, Chu Yunfan successfully arrived at the core of the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle. Different from the outside, there were only two figures guarding the core of the array. However, these two figures carried an extremely powerful aura that intimidated others."]},{"number":1559,"title":"Chapter 1559 Possession","paragraphs":["1559 Possession","The two of them carried an unimaginably powerful aura. Each of them far surpassed the khan, who was at the peak of the Core Form Stage. Compared to him, who was at the peak of the Core Form Stage, they were one step further. If one had to give them a definition, they should be at the half-step Golden Core Stage. Masters of this level, even though they were a little weaker than Chu Yunfan, they were not much weaker.","Chu Yunfan entered the Mountain River Diagram as soon as he came over, but even so, he still attracted the attention of the two demons. Immediately, two divine wills swept out like radars. Their shut eyes immediately opened and looked directly in Chu Yunfan’s direction. However, they looked at each other in confusion because they did not see anything. They thought that they had made a mistake.","Chu Yunfan did not choose to attack immediately. He knew that even though experts of this level could not compare to the league master, they were still much stronger than ordinary Core Formers. Such experts would need to be killed in one blow or the demons near the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle, especially the Great Ancestor Demon, would be alerted.","He observed the two demons carefully. One of them had the head of a wolf and the body of a human. He had a huge wolf head and looked like a fierce wolf king. The other was a middle-aged man with thick armor on his back. His true form was probably a turtle demon. However, this turtle demon had the head of a snake. It looked extremely strange.","Chu Yunfan knew that this was a very remarkable change. Just like how the ultimate goal of the bloodline transformation of all snakes was to become a true dragon above the nine heavens, all turtles had the bloodline of one of the legendary four spirits, the Black Tortoise. Only when their cultivation reached a certain level would they have a certain chance to undergo the Black Tortoise transformation.","The level of this turtle demon was about the same as the flood dragon among the snake-type demons. It could be said that its cultivation was extremely shocking. Ordinary Golden Core turtle-type demons could not activate the Black Tortoise bloodline in their bodies.","In any case, neither of these two demon experts was easy to deal with. If they really fought, Chu Yunfan was not afraid, but how to kill them in the shortest time was the goal that he was considering.","“Was I mistaken somehow?” Turtle Demon King spoke first.","“My senses must be off. There’s no one there,” said the Wolf Demon King. However, he still looked around warily as if he was afraid of a sudden attack.","“However, it’s not wrong to be careful. This is the most important time. The great ancestor is currently using the possession technique, and he can’t afford to fail. If he succeeds, he’ll live for another thousand years and lead the demons to rise up and take over this world,” Turtle Demon King said as he frowned. “I just received news that the league master might have fallen.”","“Impossible. How strong is the league master? He’s in the Golden Core Stage. Even if he’s surrounded by humans, he can still kill them. Humans are so weak, how can they kill him?” Wolf Demon King immediately said.","“That’s true. However, the only ones who will infiltrate and invade now are the humans. Now the demons have united and want to help the great ancestor seize the body, there shouldn’t be anyone who will stab us in the back. After all, only when the great ancestor advances can he teach us the Golden Core cultivation method. We’ve been stuck at the half-step Golden Core Stage for too long,” Turtle Demon King said and shook his head.","The shocking information revealed by their words made Chu Yunfan’s expression change drastically. At this moment, he finally understood the whole story. No wonder these demons who usually killed each other were so united.","Although the demons had established the demon league, many powerful demon kings usually listened to their orders and did not take the league master seriously. On a normal day, countless demons would constantly go on expeditions. This was the fundamental reason why the human world could maintain peace.","But now, these demons of the demon league had joined forces. This was unusual in itself. It turned out that the Great Ancestor Demon of the demon league was actually going to pass down the method of cultivating to the Golden Core.","Chu Yunfan knew that the cultivation method in this world was incomplete. Although it was much stronger than the Federation, there were still gaps. This was because the Golden Core technique was no different from a heavenly book to the higher-ups of this world. Even if someone occasionally broke through, it was also due to their fortuitous encounters. Moreover, they were generally tightly concealed, afraid that others would know. After all, Cores and non-Cores were two completely different things. A Golden Core could easily kill a group of Core Formers. The strength of both parties was simply not on the same level.","Chu Yunfan was able to kill the league master mostly because of luck. Now that the Great Ancestor Demon was about to pass down the cultivation method to reach the Golden Core Stage, it was this reason that the great ancestor had sacrificed so much.","Chu Yunfan had been thinking the same thoughts as Yun Tian. He thought that the demons were trying to revive the demon that was suppressed by the Monster Subduers. Only now did he know that this was not the case. It turned out that the goal of the Great Ancestor Demon was to possess someone. The Blood and Spirit Revival Circle was used to revive the vitality of that demon, and its ultimate goal was actually to possess it.","After thinking about it, Chu Yunfan immediately understood. The ancient demon had lived for too long, so long that it might have existed a few dynasties before Great Wei. Even if the lifespan of demons was far longer than that of humans, even if he was the longest-lived turtle demon, he was probably nearing the end of his life. At this moment, he could either wait for death peacefully or fight to the death.","Possssessing a body wasn’t easy, and it had always been the case since ancient times. Especially if the person one wanted to possess was a powerful demon, the risk would be even greater. However, this Great Ancestor Demon was definitely prepared to fight to the death.","In this way, everything was logical.","There was a great terror between life and death. As long as he could survive, he could give him anything he wanted, let alone the cultivation method to reach the Golden Core Stage.","“If we break through to the Golden Core Stage, our lifespan will increase. Otherwise, we won’t be too far away from the end of our lives.” Wolf Demon King nodded happily, and at the same time, a hint of envy appeared in its eyes.","“I’m really envious of the great ancestor’s methods. That’s an ancient demon. Unlike us, it was born very powerful. In addition, it has gone through the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle and absorbed so much blood essence. Once the possession is successful, the great ancestor will instantly surpass the Golden Core Stage.”"]},{"number":1560,"title":"Chapter 1560 Killing Half-Step Golden Cores","paragraphs":["1560 Killing Half-Step Golden Cores","“That’s right. If we hadn’t seen the records in the ancient literature, I’m afraid we wouldn’t have known that the demon suppressed under the Monster Subduers was actually an ancient demon.” The Turtle Demon King sighed emotionally. “I didn’t expect that there would be ancient demons in this era. After all, ever since the world changed, I haven’t heard of ancient demons!”","The Wolf Demon King revealed a bitter smile. There was a gap in the world’s era. It wasn’t just humans who had their future cut off. The demons were the same. They were just slightly better off than humans, but there was no fundamental difference. If the demons had a complete inheritance, they would have occupied this world long ago.","Demon Kings like them, if they were to read from some ancient records that were rarely passed down by the demons, or from some scenes that were engraved in their bloodlines, would be known as existences like them. They could be kings in the present, but in ancient times, they were not even cannon fodder.","At the thought of this, a burning desire appeared on their faces. Although the possession of the Great Ancestor Demon had nothing to do with them, if he could activate some bloodline after possession and obtain some extraordinary divine powers and techniques, it would be very important to the entire demon race. As high-level demons, they would definitely be able to get a share of the profits.","This was the reason why these unruly demon kings were willing to guard the door in peace. To the demons, bloodline divine power was more important than anything else.","For humans, whether they could embark on the path of cultivation depended on whether they had the opportunity to gain a master and receive systematic knowledge. However, the demons were different. There were thousands of demon races, and they were almost completely different. If they were to be taught uniformly, there would be problems.","The brutal and bloodthirsty demons had always fought against each other, so there was no chance for them to teach each other. They relied on the memories that were deeply engraved in their blood. Once they awakened their intelligence, they could obtain the inheritance since ancient times. However, it was generally some basic methods.","However, there were also some demons who obtained powerful techniques and soared into the sky. The purer and stronger their bloodline was, the more powerful the techniques and divine powers they awakened were.","If the Great Ancestor Demon could successfully possess some of the ancient demon techniques, it might not be able to increase the strength of the entire demon race, but for experts like them who had reached the critical point of cultivation, the effect was naturally self-evident.","Suddenly, the array began to rumble. Wolf Demon King and Turtle Demon King looked at each other as joy flashed across their eyes. The possession was finally about to begin.","From inside the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan had already realized the seriousness of the problem. He could not wait any longer. What would happen when the Great Ancestor Demon’s possession was complete?","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan didn’t hesitate. He took a step forward, and a sky full of light appeared under his feet. He instantly appeared in front of Turtle Demon King.","Swoosh!","The Monster Vanquisher sliced through the sky, bringing with it a terrifying sword light and a terrifying attack.","“Who are you?!”","Turtle Demon King wasn’t expecting someone to attack him. Although he seemed to have sensed something amiss, he confirmed with Wolf Demon King that there was nothing wrong. Therefore, he had always believed that there was nothing wrong.","Who knew that their initial perception was not wrong?","Slice!","The Monster Vanquisher instantly slashed through Turtle Demon King’s protective energy shield. His huge head was sent flying and landed on the array. Blood splattered out and was absorbed by the array. His body was then grabbed by a large hand into the Mountain River Diagram. He was crushed and poured into the Brahma Tree.","“An enemy attack!”","Just as Chu Yunfan finished off Turtle Demon King, Wolf Demon King shouted. However, at this critical juncture, no one came to help him.","However, Wolf Demon King was a half-step Golden Core after all. It was a rare expert in the world. If it was not for the Great Ancestor Demon, it was impossible for ordinary people to gather them. His reaction was quick, and he immediately reacted. His claws tore through everything and tore at Chu Yunfan. His divine power was so powerful that it tore the sky apart.","Bam!","When the sword descended, it shattered everything. It tore apart Wolf Demon King’s attack and landed on him. Wolf Demon King landed ruthlessly above the array. It was blocked by the array, but it also shook the array.","The array was clearly guarded against living things. Living things could not fall in like dead things. Therefore, the Wolf Demon King didn’t land inside.","“D*mn it! How are you so strong?!”","Wolf Demon King cried out repeatedly. His entire body was almost split apart. He had calculated everything. His strength was inferior to Chu Yunfan’s, so the attack he had unleashed in a hurry was surely inferior to Chu Yunfan’s.","Chu Yunfan had defeated all his attacks. His body was almost torn apart, but even if it wasn’t, his situation wasn’t any better. Blood splattered everywhere.","Chu Yunfan’s attacks followed him like a shadow without any pause. He stepped on a beam of light and instantly arrived in front of Wolf Demon King. He stomped down, producing countless amounts of netherworld water, crushing everything and destroying everything.","Boom!","Wolf Demon King was stomped into pieces in midair, dying a tragic death on the spot.","All of this seemed to take a long time, but in reality, it had only been a short time. It had already ended.","Chu Yunfan ended everything quickly. However, he was not happy as he knew that the real battle had just begun."]},{"number":1561,"title":"Chapter 1561 Fighting the Great Ancestor Demon","paragraphs":["1561 Fighting the Great Ancestor Demon","Chu Yunfan put away Wolf Demon King’s corpse and looked at the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle. At this moment, the blood-red barrier above the array was flickering with a strange blood-red color. He could even see the roars of countless vengeful souls.","The array had already begun its final operation. This meant that the Great Ancestor Demon’s possession was about to begin. Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan took out the nuclear launcher and fired a nuclear bomb at the array core.","The nuclear bomb landed at the center of the array with a long tail of flames.","Rumble!","A huge mushroom cloud rose into the sky like a rising sun. The terrifying energy tide tore everything apart and shattered everything. Even the extremely powerful Blood and Spirit Revival Circle could not withstand the impact of such a nuclear bomb. It exploded and turned into blood-red fragments that scattered in all directions.","Chu Yunfan saw that above the array, a huge creature was constantly twitching. This creature looked like a dog, but its body was covered in fur like a lion. This incomparably huge creature was emitting a monstrous might from all over its body, looking extremely terrifying. At the same time, countless spirit energy was gathering in the blood pool formed by the array below.","Every pore of this demon was opening up, crazily absorbing the blood essence within, causing its aura to continuously strengthen. At this moment, above him, an old man was opening his eyes and staring at the ferocious beast in front of him with an extremely greedy expression.","“Hahahahaha, the hou’s body is mine!”","The old man’s expression was extremely ferocious and carried a hint of greed. He looked extremely terrifying and could scare ordinary people to death.","Only now did Chu Yunfan know what this ferocious beast was. It was actually a hou, a legendary beast. Even in the era of the emperors, a creature like the hou was a terrifying existence that was fierce enough to challenge the emperors.","The dragons had been the most powerful creatures in the world, standing at the top of the food chain. However, the hou fed on dragons and was the dragons’ mortal enemy.","One could imagine how terrifying this creature was.","Of course, the hous were one of the best among the divine creatures, but this one had not reached that level. However, it could also be seen from this that the potential of this hou was astonishing. Its future was limitless. It was no wonder that he had not died after being suppressed by the Monster Vanquisher for so many years.","A beast of this level was definitely ranked at the top among the primordial beasts. No wonder the Great Ancestor Demon wanted to seize it at all costs and possess it. If the Great Ancestor Demon really succeeded in possessing the hou, with the divine beast’s aptitude, an unimaginably terrifying peerless demon king would appear in this world.","“I can’t let him succeed!”","Chu Yunfan immediately made a judgment. He absolutely could not let the Great Ancestor Demon succeed. Otherwise, no one in the world could stop him.","However, the moment the nuclear bomb shattered the array, the Great Ancestor Demon immediately reacted. His eyes swept over like a pair of eagle eyes, and there was incomparable killing intent in them.","“You’re courting death!”","The Great Ancestor Demon was burning with rage. At the critical moment, he had finally managed to use the array to wipe out the hou’s primordial spirit. He was about to take over the hou’s body when a human suddenly appeared and ruined his plan to live forever.","The Great Ancestor Demon roared and grabbed at Chu Yunfan with a sharp claw. Although the Great Ancestor Demon looked like he was on his last breath and could die at any moment, a Golden Core expert was still very terrifying.","His angry attack was not inferior to the league master.","Chu Yunfan’s heart tightened, and he quickly retreated hundreds of meters away, barely dodging the Great Ancestor Demon’s attack.","“Die!”","The Great Ancestor Demon roared. Like a leopard, he arched his body and clawed out again. This attack instantly covered the sky and earth, tearing apart everything and destroying everything. The moment he attacked, it was an extremely powerful attack.","Chu Yunfan grabbed at the air and a fist-sized fruit appeared in front of him. If it wasn’t the Brahma Fruit, then what was it?","At this moment, the Brahma Fruit had finally ripened once again. At this critical moment, Chu Yunfan swallowed it. In an instant, the Brahma Fruit transformed into a terrifying medicinal strength that directly surged into his limbs and bones.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s four limbs burst out with a huge amount of divine power. With him as the center, it swept out like a storm. He jumped to avoid the attack of the Great Ancestor Demon, but the terrifying tide created by the sharp claws still blew his clothes.","“You’re rushing to break through while fighting?”","The Great Ancestor Demon instantly saw what Chu Yunfan was doing. His eyes flashed with a cold killing intent. Chu Yunfan actually dared to break through during the battle with him. What did he take him for? A whetstone?","At the thought of this, the Great Ancestor Demon’s eyes flickered with unimaginable killing intent.","“Die!”","The Great Ancestor Demon immediately made a judgment. If he did not kill Chu Yunfan, it would be difficult for him to carry out the possession in peace. He pounced toward Chu Yunfan like a mountain.","“Sky Devouring Demons!”","He roared loudly as he clawed out. He split into millions of powerful demons, swallowing the sky and devouring the earth, the whole world was in their hunting range.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan also threw a punch, turning into eight dragons to protect himself. Then, he turned into a fist wave and collided with the group of demons.","Boom!","The two attacks collided, and Chu Yunfan was sent flying like a kite with a broken string.","Spurt!","It took Chu Yunfan a long time to stabilize himself, and he spat out a mouthful of blood.","“As expected of the Great Ancestor Demon. Just this one move is enough to prove your reputation.”","Chu Yunfan wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth, but he was not afraid. The divine power in his body surged."]},{"number":1562,"title":"Chapter 1562 Borrowing Other’s Knife to Sharpen Oneself","paragraphs":["1562 Borrowing Other’s Knife to Sharpen Oneself","Chu Yunfan didn’t use any tricks when he clashed with the Great Ancestor Demon. It was a head-on battle.","The Great Ancestor Demon’s unfathomable strength erupted and severely injured Chu Yunfan. Without any fancy moves, the Great Ancestor Demon crushed Chu Yunfan with absolute strength.","Chu Yunfan had always been good at crushing all-powerful enemies with absolute strength, but now he was at a disadvantage in terms of absolute strength when facing the Great Ancestor Demon.","With Chu Yunfan’s strength, he was at most at the half-step Golden Core Stage. However, the Great Ancestor Demon was a genuine Golden Core. His strength was far beyond Chu Yunfan’s imagination. Even though he was already old, the Great Ancestor Demon’s strength was still above the league master’s, far stronger than Chu Yunfan’s.","After this attack, the Great Ancestor Demon’s eyes flashed with a hint of surprise. Chu Yunfan was actually not killed. He had forgotten how many years it had been since he had fought. His strength was unmatched throughout the world, and his status among the demons was revered.","Even the league master could be deposed by him with a single word, and the entire demon race would be tyrannized by him. All the demons had grown up listening to his illustrious reputation. He didn’t even need to do anything to solve all the problems.","Even so, he was very clear about his own strength. The current Core Form Stage, which outsiders thought was the strongest in the world, was only slightly larger than an ant in his eyes that he could casually slap to death. Chu Yunfan’s existence was completely beyond his expectations. A Void Core was not killed by his attack. This in itself was a miracle.","“What a powerful body. I don’t know if you started training right after being born or if you awakened some ancient bloodline, I know it’s not easy for you to reach this level.”","The Great Ancestor Demon looked at Chu Yunfan greedily. If it was before this, Chu Yunfan would probably have become one of his targets. Although Chu Yunfan was a human and he was a demon, it did not matter to him. To him, the distinction between races was bullshit. As long as he could ascend to the clouds and prove his immortality, everything would be meaningful.","Moreover, so what if he possessed the body of a human? It made no difference whether his vessel was a demon or a human.","Chu Yunfan’s physical body was too outstanding, making him drool. After he obtained the possession technique, he secretly kidnapped the top geniuses of the human and demons, but he never made a decision.","This was because the technique he had obtained had a flaw. Once he possessed the body, there would be no second chance, regardless of whether he succeeded or failed.","If he didn’t have hou’s body for him to possess, he would probably have other thoughts. However, there was only a terrifying killing intent in his eyes now, and there was a fierce light flickering in them.","“However, your good luck ends today. Die!”","The Great Ancestor Demon roared and rose from the ground. He turned into a mountain and rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","“Sky Devouring Demons!” The Great Ancestor Demon clawed down.","Chu Yunfan, who was blasted away, was not afraid. He let out a long roar and his entire body was like a meteor. He was not afraid. On the contrary, he faced the difficulty head-on and fought with the Great Ancestor Demon.","Boom!","The collision between the two sides was like a collision between Mars and Earth. They collided in the air and set off a monstrous tide.","After the loud bang, Chu Yunfan flew out like a meteor and was once again sent flying by the Great Ancestor Demon. He flew far away before he finally managed to steady himself. He felt the blood in his body tremble. The strength of the Great Ancestor Demon was far beyond his imagination. If the Great Ancestor Demon was at his peak, Chu Yunfan would have been torn to pieces.","But even so, Chu Yunfan was not afraid. On the contrary, he felt the fighting spirit in his body boil. When he was sent flying, although he was slightly injured, at the same time, the powerful medicinal power of the Brahma Fruit in his body instantly healed his injuries. Not only did it allow him to recover to his peak, but it also allowed him to absorb even more of the Brahma Fruit’s medicinal strength.","In this situation, although he was at a disadvantage, he was not worried. He even felt that the more he fought, the braver he became. Right now, all he could think about was fighting.","In this world, other than the Great Ancestor Demon, there was no one else who could make Chu Yunfan attack with all his strength without any scruples. The Great Ancestor Demon was strong, but this strength made Chu Yunfan feel that this was an opportunity for him to break through. He wanted to stall. Time was on his side, not on the side of the old Great Ancestor Demon.","The Great Ancestor Demon pounced on Chu Yunfan again. His continuous attacks failed to injure Chu Yunfan, which finally made him impatient. All kinds of terrifying attacks fell on Chu Yunfan as if they were free, almost drowning him.","Chu Yunfan did not want to be outdone. The Eight Astonishing Punched, the Nine Netherworld Stomps, the Nine Heavenly Deity Transformations, and many other unique techniques came into play. He was like a god in the sky that shook the world.","In an instant, both sides had collided dozens of times. Chu Yunfan was sent flying dozens of times, hundreds of times, but the more he fought, the braver he became. He kept charging at the Great Ancestor Demon.","At this moment, the demons who had rushed over from all over saw this scene and felt their hair stand on end. They knew that the Great Ancestor Demon was terrifyingly powerful. Which one of them hadn’t grown up hearing about how terrifying the Great Ancestor Demon was? Reality proved that they were right. Even a Core wouldn’t be able to survive a single round against the Great Ancestor Demon.","But the one who truly shocked them was Chu Yunfan. His existence had completely overturned their worldview. If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they would never have imagined that someone could fight the Great Ancestor Demon to this extent.","Chu Yunfan was clearly not in the Golden Core Stage, but he was able to keep on fighting. He was at a disadvantage but not completely defeated. If it were them, they would have died in an instant. It was impossible for them to last until this point.","They looked at Chu Yunfan differently."]},{"number":1563,"title":"Chapter 1563 Stronger and Stronger, Peerless Style","paragraphs":["1563 Stronger and Stronger, Peerless Style","Although the demon kings didn’t dare to interfere in a battle of that level, they looked at Chu Yunfan as a top-tier master instead of an ignorant invader. Although Chu Yunfan seemed to be in a sorry state under the Great Ancestor Demon’s attacks, he was just at a disadvantage.","It was just a small injury, but Chu Yunfan seemed to have completely recovered after turning his head. Therefore, if such injuries could not accumulate into serious injuries, they would be useless.","Even Chu Yunfan’s body was still surging with powerful energy. At this moment, his entire body was like a furnace, constantly spitting out terrifying energy. This energy turned into a torrent in the battle and scattered in all directions.","Without the protection of the enchantment, huge waves were raised above the blood pool in the array. The blood-colored waves were raised to hundreds of feet high. One could imagine how terrifying their power was.","But soon, some of them with sharp eyes noticed that something was wrong. They realized that Chu Yunfan’s aura seemed to be undergoing a transformation every moment. In their perception, he was getting stronger every moment.","Although Chu Yunfan was sent flying, the distance he was sent flying was getting shorter and shorter. Moreover, in a very short time, he was only forced back. Even the Great Ancestor Demon could not send Chu Yunfan flying like before.","It was because of this that they were worried. The Great Ancestor Demon was already old, and it was because of this that he chose to possess the hou. It was because of this that the old didn’t use their body. Whether it was the demons or the humans, these were all wise sayings.","At this point in the battle, how could they not see that the Great Ancestor Demon was no longer as reckless as before? Every time he attacked, he tried his best to accurately control his divine power within a certain small area.","This showed the amazing control of the Great Ancestor Demon’s divine power. However, to them, this also proved that the Great Ancestor Demon was in a difficult situation. In a battle of this level, the consumption of divine power had reached a shocking level. Even an expert at the level of the Great Ancestor Demon could not keep up with his divine power. This forced the Great Ancestor Demon to conserve his mana.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan’s divine power was being unleashed like it was free. At this moment, the physical advantages of the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique were fully reflected. His recovery speed had reached an astonishing speed. He could recover almost any consumption. Coupled with the medicinal effect of the Brahma Fruit, Chu Yunfan was now more like a Golden Core.","“How is this possible? The great ancestor has dominated the world for so many years.”","“Who is this human? How is he so strong?”","“I recognize him. Isn’t he the new number one expert of Great Wei, Chu Yunfan?”","Hearing someone expose Chu Yunfan’s identity, many demons were shocked. They had never thought that this human actually had such an identity.","As a matter of fact, the entire demon league had no interest in the so-called number one expert of the human race. Not to mention the number one expert of Great Wei, even the number one expert of Jingzhanhan was a small fry among the demons.","No matter how arrogant the so-called number one of Great Wei, Yun Huang, was, he did not dare to get too close to the demon league. Otherwise, he would be courting death.","None of them had expected the number one expert of Great Wei to possess such strength. He could fight 300 rounds with their Great Ancestor Demon, and even the Great Ancestor Demon could not do anything to him.","“If this continues, I’m afraid the great ancestor won’t be able to do anything to him. It won’t be good if he escapes. We have to stop him!”","“That’s right, but this beast is fierce. We might not be his match in a one-on-one battle. We have to form an array to deal with him,” one of the demon kings shouted.","All the demon kings nodded. They understood that they might not be a match for Chu Yunfan in a one-on-one fight. Just from the situation where Chu Yunfan fought with the Great Ancestor Demon, it was clear that he could easily beat them up. He could beat them up a hundred times head-on or a hundred times in reverse. It was not difficult at all.","If they did not form an array, they would not be able to deal with Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was sent flying again, but he stopped after sliding for more than 20 meters in the sky. He had been sent flying for more than 1,000 meters in the beginning, but now he was only pushed back by a little after 20 meters. One could imagine the huge transformation.","In the Core Stage, there was a huge difference between each level. There was naturally a huge difference between the Core Form Stage and the Void Core Stage.","He could feel that the barrier of the Core Form Stage was already riddled with holes. The Void Core in his body was condensing at an astonishing speed.","“Hahahaha, Great Ancestor Demon, use whatever methods you have!” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud. The blood in his body boiled, washing away all the impact, causing the divine power in his body to boil.","Youth was the absolute truth.","The Great Ancestor Demon’s eyes were filled with killing intent as he said, “My boy, I’ve roamed the world for so many years, but I’ve never seen a human like you. And you actually dare to use me as your whetstone.”","The Great Ancestor Demon could see that he had been used by Chu Yunfan and had become his whetstone. At the thought of this, he was so angry that he wanted to go crazy. His entire person was extremely violent, and at the same time, there was a deep fear in his eyes. Just this Chu Yunfan was already so difficult to deal with. If he waited for his cultivation to advance, wouldn’t he have the strength to threaten him?","Thinking of this, the killing intent in his heart became even stronger."]},{"number":1564,"title":"Chapter 1564 Two Chu Yunfans? Everyone Was Dumbfounded!","paragraphs":["1564 Two Chu Yunfans? Everyone Was Dumbfounded!","He could not wait any longer and let Chu Yunfan grow. No matter what kind of genius Chu Yunfan was, he was only a meteor if he couldn’t grow.","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan could see countless humans being raised in captivity, like chickens, ducks, cows, and sheep, becoming food for the demons. Thinking of this, his eyes suddenly turned cold and he said, “Great Ancestor Demon, it’s not even certain whether you can defeat me. With me here, you will definitely die.”","Chu Yunfan could feel an extremely powerful aura in his body. He was only one step away from breaking through. Therefore, when he faced the Great Ancestor Demon, he was not afraid.","“You want to kill me? Good ambition!” the Great Ancestor Demon said through gritted teeth. At this moment, his fangs had grown out again. His originally white hair and beard had turned black, and his originally hunched body became taller.","Boom!","A terrifying aura was released from his body, and a great demon of an era truly appeared in front of everyone. This was the peak state of the Great Ancestor Demon. If the previous Great Ancestor Demon only gave Chu Yunfan some pressure, then the current Great Ancestor Demon definitely gave Chu Yunfan more than just pressure. On the contrary, it even made him feel a little suffocated.","That powerful pressure pressed down, and the spirit energy in the entire world stopped. Even breathing felt like it was not allowed.","“How is this possible? Is the great ancestor activating the last of his blood essence and planning to fight for the last time?”","Some demon kings immediately saw through the Great Ancestor Demon’s plan, but they were completely in disbelief. This was because if he did this, with the Great Ancestor Demon’s current lifespan and physical condition, even if he did not die immediately after the battle, he would not be far from death. No matter how they looked at it, he would have to pay a huge price.","“I understand now. The great ancestor must be planning to possess Chu Yunfan. His current body is useless.”","“That’s right. If it’s just possession, it won’t be that easy for the ancestor to use the hou as he pleases.”","“The great ancestor is going all out!”","These demon kings discussed excitedly. They could sense that after this battle, their Great Ancestor Demon would possess the hou and bring the demons to an unprecedented height. It would be a brand new era.","At this time, Chu Yunfan understood the Great Ancestor Demon’s plan. The Great Ancestor Demon clearly sensed that he was using him as a whetstone. Under such circumstances, the Great Ancestor Demon definitely would not sit still.","He could feel how terrifying the old demon was. This was the true peak state of the Great Ancestor Demon. He had broken through and recovered his physical body to its peak state. At the same time, he had rich combat experience. In this state, this demon was ten times more terrifying than when he was young.","It was several times stronger than before, and it instantly gave Chu Yunfan a huge sense of oppression.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was solemn. Suddenly, his pupils constricted slightly. At that moment, a figure appeared in front of him. That figure clawed at him.","Chu Yunfan reacted instinctively and put his hands in front of him.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan felt a huge force coming at him. His entire body was instantly sent flying hundreds of meters away. He felt pain all over his body and felt dizzy. Only then did Chu Yunfan notice that his arms were covered in blood. It was very difficult for the Great Ancestor Demon to hurt him. At most, it was just a small injury.","Although Chu Yunfan’s Imperial Physique and Thunderclap Physique were very strong, the difference in their strength was too great.","“You aren’t dead.”","The figure of the Great Ancestor Demon appeared. He was the one who had made a move just now. In an instant, he had surpassed the limits of everyone’s vision. They only saw Chu Yunfan had been sent flying.","The Great Ancestor Demon was a little surprised. He was aiming for Chu Yunfan’s neck so that he could wring it off in one fell swoop. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would block his attack at the critical moment?","Chu Yunfan’s strength and resistance were a little beyond his imagination.","“However, you will only prolong your life a little and make your struggle to your deathbed even harder.”","After the Great Ancestor Demon returned to his peak, he felt that he was invincible and dominated everything. It had been too long since he had felt this way. It had been so long that he could no longer remember.","However, he knew that he did not have much time left. The most important thing for him was to kill Chu Yunfan and then possess the hou. At that time, everything would be perfect.","His figure flashed, and when he reappeared, he was in front of Chu Yunfan and slapped him.","Boom!","This slap gathered all the murderous aura in the world and sent it flying at Chu Yunfan.","“I don’t believe that even if you’re a turtle shell, you can withstand much.”","Seeing that he couldn’t kill Chu Yunfan in one move, the Great Ancestor Demon became impatient. His eyes flickered with terrifying killing intent.","At this moment, a figure appeared out of thin air and headed in the direction of the hou with lightning speed.","This change came too suddenly. The people who were immersed in the battle between the Great Ancestor Demon and Chu Yunfan didn’t notice it. But the Great Ancestor Demon who had been paying attention to the hou reacted immediately.","“Who are you?! You’re courting death!”","The Great Ancestor Demon was furious and formed a large hand of spirit energy, grabbing at the figure. Waves of golden light erupted from the figure’s body. He wrapped a flag around his body and blocked the large spirit hand.","At this moment, everyone realized that this person was actually another Chu Yunfan and was utterly dumbfounded!"]},{"number":1565,"title":"Chapter 1565 Seizing the Body","paragraphs":["1565 Seizing the Body","All the demon kings were dumbfounded because they realized that this person was another Chu Yunfan. It could be said that he was exactly the same as Chu Yunfan, who was fighting with the Great Ancestor Demon!","‘Could it be twins?’","Such a thought appeared in everyone’s minds.","This person was a little different from Chu Yunfan. His entire body was emitting a divine glow, giving him a feeling that he was not human. He was wrapped in a battle flag. It was this battle flag that had blocked the attack of the Great Ancestor Demon.","On the battle flag, a wolf howled into the sky.","“Isn’t that the Ash Wolf Flag?”","Someone recognized it. If that flag wasn’t the Ash Wolf Flag, then what was it?","Although the Ash Wolf Flag had not been used for a long time, with the power of Jinzhanghan, other forces were not enough to make them so embarrassed that they needed to use the Ash Wolf Flag, except for the demon league.","Not only was Jinzhanghan extremely powerful, but the khan, the Left King, the Right Sage King, and many other experts were also unrivaled in the world. Therefore, it was very rare to use the Ash Wolf Flag. However, this did not mean that the Ash Wolf Flag was not famous. Ordinary people did not know about it. However, although many of the demon kings present were in their prime, they could be considered old demons in terms of human age.","Old demons who were more than a thousand years old were experienced and knowledgeable. Although the Ash Wolf Flag had not been used many times, they were not unfamiliar with it. Those who had never seen it before had heard of it. After being reminded by someone, they immediately recognized it.","Many people did not understand why Jinzhanghan’s Ash Wolf Flag would appear here. It was Jinzhanghan’s national treasure and should not have appeared in the hands of others. Jinzhanghan had an alliance with the demon league. Although everyone knew that this alliance was just a fragile verbal agreement, it was reasonable to say that Jinzhanghan would not fall out so quickly.","The news of Jinzhanghan besieging the capital of Great Wei and being killed by Chu Yunfan had not reached here yet, so they did not know that Jinzhanghan had failed. However, this was enough for them to find it strange.","The demons quickly reacted. No matter what Chu Yunfan’s goal was, two Chu Yunfans had appeared at this time. They must be up to something.","“Stop him!”","The Great Ancestor Demon immediately knew that things were not good. When Chu Yunfan had just appeared, he had already reacted. Chu Yunfan must have a big goal. No matter what Chu Yunfan’s goal was, he definitely could not let him achieve it.","These demon kings were stunned for a moment before they reacted. They roared and pounced on the second Chu Yunfan. The second Chu Yunfan waved the Ash Wolf Flag. A huge golden wolf condensed out of thin air and rushed toward these demon kings.","Boom!","After a loud bang, the huge golden wolf was blown up. There were too many demon kings who attacked, and there was no lack of Core Formers. Moreover, there were quite a number of them. Therefore, no matter how strong this golden wolf was, it could not withstand it and was blown up.","However, in that instant, Chu Yunfan’s entire body was glowing with golden light. Then, he suddenly rushed into the hou’s body.","At this moment, everyone understood Chu Yunfan’s goal. Without a doubt, his goal was the hou. They could only watch helplessly as Chu Yunfan entered the hou’s body. They were instantly stunned. They did not know how Chu Yunfan did it.","However, someone quickly reacted.","“That Chu Yunfan doesn’t have a physical body. He’s just an energy clone!”","Everyone immediately reacted. If it were an energy clone, it would be different. Now, only a body as huge as a small mountain was left. In fact, its primordial spirit had almost been worn down by the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle.","This was the best time to seize the body.","No one had expected that Chu Yunfan would take advantage of the situation.","“D*mn it!”","The Great Ancestor Demon immediately reacted. The anger in his heart could not help but erupt. He had worked so hard to prepare these things for god knows how many years, but now, they were actually being plucked by someone.","“You’re courting death!”","The Great Ancestor Demon roared and clawed at Chu Yunfan. The demons roared and the earth shook.","At this moment, the Great Ancestor Demon no longer felt that victory was in his grasp. Previously, he was certain that even if this body was finished, he could still possess the hou, so he did not panic. Now, the physical body he had prepared was taken away by Chu Yunfan’s clone. One could imagine the anger in his heart.","Chu Yunfan kept retreating, but the Great Ancestor Demon’s claws kept following him, wanting to crush him into pieces. He had no choice but to gather all his strength and form the Eight Astonishing Punches.","Boom!","At the moment of collision, Chu Yunfan’s eight heavenly dragons were smashed into pieces. After the difference in strength reached a certain level, it was not something that martial techniques could make up for.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan was sent flying like a shooting star.","However, Chu Yunfan was not depressed at all. A smile appeared on his face because the one who had just attacked was none other than his Ash Fire Physique. At the crucial moment, he released his Ash Fire Physique. This was the only way to stop the Great Ancestor Demon from possessing the hou.","The Ash Fire Physique was not made of flesh and blood and there was his primordial soul inside. Of course, the Great Ancestor Demon could also possess it, but this Ash Fire Physique would cripple him.","However, Chu Yunfan did not regret it. Being able to possess a hou would undoubtedly benefit him in the future.","Spurt!","Chu Yunfan spat out a mouthful of blood from the corner of his mouth. His entire body was trembling, and the surface of his skin was cracking.","“Die!”","The Great Ancestor Demon roared. But this time, his target was the hou. He wanted to grab Chu Yunfan’s Ash Fire Physique from the hou before it could fuse with it.","“I’m your opponent. Unless I die, you won’t be able to pass!”","Suddenly, his vision blurred. He didn’t know when Chu Yunfan had appeared in front of him."]},{"number":1566,"title":"Chapter 1566 Breakthrough to the Core Form Stage!","paragraphs":["1566 Breakthrough to the Core Form Stage!","Chu Yunfan stood in front of the Great Ancestor Demon with his battered body. His skin which had been shattered was recovering at an astonishing speed. At this moment, the strength of his physical body was undoubtedly displayed.","“Ancestor of All Demons!” the Great Ancestor Demon roared, and the divine power in his body boiled. It turned into countless demon shadows and swept toward Chu Yunfan.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan was not afraid. He was not afraid when he fought with the Great Ancestor Demon, but the result was that he was sent flying.","Blood spurted out of his body as if he was bathed in blood.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","In his anger, the Great Ancestor Demon did not hold back. He kept bombarding Chu Yunfan. No matter how far he hid, it was useless.","“I’m going to kill you!”","Chu Yunfan’s body was almost shattered.","“D*mn it, how can this be? One last hit, just one last hit!” Chu Yunfan roared repeatedly. He could feel that the mana in his body had reached the point where it would cause a qualitative change. That was the key point of the true transformation. He was only one step away, and he was about to take that step.","But at the same time, he had also been severely injured by the Great Ancestor Demon. After the Great Ancestor Demon recovered to his peak, his combat strength was no longer the same as before. Chu Yunfan could not pose any threat to him.","“Die!”","The Great Ancestor Demon’s face revealed a ferocious expression. A blood-red claw clawed at Chu Yunfan. Suddenly, the entire sky seemed to explode. The Great Ancestor Demon knew that this was the last blow. It was enough to seriously injure or even kill Chu Yunfan.","He still had to hurry to get Chu Yunfan’s Ash Fire Physique out of the hou. If he waited too long, he wouldn’t be able to make it in time.","Suddenly, at this critical moment, a huge furry claw descended from the sky. This furry claw covered the sky and covered the earth, like a cloud that covered the sky, shielding Chu Yunfan.","The Great Ancestor Demon’s attack landed on the furry claw, but it was repelled. It could not pose any threat to the furry claw.","“What is it? What’s that?”","The Great Ancestor Demon turned his head in anger and saw that the hou, which was restrained by countless huge chains above the blood pool, had attacked. The hou had managed to break free from some of the chains and protect Chu Yunfan.","The Great Ancestor Demon immediately reacted. His anger instantly erupted. There could only be one reason why the hou suddenly moved. It was because Chu Yunfan’s Ash Fire Physique was controlling it, which blocked his attack at the critical moment and allowed Chu Yunfan to escape.","There was still a chance to catch Chu Yunfan.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would use the truth to slap him in the face? The truth was not what he had thought before.","Chu Yunfan’s Ash Fire Physique had only been in there for a short while, and he was already able to control the hou to forcefully break free from a portion of the chains. How amazing was that?","The hou’s hand was immediately pulled back and pulled down by the chain. This chain was one with the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle. It was to prevent the hou from suddenly attacking.","“You’re dead meat. I don’t believe you can dodge a second time!” The Great Ancestor Demon glared at Chu Yunfan with a fierce look in his eyes.","“The second time? I don’t need a second time!” Chu Yunfan’s cold voice was heard.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan and saw that he had stood up. The cracks on his body were healing at an alarming speed. His aura was growing stronger. If it was said that Chu Yunfan’s strength seemed to have been blocked just now, then now, his strength suddenly broke through something. It was endless and kept rising.","Everyone could clearly see that Chu Yunfan’s divine power was constantly rising.","“Then let’s try!”","The Great Ancestor Demon attacked at lightning speed. Another move, the Ancestor of All Demons, swept out. The huge blood-red claws destroyed everything. He was already a little anxious because he could feel that his life force was decreasing. Every time he attacked, he would consume a lot of his already small life force. If it wasn’t for Chu Yunfan forcing him to a dead end, he wouldn’t have wanted to do this.","Boom!","But this time, everyone was surprised to find that Chu Yunfan was not sent flying. Chu Yunfan managed to block the Great Ancestor Demon’s lightning-fast attack.","Thud, thud, thud!","Chu Yunfan took seven steps back before he finally stopped. However, everyone had already seen the difference. Chu Yunfan had been directly sent flying earlier. He was not a match for the Great Ancestor Demon. However, this time, Chu Yunfan was able to block him and was only forced back seven steps. The gap between them was simply impossible to calculate.","“How is this possible? What changes have happened to his body?” someone exclaimed as they looked at Chu Yunfan.","They saw that Chu Yunfan’s divine power did not weaken after taking the attack of the Great Ancestor Demon. Instead, it became even stronger. It was like a rocket that kept rising. Everyone’s expression changed. Although Chu Yunfan’s aura was terrifying, it was still within their reach.","However, this time, Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough started to have a similar aura to the Great Ancestor Demon. It was a suffocating and invincible feeling.","“He can’t have broken through, right?”","Some people suddenly felt like Chu Yunfan was about to make a breakthrough on the battlefield and had treated the Great Ancestor Demon as a whetstone. Previously, they could still laugh it off, but now, they were like ducks with their necks grabbed. They looked at the scene in front of them with their mouths agape.","Chu Yunfan actually did it, not bragging, not going crazy, and not jumping over a wall in desperation. He actually pulled off a miracle!"]},{"number":1567,"title":"Chapter 1567 Killing the Great Ancestor Demon","paragraphs":["1567 Killing the Great Ancestor Demon","Breaking through on the battlefield was a small probability, especially in such an intense battle. Every minute and every second could determine life and death. Chu Yunfan actually dared to do this. In the eyes of others, he was forced to do this by the Great Ancestor Demon. He was basically a cornered beast that would fight like a cornered dog.","After Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough, his combat strength had undergone a tremendous change. It was a qualitative change.","Chu Yunfan smiled. He had finally succeeded. Although he had broken through on the battlefield, it was a miracle for others. For him, it was not the first time he had encountered such a thing. In fact, it could be said that he was familiar with it.","He was already prepared.","And now, he had finally condensed the illusory core into a solid body. This was the Core Form Stage of the Core Stages. At this point, whether it was the degree of condensation of the divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body or the thickness of the divine power, there were earth-shaking changes.","At the same time, his combat strength had completed a breakthrough and charged into the Golden Core Stage. Finally, he had the strength to fight, and he was in the same realm as the Great Ancestor Demon.","At this moment, he felt that the Great Ancestor Demon was no longer as powerful as he had been in the beginning where he felt that his life was threatened. On the contrary, the Great Ancestor Demon was no longer mysterious in his eyes.","“You actually broke through?” The Great Ancestor Demon realized that he had been used as a whetstone, and Chu Yunfan had actually broken through.","Wasn’t this a slap to his face?","Thinking of this, for some reason, other than anger, he actually felt a little terrified.","The Chu Yunfan in front of him was unfathomable. Although he had just broken through, he gave off a powerful aura that was as deep as the ocean. If he was in his prime, he would not be afraid of a little kid like Chu Yunfan who had just entered the Golden Core Stage. However, his current peak was only obtained by sacrificing his lifespan. It was impossible for him to last long.","Now that his only way out had been cut off by Chu Yunfan, he was no longer as calm as before. There was only one reason why he could be so calm, and that was because he thought he had everything under control. However, now that Chu Yunfan had used the truth to slap him in the face, he instantly panicked.","“It’s you! It’s all your fault! You deserve to die!” the Great Ancestor Demon said through gritted teeth.","The corner of Chu Yunfan’s mouth curled up slightly as he said, “Your biggest mistake was to not let me breakthrough. Yes, your strength is above mine, but at this time, do you think it’s meaningful? Even if you drag it out, you have to die!”","Chu Yunfan was clear in his heart because he knew very well that the Great Ancestor Demon was burning his life. At his level, how much life could he burn?","On the contrary, Chu Yunfan was at an unprecedented level of strength. His injuries were healing rapidly, and his divine power was still growing. He could feel that after breaking through the bottleneck, he was getting stronger every moment.","On one side, the sun was setting and the mountains were constantly weakening, while on the other side, the sun was rising and becoming stronger. The result was obvious.","“I can still kill you now!”","The Great Ancestor Demon roared. At this moment, his eyes were red. He no longer had the calm demeanor from before. He wanted nothing more than to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces.","At the thought of this, he let out a roar and appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. Then, his claw slashed down. This claw covered the sky, but at the same time, it was unimaginably fast.","Only a bloody light had grabbed Chu Yunfan’s body.","But this time, Chu Yunfan’s reaction speed was extremely fast. In an instant, he had already reacted. He punched the Great Ancestor Demon’s claw, and the sound was like the sound of metal colliding.","“Come, let me bury you with my strongest strength!” Chu Yunfan said loudly. A pair of thunder wings spread out from his back, and the divine power in his body boiled like the sea.","“Your era is over, so let me bury it!”","“As you wish!”","The Great Ancestor Demon was furious. All kinds of terrifying attacks fell on Chu Yunfan as if they were free.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, was not in a hurry. His speed was extremely fast, especially with the support of the thunder wings on his back. His speed was not inferior to the Great Ancestor Demon’s, or even faster. It was not like before when he was not a match at all and could only be beaten passively. There was already a fundamental difference.","Chu Yunfan’s entire body was wrapped in blue lightning. His entire body was like a blue lightning storm. On the other side, the Great Ancestor Demon was surrounded by a ball of blood-red energy, like a blood-red storm.","The two of them collided in the sky. The speed had already surpassed the limits of everyone’s imagination. Even the Core Former demon kings could barely keep up. Void Core demon kings could not see the battle at all, let alone Divine demon kings. They were completely blind.","They could only see two completely different energies colliding in the sky.","In the beginning, the red energy had the upper hand. However, they slowly realized that the blue lightning was slowly shifting the situation back to a balance.","“Will the great ancestor fail?”","Someone couldn’t help but say. Although it was a little disrespectful to say this at this time, everyone couldn’t help but have this thought in their hearts.","Chu Yunfan’s performance was too strong. He was so strong that they felt that the invincible golden body of the Great Ancestor Demon might be broken today.","These demon kings knew very well that the Great Ancestor Demon who burned his life force would only become weaker and weaker, while Chu Yunfan would become stronger and stronger. The longer the battle dragged out, the more disadvantageous it would be for the Great Ancestor Dmeon.","Thinking of this, they could not help but worry.","At this moment, there was a huge collision sound in the sky. Immediately after, everyone saw a blood-red figure being sent flying. It was impossible to maintain that high-intensity battle.","Everyone focused their eyes. Who else could that person be but the Great Ancestor Demon?","Everyone was shocked. They saw the Great Ancestor Demon spit out a mouthful of blood and wanted to fight, but Chu Yunfan had already appeared in front of him. Chu Yunfan stomped on the Great Ancestor Demon and instantly killed him."]},{"number":1568,"title":"Chapter 1568 Pacifying the Ultimate West Demon League","paragraphs":["1568 Pacifying the Ultimate West Demon League","Chu Yunfan stomped on the Great Ancestor Demon and tore him into pieces. The Great Ancestor Demon’s strong and powerful body was instantly turned into dust.","There was nothing left.","The Great Ancestor Demon’s life force was already running out and had been forcefully stimulated. Therefore, once he died, he completed collapsed.","The demons were completely dumbfounded. What had they seen? The Great Ancestor Demon, who had never been defeated, had died. Chu Yunfan had even stomped him into dust. To them, this was unprecedented.","“Kill him and avenge the great ancestor!”","Someone shouted, and dozens of figures flew toward Chu Yunfan. These figures were all Cores. Their eyes were red. They were those who had a close relationship with the Great Ancestor Demon. And seeing Chu Yunfan kill the Great Ancestor Demon in one fell swoop, how could they endure it? They roared and pounced over.","Chu Yunfan sneered and looked at them. He swung the Monster Vanquisher. A sword light poured out like mercury. These Core Stage experts who were flying toward them didn’t have time to dodge or react.","They had never seen Chu Yunfan use the Monster Vanquisher before, so they did not understand how terrifying it was. With just a single strike, the demons that were pouncing over screamed and exploded. Their bodies were turned into a bloody mist.","Chu Yunfan had only attacked once!","The remaining demons felt that it was difficult to breathe. Under Chu Yunfan’s gaze, they felt that it was difficult to breathe. Even movement became difficult. When they faced Chu Yunfan again, it was as if they were facing a peerless god. Just one look was enough to make them feel that even breathing was difficult.","‘Run!’","This was the only thought left in their minds. Nothing else was important.","“Since you’re here, don’t leave. Today, all of you will pay with your lives for the tens of millions of blood debt,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","The hundreds and thousands of demons and demon kings before him fled in all directions.","If it was just an ordinary monsters killing humans, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t care. This was the way of the world. But using humans as blood sacrifices touched Chu Yunfan’s bottom line.","He raised his right arm high, and the Monster Vanquisher flew up into the air. In an instant, it swept out countless sword lights. These sword lights split up and chased in all directions. Their targets were the demons and demon kings. It was as if they had eyes.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","The sword light swept across the sky and blasted into the demons and demon kings. They exploded in the air and turned into blood rain that fell into the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle. The demon kings and demons all had looks of disbelief on their faces. They never thought that they would be killed by Chu Yunfan without even being able to escape. They were no different from the tens of millions of humans who had been captured and sacrificed by them.","In their eyes, those tens of millions of people were just a bunch of ants, and in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, they were no different. They were nothing more than slightly bigger ants.","Chu Yunfan shook his head. He looked down on these demon kings. At his level of cultivation, although he was only in the Core Form Stage, his combat strength far exceeded their imagination. Every step in the Core Stage was like the difference between heaven and earth.","To him, these demons were no better than ants. If they joined forces, they might still pose a threat to him, but if they scattered and fled, they would really give their lives to Chu Yunfan. A quantitative change would lead to a qualitative change, but when Chu Yunfan’s personal strength reached an unprecedented height, the quantity was not worth mentioning.","Chu Yunfan didn’t pay much attention and simply took out the nuclear missile launcher from the Mountain River Diagram. After a few nuclear missiles were fired, a few mushroom clouds surged up. Without the protection of the barrier, the Blood and Spirit Revival Circle was destroyed. Countless vengeful spirits no longer rolled and howled because they were no longer bound by the array. They disappeared into the sky.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know if they had gone to reincarnate or if they had disappeared from this world. It was unknown if there was an afterlife. Even the powerful emperors of the Ancient Zenith Civilization had limited understanding of death. They could not live forever and would never understand it.","As for Chu Yunfan, he didn’t believe in the afterlife. He only believed in the present world and himself. But no matter what, anything was better than these spirits being locked up here and suffer endless torture to provide power for the array.","This was the only thing Chu Yunfan could do for them.","Chu Yunfan breathed a sigh of relief. The energy storm that was sweeping out like a storm was extinguished bit by bit and returned to his body. This meant that he had completely stabilized his Core Form Stage cultivation. His divine power could be freely released and used without being affected.","After this battle, the Ultimate West Demon League was completely pacified. Chu Yunfan did not intend to massacre the entire demon league or uproot them. However, in this battle, he had slaughtered at least 80% of the demons, especially the top experts of the half-step Golden Core Stage. Even the Golden Cores were slaughtered.","The demon league had suffered a great loss and could no longer pose a threat to the human world. It was now useless. It would take many years for it to recover to its peak. Before that, it could only wait and hide.","This was all Chu Yunfan could do.","“Now that this matter is over, it’s time to leave and search for Siyu.”","After pacifying Jinzhanghan and the demon league, Great Wei’s power was unstoppable, and he could leave with peace of mind. From then on, the sea was wide and the fish jumped, and the sky was high and the birds flew."]},{"number":1569,"title":"Chapter 1569 The World Was Shocked, the Heroes Were Aware","paragraphs":["1569 The World Was Shocked, the Heroes Were Aware","The news that Chu Yunfan had pacified the demon league quickly spread to the outside world. They couldn’t hide this fact. The remaining demon kings were afraid that Chu Yunfan would continue to hunt them down, so they simply handed over their surrender.","First, the demon league suddenly launched an attack and attacked the western border of Great Wei. Countless casualties, numbering in the tens of millions, shook the world. Although the factions were different, at this moment, everyone felt the pain.","After all, humans were afraid that the tide set off by the demon league would sweep the world. If that was the case, it would be very difficult for the humans who were independent to resist such a demon tide. And just as the major forces were paying close attention to this matter, they heard that Jinzhanghan had sent tens of millions of cavalry south to surround the capital of Great Wei. For a moment, the world was in chaos. No one had expected Jinzhanghan to do such a thing.","Great Qi was immediately on full alert. After all, after Jinzhanghan destroyed Great Wei, the world had already been divided into two thirds, and the remaining Great Qi would be unable to support it alone.","Great Qi immediately made the decision to go south to rescue Great Wei. Who would have thought that before the army had even crossed the border, they would receive news that Jinzhanghan’s army of ten million had been destroyed and that less than a million had fled back to the northern grasslands.","The world was instantly shook.","No one could understand why the army of 10 million had just disappeared. Even if a Core were to kill 10 million pigs, it would take a long time, let alone an elite army of 10 million soldiers. Just the powerful blood energy surging from the army of tens of millions was enough to make ordinary Cores retreat and not dare to approach.","In the end, they were completely annihilated in one battle. The world was shocked.","Soon after, more news spread out. It seemed that the number one expert of Great Wei had used some kind of peerless magic tool to wipe out most of the army in one fell swoop. Great Wei did not even suffer much losses.","In this battle, all the experts of Jinzhanghan were wiped out. It was said that the top successors of Jinzhanghan, the Left King and the Right King, were all dead. The person who killed them was none other than Chu Yunfan.","He became famous overnight.","Although Chu Yunfan was already famous before, he was only relatively famous in Great Wei. In other regions, his reputation was not well-known. Many people had never even heard of him. However, with this battle, Chu Yunfan had established his position as the number one expert throughout the land.","Even the number one expert in the world, the khan of Jinzhanghan, had been defeated by Chu Yunfan in front of everyone. One could imagine how prestigious Chu Yunfan was.","When the news spread, Chu Yunfan’s title as the number one expert was confirmed. Especially after the defeat of the khan, there was no one else in this corner of the world that could compete with Chu Yunfan.","Great Wei took this opportunity to pursue Jinzhanghan and invaded its territory. In a short time, it had swallowed up more than half of Jinzhanghan’s territory.","And before they could digest this news, they were shocked to find that the Ultimate West Demon League, which had stirred up the world and was about to sweep the world, had surrendered.","They wanted to submit to Great Wei!","Everyone was speechless and dumbfounded. The surrender of the demon league was something that no one had expected since ancient times. The demon league had existed before the establishment of the three kingdoms. It had a style of being unmoved no matter what kind of means. Even if the three great human countries were gathered together, they still might not be able to deal with the demon league. Therere had never been news of the demon league surrendering to a human kingdom.","Everyone was stunned. They did not know why things had turned out this way. Even the people of Great Wei were completely dumbfounded. They saw the countless demons that had been wreaking havoc at the western border retreat into back to the Ultimate West Demon League in an orderly manner.","Before they could understand what had happened, news came from the Ultimate West Demon League. Chu Yunfan had infiltrated the league and killed the league master and the rumored Great Ancestor Demon. Moreover, he had killed more than 70% of the top experts of the demon league.","The demon league, which was known to have many experts, had suffered heavy losses. Under such circumstances, to avoid Chu Yunfan’s pursuit, they surrendered.","In addition to surrendering, to appease Great Wei’s anger, or maybe to appease Chu Yunfan, the demons handed over more than five billion low-grade spirit stones. They piled up into a mountain and were sent to the Imperial Capital of Great Wei. This was a massive treasure. Though the demon league was well-off, this was considered a huge amount.","After this series of events, everyone suddenly realized that Great Wei did not suffer a great loss of vitality and decline as many people thought. On the contrary, its strength had improved greatly. They had even expanded their northern borders. It had two out of three parts of the world and suddenly became a big country that attracted the attention of the world.","Originally, Great Qi had mobilized its army to help Great Wei. But now, everything had suddenly changed. They now had to prevent Great Wei from pushing their victory and attacking Great Qi, destroying Great Qi in one fell swoop. Even though Great Wei was not strong enough to do that, just destroying Jinzhanghan was already too much for them.","The man standing behind Great Wei made all the major forces look sideways and instantly lose their voices. If Chu Yunfan were to make a move, Great Wei might have a chance to unify the world. After all, that man had single-handedly destroyed millions of horsemen of Jinzhanghan. Such a glorious battle record was as unreal as a myth."]},{"number":1570,"title":"Chapter 1570 The Demons’ Tribute, Becoming Rich Overnight","paragraphs":["1570 The Demons’ Tribute, Becoming Rich Overnight","For a time, the world was shocked and all the heroes looked to them.","Everyone looked over.","There had never been an existence of such a level before. One person could single-handedly destroy a country, bring a country to the peak, and casually destroy an extremely powerful country. Although he was not a god, to the heroes of the world, he was no different from a god.","It was rumored that Chu Yunfan had already surpassed the Core Form Stage and reached the Golden Core Stage. However, rumors were just rumors. No one could verify it, and Chu Yunfan did not announce any news to the public.","Just as everyone was discussing animatedly, Chu Yunfan returned to the capital of Great Wei. In the back garden of the imperial advisor’s Residence in the capital of Great Wei, Chu Yunfan and the emperor of Great Wei, Wei Wuji, sat opposite each other.","“Delightful! Truly delightful!” Wei Wuji laughed loudly. Though a few days had passed, thinking about things now still made him feel very happy.","Being the emperor, he had always been unhappy. It could be said that he was very aggrieved. Outside, there was a giant like Jinzhanghan eyeing them covetously, and inside, there were many vassals who did not listen to their orders. There were many internal and external troubles.","Some people had long wanted to raise an army to rebel, but now, all of this had been resolved. With this series of great victories, Wei Wuji had expanded Great Wei’s territory by more than double. Although most of it was grassland, this was also an illustrious feat that surpassed the ancestors. It was unprecedented. And all of this was brought about by Master Chu. Thinking of this, Wei Wuji couldn’t help but put on a respectful expression.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about Wei Wuji’s flattery. He just smiled and didn’t say anything.","“Thank you, Master Chu. Great Wei would have been overturned if not for you.” Wei Wuji stood up and bowed deeply to Chu Yunfan.","“You’re too polite, Your Majesty. I only did what I should,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“Master Chu, I represent all living beings in bowing to you. Without you, I’m afraid the entire human world would be overturned. It would not only be the life and death of Great Wei, but the life and death of the entire human world,” Wei Wuji said.","He didn’t know much about the Ultimate West Demon League, and Chu Yunfan didn’t say much either. However, judging from the situation that was revealed, it was definitely extremely dangerous. No one except Chu Yunfan could pacify such chaos.","Chu Yunfan accepted the bow and said, “Your Majesty, now that the world has been settled, the rest will depend on you.”","Chu Yunfan saw that Wei Wuji seemed to have something to say and immediately understood his thoughts. There was a very strong discussion outside now, hoping that Chu Yunfan would help Great Wei defeat Great Qi in one fell swoop and unify the entire world. If he could do it, it would be an unprecedented golden age.","After the Violet Thunder Swords, the human world had been divided for countless years. Now, not only the people, but even Wei Wuji had such thoughts.","However, Chu Yunfan rejected him. He was not a nanny and had no intention of helping Great Wei do everything.","“Your Majesty, I’m sure you understand that Great Wei’s national strength is limited. Forcefully swallowing Great Qi will not be a good thing. On the contrary, if you develop your current territory well, you’ll have the strength to be proud in a few years. There’s no need to rush,” Chu Yunfan said.","Wei Wuji smiled embarrassedly. He understood Chu Yunfan’s intention. Chu Yunfan had no intention of helping him. He was a little regretful, but he also let out a sigh of relief. It was clear from this that Chu Yunfan didn’t have many thoughts about worldly affairs.","“Oh right, the demon league has sent over many tributes. I don’t dare to keep them. Although they’re said to be for Great Wei, I know that they’re realy for you, Master Chu,” Wei Wuji said and handed over a spatial ring. The tributes that the demons had given were inside the ring.","Chu Yunfan didn’t argue. He took the ring and scanned it with his divine will. He immediately found that there were mountains of low-grade spirit stones inside. Five billion low-grade spirit stones were endless, like mountains and seas. In addition to all kinds of natural treasures, Chu Yunfan calculated its value and estimated it was worth more than ten billion low-grade spirit stones.","Even with the demons’s foundation, this was considered a serious injury.","For Chu Yunfan, the most urgent thing at the moment was spirit stones. The herb mountain in the Mountain River Diagram was constantly operating, and the number of spirit stones needed was simply unimaginable for ordinary people.","He was constantly comprehending new techniques and the divine dao. He had to cooperate with the godhead in his mind, and the godhead consumed a large amount of spirit energy.","The series of wars had also exhausted his spirit stones. Now, the demons had sent so many spirit stones and all kinds of natural treasures, including many precious herbs, which were exactly what Chu Yunfan needed.","For Chu Yunfan, who had inherited the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, with these herbs, he could refine many pills in large quantities. Many of them were even urgently needed by Chu Yunfan. After he stabilized his current realm, he would need to make a further breakthrough. He did not have as much time as ordinary people to make breakthroughs.","“This will do nicely.” Chu Yunfan nodded. Since the demon league knew the rules so well, he would not continue chasing after the demon kings. With Chu Yunfan’s current strength, it was impossible to kill all the demons but he was still confident in killing the Cores among the demons.","“By the way, Your Majesty, I have something to entrust you with,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Go ahead, Master Chu. As long as you ask for it, I will mobilize the power of the entire country to do it for you,” Wei Wuji said.","“Please help me gather any and all of information regarding the Violet Thunder Swords, as well as related ancient records. I want to know how exactly the Violet Thunder Swords managed to conquer the outer region powers back then,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“Alright, I will arrange for someone to do it at once,” Wei Wuji said.","He thought that Chu Yunfan would make some kind of request. He was not expecting Chu Yunfan to ask him to collect some useless information.","“In that case, I won’t keep Your Majesty,” Chu Yunfan said, “I’ll take my leave.”"]},{"number":1571,"title":"Chapter 1571 A Year Later, Foreign Visitors!","paragraphs":["1571 A Year Later, Foreign Visitors!","In the capital of Great Wei, the wind and clouds were surging, especially after Chu Yunfan returned. This place had become the focus of everyone’s attention. However, to everyone’s surprise, while everyone was discussing him and seeing what else he would do to stir up the world, Chu Yunfan announced that he was going into seclusion.","Ignoring everyone’s eagerness to know what had happened in the demon league, he announced his secluded cultivation. In the past, no one dared to disturb his seclusion. Now that he had confirmed his position as number one, no one dared to disturb him.","In the blink of an eye, a year passed. Time flew by. It had been a year since the world was in turmoil. With the buffer of more than a year, everyone was able to accept this series of changes.","After more than a year, Jinzhanghan had been destroyed and Great Wei become a behemoth that owned more than two-thirds of the world. In the process, the Ultimate West Demon League had blocked all their borders as if they were going to close their kingdom.","The previous battle was undoubtedly a catastrophe for the demon league. Countless demon kings had died, and without the suppression of the league master and the Great Ancestor Demon, the demon league welcomed a reshuffling.","However, the human world did not care about this. They could only see the soldiers of Great Qi gathering at the border, but in the end, they did not dare to clash head-on with Great Wei.","Great Qi and Great Wei didn’t send troops to fight for the territory of Jinzhanghan as many people had predicted. Everyone understood that Great Qi was afraid of the terrifying existence who could single-handedly wipe out tens of millions of horsemen of Jinzhanghan, even though he was in seclusion.","For martial artists, secluded cultivation or coming out of seclusion was nothing more than a matter of a word.","One year was enough for Great Wei to finish taking over Jinzhanghan. The country’s strength increased greatly, and the whole world had fell into an unprecedented peace. The various forces digested what they had obtained, those who were afraid of not appearing licked their wounds, and the world was peaceful. The people could finally accept the destruction of the powerful Jinzhanghan and the power of Great Wei.","However, at this moment, at the extreme end of the world, waves of fluctuations appeared in the sky. Above the sky, there was a huge barrier that wrapped the entire world within.","That was the end of the world, a limit that no one could reach.","In the sky, after waves of fluctuations, some figures appeared in the sky one after another. These people all carried a faint and incomparably powerful aura. With their strength, they could hold up the sky.","“Hahahaha, I’m finally here. The Violet Thunder Sword Domain. This is the Violet Thunder Sword Domain!”","A figure laughed. Behind him, more and more figures appeared in this world. He didn’t stay long. He and other half dozen people stepped on the light and flew into the distance as fast as lightning. The figures that appeared behind him also disappeared in groups of twos and threes.","The entire sky rippled like water. It was the ripples caused by the spatial fluctuations.","At this moment, in the north of Jinzhanghan, deep in a boundless desert, a group of people were walking through the endless sandstorm. At a glance, these people were extremely strange. The sandstorm that was enough to sweep away ferocious beasts did not have any effect on them at all. It didn’t even reach within one meter of them.","If the shepherds nearby saw this, they would probably be scared to death. The shepherds in the north called this place the Demon Desert. There were demons living in the desert.","This desert environment was extremely harsh. During the day, the temperature could be several hundred degrees, enough to melt everything. At night, it was dozens of degrees below zero. Even powerful martial artists rarely came here because the harsh environment here was unbearable. When the temperature was high, their bodies would be ignited. When the temperature was low, the divine power in them would be frozen. It was a desolate area.","However, a group of people had arrived in the desert today. This group of people were all youngsters in their twenties or thirties. They were dressed smartly as if they were royalty. They had extremely powerful auras on them. The extremely harsh environment here did not make them frown in the slightest and walked across the sand without leaving a single footprint.","Everything was surreal.","“Are we going the right way? The environment here is so harsh. Is this the place we’re looking for?” a young girl who looked about eighteen or nineteen said in a reproachful tone.","Although the harsh environment here was not enough to pose a threat to her, the endless sand made her a little annoyed.","“We can’t be wrong. According to the information we received from the descendant of the Violet Thunder Swords, the ruins should be here,” a handsome man who looked about 27 or 28 answered. His face was slightly pale. “I wonder if the ruins are still intact after so many years.”","“It’s hard to say. It might have been taken over by the natives here,” a young man in his thirties said.","He was the oldest among these people, and he looked the most muscular.","“Impossible. According to the information we got, the natives here are too weak. There are very few Core Formers among them. How could they open the ruins?” another man with a pointed mouth and ruddy cheeks said.","“The natives of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain have been isolated from the outside world for too long.”","Everyone’s gaze turned to the last person in the group. He was a young man in white who was about twenty-four or twenty-five. This young man was the true leader among these people.","“According to what the descendant of the Violet Thunder Swords said, it shouldn’t be far from here,” the white-robed youth said, “However, we have to be careful after entering. Although the strength of the natives here is average, Violet Thunder Swords was once a prominent sect. We have no choice but to be careful of the trump cards they left behind.”","“We’re here. I can feel the traces of the barrier!”"]},{"number":1572,"title":"Chapter 1572 Slapping a Half-Step Gold Core to Death","paragraphs":["1572 Slapping a Half-Step Gold Core to Death","The white-robed young man began to form a seal, and his divine power turned into threads that scattered into the air. After a while, a huge barrier appeared in front of everyone.","The ruddy man, the muscular man, the pale-faced man, and the young girl made their moves. They formed complicated seals and attacked the barrier, opening a huge gap. Everyone hurriedly flew into the cave and disappeared. When they reappeared, they had already entered another space.","“It really is a different world.”","At this moment, everyone looked around. As expected, they had entered another space. Unlike the extremely harsh environment in the outside world, this space was filled with spring flowers and beautiful scenery.","“Thank goodness we prepared talismans. Otherwise, we might have been injured.”","The ruddy man took out a talisman from above his head. The orange-yellow talisman was covered in cracks. There was also talismans above the heads of the others. They were engraved with complicated patterns and had the power of magical rules, giving them the ability to resist the fluctuations of space.","“This place is different from the outside world. The concentration of spirit energy here is at least several times that of the outside world. Cultivating here is yields twice the result with half the effort,” the muscular young man said.","He looked around and felt that the concentration of spirit energy was completely different from outside.","“That harsh environment of the northern desert has something to do with this barrier. The spirit energy outside has been drawn into this array, so there’s no spirit energy to nourish the outside world, which is why such a harsh environment came to be,” the girl surmised. She looked young, but she had a lot of experience.","“But according to the information we received, no one has come to this barrier for a long time. It’s continuously drawing the spirit energy, so the concentration of spirit energy here should be much higher than this,” the pale-faced man said.","The others realized that something was wrong. This was not consistent with the information they had received. According to the information, the spirit energy within this barrier should be so dense that it was liquefied or even higher. But from the looks of it now, it was not that dense.","All of a sudden, they felt that the surrounding spirit energy flow toward the center of the barrier like flowing water. Everyone looked at each other and immediately made a decision. They hurriedly headed toward the center of the barrier.","From afar, they saw a cocoon-like existence in the center of the barrier. Outside this cocoon, countless spirit energy was constantly rotating as if forming a storm. The storm formed by spirit energy was being absorbed into the cocoon bit by bit.","“What is that?” the girl exclaimed.","“Someone is absorbing the spirit energy inside the barrier. Someone got here first.” The white-robed young man’s expression fell.","They all opened their third eye and discovered that this cocoon was made up of spirit energy. It was formed out of the endless spirit energy floating around it. In the center of this cocoon was a figure that was faintly discernible.","They realized that someone had arrived one step ahead of them.","The spirit energy here was not as liquefied as they had thought was because it was being absorbed by the person in front of them. Thinking of this, everyone’s eyes turned bloodshot. In their opinion, this was a fortuitous encounter that belonged to them. They had painstakingly come to the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, but the benefits had been taken by someone else.","This was the worst.","“D*mned native, how dare you steal my fortuitous encounter!”","Boom!","But suddenly, in that instant, a large furry claw descended from the sky and slapped the man.","Bang!","The ruddy-faced man was slapped mid-air, and his entire body was ruthlessly pressed to the ground. The ground was smashed open, and a huge pit was formed. The man struggled for a moment, but he couldn’t get up and instantly died.","All at once, the surroundings became as silent as death. Everyone could feel the entire ground shaking violently.","Everyone stared at the scene in front of them with their mouths agape. They were completely dumbfounded. Although the ruddy-face man’s cultivation was not considered top-notch among them, he was already at the half-step Golden Core Stage.","According to the information they had gathered previously, the natives of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain had degenerated greatly. A Core Former was already considered a kingdom guardian here.","In the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, Core Former were extremely rare, and half-step Golden Cores were unheard of. Therefore, they were full of confidence. Although there weren’t many of them, any one of them had the strength to sweep through an entire country. If they gathered together, they wouldn’t fear anything.","Who would have thought that one of them would be killed with a single slap?","At this moment, everyone finally saw that in the endless spirit energy storm, a huge figure like a small mountain was quietly watching them. His eyes were like lanterns. From inside the endless spirit energy storm, the figure made their hair stand on end.","‘There’s a demon!’ This sentence appeared in everyone’s minds.","“Playing tricks!”","The white-robed young man shouted. The divine power in his entire body surged, and it was like a huge sword that split the sky and swept everything. It slashed straight at the huge figure."]},{"number":1573,"title":"Chapter 1573 Golden Cores? They’re Just Ants!","paragraphs":["1573 Golden Cores? They’re Just Ants!","This white-robed young man was a sword expert. It was only now that he finally showed it. Dressed in white, he was a peerless swordsman.","The terrifying sword light rose into the air for a hundred feet, ten times stronger than the ruddy-faced man’s attack. And unlike the ruddy-face man who was only a half-step Golden Core, he was a genuine Golden Core. This attack was a completely different power. The heavenly power in the entire domain was suppressed by this sword.","The other three looked at the white-robed young man with a calm expression on their faces. A Golden Core should be enough to sweep through the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. It was not a legend that a person could destroy a country.","He was the strongest expert among them. The others were also half-step Golden Cores.","Having cultivated to this level, they naturally understood that the gap between half-step Golden Core and Golden Core was too great. This attack was like the difference between heaven and earth.","However, what happened next made their jaws drop.","Facing this shocking sword, the huge figure did not even look at it and slapped down with another huge furry claw.","Bam!","The terrifying sword light landed on the furry claw, but it was unable to break through it. Instead, the entire sword light was shattered into pieces. Then, the huge claw slapped the white-robed man.","Spurt!","The white-robed man screamed and spat out a mouthful of blood. His entire body crashed into the ground like a meteor. The entire ground shook violently again as if it was about to collapse.","“How is that thing so strong?!”","The white-robed man was in the deep pit, staring at the incomparably huge figure with his mouth agape. It was as if he had seen a ghost. He simply did not dare to imagine that with his cultivation, he was seriously injured by a single slap.","At this moment, he finally understood why the ruddy-faced man had been slapped to death. That incomparably huge ferocious beast was too terrifying.","The white-robed man wanted to move, but most of the bones in his body had been shattered. Just a casual movement causes his entire body incomparably pain.","As for the remaining muscular man, the paled-face man, and the girl, they were completely dumbfounded. Just what terrifying monster was this to cripple a Golden Core with a single slap?","The remaining few immediately felt their hair stand on end. They had been targeted by this terrifying ferocious beast and couldn’t move.","“How is there such a terrifying existence in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain?”","Many thoughts appeared in their minds.","Fortunately, they did not move. The figure in the spirit energy cocoon did not move either. It just stared at them quietly. They had a feeling that if they moved a little, they would immediately attract an attack.","At this moment, how could they not understand that the person that the ferocious beast was protecting was the person in the middle of the spirit cocoon. Their actions were deemed offensive by the ferocious beast, which was why one of them was killed with a single slap and the next was seriously injured.","The strength of that fierce beast was inconceivable. Similarly, to be able to subdue such a fierce beast, it was inconceivable how strong the person in the spirit cocoon was.","At this moment, the paled-face man gritted his teeth and bowed toward the person inside the spirit cocoon.”I didn’t know you were here in seclusion, sir. I’m really sorry for disturbing you.”","The paled-face man’s expression was somewhat forced. After all, he never thought that he would have to lower himself to the natives of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. It was simply a great humiliation.","But reality forced him to lower his head. If the other party wanted to kill them, it would be effortless.","At this moment, these people were about to cry. This was completely different from what they had agreed on. According to the information they had received, the Violet Thunder Sword Domain should be the end of the martial path. The natives of the Violet Thunder Swords shouldn’t have any martial arts experts. Those in the Core Form Stage were considered overlords and kingdom guardians.","To them, this was simply a joke. However, it was precisely because of this that they were able to roam the world. Who knew that they would bump into a super terrifying existence the moment they entered?","The ferocious beast did not use any divine arts. It could kill them with just a casual slap. Under such circumstances, they had no choice but to lower their heads.","At this time, the surrounding spirit energy dispersed a little, and they finally saw what the mountain-like demon was.","“A hou... It’s a hou!”","When the girl saw the demon, she almost fainted from fright. She came from a large sect with inheritance, so she knew more about some ancient secrets than many people.","Even in the ancient times, where all kinds of ferocious beasts were everywhere, hous were terrifying ferocious beasts that ranked at the top of the food chain.","However, after the ancient era, the world changed. These ferocious beasts that dominated the world in ancient times lost their optimal living enviroment, and they became existences only in ancient books.","These ferocious beasts once wreaked havoc. Any one of them could turn the world into hell. Some fire-attributed hous could even transform a thousand miles of land barren. They were called hanba.","This was an extremely terrifying beast.","That gaze that seemed to come from ancient times made her hair stand on end and her back break out in cold sweat.","The other two were also completely dumbfounded. They recalled how terrifying the hou was. Everyone suspected that the figure was an old demon who had been cultivating in seclusion for who knew how many years.","The more they thought about it, the more they felt that it was possible. Even though the Violet Thunder Swords was the end of the martial arts world in their eyes, the hous had once dominated a region. It was not strange for them to have such a foundation.","“Half-step Golden Cores and a Golden Core. Interesting.”","A cold voice came from the spirit cocoon. Then, a figure slowly appeared in front of everyone. The spirit cocoon collapsed inch by inch. At this moment, everyone finally saw that it was a young man in black clothes.","Everyone was completely dumbfounded. It was a young man who looked like he was twenty years old. It was not an old demon living in seclusion as they had guessed."]},{"number":1574,"title":"Chapter 1574 A Group of Frightened Outsiders","paragraphs":["1574 A Group of Frightened Outsiders","This black-robed youth looked young. Too young!","His appearance could deceive people, but the aura on his body could not. For cultivators, outer appearances could deceive others, but auras could not.","And Chu Yunfan’s aura was very young.","In other words, this native was about the same age as them, or maybe even younger. And he had such a terrifying cultivation. Even in the outside world, it was enough to make a name for himself.","How could such a terrifying existence be raised in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, which was considered the age of chaos? A true dragon could not be raised in the water. This should be an unchanging principle.","However, the young man in front of them had broken all the rules.","Chu Yunfan looked at the young experts who had appeared in front of him, and his face revealed a somewhat excited expression. Although these people didn’t seem to be a threat to him, it was enough to surprise Chu Yunfan. In this world, he had only ever met two Golden Cores. One was the leader of the Ultimate West Demon League, and the other was the Great Ancestor Demon. However, both of them had died at his hands.","Chu Yunfan felt that no one in the world was his match.","In the blink of an eye, a year had passed since the demon rebellion was quelled. During the past year, the territory of Great Wei continued to expand, and the power of the kingdom was as strong as the noon sun. All the major factions submitted, and Great Qi could not compete with Great Wei. It was now the strongest kingdom. Throughout the land, everyone knew that Great Wei was supported by Chu Yunfan. As long as the was alive, the power of Great Wei would not disappear.","But for the past six months, Chu Yunfan had not appeared in public. Half a year ago, Wei Wuji sent news that in the depths of the Northern Desert, there was a relic left behind by the Violet Thunder Sword Sect.","This relic had only been accessible to the past Violet Thunder Swords sect masters, and the function of the array around it was to absorb the surrounding spirit energy and purify it. Spirit energy was impure compared to spirit stones. There were all kinds of impurities in it. If one absorbed it directly, the efficiency would be very low.","At Chu Yunfan’s current level, he would not directly absorb spirit energy. Only spirit energy in some special environments could satisfy his requirements. Normally, he would absorb low-grade spirit stones when he cultivated. But this array was different. It could purify spirit energy directly. For an expert like Chu Yunfan, this purified spirit energy was good.","After purification, the spirit energy here had surpassed low-grade spirit stones and was comparable to middle-grade spirit stones. Middle-grade spirit stones were rare finds. Though Wei Wuji sent some here and there, it was far from enough.","According to ancient records, there was no shortage of middle-grade spirit stones in the era before, but they had been consumed. The conditions for the formation of middle-grade spirit stones were far more difficult than low-grade spirit stones. It was because of this that Chu Yunfan rushed here as soon as he received the news from Wei Wuji.","After half a year of bitter cultivation, not only had Chu Yunfan stabilized his fledgling Core Form Stage cultivation, but he had also broken through to the intermediate Core Form Stage. The spirit cocoon formed around him was formed by countless spirit energy.","Chu Yunfan sighed. After the Violet Thunder Sword Sect was destroyed, this array had not been activated for a long time. It was still not enough to face Chu Yunfan, who was like a bottomless pit. It could only barely help him enter the intermediate Core Form Stage.","If it were outside, this would be shocking. The spirit energy here was so dense that it was enough for several Golden Cores to break through. However, it was far from enough for Chu Yunfan.","However, the benefits of high-level spirit energy were needless to say. Chu Yunfan’s physical cultivation reached an incredible level. It was difficult for him to advance further, but under the washing of this high-level spirit energy, he managed to advance another step. This caused his combat strength to soar again. Although he was only at the intermediate Core Form Stage now, in terms of cultivation, ordinary intermediate Golden Cores were no match for him.","These newcomers had been attacked by his hou clone. If Chu Yunfan had attacked personally, their outcome would not be any better. Ordinary Golden Cores were no match for him.","Chu Yunfan had merged his Ash Fire Physique into the hou’s body. After more than a year, he could barely move. Even though he had many brilliant possession techniques in his mind, this hou’s strength far exceeded the Core Stage and was unfathomable. One could imagine how difficult it would be for Chu Yunfan to control it. The hou was very powerful and its body was invincible. Chu Yunfan, who could control its body, could easily injure Golden Cores and kill half-step Golden Cores.","The remaining people looked at Chu Yunfan. They didn’t know what he was thinking. They only felt that under Chu Yunfan’s gaze, the pressure on them increased. They felt as if they were being stared at by a terrifying existence. Even if they were stared at by their sect elder in such a manner, they would be this terrified.","Chu Yunfan stood on the head of the huge hou and looked down at them with his arms crossed. He then said, “Tell me who you are. With your strength, you don’t seem like people of this land.”","In the first half of this year, Chu Yunfan had traveled to the ends of the earth and had not managed to uncover any hidden sects. That was why he was confident there were no other powerful sects here. The appearance of so many young half-step Golden Cores and even a Golden Core made him realize that these people were probably not from around here.","“You’re right, sir. We aren’t from the Violet Thunder Sword Domain,” the paled-faced youth answered.","He gritted his teeth. Although he had confirmed that Chu Yunfan was not a demon or an old man, the person who had reached the top came first on the road of cultivation. Now that their lives were in Chu Yunfan’s hands, he did not dare to make any rash moves.","‘Violet Thunder Sword Domain...’ Chu Yunfan thought, ‘It seems like the people outside call this place the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. It’s probably related to the Violet Thunder Swords.’","“Are you from the outside world?” Chu Yunfan said.","“That’s right. We’re from the Grand Xia Empire. May I know your name, sir?” the pale-faced man replied."]},{"number":1575,"title":"Chapter 1575 The Grand Xia Empire","paragraphs":["1575 The Grand Xia Empire","“The Grand Xia Empire?”","After all, what he wanted was information books. Some of them recorded personal notes regarding the Violet Thunder Swords, records of what they had seen and heard, and so on. They did not involve the core secret manuals, so even if they gave them to Chu Yunfan, there would be no loss.","Everyone was willing to do such a thing.","In just a short year, Chu Yunfan had gained an unprecedented understanding of the Violet Thunder Swords. His understanding surpassed the imagination of ordinary people. In many ancient records, it was said that the Violet Thunder Sword Sect had declined because they failed in their expedition, causing their strength to be greatly reduced. And the force that the Violet Thunder Swords had gone on an expedition against back then was mentioned faintly in many ancient records—the Grand Xia Empire.","Regarding Grand Xia, these ancient records didn’t have much information about that kingdom. The people who wrote those records didn’t know what Grand Xia was exactly. They only knew that Grand Xia was extremely powerful.","After all, the Violet Thunder Swords had ruled the entire world. But even so, they were still defeated by Grand Xia. From this, one could see how terrifying Grand Xia was.","Thus, when Chu Yunfan heard that these people were from Grand Xia, his eyes lit up. It was as if he could see the hope of leaving this part of the land. Since these people from Grand Xia could enter, they must have a way to leave. Chu Yunfan could also take advantage of the situation to get out of here.","“My name? My name is Chu Yunfan,” Chu Yunfan answered, not hiding his name.","Everyone was dumbfounded. The seventeen or eighteen-year-old girl exclaimed,”What? Chu Yunfan, how is that possible?”","They had been in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain for a few days now. They wouldn’t have been able to find such a remote place otherwise. Even with the information to support them, it was not enough. And though they had only been in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain for a short time, they had heard all kinds of things about Chu Yunfan.","In this world, anyone with ears would have heard of his existence.","One year ago, Chu Yunfan had wiped out tens of millions of Jinzhanghan’s calvary, and his various deeds of pacifying the demon rebellion had become famous throughout the world. In particular, the royal family of Great Wei also added fuel to the fire. Wei Wuji knew very well that Chu Yunfan was his true backer. The more powerful Chu Yunfan’s reputation was, the more powerful their Great Wei would be.","Therefore, even these outsiders had heard of Chu Yunfan’s name, but they believed that the story of Chu Yunfan exterminating the ten million cavalry of Jinzhanghan was a fantasy. Tens of millions of elite cavalrymen, even if they were made up of just ordinary Innates, the huge force of an army of tens of millions was enough to kill ordinary Cores. Even Golden Cores would be heavily injured.","It was impossible to kill that many people in one go. After all, quantity led to qualitative changes. After the number reached a certain level, there was no doubt about its strength. However, it was rumored that Chu Yunfan had single-handedly wiped out tens of millions of horsemen and allowed less than a million of Jinzhanghan’s calvary to escape.","For experienced and knowledgeable people, this was a myth and a miracle. Even an expert who had surpassed the Core Stage couldn’t do this. Therefore, they thought that those people were spreading rumors. It was impossible for such a thing to happen.","In their hearts, they had looked down on Chu Yunfan. Naturally, they were suspicious of all of his deeds. Who knew that they would feel a sense of awe when they met him in person. Even if he didn’t have the momentum to annihilate ten million cavalry in one go, his strength was unquestionable. Even if they attacked together, they wouldn’t be able to take a few hits. Especially when the other party had managed to subdue a hou.","This fact alone scared them silly.","At first, they thought Chu Yunfan was just a native who was jumping around in a small pond. Now, they realized that they were the ones who were looking at the sky from the bottom of the well.","“You’re Chu Yunfan, sir?” The young girl covered her mouth in shock. A hint of horror flashed across her eyes, but there was also a hint of surprise.","The others were also extremely shocked as if they had seen a ghost. At this moment, they felt as if they had messed up badly. A divine dragon had flown out of a small pond like the Violet Thunder Sword Domain.","“You know who I am?” Chu Yunfan looked at these people with interest. In his opinion, these people were probably not simple. A group of outsiders knew his name, so it was likely they were here with ill intentions.","He had always been very confident in himself. He was one of the best among his peers. Who knew that he would encounter such a monster? And Chu Yunfan was not a young expert of Grand Xia, but a native of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. This crushed his self-esteem.","“We came here because we got information from a descendant of the Violet Thunder Swords. I didn’t expect you to be so fast, sir. We’re sorry for interrupting you,” the pale-faced man said anxiously.","Before Chu Yunfan, he didn’t not dare to have the slightest thought of resisting. He was afraid that Chu Yunfan would notice and slap him to death.","“The Violet Thunder Swords has a descendant?” Chu Yunfan was taken aback. He didn’t know about this. “I’ve not heard of this.”","“That is expected, sir. The descendant isn’t in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, but in Grand Xia. It’s said that after the Violet Thunder Swords was destroyed, he fled into Grand Xia and hid his tracks,” the paled-faced youth explaining, “After the descendant spilled his secrets, the various factions joined forces to open the barrier of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain and allowed us to enter.”"]},{"number":1576,"title":"Chapter 1576 Killing Someone Without Warning","paragraphs":["1576 Killing Someone Without Warning","Chu Yunfan suddenly realized that the descendant of the Violet Thunder Swords was in the outer world. In reality, the matter of the Violet Thunder Swords was nothing more than a myth to ordinary people. The vast majority of people didn’t even know about the. However, all the major powers that knew about the Violet Thunder Swords were either openly or covertly searching for a descendant of the sect.","Back then, the Violet Thunder Swords’ headquarters had been breached, and a large number of experts had died in battle. The sect’s inheritance had been snatched away, disappearing without a trace.","Later on, someone discovered from the inheritance that the matter was not as simple as what ordinary people thought. The majority of the Violet Thunder Swords’ inheritance was still there. However, the most important and crucial high-end inheritances was missing.","The disappearance of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain’s martial arts inheritance was largely related to the disappearance of that high-end inheritances.","In the past, the Violet Thunder Swords had been the sole power in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. The other powers were not a threat at all. They could not even be considered ants. If it wasn’t for the failed expedition, which resulted in a great loss of strength and the deaths of countless experts, there would be no chance of the rebellion succeeding. The Violet Thunder Swords would have easily crushed these rebellious sects with a single finger, and any top expert could easily wipe out the rebellious sects and powers.","However, the Violet Thunder Sword Sect didn’t have the strength to do so.","Their high-end inheritances disappeared. The various major powers were extremely terrified by this, deeply afraid that the Violet Thunder Swords would rise again. This was especially so for the descendant who had obtained the Violet Thunder Swords’ inheritance, who might come back for revenge. The rise and fall of each generation of powers had changed, but the various major powers had always maintained the same vigilance toward the Violet Thunder Swords.","All these years, no one had been able to find a single descendant of the Violet Thunder Swords, nor were they able to find the high-end inheritances that had disappeared. However, no one had expected the Violet Thunder Swords to have have a descendant, and that this descendant was hiding in Grand Xia outside the Violet Thunder Sword Domain.","More than one or two people had thought of this idea.","“So you’re not the only ones who entered this place?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Yes, sir. Right now, a large number of experts have entered the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. We’re only a small portion of them,” the pale-faced man said.","Chu Yunfan’s expression turned solemn. There was no need to doubt the strength of Grand Xia. Back then, even the mighty Violet Thunder Swords had failed in their expedition. One could very well imagine how powerful they were. Now that Grand Xia was invading, it was undoubtedly another catastrophe for the Violet Thunder Sword Domain that had just completed its reshuffling.","Back then, the Violet Thunder Sword Domain had not gone easy on Grand Xia. Now, Chu Yunfan did not believe that Grand Xia would be nice to them.","‘This can’t be allowed to continue!’ Chu Yunfan thought, his expression extremely solemn.","“With your strength, what level do you think you are among the people who came in?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Sir, we’re not belittling ourselves, but our strength is only average. Only those with cultivation above the Golden Core Stage are considered powerful in Grand Xia,” the pale-faced man answered, “I’m sure you are are awre that although we’re all at the half-step Golden Core Stage, there’s a world of difference between half-step and true Golden Core. If we don’t cross it, we just aren’t there.”","Chu Yunfan nodded and immediately understood. From this, it was clear that the strength of Grand Xia was terrifying. These people looked young—only in their twenties or thirties. At most, they were in their forties or fifties. However, they were all in the half-step Core Form Stage and even the Golden Core Stage.","In the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, such a cultivation base was practically a myth.","“We came here in search of treasures. We didn’t know that you were already here, sir. We’ll leave you to it now,” the pale-faced man hurriedly said.","The others quickly agreed. Witnessing Chu Yunfan’s might, how could they dare to stay? They were afraid that Chu Yunfan would accidentally slap them to death. They didn’t know how a native with such a terrifying cultivation base had suddenly appeared in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain.","“Since you’re here, don’t be in such a hurry to leave.” Chu Yunfan smirked.","“Do you need something from us, sir?” the pale-faced man asked.","“Since you’re already here, don’t leave. I want to understand more about Grand Xia. From now on, how about you guys follow me?” Chu Yunfan said.","“Excuse me, sir?” The pale-faced man was shocked. Chu Yunfan was not willing to let them go and wanted to use them. Thinking of this, their expressions changed.","“Sir, please don’t go too far. Although our cultivation levels are not as high as yours, it doesn’t mean that we’re afraid of you. We all have powerful sects behind us. If you provoke the elders of our sects, I’m afraid you won’t get away with it,” the muscular man said loudly, “A warrior can be killed but not humiliated. Senior, if you want us to be slaves, then don’t blame us for retaliating.”","But just as the muscular man finished his sentence, a sword light slashed down from the sky. It was extremely fast and indestructible. In an instant, his head was cut off.","This sudden change shocked everyone. They weren’t expecting Chu Yunfan to attack without any warning. At this moment, the remaining three people looked at Chu Yunfan with terrified expressions.","“Sir...” the pale-faced man said in shock.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, looked calm and said, “Don’t even try to negotiate over this with me. It’s too late to pretend to be good people now. If my cultivation was inferior to yours, would you have let me go?”","At his words, the three’s expression became extremely unsightly. They realized that if they had the advantage earlier, Chu Yunfan would have died. He had dared to use the spirit energy that they had been planning for a long time, so they naturally would not let it go. However, they were not as strong as Chu Yunfan, so they could only lower their headd.","Chu Yunfan looked at their expressions and sneered. He could tell that these people were not good people, so he did not show any mercy.","“As for the sect elders, what’s the use of using them to threaten me?” Chu Yunfan sneered."]},{"number":1577,"title":"Chapter 1577 How Terrifying Is Chu Yunfan?","paragraphs":["1577 How Terrifying Is Chu Yunfan?","“I don’t know how you guys got in here, but I’m sure it mustn’t have been easy. Perhaps the barrier that you opened has a strength limit it allows to pass. Otherwise, why would you be here? The ones who’ve come in search of the Violet Thunder Swords’ inheritance should be your sect elders, right?”","Chu Yunfan’s revealed a smile. Since so many people were drooling over the Violet Thunder Swords’ inheritance, there was no reason for the younger generation to be the only ones to enter. Were not a single one of the older generation greedy?","So there could only be one reason. It was not easy for martial arts experts with a certain cultivation level to enter the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. Therefore, they could only send these young people in.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, the expressions of the three people became solemn as he had hit the nail on the head. They simply could not believe that Chu Yunfan had deduced everything with just a few words. At this moment, how could they still have any thoughts of underestimating Chu Yunfan. This native was definitely a hidden dragon.","They did not know that this native was actually not a true native of this world. Chu Yunfan was also an outsider.","“So, it’s best you don’t play tricks on me.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Countless divine power condensed on his finger and turned into a sigil. Then, he casually pointed, and the sigil split into three rays of light and flew toward the three people. Before the three of them could react, it fused into their bodies.","“What is this?”","The three of them instantly knew that things were not in their favor. But before they could react, the sigil had already fused into their bodies.","“It’s a special sigil I made, the Yin Yang Energy Sigil. It’s a sigil formed from the Yin and Yang. Every month, I must personally administer you an antidote. Otherwise, your Yin and Yang energy will run amok and your divine power will explode.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","The expressions of the three fell. They didn’t know if Chu Yunfan was telling the truth, but they didn’t dare to bet on it. If it was true, they would really die.","The white-robed man looked at Chu Yunfan with a hint of resentment in his eyes, but he did not dare to have any more thoughts. He quickly hid the resentment in the depths of his eyes and did not dare to glare at Chu Yunfan.","Now that their lives were in Chu Yunfan’s hands, they had no other choice. If Chu Yunfan wanted them dead, they had to die.","“Now, tell me, what are your names?” Chu Yunfan said.","“My name is Cui Mingjie, sir,” the white-robed man said through gritted teeth.","“My name is Lu Hongyuan,” the pale-faced man answered.","Everyone’s eyes turned to the young girl. She said, “Sir, I’m Ye Qiushui.”","Chu Yunfan nodded and said, “All right. Wait here for me here.”","He then returned to the place where he had been in seclusion. That was where the core of the array was, and also where countless spirit energy gathered. Since he was going out, he had to strengthen himself one last time because he did not know what kind of strong enemies he might encounter after departing.","As he circulated the Emperor Method, the pure high-level spirit energy surged toward him. In a short while, it formed a spiritual cocoon. Around him, countless spirit energy turned into a storm and spun around Chu Yunfan. Every time the storm turned, a part of it was absorbed by Chu Yunfan. The incomparably huge hou stood by the side and guarded him. Because this hou was his clone, he could be extremely at ease.","Cui Mingjie and the others didn’t know about this. The three of them quickly retreated to the side, not even caring about the bodies of their two companions on the ground. Cui Mingjie sat down cross-legged to heal his injuries. Just now, he was hit by Chu Yunfan’s hou clone and was heavily injured and almost smashed into pieces.","After a long time, he opened his eyes and exhaled. His wounds had mostly recovered. After all, he was a Golden Core, and his recovery ability was shocking. However, his expression was becoming more and more pained. He no longer had the high-spirited feeling from before.","The three of them looked at each other and began to communicate with each other through telepathy.","“Who is this native? How could he be so terrifying? It’s completely different from what the intelligence said,” Ye Qiushui said with a bitter face.","“It’s too terrifying. Even without that hou, he gives me a sense of pressure that’s similar to death. Has he already surpassed the Core Stage?” Lu Hongyuan said bitterly, “Someone like him can probably kill a group of mes with a single slap. My God, how is he such a freak?”","He was considered one of the top geniuses in the sect, especially at his age. He was invincible and could be considered one of the top geniuses in Grand Xia. In the end, Chu Yunfan beat him to the ground, and he couldn’t even resist.","“Impossible. I’s impossible for him to have already stepped into that level. The feeling of transcending the Core Stage isn’t like this.” Cui Mingjie shook his head.","Among the three of them, he had the highest cultivation level, so he knew what it was like to surpass the Core Stage. Although Chu Yunfan was terrifying, he hadn’t reached that level.","“He’s already so powerful even without transcending the Core Stage,” Lu Hongyuan said gloomily.","“How can it be that easy? The Core Stage is a major realm. Once one truly transcends, they’ll be able to contend with the peerless geniuses of the world. In Grand Xia, they’d be considered high-ranking figures.” Cui Mingjie shook his head.","“But this Chu Yunfan looks younh. I wonder how he is compared to those people,” Ye Qiushui said.","Speaking of those people, their eyes immediately lit up.","“I think Chu Yunfan is not inferior to them. There are many special physiques among them, and in comparison, we mortals are at a disadvantage.” Cui Mingjie sighed. “Now I just hope we can escape from his control one day. Chu Yunfan is unfathomable and not to be trifled with.”"]},{"number":1578,"title":"Chapter 1578 A Storm Rises and Sweeps Through the Land","paragraphs":["1578 A Storm Rises and Sweeps Through the Land","The three of them looked at each other. There was no doubt that in their hearts that Chu Yunfan was an invincible existence. But it was not that there was no one stronger than Chu Yunfan in the world, but those people were back in Grand Xia.","Chu Yunfan decisively killed two people in a row, completely suppressing them. He made them understand that if they angered him, the consequences would be unimaginable. To kill them was nothing more than lifiting a finger.","Ye Qiushui turned her head to look at Chu Yunfan. Her eyes were full of energy. She didn’t seem to be afraid, but rather excited. As if she had thought of something, a subtle smile appeared on her face.","While the three of them were discussing Chu Yunfan, the outside world was boiling.","In Great Qi, its army had been waiting solemnly, afraid that Great Wei’s army would suddenly charge into their kingdom to unify the world. The real storm had just begun.","In the arena of the Infinite Sword Sect of Great Qi.","A figure flew out and outside the arena, creating a huge hole in the ground. In the surroundings, hundreds of disciples dressed in the uniform of the Infinite Swords were dumbfounded when they saw this scene. The person who was sent flying was their sect master!","At this moment, a huge hole had been blasted open on their sect master’s body. Blood flowed out and he almost died. The disciples of the Infinite Swords watched this scene with their mouths agape. Their sect master was a famous expert in in Great Qi. His cultivation had reached the Core Form Stage. He was also a famous kingdom guardian level expert.","Now, he was sent flying by a punch and was instantly heavily injured!","As they looked over, they saw a muscular man. He stood with his hands behind his back and clenched his fists. His fists were flickering with golden light. It seemed that his cultivation was concentrated into his fists.","“This is your so-called kingdom guardian? It’s too weak!” The muscular man revealed a disdainful expression as if he did not care about this sect master.","“Where did this person come from?”","Everyone was bewildered. It wasn’t that they couldn’t do it, but that this young man was too terrifying. He had risen like a comet in the past few days. Tey had never heard of him. Previously, the strongest person in the world was Chu Yunfan, but now it seemed that even the rumored Chu Yunfan was only so-so.","“According to our agreement, from today onward, the Infinite Swords will listen to my command and work for me. If you don’t, well, you heard about what happened to the Divinity Destroyers, right?” the muscular man said.","Everyone suddenly remembered how terrifying this young man was. He suddenly appeared three days ago, and no one knew where he came from. In just three days, he had defeated more than ten sects along the way. He defeated them and took them in for his own use. One of the sects, the Divinity Destroyers, went back on its word and was unwilling to abide by the agreement. They even contacted a group of experts in an attempt to ambush this muscular man.","The man then showed his truly terrifying side. He killed all these experts in one fell swoop and turned the Divinity Destroyers into ruins. Not a single person in the sect escaped. They all died under his fists.","With the precedent of the Divinity Destroyers, no one dared to say anything in retaliation.","“Alright, listen up. I’m going to your capital to take a look around. I heard that Great Qi is considered one of the strongest kingdoms in this areas,” the muscular man said.","After saying that, he stepped out of a beam of light and disappeared. Everyone heaved a sigh of relief. This man was simply a killer god!","“Where did this expert come from? How is he so terrifying? I’m afraid that even Chu Yunfan is only so powerful,” a disciple of the Infinite Swords said with trepidation.","Some of the elders of the sect seemed to have thought of something and turned pale with fright. They had already vaguely guessed Liang Ruicai’s identity and background. If that was really the case, then it was extremely shocking.","At this moment, all the forces in Great Qi were like birds frightened by the twang of a bow. Liang Ruicai had suddenly appeared, but he was definitely not the first. Not long after Liang Rui, another unknown expert appeared out of nowhere.","It had been many years since the human world had produced a true Golden Core. To the people of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, a Core Former was a kingdom guardian. Once a Golden Core appeared, they even had the chance to unify the entire world.","Now that so many top-notch experts had appeared in one breath, one could imagine how shocking it was to the entire world.","As more and more of these people appeared, their origins could no longer be concealed. These people were not people of this world, but from a place called Grand Xia. That was a world that ordinary people had never heard of before. However, to the truly powerful, although Grand Xia was also unfamiliar to them, it was not unheard of.","After hearing about their origins, many people’s expressions changed. The world was about to be overturned.","A storm was coming!"]},{"number":1579,"title":"Chapter 1579 The Changing of Emperors on the City Wall","paragraphs":["1579 The Changing of Emperors on the City Wall","The situation in Great Qi changed. All the experts from Grand Xia had appeared at the same time. Although their strength could not be compared to Liang Ruicai’s, they could easily defeat a large number of forces in Great Qi in groups of three to five.","The power of the imperial court of Great Qi was defeated. Originally, they had gathered to deal with the large-scale invasion of Great Wei’s army, but now, they were all used to deal with these experts. The emperor of Great Qi even personally acted as bait to lure these experts into an encirclement.","However, this battle showed the entire world how terrifying these experts from Grand Xia were. The million strong army of Great Qi had gathered, and they were all the elites of the elites. However, this lineup could not stand up in a fight against three people, and they were able to pierce through one another, allowing the other party to easily capture and kill the emperor.","It was said that a Golden Core defeated the imperial guards of Great Qi, killed the emperor of Great Qi, and defeated the million-strong army of Great Qi. This person became famous in one fell swoop. Only now did everyone truly understand how terrifying and powerful these people were. They were like gods from beyond the heavens.","It wasn’t that the various experts in Great Qi didn’t organize a counterattack, but their counterattack was too weak. Countless people were killed or injured, but they couldn’t even hurt a single person.","In just a short month, Great Qi had fallen. The various forces submitted to the experts of Grand Xia, so there was no longer a unified force. Under the rule of these experts, they were divided into different forces. At the same time, these forces sent their disciples down the mountain wantonly as if they were looking for something.","However, this was just the beginning.","Following the fall of Great Qi, everyone discovered that a large number of experts had also appeared in Great Wei. They were all from Grand Xia, and these people were extremely vicious. Those who resisted were massacred and their experts killed.","For a time, Great Wei was in an uproar.","Although the current power of Great Wei was much stronger than Great Qi, in the face of the surprise attack from these experts who were at least at the peak of the Core Form Stage, the outcome of the various major forces of Great Wei was not much better.","Facing these Grand Xia experts, the emperor of Great Wei, Wei Wuji, who had just ascended the throne, decided to personally lead the army. But the million-strong army was crushed by a single person. It was scattered and the attacking forces came to dominate the Imperial Capital.","On the city wall of the Imperial Capital, Wei Wuji, who was wearing a broken armor, was looking at the yellow-robed youth flying in the air. The youth held a long spear in his hand, and his face revealed an arrogant and unruly aura. He looked at Wei Wuji with a disdainful expression.","Wei Wuji’s eyes were filled with disbelief. After Chu Yunfan, he had now seen another expert who could single-handedly defeated the entire Great Wei Imperial Army. This kind of power was no longer something that humans could possess.","He simply could not believe it. How could someone be so powerful?","Not far away from him was the imperial guardian of the imperial family. He was the only Core Former in the imperial family. But against this yellow-robed man, the imperial guardian could not withstand a single blow and was stabbed to death. He did not even have the strength to resist.","“I heard that you’re the emperor of this kingdom. Do you want to kneel down and beg for mercy?” The yellow-robed man looked at Wei Wuji with a mocking expression. “If you kneel and beg, I’ll let you live.”","He thought nothing of Wei Wuji. He thought Wei Wuji a native who did not know the immensity of heaven and earth. Wei Wuji dared to raise his troops to resist against him, Xiang Feiyun. This was simply overestimating himself.","Xiang Feiyun had defeated a million strong army all on his own, but he did not think much of it. They were just a group of natives.","“If you want to kill me, then kill me. Cut the crap!”","Wei Wuji looked extremely miserable, but his face was very resolute. At this moment, he understood his father’s choice. An emperor could die, but he could not accept such humiliation. He never expected his reign to be so short. Back then, his father had died here calmly. Now, it was his turn.","“Have some backbone. I like killing those with backbone,” Xiang Yunfei said mockingly.","“If you kill me today, then so be it. But when our kingdom’s imperial advisor, Chu Yunfan, returns, he will definitely kill you,” Wei Wuji said through gritted teeth.","“Kill me? You natives think you can kill me?” Xiang Yunfei did not believe it at all. His cultivation had long broken into the Golden Core Stage. In this world, this cultivation was considered invincible.","People like the imperial advisor were just frogs at the bottom of a well. They did not know the vast world outside and thought that they were invincible.","“Hang on... Did you just say Chu Yunfan?” Xiang Feiyun suddenly remembered another reason for coming to this world. “Where is Chu Yunfan? Speak!”","“If you want to kill me, then kill me. Don’t talk nonsense. Just wash your neck and wait,” Wei Wuji said.","“How stubborn. Fine, go to hell then!”","Xiang Feiyun smiled coldly and slapped out. It transformed into an incomparably huge hand of energy that slammed down fiercely.","Boom!","The entire city wall was smashed into ruins, and Wei Wuji, who was in the middle of it, was smashed into a pile of flesh and blood. The soldiers nearby were also killed. The rest knelt down and trembled, not daring to resist.","At this moment, a person in the distance raised a white flag and stepped on a flying light. He arrived in front of Xiang Feiyun and handed over a surrender letter.","“I am Wei Xingbang, the 32nd son of the previous emperor of Great Wei. I represent the noble clans in the city in surrendering to you.”","This person was the son of the previous emperor of Great Wei.","“Wei Wuji overestimated himself and dared to go against you. He deserved to die.”","Xiang Feiyun did not even look at the surrender letter. With a wave of his hand, the letter was burned by a ball of raging fire.","“You adapt quickly. From now on, you will be the emperor of Great Wei.” Xiang Feiyun nodded in satisfaction.","“Thank you, Great One. I’m willing to do anything for you.”","Wei Xingbang’s face, which was somewhat similar to Wei Wuji’s, revealed a delighted expression. He had made the right bet. No one in the city dared to come here. He was the only one who came here to take this chance.","Wei Wuji, had taken a gamble and chosen Chu Yunfan. In the end, Wei Xingbang succeeded in ascending the throne. He also needed such an opportunity."]},{"number":1580,"title":"Chapter 1580 The Chu Clan Is Executed, Chu Yunfan Comes Out of Seclusion","paragraphs":["1580 The Chu Clan Is Executed, Chu Yunfan Comes Out of Seclusion","“I don’t need you to go through hell and high water. That’s useless to me. I only have one request for you. That guy earlier mentioned that your imperial advisor is called Chu Yunfan?” Xiang Feiyun said.","“Yes.” Wei Xingbang nodded with some doubt. He did not know why Xiang Feiyun mentioned Chu Yunfan, but his heart tighten slightly at the mention of his name.","The shadow that Chu Yunfan had cast on the people of Great Wei was something that only the people of Great Wei could understand. In just a few short years, Chu Yunfan had single-handedly suppressed all the major forces in Great Wei. He had fought his way up level by level. In the end, he even rebelled and placed Wei Wuji to the throne of the emperor. If Chu Yunfan was here, Wei Xingbang wouldn’t even have the slightest thought of resisting.","If he hadn’t seen how terrifying Xiang Feiyun’s strength was and how he had defeated Great Wei’s million-strong army, it would seem that his strength was not inferior to Chu Yunfan’s.","Chu Yunfan had not been able to do this with his strength back then and had to rely on Wei Wuji’s strength. Wei Xingbang was taking a gamble. Chu Yunfan helped Wei Wuji ascend the throne and become the emperor of Great Wei. At that time, Wei Xingbang didn’t dare to resist. And now, he was betting on this opportunity!","“Tell me about him!” Xiang Feiyun said as he stared at the man before him.","Wei Xingbang immediately told him everything he knew about Chu Yunfan. These things were not secrets. On the contrary, as Chu Yunfan became famous and became the number one expert. Everyone knew about it.","“What? He’s only in his twenties?” Xiang Feiyun said with a surprised expression.","Even if Chu Yunfan was in the Golden Core Stage, he would not be surprised. No matter how backward the Violet Thunder Swords was in his eyes, it was still a world. It was not strange for a powerful person to appear. However, what really surprised him was Chu Yunfan’s age.","“Yes, he was born in the Chu royal family of Great Wei. No one knows what fortuitous encounter he had, but he managed to rise all the way to become the number one expert in the world,” Wei Xingbang said, “But I’m sure he’s only in his twenties.”","“The number one expert in the world?” Xiang Feiyun sneered.","Wei Xingbang quickly said, “Of course, he’s nothing compared to you. He’s just a clown. A monkey will call itself a king when there’s no tiger in the mountain.”","Xiang Feiyun laughed and said, “Not bad, not bad. I like this saying. The so-called number one expert in the world is just a frog at the bottom of a well.","“Now you are the emperor of Great Wei. I want you to do one thing. Kill King Chu and his family and spread the news,” Xiang Feiyun said.","“But if we do that, I’m afraid Chu Yunfan will find out very soon,” Wei Xingbang said. He thought of Chu Yunfan’s terrifying deterrence and suddenly felt a chill run down his spine.","“I want him to know. Otherwise, why would he come to me?” Xiang Feiyun sneered. What he wanted was to force Chu Yunfan out. Only then could he complete the mission.","Wei Xingbang suddenly realized that Xiang Feiyun’s target was Chu Yunfan. Although he didn’t know why this was, he said, “It just so happens that the Chu royal family is in the city right now. As long as you give the order, Great One, none of them will escape.”","“All right, go ahead and do it,” Xiang Feiyun said.","The various powers of Great Wei that were paying attention to the Imperial Capital suddenly received a shocking piece of news. The emperor of Great Wei, Wei Wuji, had been killed by the intruder, Xiang Feiyun. The new emperor of Great Wei, Wei Xingbang, had ordered the entire family of the meritorious minister of Great Wei, King Chu, to be executed. Because these orders had came too quickly, nobody had time to react. It was said that the entire family of King Chu was executed.","For a time, the world was in an uproar. Just King Chu alone was not enough to shock them so much, but everyone knew that behind King Chu was the number one expert in the world, Chu Yunfan. But now, the entire family had been executed. There was no doubt that this was targeted at Chu Yunfan, who was behind King Chu.","Everyone knew that with Xiang Feiyun’s strength, it was difficult ofr him to find a worthy opponent in the world. Although King Chu was considered to have a high position and authority in Great Wei, it was not worth it for Xiang Feiyun to deal with him personally.","This caused an uproar, and everyone was dumbfounded. Everyone had a feeling that a storm was coming. Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts were unknown, and once he returned, it would be another fierce battle.","Now, everyone’s hopes were pinned on Chu Yunfan. After all, compared to these vicious outsiders, although Chu Yunfan’s methods were equally fierce, he was not unreasonable. He did not break the current system, but Xiang Feiyun wanted to break this system and trample the imperial power under his feet.","Soon, Xiang Feiyun’s words came from the Imperial Capital.","“What number one expert in the world? It’s just a monkey calling itself king when there’s no tiger in the mountain. What a joke. Chu Yunfan is just a coward. I killed his entire family, and he doesn’t dare to show his face.”","In an instant, everyone was in an uproar. Everyone could see that Xiang Feiyun was here for Chu Yunfan. Although they didn’t know the exact reason, there was no doubt that this was a challenge.","And after Xiang Feiyun’s arrival, many Grand Xia experts invaded the various forces of Great Wei. It was the same as in Great Qi. They used absolute strength to subdue all the forces and then made them their own. For a time, the major forces did not have the time to pay attention to Chu Yunfan’s matter. The entire world fell into a violent turmoil.","At this moment, everyone saw Chu Yunfan as their true savior, but where was he?","In the endless northern desert, a huge array collapsed with a loud bang, revealing a world that was completely different from the outside world. Inside, a man and a beast were flying in the air. Without the isolation of the array, Chu Yunfan’s comms talisman instantly received countless messages. When he finished reading them, his expression became ferocious.","“Very well. Xiang Feiyun, since you want to die, I’ll grant you your wish!” Chu Yunfan’s face was ashen as he gritted his teeth."]},{"number":1581,"title":"Chapter 1581 Life or Death","paragraphs":["1581 Life or Death","There were all kinds of information in Chu Yunfan’s comms talisman, and all of them were about his clan being executed in the capital. There was no doubt that the Chu family itself did not have anything that could make Xiang Feiyun look askance, so there could only be one reason, and that was him.","Chu Yunfan did not know why Xiang Feiyun was targeting him. Was it because of his so-called number one title? Or was it to kill chickens to scare monkeys?","After all, if Chu Yunfan was killed, all the major forces would surely be terrified. It would be impossible for them to even have the thought of resisting.","Most of the people in the Chu family had nothing to do with Chu Yunfan, but the matriarch was someone who had done him a great favor and treated him like her own. Over the years, he had respected the matriarch as if she was his own elder.","Now, the matriarch had been brutally killed by the other party.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan’s eyes became bloodshot and he radiated killing intent. With his current cultivation, the killing intent he released enveloped a radius of hundreds of miles. Ye Qiushui, Cui Mingjie, and Lu Hongyuan, who stepped out of the array behind him, suddenly felt as if Mount Tai was pressing down on them. An unprecedented killing intent swept through them. They felt that if Chu Yunfan wanted to kill them, they wouldn’t even be able to resist.","At this moment, they realized that Chu Yunfan had suppressed them completely without even using half of his strength. To think that they thought they knew Chu Yunfan’s strength before this. Only now did they realize that Chu Yunfan’s strength was not only unfathomable, but also terrifying.","They didn’t know what had happened to make Chu Yunfan so angry.","Chu Yunfan slowly reigned in his aura. During this period, he had absorbed all the spirit energy in the array, and his cultivation had improved. He rushed straight to the peak of the intermediate Core Form Stage and was only one step away from the advanced Core Form Stage.","Every stage of the Core Stage was a threshold, but after crossing it, the main thing was to accumulate power and finally form the golden core in one’s body. This was the stage where one could quickly accumulate their strength. And Chu Yunfan could even feel that his strength was constantly increasing.","“I have a questions for you three. Do you know anything about Xiang Feiyun?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Xiang Feiyun?” The three of them were stunned. They didn’t know how Chu Yunfan knew about Xiang Feiyun’s existence, but since he had asked, they didn’t dare to hesitate.","Cui Mingjie quickly answered, “Sir, Xiang Feiyun is a disciple of Central Sky Academy of Grand Xia. He’s even stronger than me.”","“Stronger than you?” Chu Yunfan glanced at Cui Mingjie.","“Yes, Xiang Feiyun is famous for being arrogant and unruly. He has always been ruthless when representing the imperial court in missions,” Cui Mingjie said.","“Ruthless? What a vicious and merciless man,” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “Since he has issued a letter of challenge, I will bury him.”","The three of them looked at each other. Just as they had expected, Xiang Feiyun had provoked Chu Yunfan. Whether it was Xiang Feiyun or Chu Yunfan, in their eyes, they were both big trouble. Their strength was far above theirs and they could not resit either of them. It was best if both sides suffered.","“I have things to take care of. You guys may leave now. Remember to gather near the capital of Great Wei in a month’s time,” Chu Yunfan said.","How could Chu Yunfan not tell that Xiang Feiyun was provoking him? He naturally wouldn’t let this go. Thinking of this, he place the hou into the Mountain River Diagram, then turned into a beam of light and disappeared.","When the three of them saw Chu Yunfan leave, they heaved a sigh of relief as if they had been pardoned. They looked at each other and saw the joy in each other’s eyes. especially Cui Mingjie. He was a Golden Core and should be a peerless existence throughout this world. They calculated the fact that they might encounter the demon Chu Yunfan. And though he was younger than them, they could not beat him in terms of strength. This made Cui Mingjie feel embarrassed.","“I don’t know how Xiang Feiyun offended Chu Yunfan, but I’m pretty sure they’ll fight to the death,” Ye Qiushui said worriedly. She could feel that Chu Yunfan’s shocking killing intent was not a joke.","“Idiot, if Chu Yunfan dies, who will undo the Yin Yang Energy Sigil he placed on us?” Cui Mingjie didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. “No matter what, we have to think of a way to break this sigil. We can’t pin our hopes on him letting us go. I don’t believe that there’s no way to break this sigil.”","The three of them immediately left the desert. Once they got out, they heard the shocking news and finally understood why Chu Yunfan’s killing intent soared and anger had attacked his heart.","To lure Chu Yunfan out, Xiang Feiyun had executed the entire Chu family. The cruelty of Xiang Feiyun’s methods made the three of them speechless. One could imagine that Chu Yunfan would definitely fight Xiang Feiyun to the death.","At this time, while everyone was looking forward to Chu Yunfan’s return, he landed in a valley near Conglong City, an important town in the south of Great Wei. A figure suddenly rushed out of the dense forest in the valley and headed toward Chu Yunfan, crying loudly.","“Brother Fan, we’re finished! The Chu family is finished! Everyone is finished!”","Chu Yunfan took a closer look. Who else could this person be but Chu Hongcai?","However, Chu Hongcai was no longer as high-spirited as he once was. He looked extremely disheveled, and it was clear that he had been severely injured in many places. He cried loudly without a care for his image.","“Brother Fan, you have to avenge us. His Highness, the Matriarch, and many elders are dead!”"]},{"number":1582,"title":"Chapter 1582 The Subduing of the Imperial Capital","paragraphs":["1582 The Subduing of the Imperial Capital","Chu Hongcai cried sadly. This time was different. Last time, they were saved by Wei Wuji, so although they suffered a big change, they were fine. This time, the entire Chu family had been executed, and he was the only one who had escaped.","Chu Hongcai had only managed to escape with his life under the protection of his personal guards. At that time, Xiang Feiyun had not cares for this million-strong army and just let them go after scattering them. After all, not everyone was like Chu Yunfan who had a nuclear bomb in his hands. Destroying an army of a million soldiers and killing an army of a million soldiers were two different things.","Tens of thousands of people was a whole wave of people, not to mention millions. Even if a Golden Core wanted to kill all these people, it would be very difficult. Under those circumstances, Chu Hongcai had managed to escape. But before he could return to the Imperial Capital, he heard that the entire Chu family had been executed. Naturally, he did not dare to return to the Imperial Capital.","Instead, he came to this secret valley. Ever since they had been interrogated by the imperial court and were almost killed, the Chu family had been on guard. Even though Wei Wuji had great trust in the Chu family, no one truly knew his thoughts, not to mention that the future emperor might not trust the Chu family so much. As the saying goes, a crafty rabbit has three burrows. Therefore, the Chu family had established a secret base in this forest. It was hard to spot from the outside.","After Chu Hongcai sent Chu Yunfan a message, he retreated to the secret base to wait for Chu Yunfan because he knew that Chu Yunfan would come here to find him as soon as he returned.","As expected, he met Chu Yunfan here.","“It’s too tragic, Brother Fan. I was useless. I only dared to look from afar. Everyone’s heads were hung on the city walls.” Chu Hongcai burst into tears. He had not been like this since becoming an adult.","In just a few short years, Chu Hongcai had grown from a young boy when Chu Yunfan first met him to a resolute and decisive youth. His cultivation had went for the early Divine Abilities Stage to the peak. His progress was not slow. Other than Chu Yunfan’s guidance, more importantly, the Chu family had risen through the clouds because of Wei Wuji. Chu Hongcai could then enjoy a hundred or even a thousand times more resources than before.","In the end, cultivation was a process of accumulating resources. In a situation where they had similar talent and resources, their cultivation speed could not be mentioned in the same breath. But now, he couldn’t hold it in any longer and started to cry in front of Chu Yunfan.","“I’m useless! Useless. I could only watch as everyone died!” Chu Hongcai started to wail.","“Why are you crying?” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “Wipe your tears and kill all these people who think they’re gods.”","Chu Yunfan was burning with anger. He no longer cared about the background of these people. Since the other party was clearly coming for him, he would not be a coward. He still had nuclear bombs, so he was fearless.","“I promise you that I’ll let you chop off Xiang Feiyun’s head with your own hands,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“Thank you, Brother Fan.” Chu Hongcai wiped away his tears. He knew that he and Chu Yunfan were the only two people left in the Chu family. Chu Yunfan was destined to be someone extraordinary and would not stay in this world for long. From now on, the Chu family could only rely on him to prosper.","“You are not a child anymore. The Chu family’s resurgence will depend on you,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Yes, Brother Fan.” Chu Hongcai nodded.","“No matter who the other party is, I promise you that I’ll make them pay the price!” Chu Yunfan gritted his teeth. “Let’s go to the Imperial Capital. I want to check out how strong he is.”","Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai flew in the direction of the Imperial Capital. Chu Yunfan was extremely fast. In just two hours, he had already arrived at the Imperial Capital.","The Imperial Capital, which had just experienced a great battle, had recovered its former prosperity. Although the million-strong army had been defeated, the casualties were only a few hundred thousand. Without experiencing a siege, the Imperial Capital of Great Wei had surrendered.","Under Xiang Feiyun’s pressure, all of Great Wei had bowed their heads, just like how they had bowed their heads to Chu Yunfan. In the face of absolute strength, even a country had to bow its head. This world was the heyday of martial arts. If it was the Federation, no powerhouse would dare to do such a thing. The most powerful would always be the Federation Government. They could capture powerful Divines and uproot a behemoth as they pleased.","No one dared to face the power of the Federation. That was the golden age of ordinary people. No matter how powerful the cultivators were, they had to be under the law.","A roar filled with anger exploded above the Imperial Capital.","For a moment, figures flew out one after another and looked up at the sky. When they saw who it was, they were instantly scared out of their wits. The two people flying in the air were none other than Chu Hongcai and Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan had accumulated a lot of power over the years. Even though Xiang Feiyun had proven that his cultivation was extremely terrifying, at this moment, he was not as terrifying as Chu Yunfan.","“He’s back. He really came back!”","“That’s right. With Chu Yunfan’s personality, he definitely won’t let this go.”","“A storm is coming!”","“So what if Chu Yunfan defeats Xiang Feiyun? There are too many experts from Grand Xia. He can’t fight all of them alone.”","For a moment, everyone was discussing animatedly. Everyone could feel a shocking killing intent from Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai. It was fine if it was Chu Hongcai, but it was Chu Yunfan’s strength that made everyone tremble in fear. They did not dare to underestimate him.","At this moment, in a manor in the depths of the Imperial Capital, a group of young men in luxurious clothes were chatting and laughing away."]},{"number":1583,"title":"Chapter 1583 Taking Your Head","paragraphs":["1583 Taking Your Head","These young men were dressed in luxurious clothes. Each of them looked dignified, like dragons and phoenixes among men, and their cultivation levels were unfathomable. Other than these people was the current emperor of Great Wei, Wei Xingbang, who was serving them like an attendant. If others saw this, they would definitely be shocked.","“It’s just a world of natives. Without the Violet Thunder Swords, what’s left is just a bunch of natives,” another slim and handsome young man in green said.","“That’s true. They’re just a pile of trash. I heard that the demons in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain are quite strong. Maybe I’ll go kill a few demons,” another young man with an arrogant expression said bluntly.","These people were brazenly discussing and belittling the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. They barely even acknowledged Wei Xingbang.","Wei Xingbang’s expression remained unchanged as if he wasn’t a native of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. Just this shrewdness alone showed that he was indeed born into the royal family.","“But the most important thing is to find the Violet Thunder Swords’ base. I heard that there’s a high-level inheritance inside,” the square-faced youth said.","When the others heard this, their eyes lit up. Although they didn’t care about the natives of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, they had to admit that the Violet Thunder Sword was indeed extraordinary. The purpose of these people’s visit was to obtain the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Swords. The inheritances developed by ordinary forces could not even make them blink.","“If we can obtain it, our cultivation will greatly improve. If we can surpass the Core Stage, then we can become the elites of our respective sects,” the unruly young man said after a moment of thought and clicked his tongue.","“That’s right. This is actually an opportunity that the Marquis has fought for us. Otherwise, when the army breaks through the Violet Thunder Sword Domain barrier and a large number of experts pour in, how would we have the chance to show our strength?” Xiang Feiyun said loudly as he flew down from the sky.","His gaze was like an eagle as he looked at these people. “Since we have received benefits from the Marquis, we have to work for him. The Marquis is the youngest marquis of Grand Xia, and his future is limitless. Only by following him closely will we be able to fight for greater benefits in this world of great strife.”","“Brother Xiang, we don’t need you to tell us this. The Marquis started from scratch and is now recruiting his own people. We are now relying on him and working for him. In the future, the marquis will rise to the clouds and may have the opportunity to become a king. At that time, we too will be famous.” A muscular man nodded.","“It’s good that you know who you’re taking advantage of. The Marquis wants that Chu Yunfan killed, so all of you should put in some effort. When the time comes, I’ll ask him for a reward. I’ll reward you with pills, and you’ll be able to break through to the Core Stage,” Xiang Feiyun said.","A hint of excitement flashed through their eyes. Everyone’s expressions were similarly excited. These people could be said to be awe-inspiring in the Violet Thunder Swords, but in their respective sects, they could not be considered to have achieved much. Now, only by hugging onto the Marquis’ thigh could they have the capital to ride the wind and rise up.","Thinking back to the generations of marquises of Grand Xia, each and every one of them had become a shining star, and the people who followed them had all ascended to the heavens. It was especially difficult for them to break through to the Core Stage. Without any fortuitous encounters, it might take them decades or even hundreds of years. In that case, they would have no chance of advancing further. To Grand Xia, breaking through to the Core Stage was standard.","At this time, Wei Xingbang’s expression did not change, but there was a hint of curiosity in his heart. What kind of person was this Marquis? Xiang Feiyun was already the most terrifying existence he knew. Even Chu Yunfan’s victory was far inferior to Xiang Feiyun’s. But now, Xiang Feiyun was working for that Marquis, and he even said that he wanted to be loyal to him.","What kind of shocking existence was that? Wei Xingbang simply did not dare to imagine it.","But although he was curious, he did not dare to show it. He knew that in the eyes of these people, he was an ant that could be crushed with a finger. He had no standing.","“Xiang Feiyun you damn thief, your daddy’s here to claim your miserable life!”","Suddenly, a loud shout shook the entire Imperial Capital.","Everyone’s expression changed, especially Xiang Feiyun’s. His expression was slightly ugly, but then he revealed a little joy. He pointed at the two figures in the distance and said, “Is one of those Chu Yunfan?”","“It’s him!” Xiang Feiyun sneered. “Just in time for me to take his head!”","Xiang Feiyun glanced at Dai Xiuwen and said, “All right, go and take his head. When the time comes, I’ll report this to the Marquis.”","Xiang Feiyun thought about it and decided not to make a move. His merit had been achieved, so he would not be affected.","“Okay, I’ll go take his head! Hahaha!” Dai Xiuwen laughed. His body turned into a beam of light, and he rushed toward the two people in the air.","Chu Hongcai had just finished shouting when he suddenly felt a terrifying aura sweeping toward him.","A square-faced young man pounced over.","“Chu Yunfan, you monkey, watch me take your life. I, Dai Xiuwen, will kill you!”","Dai Xiuwen roared and rushed toward Chu Yunfan like a divine mountain. This was a terrifying divine power of his sect. It was called the Mountain Moving Arts. It turned one’s entire body into a divine mountain. The stronger one’s cultivation was, the more powerful the technique would be."]},{"number":1584,"title":"Chapter 1584 Death by a Finger","paragraphs":["1584 Death by a Finger","If one’s cultivation had reached the peak, one would be like an enormous mountain crashing down. There was no way to resist. Dai Xiuwen’s cultivation had not reached that level, but even so, it could already be said to be very shocking. Just the aura that swept over made Chu Hongcai feel that it was difficult to breathe, let alone move.","‘Another half-step Golden Core.’","Chu Yunfan thought that the strength of Grand Xia was truly far above that of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. In the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, half-step Golden Cores were rare. But among the experts of Grand Xia, it was not uncommon. Moreover, the weakest was at the peak of the Core Form Stage, and the ordinary ones were at the half-step Golden Core Stage. In terms of strength, it was not something the Violet Thunder Sword Domain or the Federation could compare to.","Just as Chu Hongcai felt that he was about to suffocate to death, a gentle aura enveloped him. The aura that almost suffocated him just now disappeared. He didn’t know when, but Chu Yunfan was already standing in front of him. Although he had only taken one step, it made Dai Xiuwen’s aura disappear.","At this moment, in the Imperial Capital, the group of youths were watching Dai Xiuwen make his move.","“What a great technique. Tsk, tsk. The Mountain Moving Arts is considered a core skill in the Mountain Mover Sect. Dai Xiuwen is not even a core disciple, yet he already learned this technique.”","“I’ve seen an expert from the Mountain Movers use this technique. It’s like an endless land crashing down. Ordinary people would be scared out of their wits before they even fight.”","“Dai Xiuwen is qualified to sit with us just based on this move.”","These young disciples were commenting on Dai Xiuwen’s attack without any restraint. As for Chu Yunfan, he was a dead man in their eyes, and how long he could live was up to them.","It was not that they had not investigated Chu Yunfan beforehand. Although Chu Yunfan had the combat strength of the Core Form Stage and was extremely terrifying in the eyes of ordinary people, to them, a Core Form Stage cultivation was nothing. He was not even qualified to talk to them.","Chu Yunfan looked at the mountain that was rushing toward him. He sneered and pointed out with his finger. Chu Yunfan’s finger was like a sharp sword, instantly cutting the mountain into two halves.","Dai Xiuwen’s figure was revealed. He never expected Chu Yunfan to be able to reveal his true form. Chu Yunfan had forced out his divine power.","“You think you can break me? You’re still far from it!”","Dai Xiuwen roared, and the divine power in his body burned again. This time, he didn’t go easy on Chu Yunfan. Although Chu Yunfan was a native, he did have some skills. Thinking of this, he formed a seal.","“Mountain Wrap Seal!”","This seal was even more brilliant than the Mountain Moving Arts. It was as if an archaic god was holding an archaic divine mountain and crushing it. This terrifying technique instantly smashed down with invincible strength. This divine power was indeed very impressive. Even Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with admiration, but that was all.","“Mountain Wrap Seal? Get destroyed!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and pointed out with his finger. This finger was ordinary, but it was extremely terrifying. It instantly tore apart the Mountain Wrap Seal and revealed Dai Xiuwen’s figure.","Bam!","After breaking through the seal, Chu Yunfan pointed his finger at Dai Xiuwen. Everyone saw a big hole appear in Dai Xiuwen’s body, which was pierced by the sword energy from Chu Yunfan’s fingertip. The inner armor and defensive magical equipment he was wearing instantly failed. To be precise, Chu Yunfan had pierced through them.","He couldn’t even block a simple attack from Chu Yunfan?","Boom!","Everyone saw Dai Xiuwen being hit by Chu Yunfan. Then, he fell from the sky like a stone and landed on the ground. He was dead.","“What the...” All the experts in the city were dumbfounded.","In the depths of the Imperial Capital, the experts of Grand Xia who had just been talking about what rewards they would receive after killing Chu Yunfan were dumbfounded by this scene. It was as if a duck that had been squawking non-stop just a moment ago had its neck grabbed, and it was instantly unable to speak.","They couldn’t believe what they were seeing. After all, Dai Xiuwen wasn’t bad in terms of cultivation level and technique. His cultivation was at half-step Golden Core Stage. Although he wasn’t the best among them, he wasn’t bad either. There shouldn’t be anyone in this domain who could defeat him.","These Grand Xia experts had swept through this domain, and countless factions had submitted to them. Not a single one of them had died, and this had fueled their arrogance. They felt that this world was just so-so and that there was nothing to care about.","However, who knew that when they were at their most arrogant, Dai Xiuwen’s death would slap them in the face? It would have been fine if Chu Yunfan had used some kind of powerful move, but it was just a simple attack!","Suddenly, their internal alarm bells went off. They were arrogant, but they weren’t stupid. They immediately raised their evaluation of Chu Yunfan.","‘He can’t be a Golden Core, right?’ everyone wondered.","“Tell me, are you deliberately trying to trick us? Your information isn’t accurate!”","The muscular man was instantly enraged. He kicked Wei Xingbang to the ground, causing him to be seriously injured. His entire body curled up like a shrimp."]},{"number":1585,"title":"Chapter 1585 Killing a Golden Core in One Move","paragraphs":["1585 Killing a Golden Core in One Move","Wei Xingbang was also dumbfounded. He didn’t understand why the information he gathered was inaccurate. It was only a year ago, and a year was nothing to a Core. Moreover, Chu Yunfan had only just entered this cultivation level a year ago. How could he have broken through again?","Wei Xingbang did not think that the information he gave was wrong. Moreover, he was in the same boat as these experts of Grand Xia. There was no need or possibility for him to trick them.","“Stop fighting!” The arrogant young man said as he stood up. “What’s the use of beating him? He’s just an ant.”","The young man glanced at Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai, who were flying in the sky, and locked his gaze on Chu Yunfan. Although Chu Yunfan was far away, his eyesight was not affected. He could see the young man in black standing proudly.","A hint of displeasure flashed across his eyes. “He only killed Dai Xiuwen. What does that make him? I’ll kill him!” He sneered.","“Wang Feihang, be careful. This Chu Yunfan is a little strange,” Xiang Feiyun said with a solemn expression.","Although he didn’t think that Chu Yunfan was that scary, he no longer looked down on Chu Yunfan like before. This native whom the marquis had personally instructed to kill did have some skill and was not someone to be trifled with.","The arrogant young man, Wang Feihang, sneered and said, “So what if he’s also in the Golden Core Stage? There’s no impressive inheritance in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. I can beat ten of him!”","The other experts of Grand Xia nodded. To them, this was something very normal. They were both in the Golden Core Stage, but a disciple of a prestigious family with an inheritance and an unorthodox person without an inheritance were two completely different things.","Itinerant cultivators in the Golden Core Stage often did not have good inheritances. They lacked powerful divine powers and martial arts. They were not worth worrying about at all. Compared to the disciples of the large sects, their strength was really too far apart.","Wang Feihang smiled as he stepped on a light beam and arrived in front of Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai.","“Another one here to die. Where’s Xiang Feiyun? Does he not dare come out?” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“You sure talk big,” Wang Feihang said with a cold smile. Although he was still a little afraid of Chu Yunfan earlier, it had now turned into anger.","“You’re no match for me. If you don’t want to die, get lost,” Chu Yunfan continued expressionlessly.","“How arrogant. You don’t want to kill me, but I want to use your head to collect a reward.” Wang Feihang sneered.","He immediately attacked. A treasure saber appeared in his hand, and it swept up a terrifying saber light. It was densely packed, like a torrential rain that swept out.","Chu Yunfan also made his move. Countless divine power boiled around him as he formed a seal. The figure of a god appeared in front of him. Then, it wrapped a huge divine mountain and suppressed the light that filled the sky.","“What is that? Isn’t that the Mountain Wrap Seal?” Everyone was dumbfounded.","What was Chu Yunfan using if not the Mountain Wrap Seal?","Dai Xiuwen’s seal had already amazed everyone, but it paled in comparison to Chu Yunfan’s. When Chu Yunfan displayed the Mountain Wrap Seal, it was like a god holding a divine mountain and smashing it down.","The most terrifying thing was that this was a divine ability!","“How did he manage to learn the seal?!”","The experts from Grand Xia were dumbfounded. Although the Mountain Movers were not considered as the top sect or inheritance, the Mountain Wrap Seal and Mountain Moving Arts were unique. If these techniques were cultivated to the peak, one would become a world-renowned expert.","And now, Chu Yunfan had learned it so easily with just a glance.","Dai Xiuwen had only used the Mountain Wrap Seal once. What kind of shocking learning ability was this?","Of course, they did not think the Mountain Wrap Seal was easy to learn. If the seal was easy to learn, then everyone in the world would have learned it. Even if one was given a secret manual, it would be difficult to master the seal without several years of hard work and a top expert guiding them day and night.","And Chu Yunfan had learned the seal after just one look. What kind of shocking ability was this?!","Clang, clang, clang!","Countless saber lights slashed at the Mountain Wrap Seal. The power that Dai Xiuwen did not manage to display earlier was completely unleashed. It crushed these saber lights and then fell toward Wang Feihang at lightning speed.","Wang Feihang’s expression fell as he felt the threat of death. He shouted, and the golden core in his body burst out with light. Terrifying divine power surged out and rushed into the treasure saber in his hand through his arm.","“Break!” Wang Feihang shouted. As he slashed with his saber, the world shook violently. The saber fell, and the world was torn apart.","Bam!","However, when this saber light landed on the Mountain Wrap Seal, it was actually bounced off. The seal continued to fall. At this moment, the seal that Chu Yunfan displayed was completely different from the one Dai Xiuwen had displayed. It was terrifying.","As the seal continued to descend from the divine mountain, its power continued to increase. This was something that even Dai Xiuwen could not do. This proved that Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the Mountain Wrap Seal was stronger than Dai Xiuwen’s.","“Break, break, break!” Wang Feihang did not want to be outdone. He spat out his golden core in his mouth. Countless divine powers were burning on the golden core as if it had formed a fireball and rushed up to the divine mountain.","Boom!","There was a loud explosion, but Chu Yunfan’s expression remained unchanged. He pressed down casually, and the Mountain Wrap Seal shattered Wang Feihang’s golden core. It turned into an energy storm and exploded in the air.","Immediately after, Chu Yunfan’s Mountain Wrap Seal did not lose its momentum and landed on Wang Feihang.","Bam!","Wang Feihang screamed as his body exploded.","A Golden Core had fallen miserably under everyone’s watchful eyes."]},{"number":1586,"title":"Chapter 1586 Everyone Was Shocked","paragraphs":["1586 Everyone Was Shocked","Everyone looked at Wang Feihang, whose body had been shattered by the Mountain Wrap Seal, and held their breaths as if they had seen a ghost. Dai Xiuwen, who was at the half-step Golden Core Stage, was killed by Chu Yunfan with a single finger. Wang Feihang, who was at the Golden Core Stage, was not any better.","He was killed in one move.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan did it using Dai Xiuwen’s divine art!","“H-How strong is he?!”","“This is terrifying. He managed to learn the Mountain Wrap Seal in such a short time!”","“Is he a monster?”","At this moment, even the experts of Grand Xia who had looked down on Chu Yunfan were completely dumbfounded. From all aspects, the strength that he displayed was dominating. He did not lose to the disciples of Grand Xia who thought themselves to be high and mighty. Even Wang Feihang, who had already stepped into the Golden Core Stage, was not a match for Chu Yunfan and was killed in one move. One could imagine how much shock this had caused them and completely overturned their worldview.","“He’s a monster... Can we defeat such a person?”","The originally confident experts began to question if they could defeat Chu Yunfan.","To the various forces in the Imperial Capital, this was undoubtedly a huge shock. When Xiang Feiyun and the others appeared, they thought that Chu Yunfan’s era had passed. The strength that he had displayed before was only at the peak of the Core Form Stage. Xiang Feiyun and the others were far more powerful than that.","They were from Grand Xia, which was at the peak of martial arts. Of course, these Grand Xia experts were much stronger than them. But now, they truly understood that Chu Yunfan’s era had not passed.","They simply could not understand Chu Yunfan’s strength. Before they knew it, he had already grown to the point where he could crush all the powerful enemies. Even though he was facing these experts of Grand Xia, Chu Yunfan’s performance was not bad.","“He’s so strong. As expected of the imperial advisor!”","“Hahaha, so what if these people are arrogant and don’t treat us as humans?”","“That’s right. They treated us like ants, but they’re still killed by the imperial advisor in one move!”","“I thought they were amazing, but now it seems that they are just so-so.”","“Don’t underestimate them. It’s not that they’re not strong enough. Any one of them can break through the defense of the Imperial Capital. Even a million elite troops are nothing to them.”","“The imperial advisor’s title as the number one person in the world is not just for show.”","The major forces in the capital had been suppressed to the point that they did not dare to speak. Compared to these people who did things unscrupulously and treated them like ants, even Chu Yunfan had not gone so far. They were naturally more willing to side with Chu Yunfan.","“Killing a Golden Core with one move. As expected of the number one.” Someone sighed.","Just as everyone was immersed in the shock of this move, they saw Chu Yunfan coldly sweep his gaze below and say, “Xiang Feiyun, are you still going to continue being a coward? Didn’t you kill my entire family just to force me to come to your door? Now that I’m here, do you dare to show up?”","Everyone’s spirits were shaken because they knew that the real battle was coming. This was an unprecedented battle. Chu Yunfan, who had displayed unprecedented and terrifying strength, had caused many changes in the battle that everyone had thought would not happen.","“Very well. Chu Yunfan, you’re courting death!”","Xiang Feiyun sneered and flew out. His face was ashen, and his lungs were about to explode. His face looked expressionless, but he was deeply angered by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was simply slapping him in the face. Killing in front of him, wasn’t this simply disrespecting him?","“You dare to kill someone in front of me. It seems that you’re really courting death!”","Xiang Feiyun flew out, and a group of young men followed behind him. Each of these young men had an imposing appearance and looked like dragons and phoenixes among men. Each of them was different from the others.","These people flew out collectively. Just the pressure alone was enough to scare the guts out of ordinary people.","“Who here is Guan Yi?” Chu Yunfan glanced at these people and did not even pay attention to Xiang Feiyun.","Following Chu Yunfan’s words, the experts of Grand Xia all focused their gazes on a square-faced young man. The young man in question cursed his stupid teammates. Wasn’t this exposing him to Chu Yunfan?","Before this, he didn’t care because he never thought anything of Chu Yunfan. But now, Chu Yunfan, who had killed two people in a row, gave him a huge sense of pressure.","“I’m Guan Yi. What do you want?” the square-faced youth shouted. Although his voice was deep, he unknowingly carried a tone of guilt in it.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze was like a sharp blade hanging above his head. “I heard that it was your idea to hang the heads of my family on the city wall,” he said with a cold expression.","“Sh*t!”","Guan Yi instantly felt as if he had fallen into an ice cave as if he was being targeted by a terrifying ancient beast. He had never felt this way before, but he trusted his instincts. This was a feeling of impending death. Instinctively, he stepped on a light beam and fled into the distance.","“Trying to leave? What a joke!”","Chu Yunfan’s body swayed slightly and disappeared from where he was.","“Oh no!”","Xiang Feiyun immediately realized what Chu Yunfan was going to do. He quickly tried to stop him. But with his speed, how could he stop Chu Yunfan?","He didn’t know when, but Chu Yunfan had already arrived in front of Guan Yi and looked at him with a cold smile.","“Die!”","Guan Yi roared. He was forced into a desperate situation. He slapped his palm at Chu Yunfan. This palm strike was earth-shattering and had great power. As the palm strike landed, Guan Yi’s face turned pale. He had burned his life force to unleash this attack."]},{"number":1587,"title":"Chapter 1587 Even Gods Would Be Terrified in the Face of Terrifying Slaughter","paragraphs":["1587 Even Gods Would Be Terrified in the Face of Terrifying Slaughter","Following his instincts, he made this decision immediately. His instincts told him that if he did not do this, he would die. Guan Yi instantly already burned his life force and attacked Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","The palm landed on Chu Yunfan’s body.","Guan Yi’s face flashed with joy, but before he could even think about it, the palm strike shattered inch by inch. It landed on Chu Yunfan, but it couldn’t do anything to him. It couldn’t even hurt him slightly.","“How is this possible?!” Guan Yi’s face was filled with disbelief. With his cultivation, he had burned his life force and attacked with all his might, but he couldn’t even break through Chu Yunfan’s defense.","Chu Yunfan sneered. How could his Imperial Physique be ordinary? He wouldn’t even frown when faced with an attack of this level.","‘How strong is his physical body?’ Guan Yi turned pale with fright. He wanted to escape, but there was no time.","Chu Yunfan had already made his move. It was just a simple slap. It looked like a simple attack, and there was no aura to it. The palm strike seemed slow but was actually fast. In an instant, it had already arrived in front of Guan Yi and struck his chest.","Bam!","Guan Yi let out a miserable cry as his body shattered, turning into a rain of blood. Another half-step Golden Core had died tragically.","Everyone was scared silly, especially the various forces in the Imperial Capital. When they saw this scene, they were in disbelief as if they had seen a ghost. Chu Yunfan had just appeared, and in just a short time, he had killed two half-step Golden Cores and one Golden Core. Any expert of this level could easily establish a powerful force in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, but now Chu Yunfan had killed them like ants.","Many people didn’t even know what had happened. Three experts of Grand Xia had died in a row. They finally understood what it meant to be unable to withstand a single blow. This was the true meaning of being unable to withstand a single blow.","“Invincible in the current era... The imperial advisor is truly invincible in the current era. He is not at a disadvantage even when facing these people from Grand Xia!”","Some people in the Imperial Capital were excited by Chu Yunfan’s strength, but at the same time, there were also some people who were anxious because of his strength. They had betrayed Chu Yunfan, betrayed Emperor Wei Wuji, and chose to join Xiang Feiyun and the others. The more powerful Chu Yunfan was, the more terrifying it was for them. Chu Yunfan’s strength meant that they might be punished.","“How is this possible? How are you so strong?” Wei Xingbang clutched his stomach, and there was a trickle of blood at the corner of his mouth. It was the result of Wang Feihang’s kick. He stared at Chu Yunfan, who was in mid-air, and wished he could tear Chu Yunfan into pieces. However, he knew that he could not do that. He didn’t have the right to intervene.","Wei Xingbang’s heart filled with panic. He had betrayed Wei Wuji, and he was the one who had single-handedly captured and executed everyone from the Chu family. Now that Chu Yunfan was back, Chu Yunfan undoubtedly would not let him go just like that. Thinking of this, he felt a chill run down his spine.","“How are you so strong? Why didn’t you die?”","Of course, Wei Xingbang’s nagging could not affect Chu Yunfan in the slightest. After killing Guan Yi in one move, he turned his gaze to Xiang Feiyun and the others. Chu Yunfan’s continuous attacks had completely destroyed the arrogance of these proud sons of heaven. In the depths of their eyes, there was even a hint of fear that even they themselves did not notice.","“It’s your turn next. One by one.” Chu Yunfan walked over leisurely. Every step he took seemed to be stepping on their hearts.","“You d*mn native!” Xiang Feiyun roared, “I will show you how big of a mistake you have committed! Today, you killed the people of Grand Xia. In the future, I will paint the Violet Thunder Sword Region with blood using your blood to pay for your arrogance!”","Xiang Feiyun’s eyes flashed with killing intent. Mana swept out like a tidal wave around his body, erupting with bursts of thunder.","Chu Yunfan shouted coldly. His body swayed slightly and disappeared from where he was. Then, he killed his way into the Grand Xia experts.","Someone who reacted quickly saw Chu Yunfan disappear from where he was. He immediately knew that something was wrong and quickly shouted. However, it was too late. Chu Yunfan had already arrived in front of him. A sword light swept out from Chu Yunfan’s fingertip and cut off his head.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with killing intent. Before he got here, Chu Hongcai had already filled him in. These people were all involved in the Chu family tragedy. They either participated in the planning or the operation. There was no exception. These people were clearly in cahoots with Xiang Feiyun. They probably never thought that they would be in trouble for killing some natives. They did not care about the people of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, nor did they treat them as humans.","Killing the entire Chu family just to force Chu Yunfan to show himself was something very normal in their eyes. If it wasn’t for their Marquis’ instructions, they wouldn’t even be interested in doing this. In their eyes, Chu Yunfan was an ant.","But now, Chu Yunfan’s sudden attack made them feel terrified. It made these people who thought they were gods realize that even gods would be terrified in the face of terrifying slaughter.","Chu Yunfan’s movements were fast and ruthless, and he was relaxed. All kinds of attacks swept out like mercury, and any one of them could take out a person. In just a few moments, those who had been showing off and wanted to take Chu Yunfan’s head to claim credit had all been killed.","Only Xiang Feiyun was left!"]},{"number":1588,"title":"Chapter 1588 Do You Know That Even the Heavens Are Afraid?","paragraphs":["1588 Do You Know That Even the Heavens Are Afraid?","“Chu Yunfan, You’ve gone too far!”","Xiang Feiyun was furious. How dare Chu Yunfan kill his people in front of him, and kill more than ten masters of Grand Xia. Although their relationship wasn’t that close, they had gathered together because of mutual interests.","Chu Yunfan’s actions were like a slap to his face, making him dizzy. If news of this were to spread to Grand Xia, who knew how big of a commotion it would cause? So many people had died here, and they had even looked down on the natives. This was something that had never happened before.","“You’re finished. Just wait to be killed!” Xiang Feiyun gritted his teeth. The divine power on his body was exploding.","“You brought this upon yourself.” Chu Yunfan looked at Xiang Feiyun coldly. “Didn’t you say that you like to kill people with backbones? What a coincidence, I like to kill people with backbones too. Let’s see how much you have.”","“You think you can kill me? Hahahahaha!” Xiang Feiyun was so angry that he laughed out loud. “I’m different from those pieces of trash!” Behind him, countless divine power boiled like a screen of light. That terrifying pressure enveloped the entire Imperial Capital.","A truly terrifying Golden Core!","Compared to Wang Feihang’s strength, Xiang Feiyun was superior. He had already entered the intermediate Golden Core Stage, and thus why these people say him as their leader.","“When you go to hell, don’t forget to tell the king of the underworld that the one who killed you was Xiang Feiyun from the Mountain Crusher Sect!” Xiang Feiyun shouted and rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","There was quite a distance between the two sides, but in just a moment, Xiang Feiyun had already rushed toward Chu Yunfan. This terrifying speed was almost unheard of.","“Mountain Crushers’ first move! Mountain Crusher!”","Xiang Feiyun shouted and threw a punch. In an instant, this punch carried a surging fist force that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","This was the famous punch technique of the Mountain Crushers. It was a move created by the founder of the sect. Even the sect’s two words were related to this move.","At Xiang Feiyun’s level of cultivation, it was easy for him to shatter a mountain into dust with a single punch.","“Die!”","Xiang Feiyun had a savage smile on his face. His right fist seemed to be wrapped in a huge mountain. Every punch was like a mountain smashing into the ground. It was shocking and terrifying.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan moved. He opened his palm and a large hand of spirit energy suddenly flew out, unexpectedly grabbing the fist force that was like a collapse of the sky.","“How is this possible?!”","Xiang Feiyun had felt smug earlier, and Chu Yunfan was simply courting death. He dared to receive his Mountain Crusher barehanded. He simply did not know the immensity of heaven and earth.","However, Xiang Feiyun immediately realized that his punch was easily caught by Chu Yunfan. The fist force that could destroy a mountain was shattered inch by inch under Chu Yunfan’s grasp. He simply could not imagine how a large hand of spirit energy could be cultivated to such a terrifying level.","“What Mountain Crusher? It’s just a third-rate martial art. So what if you know how to use it?” Chu Yunfan said coldly. He didn’t care about the Mountain Crusher in the slightest.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know how many world-shaking martial arts techniques were recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book in his mind. Each of them had supreme power. In his eyes, this Mountain Crusher was a joke.","“What did you say?!” Xiang Feiyun was furious. Not only did Chu Yunfan look down on him, but he also looked down on their sect’s supreme technique. His temper had always been horrid, and at this moment, he was even more furious.","Xiang Feiyun was stopped by Chu Yunfan, which made the major forces in the Imperial Capital surprised and happy. The forces that were closer to Chu Yunfan and Wei Wuji were pleasantly surprised. Chu Yunfan was so strong. He could easily take Xiang Feiyun’s attack. One could imagine how terrifying he was.","“The imperial advisor is indeed powerful. Even Xiang Feiyun is no match for him.”","“The imperial advisor is so mighty! Hahaha, we have hope!”","“D*mned Chu Yun, why aren’t you dead?!”","All the major forces in the Imperial Capital had their own thoughts. At this moment, the confrontation in the Imperial Capital continued.","Chu Yunfan asked indifferently, “I have no enmity with you. You aren’t targeting me just because of my so-called number-one title, are you?”","“I think your title is simply ridiculous in my opinion.” Xiang Feiyun sneered. His eyes rolled as he spoke, looking for Chu Yunfan’s weakness.","This confrontation made him completely put away his contempt for Chu Yunfan. There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan indeed had the strength to match him, enough to make him look sideways. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan stood there casually. He did not have much defense. It seemed that there were loopholes everywhere as if he did not know any martial arts.","However, Xiang Feiyun did not dare to believe his judgment. What kind of joke was this? If a terrifying existence who had killed more than a dozen half-step Golden Core and Golden Cores did not know martial arts, then was there anyone in the world who knew martial arts?","“But yes, there is indeed someone who wants you dead. As for who it is, you don’t need to know because there’s no need for a dead person to know so much!” Xiang Feiyun shouted coldly, “Compared to that person, you’re nothing but a speck of light against the splendor of the moon.”","Chu Yunfan nodded. It was as he had expected. Xiang Feiyun was not targeting him for no reason. There was someone else behind him.","“The light of the moon? You people have been high and mighty for too long and have probably forgotten that even if you treat yourself as the sky, the sky will tremble.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “I want to know who it is. Since you don’t want to tell me, I’ll capture you.”","“Capture me? You?”","As soon as Xiang Feiyun finished speaking, he disappeared from where he was. It turned out that what he had done just now was a smokescreen. In an instant, he had already appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. While Chu Yunfan was still talking, he had already made his move. He turned into a stream of light, like a bolt of lightning.","“Mountain Crushers’ second move, Earth Splitter!”"]},{"number":1589,"title":"Chapter 1589 Xiang Feiyun’s Death","paragraphs":["1589 Xiang Feiyun’s Death","The sound of thunder rang out, and the entire sky shook. This punch shattered everything. It pierced through the sky and hit Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","A huge explosion sounded, like the sound of metal colliding.","Xiang Feiyun’s punch had a power that ordinary people could not imagine. It truly reflected his mid-stage Golden Core cultivation level to the fullest. But what really surprised everyone was that Chu Yunfan did not move in the face of this punch that could shatter the earth. Even his clothes barely fluttered.","Chu Yunfan took Xiang Feiyun’s punch without even a change in his expression!","“Impossible!” Xiang Feiyun felt a terrifying force rebound through him. The force of his punch was rebounded by Chu Yunfan without moving. The strength of Chu Yunfan’s physical body was simply beyond his imagination. Even a person wearing middle-grade spirit armor would not dare to casually receive his attack because they would be heavily injured or even killed by the punch.","Blood seeped out of Xiang Feiyun’s fist. It was blood from the backlash. Chu Yunfan was too strong, so strong that it made him feel despair. Chu Yunfan had yet to enter the late-stage Golden Core Stage, but his combat strength made Xiang Feiyun feel terrified.","“I’ll kill you!” Xiang Feiyun roared angrily, his eyes bursting with terrifying killing intent.","Since entering the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, he had yet to suffer such a big loss. When had he ever been helpless against someone? However, he was no match for Chu Yunfan.","Xiang Feiyun once again called upon the divine power in his body. On his fist, a bronze glove appeared. It was a magic weapon. The patterns on the bronze gloves were extremely simple and unadorned, but it was suffused with a terrifying fluctuation of divine power. Many people could feel the immense pressure coming from the gloves. However, no one had seen him use these gloves before. No one knew how powerful they were.","“I want to smash you!” Xiang Feiyun roared angrily and rushed toward Chu Yunfan. “Mountain Crusher’s third style, Sky Collapser!”","Xiang Feiyun’s punch was several times more powerful than before.","‘This punch is too terrifying. Can the imperial advisor withstand it?’","This thought flashed through everyone’s minds. Xiang Feiyun was too strong in this state. He was at least several times stronger than before.","“Now this is more interesting.” Chu Yunfan was not moved in the slightest, and a cold smile appeared on his face.","In the eyes of others, this attack was unimaginably terrifying, but to him, it was nothing. In this state, Xiang Feiyun was only enough to make him look sideways.","“Eight Astonishing Fists!”","Chu Yunfan threw a punch. In an instant, eight phantoms appeared around him and the sound of chanting echoed throughout the sky. This punch shattered Xiang Feiyun’s attack and collided with Xiang Feiyun.","Boom!","A huge explosion sounded as if two huge mountains had collided.","The sky trembled. Facing Xiang Feiyun’s attack, Chu Yunfan did not show any weakness and fought back with his attack. Xiang Feiyun was blasted back a few steps, and he was almost thrown away. He felt his arms trembling as if he had hit an iron plate. Chu Yunfan looked slender and thin, but his strange strength was really shocking. With just one punch, Xiang Feiyun, who had erupted with all his strength, was blasted back.","“Again! I don’t believe this!”","Xiang Feiyun roared. He didn’t believe that Chu Yunfan could withstand him more than a few times. Or rather, he didn’t want to believe it.","“Mountain Crushers’ third style, Sky Collapser!” Xiang Feiyun punched out again, and the divine power in his body surged and boiled.","Chu Yunfan also used the Eight Astonishing Punches again.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","The entire sky trembled. Many people in the imperial capital looked at the two people in the sky in horror as if two gods were fighting in the sky. What was called overturning rivers and seas and shattering stars? This was probably it.","The experts in the Imperial Capital saw Xiang Feiyun constantly struggling to get up as he was sent flying by Chu Yunfan with a punch over and over. He was sent flying out of the Imperial Capital like a meteor. In the beginning, he could still resist, but as time passed, Xiang Feiyun lost the ability to do so.","Everyone saw that Xiang Feiyun was covered in blood as if he had been fished out of a pool of blood. His entire person was as ferocious and terrifying as a blood-red Asura. But in front of him, Chu Yunfan’s expression was calm and cold. He kept punching out the Eight Astonishing Punches, and every punch had earth-shattering power.","Bam!","Finally, Xiang Feiyun was sent flying. He crashed into a mountain peak, shattering it to pieces. His entire body sank into the mountain. At this moment, he was dizzy from Chu Yunfan’s series of attacks. He was covered in blood, and his body was covered in dense cracks. They were caused by Chu Yunfan’s punches. In the confrontation with Chu Yunfan, he was at a complete disadvantage. Even the bronze gloves that he regarded as his life-saving straw had been smashed into pieces by Chu Yunfan’s punches.","Xiang Feiyun was completely dumbfounded. His brain was filled with endless pain, and what was left was an incomparable shock. What kind of monster was this? To be able to shatter a spirit weapon with his bare hands? Such physical strength was extremely rare even in Grand Xia. Not to mention that he had discovered during the confrontation that Chu Yunfan was not in the Golden Core Stage but just in the Core Form Stage.","He was an intermediate Golden Core, but he was heavily injured by a Core Form ancient martial art practitioner. Before this, he never believed that such a thing would happen. But now, this had become a reality.","While his mind was running wild, Chu Yunfan had already arrived in front of him and asked, “Who sent you here? Tell me and I’ll grant you a quick death.”","“Go ask the ghosts if you want the answer.” Xiang Feiyun stared at Chu Yunfan. In an instant, endless energy surged out of the golden core in his body and he self-destructed."]},{"number":1590,"title":"Chapter 1590 Kill Them All!","paragraphs":["1590 Kill Them All!","Boom!","Xiang Feiyun was severely injured when he faced Chu Yunfan. This made everyone’s impression of Chu Yunfan instantly change. This imperial advisor was truly terrifying. Every once in a while, his strength would improve by leaps and bounds. This number one was definitely worthy of his name.","Many people had hope in their eyes. These experts from Grand Xia suppressed countless sects and factions, throwing the entire world into chaos. Since Great Wei had just experienced a revival, its strength should have been at its strongest. In the end, it was like the end of a dynasty. Groups of thieves were everywhere, causing disaster.","At this moment, everyone hoped that Chu Yunfan would stand up and pacify the world again. And now, he had shown enough strength to pacify the world. For a time, he became the hope of countless people.","The mushroom cloud slowly dissipated, revealing Chu Yunfan’s figure. Xiang Feiyun’s self-destruct was something that ordinary people, even if they were also intermediate Golden Cores, would not dare to take so carelessly. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He was so strong that he could withstand it with just his physical body.","Chu Yunfan was expressionless as he flew straight into the Imperial Capital. Not far away, Chu Hongcai was collecting the corpses of the Chu family while crying. The heads of the Chus were chopped off and hung on the city wall. Their corpses had been piled below the wall like a mass grave. The entire Chu family, including the household servants, made for thousands of corpses lying messily in the corner of the wall.","As soon as he flew into the Imperial Capital, Chu Yunfan saw a group of people had apprehended Wei Xingbang, who was dressed in ragged clothes. They approached him.","“Congratulations on your victory, Imperial Advisor.”","“Sir, this usurper tried to escape but we spotted him. We captured him and will allow you to deal with him.”","Chu Yunfan glanced at these people. They were the heads of noble families within the capital. A cold smile appeared on his face. These people had defected to the new emperor at the first moment. Now that they saw that the situation was not right, they turned back. It was not an exaggeration to say that they were fence-sitters. However, he was too lazy to argue with them right now. This was the way these so-called big families survived.","He looked at Wei Xingbang coldly. The current Wei Xingbang had nothing to do with his previous glory, and he looked like a stray dog.","“What do you have to say for yourself?” Chu Yunfan said.","“Chu Yunfan, I have nothing to say. I’m just hateful. Why can Wei Wuji be the emperor and I can’t?” Wei Xingbang stared at Chu Yunfan. He wanted to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces. “That’s right, I was the one who ordered the Chus to be killed. All of them were killed. Hahaha, I’m going to make your heart ache!” He roared crazily.","“Stubborn!” Chu Yunfan shouted coldly. He grabbed Wei Xingbang with a large hand made of spirit energy and turned him into a ball of flesh and blood. “The thief that caused trouble has been killed. The former emperor is dead, so the eldest living son of the former emperor should be appointed as the new emperor. Do you have any objections?” he asked.","“Of course not. This is the righteous path.” At this time, these dignitaries and powerful figures naturally did not object. They had been fence-sitters for a long time anyway.","“In addition, I want you to kill those who sided with Wei Xingbang. Kill all of them, leave not a single one of them left alive. There’s no need to report to me. I only want to see results.” Chu Yunfan issued a murderous order. He knew that this order would implicate many people and cause countless heads to fall to the ground.","But these people’s actions had completely touched Chu Yunfan’s bottom line, he could not bear it.","“Yes, sir!” these people agreed in unison and looked at each other. They knew that the Imperial City would be engulfed in a bloody storm. However, they had no other choice unless they didn’t want to live anymore.","After Chu Yunfan gave the order, he immediately turned around and left. He believed that after this battle, no one would turn a blind eye to his words. He had no intention of staying in the Imperial Capital.","At this moment, after this battle, it was clear that the capital would become the focus of the world. Xiang Feiyun and his group were not the only experts from Grand Xia. Moreover, Xiang Feiyun’s matter also made Chu Yunfan vigilant. Among the experts who came from Grand Xia, there were probably many experts. He wanted to understand more about the situation, especially what Grand Xia was like. Before he figured out the whole story, he did not want to become the target of public criticism.","When Chu Yunfan left the city, Chu Hongcai finished collecting the corpses of the Chus and placed them in his interspatial ring. Chu Yunfan stopped before Chu Hongcai with a serious expression and said, “I’ll leave you to handle the funerals.”","“The situation is complicated right now, and it’s not suitable to make a big deal out of it. Take everyone back to the ancestral mansion and wait for my word,” Chu Yunfan instructed.","Facing such an expert, no matter how many people there were, they would be useless.","“I’ll be going now.” Chu Hongcai didn’t delay any further. He turned around and stepped on the flying light, heading toward Conglong.","Chu Yunfan also stepped on the light and headed in another direction. Soon, he came to a big river. This was the place where he and Ye Qiushui had agreed to meet.","“You can come out now.”","As Chu Yunfan’s voice fell, an exquisite figure appeared. It was none other than Ye Qiushui.","“Why are only one of you here?” Chu Yunfan frowned as he looked at Ye Qiushui. “Where are the others?”","At this moment, he thought of something, and a killing intent flashed through his eyes."]},{"number":1591,"title":"Chapter 1591 News of the Fiancee","paragraphs":["1591 News of the Fiancee","Ye Qiushui sighed. “They didn’t want to come.”","This was especially true for people like them. They all treated the people of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain like natives, so how could they sincerely worship them? Previously, they had been beaten by Chu Yunfan until they had no choice but to lower their heads, but as long as there was the slightest chance, they would definitely escape.","It was because of this that Chu Yunfan had placed the Yin Yang Energy Sigil in their bodies. Who knew that even so, they would still choose to betray him? It wasn’t that he had not expected this, but he hadn’t expected them to choose to betray him so quickly.","“So, have they found a way to deal with my Yin Yang Energy Sigil?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Yes, they managed to find someone to seal your sigil with a sealing sigil.” Ye Qiushui nodded.","“No wonder.” Chu Yunfan sneered. Sealing sigils could seal almost everything in the world, but it would depend on how powerful they were. His Yin Yang Energy Sigil was no ordinary sigil. Back in the era of the emperors, there was once a top-notch expert who controlled countless experts to work for him. He was famous for relying on this Yin Yang Energy Sigil. Even the emperor had been planted with the Yin Yang Energy Sigil and had to obey obediently.","Later on, because of this, he aroused public anger. He was killed through the joint efforts of many emperors. In that battle, many emperors died, and his name shook the world. Later on, the method of planting the Yin Yang Energy Sigil fell into the Alchemy Emperor’s hands and was recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book.","If the emperor couldn’t escape from the Yin Yang Energy Sigil, let alone Lu Hongyuan and Cui Mingjie. They thought that they could use a sealing sigil to seal the Yin Yang Energy Sigil and avoid being controlled by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan thought these people had gone too far. Chu Yunfan’s strength could not be compared to that peerless master of old, but Lu Hongyuan and Cui Mingjie were not the kind of masters at the emperor level.","“They’re being naive!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Ye Qiushui glanced at Chu Yunfan. She didn’t know why he could still say such words at this time. She had seen the sealing sigils before, and it was enough to suppress everything.","“But if that’s the case, why didn’t you run?” Chu Yunfan asked Ye Qiushui.","“Because I’m different from them.” Ye Qiushui shook her head. “I’ll get straight to the point. Xiang Feiyun’s goal is to enter the Violet Thunder Sword Domain to find you. That is my goal too.”","“You’re looking for me?” Chu Yunfan looked at Ye Qiushui in astonishment. He didn’t know that Ye Qiushui was also here to look for him.","“Yes.” Ye Qiushui nodded. “I was also entrusted by someone to come here to find you.”","Chu Yunfan frowned slightly and was a little puzzled.","“My senior martial sister, Sister Tang, entrusted me with coming to the Violet Thunder Sword Domain to find you,” Ye Qiushui explained.","Chu Yunfan’s expression lit up. If it was someone else, he might still have some doubts, but if it was Tang Siyu, then everything made sense. No wonder Ye Qiushui didn’t run away. It turned out that she had another motive.","“But if that was the case, why didn’t you tell me earlier?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“I didn’t bring it up because there were too many people around. Moreover, you left too quickly, so I didn’t have the chance to say much to you,” Ye Qiushui said with a bitter smile.","“Since Siyu sent you, that means you’re one of us. There are some things I’d like to ask you,” Chu Yunfan said, “I’ve been searching for Siyu. I never expected her to have gone to Grand Xia. What happened?”","Chu Yunfan heaved a sigh of relief when he heard this. Although he did not know exactly what Grand Xia was like, it sounded like his fiancee was not in any danger there. On the contrary, she was in a high position.","Ye Qiushui continued, “‘Gushe Princess’ is one of the few titles in the world and isn’t usually conferred to women outside the imperial family. It is said that Sister Tang is a disciple of the eldest princess of Grand Xia. The eldest princess personally asked the emperor for the title.”","Then, Ye Qiushui continued to tell Chu Yunfan some things about Grand Xia. Only then did Chu Yunfan finally have a certain understanding of the place.","The power of the central government back in the Federation was extremely huge. Other sects and clans either had to rely on the Federation Government or hide far away from the territory of the Federation to survive. The strength of sects in Great Wei held more power than that, and they could even interfere with the government.","As for Grand Xia, it was a different model. The strength of sects was extremely powerful. In Grand Xia, there were there ten great sects. These ten sects controlled most of the power in Grand Xia. And the sect leaders of these ten sects were the ten kings of Grand Xia. Other than them, there were many other sect leaders who were also conferred with titles of nobility. In Grand Xia, the sects held great sway, and the empire was formed by the alliance of many sects.","Grand Xia was vast and boundless, and its national strength was incomparably powerful. Each sect was equivalent to a vassal kingdom, ruling over the vast territories of Grand Xia. Therefore, the power of the imperial family of Grand Xia was not as great as that of Great Wei’s. However, it was still not to be underestimated. It was considered quite good for Tang Siyu to be conferred the title of Princess Gushe. She could be considered to have a firm foothold in Grand Xia."]},{"number":1592,"title":"Chapter 1592 LI Qianyuan, the Marquis Huntian","paragraphs":["1592 LI Qianyuan, the Marquis Huntian","“The reason why Grand Xia invaded so openly is that the descendant of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, who had been hiding, was captured. He was forced to reveal the method to enter the Violet Thunder Sword Domain,” Ye Qiushui said, “Right now, there are 100 thousand cavalry waiting outside the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. Once the barrier is opened, the cavalry will march. When that happens, the entire Violet Thunder Sword Domain will fall.”","“Only 100 thousand?” Chu Yunfan frowned.","“Brother Chu, don’t underestimate this 100 thousand-strong army,” Ye Qiushui warned, “This army isn’t like the armies of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. It’s the army of Grand Xia. The ordinary people in this army are Divines, and for every 10-men team is a Core captain.”","Chu Yunfan suddenly felt like he was sucking in a breath of cold air. The 100,000 strong army was all Divines, and the captains were Cores. In other words, there were more than 10,000 Cores in this army.","Encountering such a large army, even he could only flee.","Although he knew that the strength of Grand Xia should be far above the various major powers in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, he did not expect it to be so strong. It was simply overwhelming. They were simply not on the same level.","Such an army was enough to sweep across the world. Even Chu Yunfan’s nuclear bombs would not be able to do anything to such an army. If tens of thousands of Cores joined hands to set up a barrier, even nuclear bombs would not be able to do anything to it. It was impossible to imagine that they could sweep through the tens of millions of troops of Jinzhanghan like before.","“With such a large army on the other side, we will not be able to escape...” Chu Yunfan suddenly realized that the fall of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain was imminent.","“But if that’s the case, why didn’t this army invade wantonly?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“The barrier of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain hasn’t been completely opened yet, and we’re here to scout the way. Many of these people, like Xiang Feiyun, are spies of the army. They will continuously report back with information about the Violet Thunder Sword Domain,” Ye Qiushui said.","“I want to know why Xiang Feiyun is targeting me. He seems to know my name. Who is behind this?” Chu Yunfan asked. If he had only guessed this before, then now he was completely sure that Xiang Feiyun was indeed targeting him, and there was someone else behind it.","“If I’m not wrong, it should be related to Marquis Huntian. The army that attacked the Violet Thunder Swords was led by a previous Marquis Huntian. If it’s him, then there’s no mistake,” Ye Qiushui said.","“Who is the current Marquis Huntian?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“He’s the number one expert of the younger generation under the imperial court of Grand Xia, Li Qianyuan. His strength is unfathomable, far beyond his peers,” Ye Qiushui said, “Based on what I know, he’s probably the strongest among the younger generation of Grand Xia. He has led troops to fight for Grand Xia all these years and has made great contributions. Different from the hereditary nobles, he’s the first person in our generation to be conferred the title of Marquis after ascending the ladder from the ground up. It was said that his strength had already surpassed the sect masters of some sects and that no one can match him.”","Ye Qiushui’s words caused Chu Yunfan’s frown to deepen. Based on what she said, Marquis Huntian’s strength was so strong that it was unimaginable in the Spirit Realm, surpassing some sect masters of Grand Xia. In other words, he was at least a sect master-level existence.","Originally, whether Marquis Huntian was powerful or not had nothing to do with him. However, this marquis was clearly coming for him, so he had no choice but to treat him seriously.","“This matter must be related to Sister Tang. As far as I know, after Sister Tang became the princess of the imperial court, she had many pursuers, and Li Qianyuan was one of them,” Ye Qiushui said.","When Chu Yunfan heard this, he couldn’t help but reveal a bitter smile. It turned out that it was because of Tang Siyu. He was afraid that Li Qianyuan knew about his existence from somewhere, so he had a murderous intention. That was why they sent people to find him and kill him.","This was probably Xiang Feiyun’s mission, but he probably never thought that Chu Yunfan was so powerful. Xiang Feiyun thought that victory was in his grasp, but in the end, he was killed by Chu Yunfan.","Moreover, from what Ye Qiushui said, Tang Siyu probably had many suitors in Grand Xia. Chu Yunfan’s troubles had just begun.","Ordinary people would be scared to death if they heard this, but Chu Yunfan did not retreat. His relationship with Tang Siyu had gone through many hardships, so how could he give up just like that?","Even if he was facing Li Qianyuan, who was known to have unfathomable strength.","“I don’t care who he is. Since he has touched my bottom line, I will make him pay the price!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with fierce killing intent. To force him out, Xiang Feiyun had killed the entire Chu family, and the culprit was Li Qianyuan.","Ye Qiushui looked at Chu Yunfan in astonishment. She didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to not be scared after hearing of Li Qianyuan. On the contrary, he burst out with such a strong killing intent. At this time, there was only one feeling in her heart, that was he was fearless. It was probably because Chu Yunfan didn’t know how terrifying Li Qianyuan was, that he dared to say such bold words.","If it was in Grand Xia, no one would dare to say such words.","Li Qianyuan was one of the few young masters in the world. He was known as the strongest genius in the past thousand years. His talent was so great that even the imperial court was shocked. It was said that he had a fortuitous encounter when he was very young. He was pecked by a white crane and later obtained an extremely powerful inheritance. At a young age, he was already famous in Grand Xia.","After he grew up, he joined the army of Grand Xia and led the army to battle. He killed countless enemies and became famous. This was how he became the first marquis of the younger generation of Grand Xia. If one wasn’t part of Grand Xia, one wouldn’t be able to imagine what kind of honor it was to become a marquis.","After becoming a marquis, one would join the true upper echelon of Grand Xia. They would decide everything for the trillions of citizens.","Therefore, in Ye Qiushui’s opinion, the reason why Chu Yunfan said such a thing was because he was ignorant and fearless."]},{"number":1593,"title":"Chapter 1593 The Origin Energy Fusion Array","paragraphs":["1593 The Origin Energy Fusion Array","In Ye Qiushui’s heart, Li Qianyuan was invincible among his peers. He could kill Cores like them single-handedly. In her opinion, Chu Yunfan’s words would never come true. Although she was surprised that Chu Yunfan could cultivate to such a level in such an environment, and was even stronger than most here, she was still surprised.","However, Chu Yunfan’s potential was just that. The gap between him and Li Qianyuan was like a natural chasm. Moreover, although Chu Yunfan was growing rapidly, Li Qianyuan was also growing rapidly. With the amazing potential that Li Qianyuan showed, no one would think that his potential was only at the level of a marquis.","Ye Qiushui didn’t dare to tell Chu Yunfan that there was even a rumor in Grand Xia that Li Qianyuan was the reincarnation of an emperor from ancient times and was therefore born with wisdom. When he cultivated, he could achieve twice the result with half the effort and advance a thousand miles at a time. Compared to ordinary people, he could not be mentioned in the same breath.","Chu Yunfan could see that Ye Qiushui didn’t believe him, but he didn’t care. From Ye Qiushui’s expression, he could deduce that Li Qianyuan’s strength was far above the Core Stage, far more powerful than his. However, this did not mean that he did not have the ability to catch up from behind.","He was young, but he had experienced countless battles. Countless people who were known as top geniuses had died in his hands. Moreover, when he thought of the tragic deaths of the Chu family, the anger was like ten thousand insects devouring his heart.","“Brother Chu, as far as I know, Lu Hongyuan and Cui Mingjie have already gathered a group of people and are on their way. We can’t stay here for long,” Ye Qiushui said.","Lu Hongyuan and Cui Mingjie didn’t hide these things from her. They probably didn’t expect her to turn to Chu Yunfan. After all, in their opinion, Ye Qiushui should be on the same side as them, so she wouldn’t tell Chu Yunfan about it.","“It’s fine. I want to see what methods they have.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Brother Chu, don’t take this lightly. Lu Hongyuan and Cui Mingjie were unable to deal with your sigil, but they managed to suppress it with the help of another person. You should have heard of this person. He’s the successor of the Flying Star Temple, Liang Ruicai,” Ye Qiushui said.","“Are you talking about Liang Ruicai, the one who single-handedly destroyed Great Qi?”","Chu Yunfan was stunned, having heard of this name. Right now, the entire Violet Thunder Sword Domain was in a mess. There was no order. The biggest reason was that the capitals of the two great kingdoms, Great Wei and Great Qi, had been breached.","The person who broke into the capital of Great Wei was Xiang Feiyun. He had destroyed the rule of the capital of Great Wei State single-handedly. And there was also such an existence in Great Qi, and it was even more powerful than Xiang Feiyun. It was Liang Ruicai, the successor of the Flying Star Temple.","This person had single-handedly defeated all the major forces of Great Qi. Then, he had attacked the capital of Great Qi at lightning speed, defeated the million strong army of Great Qi, captured the emperor of Great Qi alive, and brought the entire imperial court of Great Qi under his command.","This man had created a legend.","In the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, this was unprecedented. When Chu Yunfan changed the ruling hands in Great Wei, he had gathered a million troops in the name of Wei Wuji. One could imagine how much of a sensation it would cause when Liang Ruicai and Xiang Feiyun destroyed a kingdom by themselves.","At this point, everyone in the world realized how powerful a top-notch expert could be.","“That’s right. The reason why he didn’t rush over immediately was because he was waiting for Liang Ruicai to bring his men to surround you, Brother Chu,” Ye Qiushui said.","“How strong is Liang Ruicai compared to Xiang Feiyun?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Definitely stronger. Xiang Feiyun is only at the intermediate Golden Core Stage while Liang Ruicai has already entered the late Golden Core Stage a long time ago,” Ye Qiushui said, “Brother Chu, Liang Ruicai ordered all the major forces of Great Qi to pay tribute to him with all kinds of treasures. Do you know what he wants to do?”","“What is he trying to do?” Chu Yunfan had also received similar information, but he did not pay much attention to it before. Now that he thought about it, Liang Rui had ordered all the forces in Great Qi to hand over all the spirit stones and treasures in the sect’s inventory. If they did not comply or were found to have not handed over all of them, they would be exterminated.","The various major forces in Great Qi complained endlessly, but they did not dare to disobey. Otherwise, they were easily exterminated.","Liang Ruicai wasn’t from the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, and he didn’t plan to develop himself in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain in the future. Therefore, he didn’t care about the long-term development here and ordered the various major forces to hand over all the stocks they had accumulated over the years.","“He wants to break through. He set up a large array outside the imperial capital. This array is called the Origin Energy Fusion Array,” Ye Qiushui said.","“So it’s the Origin Energy Fusion Array.” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with realization.","“Brother Chu, do you know about this array?” Ye Qiushui looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. She had not expected Chu Yunfan to know about it. She had spent a lot of effort to get some rough information about the Origin Energy Fusion Array.","This was an ancient array. Even in Grand Xia, not many people knew about it. She did not expect Chu Yunfan to know about it.","“Of course I do. The Origin Energy Fusion Array can refine all kinds of treasures into a kind of energy that can fuse origin energy. It’s very beneficial for cultivators. Once they refine it, their cultivation will advance by leaps and bounds.”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up as he spoke. Of course, he knew about the Origin Energy Fusion Array. It was recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. However, it was not easy to set up this Origin Energy Fusion Array. Not only did it consume a lot of treasures, but it also required a huge amount of spirit stones to set up.","The Alchemy Emperor’s records in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book did not care about the Origin Energy Fusion Array because the cost-performance ratio was too low. Such a huge amount of resources would only help one person or maybe a few people. It was not worth it.","Ordinary forces wouldn’t dare to set up the Origin Energy Fusion Array even if they obtained it. This was like draining the pond to catch the fish, forcibly digging out the foundation. However, Liang Ruicai didn’t care about this in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. He unscrupulously plundered all kinds of resources for himself because he regarded the living beings in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain as ants."]},{"number":1594,"title":"Chapter 1594 Kill Him Like Stepping on an Ant","paragraphs":["1594 Kill Him Like Stepping on an Ant","“That’s right. You really do know about this array, Brother Chu,” Ye Qiushui said as she nodded. “In fact, Liang Ruicai isn’t the only one who built the Origin Energy Fusion Array. There were several other powerful masters behind him. They are even more powerful than Liang Ruicai. They built the Origin Energy Fusion Array and plundered the resources in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain to break through to the Core Stage.”","Chu Yunfan nodded, feeling enlightened. “But if that’s the case, why is Liang Ruicai the only one who came forward?” he asked in confusion.","“Because Liang Ruicai is the weakest among all of them. The others are all searching for the Violet Thunder Swords’ legacy and can’t spare any time to do this,” Ye Qiushui said.","“Liang Ruicai isn’t the only one who represents them. Now that you’ve killed Xiang Feiyun, Brother Chu, I’m afraid these people will notice you.”","Chu Yunfan thought these people probably didn’t care about the experts in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. They regarded the experts here as ants. However, now that many experts, including Xiang Feiyun, had been killed by Chu Yunfan, it was hard to guarantee that these people would not feel that they were united against a common enemy.","In particular, these people were all extremely powerful. Liang Ruicai alone was at the late Golden Core Stage. In terms of combat strength, he was even stronger than Chu Yunfan. Although Chu Yunfan was confident in protecting himself, it was impossible for him to defeat Liang Ruicai. Not to mention the experts that Ye Qiushui mentioned were stronger than Liang Ruicai.","“It’s best we leave now,” Ye Qiushui said, “I came here on Sister Tang’s orders to bring you back to Grand Xia. As for the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, it’s only a matter of time before it falls. When that happens, this domain will become a part of Grand Xia’s territory.","“I’ve already arranged for people to receive us outside. When the time comes, as long as we set up a teleportation array near the barrier, we can teleport to Grand Xia. We don’t have to use the teleportation array of the imperial court’s army,” Ye Qiushui advised earnestly.","Chu Yunfan knew that Ye Qiushui was fully prepared. According to her, he should be able to leave the Violet Thunder Sword Domain as soon as possible and enter Grand Xia, just in time to avoid Li Qianyuan.","It was only a matter of time before the Violet Thunder Sword Domain lost its control. Against the powerful Grand Xia, the Violet Thunder Sword Domain had no chance of winning. The only thing that made Chu Yunfan feel slightly relieved was that Grand Xia did not intend to uproot the various forces in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. Instead, they planned to bring them under their own rule.","In that case, it would not cause the lives of the people to be plunged into misery.","However, he was unwilling to leave so easily.","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment, then said, “We don’t have to be in a hurry to leave. There’s a huge opportunity in front of us now. How about it? Do you want to reach the Golden Core Stage?”","“The Golden Core Stage?” Ye Qiushui’s exquisite face changed. Her breathing began to become rapid, and her voluptuous chest heaved up and down.","How could she not want to reach the Golden Core Stage? That was a level that she dreamed of reaching. For people of their generation, except for freaks like Li Qianyuan, most of them were still struggling in the Core Stage. Being in the Golden Core Stage made them one of the best. To be able to step into the Golden Core Stage, even among fellow disciples, they would be far ahead.","However, although it sounded easy to advance from the half-step Golden Core Stage to the Golden Core Stage, in reality, who knew how many people were stuck at this stage. On the path of cultivation, there weren’t many times where one could be brave and advance. If they couldn’t make a breakthrough quickly at their age, then their future achievements would be limited. Breaking through even a day earlier was of great significance to them.","However, Ye Qiushui suddenly thought of something. She looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “Brother Chu, are you talking about the Origin Energy Fusion Array?”","Chu Yunfan smiled and nodded. “The array has been completed. The fused origin energy inside is a great supplement for cultivators. Now that the other masters are not here, and Liang Ruicai has come all the way here to kill me, it means that the array should be left empty. As long as Liang Ruicai is not personally guarding it, even if there is a martial artist like Xiang Feiyun, they will not be able to withstand a single blow from me. This is an unprecedented opportunity.","“As the saying goes, if you don’t take what the heavens give you, you will be in chaos.” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed. “Since Liang Ruicai wants to kill me, then I’ll cut off his roots. He wants to break through, right? I just have to cut off his chance.”","Ye Qiushui gasped. She knew that if this plan was successful, it would be a fatal blow to Liang Ruicai. He had racked his brains to think of a way to get to the Violet Thunder Sword Domain first so that he could set up the Origin Energy Fusion Array and use the fused origin energy to supplement his body so that he could break through to the peak of the Golden Core Stage or even one step further, the Transcendent Core Stage.","In their generation, only existences above the Transcendent Core Stage were qualified to be famous in the world and valued by the elders of a sect. That was a completely different world. Once Chu Yunfan seized the fused origin energy, he would become the target of public criticism. The experts would not let him off.","But on second thought, wasn’t he already the target of public criticism? Isn’t it still the same?","“But if we do that, I’m afraid we will have to fight Liang Ruicai to the death,” Ye Qiushui said worriedly.","“What’s there to be afraid of? When I snatch the fused origin energy and my cultivation advances, it’s hard to say who will kill who. When that time comes, I’ll kill him like stepping on an ant.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Peerless geniuses were nothing in front of him, and he had killed more than one or two people who had surpassed his level.","“How about it? If you don’t dare to fight, then forget it,” Chu Yunfan said as he glanced at Ye Qiushui.","Ye Qiushui gulped. She knew that Chu Yunfan wanted to give her great fortune for Tang Siyu’s sake. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have brought her along. Stepping into the Golden Core Stage was a huge temptation for her. However, this temptation was a poison wrapped in sugar. Once she joined forces with Chu Yunfan, she would have to go against everyone else.","The risk was unimaginable.","After a while, she nodded solemnly and said, “Thank you for your guidance, Brother Chu. I’m willing to give it my all.”","“Good.” Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction and then disappeared with Ye Qiushui in a flash of light."]},{"number":1595,"title":"Chapter 1595 Take His Head to Obtain the Reward","paragraphs":["1595 Take His Head to Obtain the Reward","Not long after Chu Yunfan and Lin Qiushui left, a group of people arrived on light beams. These people were dressed in gorgeous robes and had arrogant expressions.","“Did he not come?”","The leader was a young man with a strong build and handsome face. He was Liang Ruicai, who had swept through Great Qi and suppressed the entire kingdom.","“I guess so. He couldn’t have gotten the news that Ye Qiushui didn’t want to join us. Did she maybe tell him about this?” a young man wondered.","“That’s impossible,” Cui Mingjie, standing among this group, said. “The Yin Yang Energy Sigil was also planted in her body. If she’s smart, she wouldn’t have told Chu Yunfan.”","Everyone nodded. No matter how they looked at it, Ye Qiushui would not tell Chu Yunfan. In other words, none of them thought highly of Chu Yunfan, a native, not to mention that Ye Qiushui was also planted with the Yin Yang Energy Sigil. No matter how they looked at it, she should be on the same side as them. In their opinion, it was impossible for her to join forces with a native.","“That’s right. We all want to kill Chu Yunfan. How could she possibly have joined him?” Lu Hongyuan added. He didn’t believe that Ye Qiushui would betray them.","“But speaking of which, you guys are useless. You allowed yourself to be marked by a native,” a young man in a luxurious robe said as he looked at Cui Mingjie with an admonishing expression.","Cui Mingjie and Lu Hongyuan’s expressions turned ugly. It was a great humiliation for them to be marked by Chu Yunfan. They would probably follow them for the rest of their lives. To suppress the sigil, they had no choice but to ask Liang Ruicai and the others for help. This matter would probably spread to the whole world very soon. They would never be able to wash away this shame unless they found Chu Yunfan and killed him.","“Don’t underestimate him. His strength is extraordinary, and most importantly, he has a hou by his side. We weren’t defeated by him, but by the hou,” Cui Mingjie said in his defense, his face going slightly red.","“Hahaha, you’re just looking for reasons to be weak.”","These young men burst into laughter. In their eyes, Cui Mingjie and Lu Hongyuan were just trying to wash away their shame by making up stories.","“Hous have been extinct for centuries. Not even one can be found in Grand Xia, so how could one possibly exist here?”","These people didn’t believe there had been a hou at all. In their eyes, it was just a cover Cui Mingjie and Lu Hongyuan were trying to pull.","“We aren’t lying. He did have a hou with him!” Lu Hongyuan said indignantly.","“You guys don’t need to make up stories. According to the information we received, Chu Yunfan never had a hou with him,” another young man mocked Cui Mingjie and Lu Hongyuan.","Their faces flushed red and were furious, but they could not find any evidence to support their argument. From the information they had collected, Chu Yunfan indeed had no connection with the hou, but they had clearly been defeated by a terrifying hou.","Although these people were their temporary companions, they had their conflicts and didn’t get along well with each other back in Grand Xia. Now that they had seized the opportunity, they naturally tried their best to mock Cui Mingjie and Lu Hongyuan.","Cui Mingjie and Lu Hongyuan shut up. They knew that they weren’t lying, but these people thought that they were talking nonsense. When they met Chu Yunfan’s hou, they would know how powerful it was. Thinking of this, they hoped that Chu Yunfan could teach these people a lesson and let them know that it was not that they were too weak, but that the opponent was too strong.","“It doesn’t matter whether Ye Qiushui betrayed us or not,” Liang Ruicai said coldly, “Since Chu Yunfan didn’t appear here, he probably doesn’t dare to. If he dares to appear, I’ll kill him.”","Liang Ruicai didn’t take Cui Mingjie and Lu Hongyuan’s words seriously. The hou was a terrifying existence that was ranked at the top of the beast list in ancient times. When one appeared, it was usually followed by a barren land of a thousand miles. It was normal for it to turn an entire world into its food.","However, they had not received any news about a hou. It was clear that this was a mistake on their part. Liang Ruicai even speculated that the two of them had mistaken another creature for a hou. After all, a monster might have the bloodline of a hou, so it was not impossible for them to look like one.","“But what Cui Mingjie said isn’t without reason. Although Chu Yunfan is only a native, he is clearly different from the others. Even Xiang Feiyun died at his hands.”","Liang Ruicai paused for a moment and then said, “Have all the forces under your control spread out their spies. We have to find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. I heard that Marquis Huntian is also offering a reward for his head. Xiang Feiyun lost his life because he went to find trouble with Chu Yunfan.”","Liang Ruicai did not take Chu Yunfan seriously. He thought it was Xiang Feiyun who was stupid. What was so great about him? Among their group, there were several people who were stronger than Xiang Feiyun. Their strength was far above his.","Liang Ruicai would kill Chu Yunfan once he appeared. Then, he would go to Li Qianyuan, Marquis Huntian, to get his reward.","Though they were proud geniuses, when Li Qianyuan was mentioned, everyone’s face changed. He was a terrifying existence that they had to look up to. His cultivation might be even more terrifying than their sect master and elders.","Within their generation, he was a legend. He was not someone they could compare to.","“That’s right. We’ll take his head and get the reward.” A young man’s eyes burned brightly.","“Marquis Huntian has never been stingy with his subordinates. It’s time for our luck to change, hahahaha!”","“This is a pie that fell from the sky!”"]},{"number":1596,"title":"Chapter 1596 What It’s Like to Draw Water With a Holey Bucket","paragraphs":["1596 What It’s Like to Draw Water With a Holey Bucket","The imperial capital of Great Qi was the center of the kingdom. It was also the center of the world in the hearts of the people of Great Qi. For those who had never left this place, it was the center of the world. The towering city walls were as boundless as a mountain range.","Countless defensive barriers were flashing with a faint light around the basin, and in the middle of this defensive barrier was an incomparably huge array. It was like an incomparably huge vortex that was stirring rapidly.","In the distance, countless carriages of all kinds of natural treasures were transported here. Then, martial arts experts threw these natural treasures into the array. After a while, they turned into orange-yellow energy and occupied the array. Countless spirit stones were also thrown into the surroundings of the array, continuously providing energy to the array.","Around this formation, countless soldiers of Great Qi’s Imperial Army were standing guard, protecting this array. Countless martial arts experts looked at this array from afar, their faces full of pain and indignation. This array was like a bottomless pit that swallowed the entire national strength of Great Qi. Due to this incident, Great Qi had suffered a heavy blow.","For a cultivator kingdom such as theirs, money was nothing. The real strategic resources were spirit stones and heavenly treasures. These were the items that provided Great Qi with an endless stream of powerful martial artists and maintained the operation of the entire kingdom.","However, the strength of Great Qi had been drained all of a sudden, and it would take fifty years for it to recover.","However, they did not dare to step forward to stop this. They all thought of the demon-like figure, the terrifying existence who had single-handedly beaten Great Qi into submission. No one dared to disobey such an existence, because those who dared to disobey were already dead. Their families were exterminated, and their sects and forces were all executed. Therefore, even if they were dissatisfied, they did not dare to show it.","At this moment, they thought of another brother in distress, the Great Wei.","Previously, they had thought of ways to prevent the invasion of Great Wei. However, with the invasion of Grand Xia, Great Wei and Great Qi instantly went from being on guard against each other to being brothers in distress.","Great Qi fell into the hands of the experts of Grand Xia. However, Great Wei was not in a better state. Their capital was also breached and their army was defeated. But when they thought of Great Wei, a hint of envy flashed through these experts’ eyes.","This was because Great Wei had a rare kingdom guardian, Chu Yunfan.","From the news they had just received, Great Wei’s imperial advisor had suddenly appeared and killed Xiang Feiyun and the others who had caused trouble in one fell swoop, ending the chaos in Great Wei. Although the order in the various parts of Great Wei had not been restored, it was still better than the chaotic and disorderly situation in Great Qi.","These experts of Grand Xia had no intention of ruling the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. They didn’t care about the hearts of the people in it. They only wanted to plunder and would plunder all the resources they could. Sustainable development was not within their consideration in the slightest.","And Great Qi didn’t have a hero who could stop this catastrophe. They could only watch from afar and did not dare to go forward.","Suddenly, just as they were filled with grief and indignation, they saw three figures break through the sky in the distance. They seemed to be stepping on lightning and had arrived at the edge of the Origin Energy Fusion Array.","“What is that?” someone exclaimed.","Everyone focused their eyes and saw that the light had dissipated. At the edge of the array, three figures stood tall in the sky. The leader was a young man in black clothes with a delicate face. He looked around 20 years old, but his body carried an unfathomable aura. Beside him was a young girl who looked like she was in her teens. Her face was exquisite, like a fairy from heaven. And lastly, a young man around the age of 20 followed closely behind.","“That looks like Chu Yunfan!”","Someone broke the silence with a cry of surprise. Immediately, everyone was in an uproar.","“Yes, it’s him! I’ve seen drawings of him before!”","Chu Yunfan was probably here for this Origin Energy Fusion Array. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have appeared here.","Many people suddenly thought of this point. Liang Ruicai had been guarding the edge of the Origin Energy Fusion Array. Even if there were some people in Great Qi who resisted and rose up in revolt, there would be other experts from Grand Xia to deal with them. Although these experts were far inferior to Liang Ruicai, they were many times stronger than the people in Great Qi.","Now, Liang Rui had left the capital of Great Qi because he wanted to kill Chu Yunfan. Now, Chu Yunfan had appeared at the edge of the Origin Energy Fusion Array, so it was hard not to think that way.","“If that’s what’s happening, that’s great news. Although I didn’t like Chu Yunfan in the past, I support him now.”","“That’s right. It’ll also allow Liang Ruicai to experience what it means to draw water with a holey bucket.”","The experts of the various major forces changed their attitudes and supported Chu Yunfan.","The three people in the sky were Chu Yunfan, Ye Qiushui, and Chu Hongcai.","Chu Yunfan had called Chu Hongcai over because he wanted to destroy the Origin Energy Fusion Array, and Chu Hongcai was the only person he was close to in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. In the chaotic world of the future, Chu Hongcai would not be able to stand firmly without strength, so Chu Yunfan wanted to help improve his strength.","“How dare you! Who dares to covet the array?! How dare you!””","Suddenly, a huge ferocious beast charged out of the array. A terrifying pressure swept over from all directions."]},{"number":1597,"title":"Chapter 1597 Shocking Thunder Abilities","paragraphs":["1597 Shocking Thunder Abilities","It was a mountain-like beast with pitch-black scales all over its body. There was a horn on its head that was several meters long. Terrifying energy was brewing in this horn.","As soon as this ferocious beast appeared, the terrifying aura it brought with it formed a frenzy that suppressed the experts of the various large factions in Great Qi.","It was a Golden Core monster!","Many people felt uncomfortable and cold at the thought of it. Just this beast alone could kill all of them. Compared to ordinary human martial artists, monsters of the same level were more powerful and difficult to deal with.","Chu Yunfan was a little taken aback. He had not expected Liang Ruicai to leave a Golden Core monster at the array while out chasing him. With the strength of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, this beast was absolutely foolproof.","“Brother Chu, be careful. This monster is from Grand Xia. It’s called the One-Horn Mountain Suppressor Beast. It specializes in earth-type divine abilities and is extremely powerful,” Ye Qiushui warned Chu Yunfan.","Ye Qiushui looked at the Mountain Mountain Suppressor with fear. Although she had never seen it before, it did not prevent her from knowing about its existence. Just this beast was an existence that she could not match up to.","The Mountain Mountain Suppressor was clearly intelligent. After looking at Ye Qiushui, it suddenly said, “You b*tch. You’re colluding with the natives to seize the array. Do you know that this is a capital crime?”","The Mountain Mountain Suppressor’s aura was released, and it was like a landslide. Ye Qiushui was forced to retreat, and a trace of blood seeped out from the corner of her mouth. Though she was a half-step Golden Core, she was still injured by the Mountain Mountain Suppressor’s aura.","Chu Hongcai felt as if Mount Tai was pressing down on him. Although the Mountain Mountain Suppressor wasn’t targeting him, he still felt an extremely huge pressure.","“A capital crime? Just you? Tsk, tsk!” Chu Yunfan sneered. “You should have stayed hidden. To appear in front of me is to court death.”","“How dare you!” The Mountain Mountain Suppressor let out a furious roar, its voice as loud as a bell. “You must be Chu Yunfan. Although you’re considered pretty good among the natives, if you go against Grand Xia, you will die. Now, if you obediently surrender, I may spare your life.”","“Hahahaha, you want me to surrender? Such a person had yet to be born in this world!” Chu Yunfan laughed, unafraid in the slightest.","His gaze swept across the Mountain Mountain Suppressor. He could feel the power of this beast. It had probably already entered the intermediate Golden Core Stage. Compared to Xiang Feiyun, who had also been in the intermediate Golden Core Stage, this Single-Horned Mountain Mountain Suppressor Beast was clearly at least twice as strong. Its huge body was not for nothing. On the contrary, this made the beast’s physique and divine power much stronger than humans.","Of course, no matter how strong the beast was, it was no stronger than Chu Yunfan. Unless it had entered the late Golden Core Stage, Chu Yunfan would not find it a problem.","“If you don’t get out of my way, don’t blame me for being ruthless.”","“You’re going to be ruthless to me?” The Mountain Suppressor sneered and immediately swiped at Chu Yunfan with its claws. Its huge claws were thicker than Chu Yunfan’s entire body. It was extremely fast, and it grabbed at Chu Yunfan. The beast’s claws were sharp, and the light it produced was like a sword light. It was like five sword lights that slashed down at Chu Yunfan on the spot.","“You’re pretty quick.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","The Mountain Suppressor was extremely fast. In addition, it was a sudden attack. If an ordinary person was not careful, they might fall into its trap. However, Chu Yunfan was no ordinary person.","At that moment, a pair of wings formed from thunder rose from Chu Yunfan’s back. It sent out a terrifying lightning storm and protected him.","Clang!","The beast’s claw swept out and grabbed onto the thunder wings. A sound like the sound of metal colliding erupted.","The Mountain Suppressor instantly felt that Chu Yunfan was difficult to deal with. Although it was a monster, with its cultivation, it was like a martial arts grandmaster whenever it attacked. This beast had a unique understanding of many martial arts and was definitely not a brainless beast. However, this move that contained all of its martial will that was fast and swift could not do anything to Chu Yunfan. This made it very surprised.","Chu Yunfan made his move. Behind him, the huge thunder wings slashed down like two blades, counter attacking the Mountain Suppressor. Dense earth energy appeared from the beast’s horn and transformed into clouds that wrapped around it.","However, it was completely useless against Chu Yunfan. It was torn apart by Chu Yunfan’s lightning wings that then slashed at the beast like two blades.","Slice! Slice!","It was as if two saber lights had landed on the beast’s body, instantly tearing apart its protective scales. Fresh blood splattered everywhere. In the blink of an eye, the One-Horn Mountain Suppressor Beast was severely injured.","The beast’s earth-type divine abilities were no match for Chu Yunfan’s thunder-type divine abilities.","Chu Yunfan raised his arm high up, and the sky swirled. Clouds formed, and in the clouds, countless lightning bolts surged. The lightning gathered together, forming an incomparably huge lightning beast. As soon as this lightning beast appeared, it gave everyone a huge pressure. It was as if a ferocious beast from ancient times had awakened.","Even Ye Qiushui’s expression became solemn when she saw this scene. Although she knew that Chu Yunfan was strong, what really made her afraid was the hou. Chu Yunfan’s previous attack was only a fleeting slap. She never knew that he had such amazing lightning divine abilities. As soon as this lightning beast appeared, her expression changed drastically."]},{"number":1598,"title":"Chapter 1598 Killing the One-Horn Mountain Suppressor Beast","paragraphs":["1598 Killing the One-Horn Mountain Suppressor Beast","Thunder divine abilities were one of the most powerful divine abilities!","In Grand Xia, many people’s martial arts contained thunder energy. However, that was martial arts. Martial arts were martial arts, and divine abilities were divine abilities. They were not the same.","What was a divine ability? It was to do something completely inconceivable and against common sense. That was a divine ability. For example, humans flying through the sky without wings was a kind of divine power. They could go through water, fire, heaven, and earth.","The power of thunder divine abilities had always been endless, but not many people could use it. This was because the requirements for one’s physique were very high, and the requirements for thunder energy were very high.","Usually, demons were the ones born with lightning divine powers. Very few humans had this ability. A long time ago, monsters dominated the world with all kinds of divine powers. That was the ability bestowed by their innate bloodline. Martial arts were different. They were acquired powers.","In a sense, there were divine abilities before martial arts, and the essence of martial arts was to achieve similar effects to divine powers through mana and various cultivation techniques.","One was innate and the other was acquired!","Martial arts had developed to an extremely prosperous point. It was not necessarily inferior to divine abilities. Most importantly, although martial arts emphasized talent, it was not differentiated by bloodline.","However, divine powers depended more on the individual’s physique. There were very few such people in the human race. Once they appeared, they would be geniuses of the generation.","Chu Yunfan was able to summon a lightning beast with ease. This proved that he had the talent to use lightning divine abilities, and it was very shocking. Based on this, as long as Chu Yunfan could grow up smoothly, his future would be limitless.","Ye Qiushui was curious. She didn’t know what kind of background Chu Yunfan had. Logically speaking, the Violet Thunder Sword Domain’s martial arts had regressed for many years. How could such a true dragon appear?","In Grand Xia, Chu Yunfan’s strength was not the most outstanding, but if one looked at his age and the environment he was in, it was very shocking.","It wasn’t that she hadn’t investigated him. Chu Yunfan was famous all over the world, and it wasn’t difficult to find out some information about him. He wasn’t born to any powerful faction. A faction like the one in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain was nothing in her eyes. He was just a descendant of a small marquis family. He didn’t have any shocking background, but he had shocked everyone. If he was given more time, the level he could reach was simply unimaginable.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know that Ye Qiushui had thought all this after seeing him use a thunder technique. At this moment, the divine power in his body was circulating rapidly, continuously turning into the thunder power.","He had never used this move before.","It was a thunder technique recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. It was called Thunder Qilin. Qilins were auspicious beasts. There were Qilins of various attributes. This thunder technique used the one’s thunder power to summon the spirit of a Qilin, and then kill the enemy with one strike.","This move had three levels, namely world descent, tribulation, and world destroyer. Chu Yunfan could only use the Thunder Qilin World Descent at the moment. Even so, this was because he had the Thunderclap Physique and was imbued with an amazing affinity for thunder.","A person who possessed the bloodline of thunder divine abilities would have to be above the Core Stage to be able to use the first level of descent. And the Thunderclap Physique was one of the best among the many thunder bloodline physiques.","Coincidentally, the creator of this move, the Thunder Emperor, also possessed the Thunderclap Physique. That was why Chu Yunfan was able to use the Thunder Qilin World Descent with his Core Form Stage cultivation.","Even so, Chu Yunfan could feel that he could no longer control the divine power in his body. Upon using this divine power, it was immediately absorbed into the sky and turned into the huge Thunder Qilin.","Chu Yunfan was testing to what extent he could unleash it.","“Qilin, descend!”","Chu Yunfan roared and waved his arm. The Thunder Qilin in the sky was like a ferocious beast that couldn’t hold back anymore. It roared and rushed down. After absorbing the last bit of Chu Yunfan’s divine power, the Thunder Qilin rushed toward the One-Horn Mountain Suppressor Beast with lightning speed. It was so fast that in the blink of an eye, the huge Thunder Qilin had charged at the equally huge Mountain Suppressor.","All of this took a long time to describe but it had only been a short moment since Chu Yunfan had used the Thunder Qilin.","The Mountain Suppressor was extremely wary of Chu Yunfan and did not attack. This gave Chu Yunfan the opportunity to use this divine power. At this moment, it roared instinctively. Endless demonic energy surged out of its body, instantly turning into a huge yellow-scarved warrior.","This warrior was a gigantic mountain god. He had the ability to mobilize the earth energy of nature. Just as this mountain god appeared, he crashed into the Thunder Qilin.","Boom!","With an incomparably loud boom, the Thunder Qilin instantly smashed the mountain god into pieces and crashed into the Mountain Suppressor.","Boom!","The Mountain Suppressor roared and burst out with earth divine abilities in an attempt to block. However, the Thunder Qilin’s momentum did not decrease. It broke through layers of defense and instantly hit the Mountain Suppressor.","Everyone saw a huge mushroom cloud slowly rise up, and countless pieces of flesh flew out. The Mountain Suppressor had been smashed into pieces by the Thunder Qilin.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan reached out with a big hand and grabbed the horn and inner core of the Mountain Suppressor. The Thunder Qilin was too powerful and too fast. Even Chu Yunfan could only save this little bit of the Mountain Suppressor.","However, these were the two most important and precious things on the Mountain Suppressor. Its inner core was the source of its divine power, and its horn was the core of its divine power.","All of this took a long time to describe, but it actually only took a moment. Everyone was flabbergasted by this shocking attack."]},{"number":1599,"title":"Chapter 1599 Entering the Array, Great Fortune!","paragraphs":["1599 Entering the Array, Great Fortune!","Countless lightning bolts illuminated the sky, frightening everyone","This was especially true for the experts of the various forces in Great Qi. They had heard of Chu Yunfan for a long time. He was known as the number one. Even the original number one, the khan of Jinzhanghan, had died at his hands.","However, that was already all in the past. They did not have a very deep impression of it. Furthermore, now that Grand Xia had invaded, any member of Grand Xia that they caught was no weaker than Jinzhanghan. In fact, they were stronger.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan’s title as the number one seemed a little ridiculous. But now, he had used this shocking attack to let them understand whether the title was true or not.","Many people thought of the earth-shaking and earth-shattering strike. The sky shook and the stars lost their light. If it landed in the capital of Great Qi, it would probably destroy more than one-third of the capital. Although it was only one-third, the capital was vast. Destroying more than one-third of it in one strike was already an existence that they could not imagine.","Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai were also deeply shocked by the power of the Thunder Qilin. The Golden Mountain Suppressor was dealt with in one strike. Moreover, it seemed that the power of the Thunder Qilin was far more than that.","One could imagine how shocked they were at this moment.","Especially Ye Qiushui. Although she had long felt that the thunder technique Chu Yunfan released was not ordinary, she did not expect it to be so powerful. Even a late Golden Core would probably be severely injured by such an attack. Chu Yunfan’s strength was truly unfathomable.","At this moment, she finally had confidence in him. Previously, she had only wanted to take a gamble and break through to the Golden Core Stage. When she left the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, she could return to her sect, so what if Liang Ruicai and the others were furious?","But now, Chu Yunfan’s attack had made her realize that perhaps the final outcome was not necessarily to escape. Judging from the might of the Thunder Qilin, they would be able to kill gods and Buddhas in their way. A hundred half-step Golden Cores like her would be killed in one blow. Those Golden Cores would not fare much better.","However, Ye Qiushui didn’t know that when she was shocked by the power of the Thunder Qilin, Chu Yunfan wasn’t satisfied. He frowned slightly. The divine power that he had consumed crazily was recovering at an amazing speed. In a moment, he had almost recovered.","The Thunder Qilin’s power was strong. With his current strength, if a late Golden Core was not prepared, they might be injured or even die tragically. This move could even threaten a peak Golden Core.","The only problem was that it was too slow. Although it wasn’t slow, it was not enough to turn the tide of a battle for peak experts. The most effective way was to interrupt his casting. In a battle between experts that were a hair’s breadth apart, the other party would not give him the chance to use the Thunder Qilin safely.","This was the biggest problem, so Chu Yunfan had to think of a way to speed up the Thunder Qilin casting. Moreover, when the Thunder Qilin used it, it would drain all of his divine power, so it would be difficult to use it as an ordinary move. It could only be used as a trump card to catch his enemies off guard at a critical moment and win in one strike.","These were all his experiences on the battlefield. Chu Yunfan would never know if he had not used them before. However, in an ordinary battle, if he was surrounded by many experts, he could use this move of the Thunder Qilin to sweep away all of them.","Chu Yunfan’s current strength was still too weak. After the Thunder Qilin took shape, he could not control it. He could only attack the other party with one blow. If the other party dodged, Chu Yunfan would have no chance.","However, this was because his current cultivation level was not at its peak. If he cultivated to the peak, he could control the Thunder Qilin to sweep across the battlefield. Ordinary Golden Cores would be killed. If one came, it would kill one, and if two came, it would kill two.","He would kill gods and Buddhas who stood in his way.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan nodded with satisfaction. This was his first time unleashing the Thunder Qilin, but its power was very impressive. If he could cultivate it to the top according to the records in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, one Thunder Qilin World Destroyer move was enough to shatter a small world.","Thinking of the records in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, even Chu Yunfan felt a little cold. Lightning divine abilities were indeed some of the most lethal divine abilities among the many divine abilities.","While everyone was still immersed in the terrifying power of the Thunder Qilin World Descent, Chu Yunfan looked to the Origin Energy Fusion Array. The barrier around the array had been blasted open by the Thunder Qilin. He stepped on the light and brought Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai into the barrier.","After entering the barrier, it was completely different from the outside. It was like a completely different world. What appeared in front of them was an incomparably huge array. This array was like an incomparably huge furnace, refining countless natural treasures into a kind of energy that mixed with vitality.","Countless medicinal fragrances assaulted their noses. Chu Yunfan took a whiff and felt all the pores in his body open up. This was his body’s instinct to absorb high-level energy.","“We don’t have much time left. Liang Ruicai and the others will soon find out about what happened here, so we have to speed up,” Chu Yunfan said. Although the array masters who maintained the array had fled, he did not think that Liang Ruicai’s people were not among them.","Even the experts of the major forces who were watching the battle just now would probably tell on them. The human heart has always been like this. As long as there were enough benefits, there was nothing that could not be sold.","“Yes, let’s hurry.” Ye Qiushui looked excited and her eyes lit up.","On the other side, Chu Hongcai was also very excited. He knew that this was a huge fortune for him.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes were fixed on the array. In his mind, the godhead emitted a colorful light, allowing him to enter a mysterious realm. In addition to the information about the array recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, countless pieces of information turned into words and appeared in front of his eyes. It didn’t take long for him to understand the mysteries of the array.","“Let’s go. The array core is over there. We’ll enter through there,” Chu Yunfan said as he led Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai straight into the array to the array core."]},{"number":1600,"title":"Chapter 1600 Nine Seals Golden Core Technique","paragraphs":["1600 Nine Seals Golden Core Technique","After entering the array, Chu Yunfan felt that the surroundings were filled with endless fused origin energy. This orange-yellow energy filled the entire space.","All materials and treasures had their own. However, this Origin Energy Fusion Array was different. It mixed together all kinds of materials and treasures into fused origin energy. In this process, a lot of essence would be lost. The real refined essence might not even be one-tenth of the original essence. However, there was no doubt that the refined fused origin energy was indeed a high-level energy that was far superior to spirit energy.","“Spread out and absorb as much as you can!” Chu Yunfan shouted and dashed off.","Ye Qiushui flew into the distance.","Chu Hongcai was left alone. He immediately sat down cross-legged and began to absorb the fused origin energy in the array. When he absorbed a mouthful of fused origin energy, he felt a majestic energy surge into his body, almost ripping it apart.","He did not dare to be careless. This fused origin energy was originally meant for those experts who had already stepped into the peak of the Golden Core Stage and transcended the Core Stage to use. To a Divine like him, even a little bit was extremely dense energy. He hurriedly stopped absorbing the fused origin energy and began to digest the energy that he had absorbed.","Boom!","It didn’t take long for Chu Hongcai to feel that he had reached the peak of the seventh Divine Abilities Stage. Moreover, the speed at which his cultivation was increasing at a crazy rate didn’t stop. In just a moment, he had already broken through to the eighth tier.","This speed made him surprised and happy. This level was not so easy to pass. He did not expect that with the help of the fused origin energy, he could break through so easily. The cultivation of the Divine Abilities Stag was essentially a process of continuous purification, refinement, and enhancement of one’s mana. When one’s mana reached a certain level, they could be condensed into one point, which was the Core Stage. At that time, it would be like forming golden core. From then on, his life would be up to him and not the heavens.","Chu Hongcai had entered a higher realm and was overjoyed. He finally understood what Chu Yunfan meant when he said that there was a great opportunity here. If he could cultivate here for a long time, it would not take him long to break through to the Core Stage, or even the Golden Core Stage. This was something he had never dared to think about before.","Just as Chu Hongcai was about to crazily absorb the fused origin energy, Chu Yunfan’s voice suddenly sounded in his ear, “Steady now. Lay a good foundation and break through to the Core Stage.”","After hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Chu Hongcai stopped and consolidated his foundation. The fused origin energy was at a high level and helped him purify the mana in his body. After his breakthrough, his mana had at least doubled and its purity had also more than doubled. All of this added up to his combat strength soaring. Now, he alone could easily defeat dozens of himself. It would be difficult to find an opponent within the same level. This was something he had never experienced before.","All of a sudden, a divine will drilled into his mind. Those were the cultivation tips after the eighth Divine Abilities Stage, as well as some mana formulations to condense a golden core. Without a doubt, these were all exclusive tricks that could not be bought with money. If he had only had the hope of breaking through to the Core Stage, now that he had these techniques, he could say that he was almost 100% sure of breaking through.","Cultivation was about resources and inheritance. When one had both, even a pig could make rapid progress.","Chu Hongcai knew that Chu Yunfan was helping him, so he didn’t dare to delay. He quickly digested the techniques that Chu Yunfan had passed on to him while absorbing the fused origin energy to strengthen his body. His aura was growing at an astonishing speed.","Meanwhile, on the other side, Ye Qiushui sat down cross-legged excitedly and began to circulate her sect’s cultivation technique. Suddenly, her entire body emitted a faint water-like luster. Her cultivation was much stronger than Chu Hongcai, but it was also because of this that the speed at which she absorbed the fused origin energy was much faster than him.","Chu Hongcai had to stop and digest every single mouthful of energy he absorbed to consolidate his cultivation. She could continuously absorb the energy for a long time.","Ye Qiushui suppressed the surprise in her heart. She could feel that the blood and Qi in her body were trembling violently. This was the fused origin energy washing the divine power in her body and cleansing her body. She was being cleansed by a high-level energy, becoming stronger and purer.","Inside her body, there was a solid golden core that was constantly spinning. It was only one step away from turning into a golden core, and that would be the true Core Stage.","The difference between the Golden Core Stage and the Core Form Stage was like heaven and earth. Unless it was a freak like Chu Yunfan, it was impossible for an ordinary person to defeat a Golden Core.","She was now just a step away. As long as she could continue to absorb the fused origin energy, she would be able to step into the Golden Core Stage. However, the problem was that she did not have much time. Soon, Liang Rui would come back after receiving the news. At that time, she would no longer have a chance.","Thinking of this, Ye Qiushui felt a little anxious. Suddenly, a voice was heard.","“Calm down and concentrate. I’ll teach you the method to break through to the Golden Core Stage.”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Ye Qiushui was instantly delighted. Even in her sect, how everyone broke through to the Golden Core Stage was a secret because it was related to the difference in the golden core that each person condensed. If someone with ill intentions knew about it, it might be used against her. A considerable price needed to be paid to the sect to obtain the tricks of those old seniors who had already passed away. There was no free lunch in this world.","It was just that she had just broken through to the half-step Golden Core Stage not long ago. She had not thought that she could break through again in such a short time, so she had not obtained these methods. And without one, it was wishful thinking to condense a golden core in a short time. And Chu Yunfan’s words had undoubtedly solved her urgent need.","Soon, Chu Yunfan passed on a method to form a golden core. When Ye Qiushui saw this technique, she was shocked.","The Nine Seals Golden Core Technique!","The technique that Chu Yunfan had passed down was actually the Nine Seals Golden Core Technique. As far as she knew, even her sect master had used this technique to condense a golden core."]}]);
